  ('zcrm_1579374000131699148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129902002', 'Nalinikrishna Doniparthi', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Made correction to email. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-01-16 10:34:37', '2024-01-16 10:52:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131722028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100874002', 'Troy Kreutzer', NULL, '1/16/24: Member called needing help finding a gastroenterologist. I walked them through using HCBB. We also discussed IUA amount and how that works, as well as their HSA and clarifying that altering their IUA would not affect HSA qualification, and to speak to their advisor about other price options. 
Member wanted replacement Planstin cards, and wanted to know how to take advantage of the preventive care. I gave a short explanation, and followed up with email with more info about aca and phcs network and specific instructions for using hcbb. At the end of call, transferred to Planstin so that member could request cards. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-16 10:27:59', '2024-01-16 10:27:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131722018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086948001', 'Bradford Winship', NULL, '1/16/24: Janet called. She''s having issues with her back and needs to see someone. From what she told me, this is going to be flagged as a pre-ex condition. I advised to check with Zion on how her situation would be handled with the phase in period. We also discussed preventive services, and I sent an email with further instructions on using them. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-16 10:20:58', '2024-01-16 10:20:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131690114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, '1/16/24- Reached out to mbr as we had missed his call, he asked could he use his health share outside of the USA, informed him he can and the same sharing rules still apply. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-01-16 10:13:53', '2024-01-16 10:13:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131690109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165388', 'Kimberly Baldwin', NULL, '1/16/24: Chris called in with a few questions on how to submit a sharing request and how to get a colonoscopy covered, explained how he can get  a colonoscopy through planstin and larger sharing requests go through Zion. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-01-16 10:08:37', '2024-01-16 10:08:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131690104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055112303', 'Scott Yarian', NULL, '1/16/24: Mbr called in and asked for his member id number, provided it to him.-WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-01-16 10:07:32', '2024-01-16 10:07:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131699143', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129524001', 'Kathryn Jarrett', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-01-16 10:05:12', '2024-01-16 10:05:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131699133', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131183002', 'Dave Duewel', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call after start date of February 1, 2024. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-01-16 09:32:32', '2024-01-16 09:32:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131722008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108522002', 'Michael Hulstrom', NULL, '1/16/24: Karen called. She''s been seeing a chiropractor, and they have referred her to have some xrays done for a possible pinched nerve. Going to hospital this morning. I advised her to present as a cash pay patient, and open a need for the issue with Zion. Gave instructions on creating portal and submitting need and transferred to Zion. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-16 09:22:35', '2024-01-16 09:22:35'),
