  ('zcrm_1579374000131694012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098613002', 'Lisa McDowell', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Member Assistant', 'Visit ID : 3427 Question : Why can’t my pharmacy find my membership or group number. Planstin is what’s showing up. Last year I had no problem. Have you changed anything. It’s a specialty medicine', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2024-01-16 08:03:36', '2024-01-16 08:03:36'),
