  ('zcrm_1579374000131690096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125105020', 'Jerome Rogowski', NULL, '01.15.2024 Jerome called. Missed the call. Called him back. Left a VM. He called back asking the following:
1-why are we receiving a planstin card - does it replace the MBP card?
2-How do I use it? Is this what I present during a catastrophe?
3-Why does my intro letter to this card jump right into how to use Cobra?

I explained his plan to him. Noticed he has not had his welcome call, so I urged him to schedule it soon and attain information verbally and via email.
I sent him the schedule link.
I need to email Joan letting her know about the "cobra" situation.
His IUA is not showing up in the CRM but it does in Admin123, $1000.  Will message Dayra to correct it. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-15 16:55:44', '2024-01-15 16:58:04'),
