  ('zcrm_1579374000131699063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047153471', 'Thomas Ferguson', NULL, '1-15-24 Thomas chose the RMHP above and is paying $200 more a month happily to avoid the aggravation of dealing with submitting bills and contradictory info from Sedera. Auto emails were telling him he didn''t choose a cash friendly hospital for his ER visit to Aspen Valley Medical Hospital. That sent him into a frustrated place. They did let him know they would share in the cost but every auto email kept saying he needed to be a good cash pay patient which became a point of contention. He chose the $0 ded RMHP and found his Dr. Edward Wiese in the network. He found it on RMHP site and I found it on C4 to confirm. He''s also not that tied to this dr. since his dr. retired a few years ago. He''s all set. I helped him cancel his PDHC membership as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-15 16:40:15', '2024-01-15 16:40:15'),
