  ('zcrm_1579374000131699023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004762035', 'Traci Hoops', NULL, '1-15-24 Taci needs to remove McCall bc she''s turning 26 but also needs to show proof of ins to her school in IL. She did some work for jail on IL in the summer and now as credit . She''s not sure if it was treated as 1099 or W2. If 1099 she can show proof to join SECURE. If not, she''ll have to find an ins broker in IL to get ins moving forward for March onward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-15 13:12:31', '2024-01-15 13:12:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131709008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130357026', 'Anthony Massaro', NULL, '1/15/24: Cynthia called in and explained how she just finished her welcome call and was curious if she would be getting a card and how to present her self at the doctors office. Explained to her how her daughters injury is a pre membership condition and not eligible for sharing in first year of membership. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-01-15 13:00:32', '2024-01-15 13:00:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131709003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055112303', 'Scott Yarian', NULL, '1/15/24: Mbr called in to find out how to get reimbursed for an invoice, explained how he wouldn''t be able to seek a reimbursement and explained how his services get billed to either zion or planstin. Sounded like the member might have an eligible sharing request so I guided him to the online mbr portal on zion, noticed he was showing cancelled still despite mentioning he was reinstated and the notes stating that as well, escalated to Wendy and Patti. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-01-15 12:59:07', '2024-01-15 12:59:07'),
