  ('zcrm_1579374000131449059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447318', 'Laurel Kelner', NULL, '1/10/24: Curtis called again asking about the pieces of his plan. And to inform us that his wife''s BC was not covered like it normally is.

