  ('zcrm_1579374000131399008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129819012', 'Bryce Roberts', NULL, '01.09.2024 Mackenzie called wanting to learn how to proceed with her preventative appointments as well as a Colposcopy. I gave her a brief overview on how to present and get coverage with Planstin on her preventive appointments, and how to proceed with the Colposcopy appointment as a cash-pay patient. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-09 12:37:38', '2024-01-09 13:01:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131399003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093919001', 'Keely Campbell', NULL, '01.09.2024 Keely called under the impression she had coverage for preventative visits, according to a communication that went out.
