  ('zcrm_1579374000131397013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124507028', 'Ryan Moyes', NULL, '1-9-24 I left a vm for Ryan and let him know the 19th is the deadline to cancel and to call me for assistance. He got a new job with benefits.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-09 11:50:06', '2024-01-09 11:50:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131374082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129367001', 'Staci Quintana', 'Member Aging into 50 Age Band eff 3/24', '1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via email - 1/9 (O)', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-01-09 11:49:21', '2024-01-09 11:49:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131397008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131740002', 'Anzhelika Siloyan', NULL, '1-9-24 Anzhelika called and is still interested in SECURE HSA or reg ins. But once I shared the 2024 prices and benes for this year, she''s most interested in SECURE HSA. She now wants a Feb. 1st start date. She doesn''t know what Cobra will cost but it will be a lot. The cheapest C4 plan will be $1063 and they won''t qualify for a subsidy. Income might be in the $300''s but she didn''t really want to reveal that. Misheard me when I said the cut off for a family of 3 is somewhere in the $100K. I just checked the cutoff is $190K. Cigna Connect Flex Bronze 0 is $1279.10 or SECURE HSA at $1000/$1005. Peter takes one med and she thinks it''s for heart burn and not really concerned about it. They both want their wellness visits covered. Most importantly she wants them protected for their sports such as snowboarding.  Dr. Cheryl Cavanaugh is in the network but Dr. Kevin Boehm is not in Anthem or Cigna. She''s not thrilled with Coal Creek Family Practice and prefers more holistic, non western medicine. She will review with her husband and we are meeting this Friday the 12th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-09 11:46:41', '2024-01-09 11:46:41'),
