  ('zcrm_1579374000131305053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123819002', 'Heidi Perry', NULL, '01.08.2024 Heidi called to learn about her plan. I see she had not had her WC, so  gave her a brief overview, and sent her the schedule link for the welcome call. All via outlook. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-08 17:42:58', '2024-01-08 17:42:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131326003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028354134', 'Mary Geitner', NULL, '1-8-24 Mary has now learned for sure that she can''t see Dr. Kristin Van Konyenburg with any ACA plans. So, she''s going to go somewhere else. She asked for my recommendations for someone who''s more homeopathic/holistic in nature that will accept health ins. I suggested Dr. Gloria Oberbeck and The Sound Clinic to look into. She will keep her current plan.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-08 16:11:16', '2024-01-08 16:14:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131305048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125254010', 'Francoise Bunnell', NULL, '01.08.2024 Francoise called to change her banking information. I guided her to the cognito form. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-08 15:21:28', '2024-01-08 15:21:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131315008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126954002', 'Mark Eudy', NULL, '01.09.24:  Called Mark re: the Planstin Rx program he inquired about.  Explained the nature of the program and that MPB won''t have it until the member is re-enrolled on Planstin''s platform sometime within the next several months.  He was fine with that.  I explained it will be free of charge and is another option for our members to locate discounted medications. Also, it offers certain meds. at no charge due to the preventive MEC.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-01-08 15:21:01', '2024-01-08 15:21:01'),
