  ('zcrm_1579374000131305028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756253', 'Robin Beck', NULL, '1/8/24: Member called in to ask how she can enroll for cirrusmd with herself and her daughter who is still currently a minor. Sent her the registration link for cirrusmd and explained the service briefly to her. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-01-08 11:28:55', '2024-01-08 11:28:55'),
