  ('zcrm_1579374000131305013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120998002', 'William Chilton', NULL, '01.08.2024 William called on behalf of his wife, who is having abdominal pain. They found a facility to care for her with a $500 for initial visit, $300 follow up visit, then $300 pr visit from here on out.

