  ('zcrm_1579374000131242003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128916028', 'Trevon Stoltzfus', NULL, '01.06.23:  Recvd. an email from Trevon which included an email from Leslie Jablonski to Patti Baron asking for her help as Trevon "spent hours on the phone with the Concierge the last few days and is not getting anywhere."  Both Nahla and I have made numerous attempts to get this resolved with Planstin/Zion.  On 1/4/24, Desiree Mckee wrote: To: Nahla Tebcherany Cc: Joan Phelps -  " I have sent this over to our integration team, I will reach out to them and see if they can expedite his file specifically."
Nahla, nor I, heard from Planstin on Friday.  I responded to Trevon''s email explaining what we''ve done so far and the response from Desiree.  I added that I have, today, emailed (and tried to leave a voice message but their system wouldn''t allow for it) for Planstin''s IT specialist, Jordell Shumway, that it is crucial for him  to enter Trevon''s membership info. into their/Zion''s system so Trevon can move forward with his Sx. on Tuesday.  I will check in with Jordell on Monday, 1/8/24, and make every attempt to resolve this for Trevon.  JSP
Trevon responded to my email. Said he wants to hear back first thing Monday morning as this is a required Sx for him.  I responded that I understand his urgency and I will alert him as soon as I get the go-ahead from Planstin/Zion.JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-01-06 12:24:20', '2024-01-06 16:15:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131237003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133541002', 'Amber Cannon', NULL, '1-6-24  Hi Kirk, I am very interested in this, however, I am now getting ready to leave town for the month of January.  I will be back in February and looking forward to learning more about MPB.

