Amber', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-01-06 09:30:34', '2024-01-06 09:30:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131185163', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114129002', 'Stephanie McCarter', NULL, '01.05.2024 Stephanie emailed me via outlook the following:
"﻿Dear Nahla
I had an annual dermatology  exam on 12/15/23  and they did a shave biopsy of a mole .
I have to get further excision due to atypical cells - so I asked for cash price w initial exam  and so now i also I pay up front for this next  procedure and send in receipts to Zion if iver $1000 ?
I tried to log in to my mpb and it asks for user name and I put in member number 122547525 from my plantis card and Zion card - did not work -
Nowhere do I see member Id on these cards or in emails - what and where is it ???
Best regards
Stephanie McCarter"

I consulted with Joan via Teams, and she concurred it is considered diagnostic and will be shared with Zion after fulfilling the IUA.

I responded to her later in the day with the following:
Sorry for the delay in responding.
According to my supervisor, you are right on track!
Continue to present yourself as a cash-pay patient, collect the receipts (hoping they give you that cash-pay discount) so they can go towards your IUA. Eventually and if needed, we will open a sharing request with Zion.

As for your MPB portal, please call us at the concierge line, and we''d be happy to give you your credentials for that. Do note, all that you will find there are transaction items you can use towards your accounting purposes.

I''m here for another 45 minutes, and again I profusely apologize for the delay response. If I don''t speak with you, I hope you have a wonderful weekend.

Nahla
800-519-2969', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-05 17:18:42', '2024-01-05 17:18:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131185158', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128951002', 'Philip Sheridan', NULL, '01.05.2024 Jan put in an RX request for: Sumatriptan Succinate 6 syringes of 6 mg/0.5ml pen injctr.

