  ('zcrm_1579374000131229034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079231033', 'Beth Sanders', NULL, '1-5-24 Beth is getting a huge subsidy with C4 this year. She chose a Kaiser plan and the ded and mop are less than with MPB. So, tough to compete with that. She had an Assister help her and not interested in having a broker at this moment unless she needs help. She was very nice and super appreciative of my help. I walked her through the cancellation form and she submitted it just how. All set for 2024.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-05 15:30:06', '2024-01-05 15:30:06'),
