  ('zcrm_1579374000131185137', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129394002', 'Edward Fu', NULL, '01.05.2024 Robin called to ask a few questions, one if we can have Planstin send Edward a digital Planstin card. I called Planstin to do so, and William was graceful enough to send over the Planstin cards, but shares that Edwards does not show up in Zion''s platform, so I told RObin I''ll be sending the trouble shooting email for that part. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-05 15:01:21', '2024-01-05 15:31:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131229026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001207493', 'Eben Grace', NULL, '1-5-23 Eben wanted to review his membership. It looks like he''s paying $319 a month for his membership at the $2500 IUA. So, he''s paying less than what he would if he joined today. It''s $1 cheaper than 2023 pricing as well. So, there''s nothing to change. I reassured him he''s in a good place. He''s happy and will leave well enough alone.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-05 14:58:46', '2024-01-05 14:58:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131229021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079231033', 'Beth Sanders', NULL, '1-5-24 Beth is looking to cancel. I just left her a vm. I also see her email wasn''t working. So, I added the new one that I''m seeing for her now.  Beth is going to be able to get a Kaiser plan with APTC this year. Playing phone tag now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-05 14:50:21', '2024-01-05 15:02:28'),
