  ('zcrm_1579374000131229016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129405128', 'Jerry Wilson', NULL, '1-5-24 Jerry is nervous bc he hasn''t received any communication from Zion yet. Zion says they will no longer be sending Zion cards bc it just creates more confusion.  However Ben at Zion can''t find his membership! So, I''m waiting for his next response. I also called Jerry and let him know there''s no card from Zion but he will get a packet from MPB. I gave him the Concierge # as well in the meantime. He has his welcome call set for Jan. 15th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-05 14:00:08', '2024-01-05 14:00:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131229011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122214002', 'Tara Skredynski', NULL, '1-5-24 Tara is looking to lower her cost and wanted to cancel MPB and get only Zion. I let her know she''s grandfathered into the lower rates for the entire year with MPB. She can remove the MEC and change her price from $300 to $240 a month at the $1000 IUA. She will think it over and get back to me.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-05 13:56:39', '2024-01-05 13:56:39'),
