  ('zcrm_1579374000131185132', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162629', 'Christopher Spencer', NULL, 'Providers office called asking about coverage for Chris for some kind of medical equipment and procedure, I explained what that would entail with his IUA, only for the part of him having an ingrown toenail. I gave her Zion''s phone number as she asked if there is prior authorization needed. I lastly told her to Co-Pay price for a specialist visit for $50, max payout of $300/visit, and per year unlimited. She got what she needed and is all set. -KF (Her name was Jessica)', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2024-01-05 12:59:25', '2024-01-05 12:59:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131229003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141390002', 'Michael Earle', NULL, '1-5-23 Christina is 64 and turning 65 in June, 25th 2024, therefore DOB 6/25/1959. Michael is 55 8/29/68. Their Cobra is ending Jan. 31st and she thinks it''s somewhere in the $1100 - less than $1500 range.  Christina had breast cancer and had a mastectomy  that wasn''t done well. She likely needs a correction surgery and she has an autoimmune condition but it''s well managed or gone. Not a candidate for MCS. Husaband is healthy, but has allergies. He was a smoker 10 years ago and quit. He takes anti depressants and uses an inhaler for allergies.  Husband is self-employed and her best guess at inceom is $125K but will discuss it with him. They spend half of the year in Mexico, so MCS might be good for her husband. But, that will throw off their APTC. They qualify for about $822 with both of them on ACA. Christina''s most imp Dr. is Dr. Acharya - Leon Radhika. Dr. Kelly Ann McAleese is in the networks. Dr. Chris? West was showing up but that''s the least imnp Dr since it''s her husband''s Dr. and he''s willing to change.  She will likely meet her mop, so we then started looking at HSA plans with Select Health or Anthem Pathway ONLY.  Anthem Bronze Pathway HMO 7900 for HSA HMO/Expanded Bronze for about $868.49 for both of them may be best.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-05 12:14:38', '2024-01-05 12:17:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131201020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064056212', 'Daryl Mackie', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update form I will process.  Member also submitted email update', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-01-05 12:13:45', '2024-01-05 12:17:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131185119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291752', 'Christine Harvey', NULL, 'Christine called in and needed to get her regular colonoscopy screening done and asked what to do. I explained to her the step-by-step process and fully understands. I am sending her a list of facilities in her area now and she will schedule her appointment. She already has her referral from her GP. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2024-01-05 12:11:38', '2024-01-05 12:11:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131185114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064056212', 'Daryl Mackie', NULL, '01.05.2024 Daryl called to change his banking information. I guided him to the Member Updates page for all the forms. We later learned his email needs to be updated as well, so I guided him to do that secondly, from the same page. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-05 11:41:04', '2024-01-05 11:41:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131185096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129213002', 'Monica Campbell', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-01-05 11:04:42', '2024-01-05 11:04:42'),
