  ('zcrm_1579374000131221008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128525025', 'Pamela Burns', NULL, '1/5/24: Pamela called in because she wanted to cancel her membership, asked her why and she mentioned not getting cards in the mail, told her while i understand being promised cards and not getting them is frustrating she can still take advantage of all the services in her plan. Mbr mentioned having an issue with her husband seeing someone where it should have been billed preventative through planstin and wasn''t. Apologized for her experience and told her we will give Leslie time to respond to our email of notice of cancellation. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-01-05 09:47:52', '2024-01-05 09:47:52'),
