  ('zcrm_1579374000131161018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129883022', 'Tod Stillson', NULL, '01.04.2024 I received a call from Planstin, William, with Tod on the other line. Tod received his new Planstin card that has optumRX on it. He called them to get registered, and they told him that Planstin needs to activate OptumRX. He calls Planstin, and Tod is hearing this for the first time, calls MPB and asks "If we are now using OptumRX? B/C Planstin is moving forward with PlanstinRX (First time hearing of that)."
Tod wants to know if his RX''s are covered by OptumRX. 
During the meeting tomorrow, I will bring up the formulary and this phone call, for educational purposes. 
Should I learn of anything other than what we have been practicing with OptumRX, I will call both parties back (Tod and William in Planstin). NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-04 17:23:41', '2024-01-04 17:36:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131168013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131477004', 'Jason Ketcham', NULL, '1-4-23 Isabelle is 22 9/11/01 and Jason is 33 5/21/90. They have been on Medicaid and will get bumped off anytime now. Their income is $135K as best guess for 2024. Jason is self-employed 1099. The only health issue is Isabella has recurring UTI''s she''s managing and taking occasional meds to manage it and takes birth control which she will be stopping soon to get pregnant. I shared the maternity benefits with her and the removal of the waiting period. She''s eager to get going bc of a wedding in Aug. they are attending and not wanting to fly when newly pregnant. They do not use tobacco, and healthy! They are fine with paying for wellness on their own but actually they want to fund the HSA. So, she''s mostly interested in SECURE HSA $1000/$555. I compared this to C4 plans as well. They use Kaiser now and loves it but she''s not tied to their drs. or their expensive plans.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-04 16:58:48', '2024-01-04 17:03:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131161013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126208001', 'Suzanne Melohn', NULL, '01.04.2024 Suzanne needed to cancel her membership due to receiving benefits through a new job. She reached out to Leslie (Email and Phone), her advisor, but was not hearing back from her. So I guided her to the form to fill out. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-04 16:37:47', '2024-01-04 16:37:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131161008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108211002', 'Karen Sachs', NULL, '01.04.2024 Received a call from Karen Sachs stating her research with HCBB is not conducive, due to the contact information not being correct and/or the entire practice no longer exists.
