  ('zcrm_1579374000131168003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128882232', 'Hany Abouyoussef', NULL, '1-4-23 Hana is Female and Hany is male. I get them backwards. There are no options for her without Pathway in the name and Anthem is still their best choice for UCHealth. Off exchange the options aren''t any better to meet her needs. Children''s Hospital isn''t accepting these plans either. The best option is Anthem Silver Pathway HMO 2800 $0 Select Drugs for $1999.19 after APTC of $1207.71. She will call the hospital and call me back tomorrow with a choice.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-04 14:33:29', '2024-01-04 14:33:29'),
