  ('zcrm_1579374000131158008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128916028', 'Trevon Stoltzfus', NULL, '01.04.24:  I was informed by Nahla that Trevon was still not appearing in Zion''s and Planstn''s systems. I called Desiree McKee, left a voicemail asking her to resolve this as soon as possible as Trevon is having a shoulder Sx this coming Tuesday and is upset and nervous that he is not registered with Zion/Planstin as yet. I also called Ashlee Williams, explained this situation and asked her to follow up with Desiree.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-01-04 12:36:26', '2024-01-04 12:36:26'),
