  ('zcrm_1579374000131116069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130311020', 'Rob Withers', NULL, '1/4/24: Molly called in to inquire about the CirrusMD links, sent them again and she was able to get in. She told me the reason she was trying to access it was to see a dermatologist for her 19 year old daughter as she was needing an rx. Informed her that she would be better off in this case seeing a derma in person if that is the goal of the visit as CirrusMD would refer her to a specialist for that most likely. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-01-04 11:54:26', '2024-01-04 11:54:26'),
