  ('zcrm_1579374000131116038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129062001', 'Michelle Archer', NULL, '1/4/24: Mbr called in confused and asked me to go her some basic member education with her since her welcome call was scheduled out for 1/4/24. Broke down the main elements of her Planstin HSA and Zion healthshare and how to sign up for Zions health portal. Mbr called back shortly after saying Zion had no record of her in their system at all and were unable to help with that. Told her I would need to look further into that and call her back. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-01-04 09:43:26', '2024-01-04 09:43:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131116033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128960002', 'Raymond Wagner', NULL, '1/4/24: Tabia called. She recently had to take her 3 year old daughter to doc for pneumonia and was almost turned away after trying to present her MPB card to provider. We went over what to tell the provider for next time when it''s illness or injury related. I explained the difference between using her health share component and MEC. Member requested a welcome call for herself. I sent over scheduler link. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-04 09:43:07', '2024-01-04 09:43:07'),
