  ('zcrm_1579374000131096059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120538002', 'Fabian Garcia', NULL, '01.03.2024 Fabian called to ask if he can go be seen at an urgent care for his physical, b/c he''s not able to get in as a new patient to be seen on a saturday.
