  ('zcrm_1579374000131085410', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048462222', 'Ann Apfelbeck', NULL, '1/3/24: Ann called in due to her husband experiencing an elbow issue and wasn''t able to visit urgent care due to lack of a primary provider. Gave her the only primary care option near her that I found in HCBB that was taking new patients and showing low cost. Sent her an email with Dr. Charles W. Lackeys information and also included information on how to create her zion Member portal. Explained briefly how once she creates that portal how she can upload her bills to the member portal. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-01-03 14:32:11', '2024-01-03 14:32:11'),
