  ('zcrm_1579374000131040047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120745009', 'Diane Sadowski', NULL, '01.02.2024 Diane called and left a message re: how to proceed Dexa Scan and where to go to get one.
I called her back and ended up leaving her a VM. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-02 16:48:07', '2024-01-02 16:50:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131040042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257276', 'Jacqueline Martinez', NULL, '01.02.2024 Left a message while we were closed. Called back. Spoke with Jackie. She shared that she just needed a letter from the doctor stating she''s not feeling well and cannot make her flight. She attempted that via CirrusMD, but they referred her to urgent care, which she obliged. She also might schedule separate Welcome calls, due to spouse''s difficult schedule. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-02 16:38:42', '2024-01-02 16:38:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131040037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122612001', 'Jennifer Speed', NULL, '01.02.2024 Jennifer called wanting to know if she needs to see her doctor to get a referral for an MRI. I told her that it depends on the facility. She can call us back to help us find her a doctor if they need her to go that route. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-02 16:26:28', '2024-01-02 16:26:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131040029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105906002', 'Derick Brooks', NULL, '01.02.2024 UCHealth, bloodwork, bill estimate was sent. Gave him 4 discounted websites to shop around on.
UCHealth is asking for a down payment $2k. Will search the different provided sites, and give us a call back tomorrow to get connected with Zion. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-02 16:12:57', '2024-01-02 16:17:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131040024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061522092', 'Nancy Allawos', NULL, '12.26.2023 Nancy called and left a VM stating all for the colonoscopy was coded properly preventative and that they included the anesthesia in the billing to Planstin. Nancy was just following up to let us know it is on the right track. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-02 15:39:06', '2024-01-02 15:39:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131040016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108211002', 'Karen Sachs', NULL, '01.02.2027 Karen called to get help in finding an ENT for Ear Wax Removal.
I guided her to the Summary of Care email, had her flag it, and then guided her to find the HCBB site and how to use it and present herself as a cash pay patient.
She found a list she will start contacting and negotiate pricing. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-02 15:17:49', '2024-01-02 15:18:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131035049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032454006', 'Georgannna Garrison', NULL, '1-2-24 Cami had to postpone her shoulder surgery in March and then 3 weeks later fell snowboarding. She had a rotator cuff tear which was 10% torn and increased it to 60% in the fall. She also had a separation of her shoulder. She then had to cancel her rescheduled surgery for Aug. to a later date. She had to wait at least 6 months to allow the separation to heal before they can do surgery. Her PT has been suggesting perhaps avoiding surgery altogether and trying PRP or stem cell therapy. She had already tried PRP and it didn''t work. So, now she''s curious about stem cell therapy and the process to do so. I let her know she needs to get it pre-approved and to also make sure they will still pay for surgery if stem cell therapy fails since they won''t necessarily pay for both. She will make sure before moving forward with stem cell therapy. They place she will go only will accept patients that they believe have a 90% chance of success. They will be honest with her if there are too many problems in her shoulder and neck to be feasible. She also tried to see if Zion would pay for Sound Therapy and they denied that. Her PT also thinks the root cause may have stemmed from an issue in her neck. After looking at imaging, her neck is not looking good either. So, she will proceed with caution with Zion''s pre-approval process. She had stuff on her record prior to her start date. But, we''re not in her 4th year of membership, so she gets up to $125K per year for pre-x. She remembered the Concierge had priced out the surgery last year and it''s around $40K. So, she''s well within that limit.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-02 14:52:24', '2024-01-02 14:52:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131027030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079563002', 'James Lee', NULL, '01.02.23:  Additionally (to Angee''s email) I texted Laurie to alert her to the registration email invite coming from CirrusMD and told her to call me if she has any problems. JSP
Heard back from Laurie. Said she registered and got in with no trouble whatsoever - it was very easy.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-01-02 14:26:00', '2024-01-02 14:53:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130993127', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129625021', 'Jacqueline Thill', NULL, '1/2/24: Jackie called wondering where her fulfillment package is. I told her they all went out last week for January start members, and she should get it this week, but to call back if not. She has an appointment this week to get her hearing checked. I advised her to present as a cash pay patient, and if it turned into something greater, she could submit a sharing request for reimbursement. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-02 14:24:38', '2024-01-02 14:24:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131035044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003848047', 'Aine Carlisle', NULL, '1-2-24 Aine sees that Zion is increasing the rates for 2024, so I let her know her membership is grandfathered in with her current rate. No change at this time.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-02 14:18:39', '2024-01-02 14:18:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131035036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165317', 'Melody Fairchild', NULL, '1-2-24 Talked with Glen and fixed his C4 account reflect a $1355.94 APTC for 2024! Their income is estimated at $70K and they get that huge subsidy. I shared the RMHP and Cigna Connect Flex both with the $0 Ded. The Cigna Connect Flex Bronze 0 looks best and their cost is only $229.41!  He will share this with Melody. I let him know about paying now and again directly with Cigna and also to let me know and I''ll help him cancel MPB. He''s very appreciative.  The C4 account is under Glen''s name.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-02 14:10:43', '2024-01-02 14:11:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130993117', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128922010', 'Glen Randall', NULL, '1/2/24: Called Glen to ask a question about recent quote request form, but he had already filled the script and paid for it. We discussed using the discount service in the future and how it works. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-02 13:56:09', '2024-01-02 13:56:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131027019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128951002', 'Philip Sheridan', NULL, '01.02.24:  Recvd. email from Desiree Mckee:  Just received confirmation this is updated and complete.  Id Cards are being sent, please let me know If you need anything else for this member. Spoke w/Angee about this. Said she needs some further info. before she contacts them. JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-01-02 13:55:47', '2024-01-02 14:19:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130993112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109598022', 'Joseph Murray', NULL, '1/2/23: Joe called in and mentioned he had injured his back here in December and was wanting to know the process of submitting a sharing request. Explained the process of submitting a sharing request and the IUA when he brought up Chiropractic care, told him I would need to do further research on that. Found something in the zions member guidelines under 37. therapeutic treatments, will reply back to the mbr via email per his request. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-01-02 13:45:21', '2024-01-02 13:45:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131035028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028354134', 'Mary Geitner', NULL, '12-21-23 Mary can''t see her Dr. that she wants because of this...

Hi Mary,

When I go onto the Cigna site to search for in-network providers I do not find Dr. Kristin as a participating provider in the Cigna Connect network. There are two issues that we need to be aware of:

1) We must be shown as in network at the 600 S. Airport Rd. Longmont location, or it doesn''t apply to this practice
2) I am unable to search the Connect for Health Colorado site because I am not registered

If your broker is saying that we show in network, would she be able to take a screenshot of the page she finds that information on and send it to me? 

Thank you!
______

I shared with Many and Whole Family Healthcare of Longmont the C4 search which shows Dr. Kristen, BUT, she doesn''t show up at their address in Longmont, only in Boulder. So, it sounds like it won''t work at the practice she wants to use.  They have not responded as to what plans they will take. I''ll see if Mary can find out.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-02 13:43:29', '2024-01-02 14:07:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131040008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128525025', 'Pamela Burns', NULL, '01.02.2024 Chris called MPB spoke with them re: not receiving their Planstin cards. Vanessa was 1st person they spoke with, 2 weeks later they spoke with MAYBE William - gave planstin''s phone number.
These members are not showing up in Planstin nor Zion''s platform.
 I explained what the tech issue was at hand and let them know that I will communicate this with Planstin and Zion and Cc Joan, my supervisor, to get it rectified, the way we have been proceeding with this situation for the last few weeks now.
Chris did pay for labwork that will need to be either reversed with the lab to bill Planstin instead, or reimbursed by Planstin. 
Chris was also in the midst of filling out the RX request, as he just learned that it is part of his plan. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-02 13:12:13', '2024-01-02 13:32:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130993099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130194011', 'Ronald Reyes', NULL, '1/2/23: Mrs. Reyes called in to inquire about rx coverage as her husband needed a couple, told her how she could fill out the rx discount form on our website. Also encouraged her to schedule their welcome call as they had not done so already. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-01-02 12:48:36', '2024-01-02 12:48:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131040003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124631170', 'Zack Aker', NULL, '01.02.2024 Zack called on behalf of Gabrielle, for not feeling very well and wanting to know the best way to making an appointment.
I guided him to have her use CirrusMD first, and most likely they will be able to treat her. IF NOT, they will request that she see someone in person.
I offered to send both of them an invitation link to register with CirrusMD, and requested to have Gabrielle call us here at the concierge line to getting set up. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-01-02 12:29:29', '2024-01-02 12:29:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131034046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131814002', 'Karyn Adams', NULL, '1-2-24 sent email.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-01-02 12:20:54', '2024-01-02 12:20:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130993094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128574001', 'Courtney Caroland', NULL, '1/2/23: Courtney called. Her child has a well visit tomorrow and wanted to confirm she is presenting as cash pay. With a direct plan, there are some child well visits shareable through zion, but I wasn''t sure if it had to be related to a maternity request and guidelines weren''t clear. It said related to maternity request and after 6 months of membership.

I advised Courtney that this visit is cash pay, out of pocket regardless since she''s only been a member since 12/1/23, but I would clarify the guidelines for future well child visits. 
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-02 12:12:38', '2024-01-02 12:12:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131034033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131814002', 'Karyn Adams', NULL, '1-2-24  
