  ('zcrm_1579374000131035023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131036041', 'Casey Obryon', NULL, '1-2-24 Casey Ann and her husband Justin are looking for ins to possibly include their 2 kids as well. But, the kids might qualify for CHP in WV. They just got bumped off Medicaid and have no ins now. However, Justin is having some gastro issues which might be a hiatal hernia and may need surgery. They don''t know yet. Their income might be around $49K unless home sales pick up. So, they will likely qualify for a tax credit. I recommended they try that path first bc of his pre-x issue for now. When that''s resolved, she can try our options after that point. She was very appreciative of my help and now has a better understanding of the tax credits and how that works.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-02 12:02:28', '2024-01-02 12:02:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130993089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123199001', 'Carey Reynolds', NULL, '1/2/23: Mbr called in and mentioned losing the email Angee had sent with the initial coupon, resent her an email with just the coupon attached and asked her to check her spam folder, member was able to find it and said she would try to pick it up now as she was at the pharmacy. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-01-02 12:00:33', '2024-01-02 12:00:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131035018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059526010', 'Robin Brenneise', NULL, '1-2-23 Robin called bc she''s at Costco and can get the med through OptumRX at a discounted rate. I told her that should be fine but she may want to contact the MPB Concierge Team to access her meds at the best price possible. She''ll use OptumRX now and call the Concierge Team in the future.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-02 11:55:00', '2024-01-02 11:55:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130993059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128951002', 'Philip Sheridan', NULL, '1/2/23: Sent Jan RX coupon per prescription quote request. See attached. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-02 11:43:36', '2024-01-02 11:43:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130993054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129295002', 'Michael Stoltzfus', NULL, '1/2/24: Michael called wanting to schedule welcome call and had questions on setting up his HSA. I emailed a link to set up call, and advised to speak to advisor or financial institution on opening an HSA account. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-02 11:39:25', '2024-01-02 11:39:25'),
