  ('zcrm_1579374000131035003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109372256', 'Daniel Biernat', NULL, '1-2-23 Dorota called to see what Daniel''s options are for him to keep Dr. Jeffrey Lewis in network. Dr. works with UCHealth in Denver and Boulder. But, they say they don''t accept his Cigna plan. So, I looked at Anthem and the off exchange plans are also Pathway or Essentials which are not likely accepted either. She will call and ask the Dr. If not, they will remain on his current Cigna Connect Flex Bronze $0 for now. He doesn''t have a job. He could get Medicaid but they might not accept that either. Again she''ll inquire and let me know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-01-02 11:33:16', '2024-01-02 11:33:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131029081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129115002', 'Tyler Hazen', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-01-02 11:03:49', '2024-01-02 11:03:49'),
