  ('zcrm_1579374000130993039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129823144', 'Pam Adamson', NULL, '1/2/23: Pam called. She had a chest xray and needs a doc to read it. She was wondering if the doc she''s been talking to with Cirrus is her primary care doc. I advised that I doubt CirrusMD docs will read chest xrays, but it couldn''t hurt to ask. I let her know about HCBB and sending an email to her with search instructions. Also said I''d be happy to perform a search for her if she needed help. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-01-02 10:01:40', '2024-01-02 10:01:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130993034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013822359', 'Heather Rose', NULL, '1/2/24: Mbr called in to get help with logging back into the mpb portal. Got Kelly to pull up her credentials because they''re not showing here in the crm and she did provide me with them but they were invalid. Was told we might need to escalate to Vinny to correct that issue. Answered the mbrs questions in the meantime and helped her complete the address change on our website which was the main reason for her call to begin with- WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-01-02 09:56:19', '2024-01-02 09:56:19'),
