  ('zcrm_1579374000131027011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079563002', 'James Lee', NULL, '01.02.23:  Called Angie and asked her to email CirrusMD the member info. for Laurie so they could enter it into their system, then email Laurie to inform her she would be getting an invite from CirrusMD to register. Angie said she''d cc me on her email.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-01-02 08:14:29', '2024-01-02 08:14:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000131027003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079563002', 'James Lee', NULL, '01.01.24:  On 12.31.23  Jim texted me: his wife, Laurie wanted to use CirrusMD for the first time, but never got an invite to register. He said it wasn''t urgent but if we could do something before Tuesday, he would appreciate it.  I sent Laurie the registration link but she responded the CirrusMD error message said they didn''t find her in the system.  I texted her to explain that sometimes, when a member is added to a primary member''s account, CirrusMD doesn''t pick up on that member info. and we need to confirm with them she is an MPB member.  I told her our Concierge will email CirrusMD her member info. on Tuesday so CirrusMD can enter her in their system and send her the registration invite.  She said she was fine with that.
Laurie''s Phone #:  319-231-7581
Laurie''s Email:  laurieonthefarm.lee@gmail.com', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-01-02 08:07:50', '2024-01-02 08:26:33'),
