  ('zcrm_1579374000130906148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131094002', 'Patrick Hill', NULL, 'Good Morning Eva,

I am delighted to welcome you!

Enrollment is easy and will take less than 15 minutes. On a phone call with me, I''ll have you navigate through the enrollment fields to get it completed. While you will be driving, I''ll be there on the call to make sure it all goes smoothly.

Annual membership fee is $25
One-time enrollment fee is $100
Pay via credit card (but has a 3% fee) or via your checking account (monthly transfer).

That''s it!  I can do this with you later today or next week after the holiday, let me know what is convenient?

Best,', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2023-12-29 09:18:53', '2023-12-29 09:18:53'),
