  ('zcrm_1579374000130830031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083676002', 'Shannon Carley', NULL, '12.27.2023 Shannon called to get help with opening a sharing request for her daughter''s concussion, happened in august, ER visit with an MRI. I gave her Zion''s number offered her brief guidance on the new process, and then I direct transferred her. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-27 17:01:11', '2023-12-27 17:04:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130830023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109658041', 'Michelle Dunn', NULL, '12.27.2023 Michelle said she called from (651) 500-5039 on December 15, 2023 @ MPB, asking for guidance in attaining a therapist. Someone gave her this number to call for mental health services: 1-800-662-4357, and they ended up charging her $10.61, which then rendered her to block them from charging anything else to her account.
I asked her a plethora of questions, trying to investigate the matter:
1-Who did you speak with?
2-What day and time did you call? (to see if we can pull up the phone call.
3-Are you sure you did not call Zion''s concierge instead?
4-Would you have called from the number you are calling from now  (651) 500-5039 ?
I guided her to the MAP under M&S EAP, her computer was playing around so I just gave her their number and briefly went over how to present herself, what to say and what to expect. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-27 15:56:40', '2023-12-27 16:09:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130830018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109671026', 'George Jarratt', NULL, '12.27.2023 George called thinking his december payment did not go through. According to Admin123 he is in the clear. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-27 15:20:59', '2023-12-27 15:20:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130830013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061021001', 'Nathan Schultz', NULL, '12.27.2023 Maya called sharing that she received a bill from the facility she had her mamm at, even though she presented her card, and guided them to call Planstin for billing.
I coached her to do one of the following first: call the facility to', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-27 15:15:56', '2023-12-27 15:15:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130830008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114129002', 'Stephanie McCarter', NULL, '12.27.2023: Stephanie messaged with good news regarding the dispute of the above bill.
"Dear Nahla
Good news I got a phone call from the imaging center and they honored my $155 price for cash pay!!!
Thank you for all your help. I’m so glad!
