  ('zcrm_1579374000130803013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674121', 'WAHEED AYUBI', NULL, '12-27-23 Per Nahla- FOR WEDNESDAY
LEAD/Inactive Advisor:
Waheeb Ayubi, needs to add two newborns who are presently in NICU. He is on SEDERA, and the mother used HER benefits (not MPB), for her maternity. He has a plethora of questions an advisor and the billing department can shed light on.
 
He''s extremely concerned about the 30 day window for adding the babies, and the other insurance not covering if he puts in the wrong date.
I told him that he will need to call you on tuesday to clarify to you what he needs in order to take the right next step.
I have messaged Patti to make sure she speaks to Waheeb before adding the babes.
I have attempted to have Kirk guide him, but Kirk confidently said he is not well versed with Sedera and is worried about misleading him.

Wendy''s Response - 

Adding them won''t avoid the pre-x clause. It sounds like it was a complicated birth. If the newborns have to be in the NICU due to any complications, that will be considered pre-x and not shareable since the mom was not a member at the time of pregnancy. However, it looks like someone already submitted the form to add the babies. They have other children and this won''t add to their cost. But, Sedera won''t share in pre-x for the babies. So, they need to add them to the mom''s insurance as well. Sedera will become the secondary benefit, not primary, in this case.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-27 11:30:18', '2023-12-27 11:30:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130785018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118217002', 'Michael Aruzza', NULL, '12/27/23: Anne left a chat "When needing medicine refills, do I go through MPB, Zion, or Cirrus MD?"
Called to discuss her question. She was confused about everything but essentially needing a script written for depression meds and blood pressure meds. 
1. I first gave her a visual walkthrough of the different portions of her plan using the member portals section of site. We discussed when to use Telehealth, Zion, and Planstin. Reminded her of Mental Health Services (since she''s seeking depression meds), and showed her where to log into personal medical records vault. 
2. We checked to see if she was already registered with Cirrus, and she was. I advised her to download the app on her phone and use Telehealth for her current need, and as her first line of defense for any issue especially since she gets unlimited access to it. 
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-12-27 11:18:43', '2023-12-27 11:25:40'),
