  ('zcrm_1579374000130747008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102421002', 'Christopher Rutt', NULL, '12/26/23: Chris called. He wants to get a sleep apnea test done and wanted to know if anything will be covered. According to ACA, sleep apnea tests are not covered, and Zion guidelines state that sleep apnea "equipment" is not covered. However, I sent him both the ACA and most recent Zion guidelines, and instructed to call Zion directly to ask about possibly sharing other expenses related to illness. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-12-26 10:00:10', '2023-12-26 10:00:10'),
