  ('zcrm_1579374000130746028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100759002', 'Lucie Lalonde', NULL, 'Member called and left VM wanting to cancel her membership.  I will send her the link and call her to advise.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-26 08:36:03', '2023-12-26 08:36:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130746023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816343', 'Mary Ann Harpenau', NULL, '12/26/23: Mbr called in to ask about submitting a sharing request, explained how she could do so. Member asked if her plan came with any preventative care, member appears with a plan she says herself she was grandfathered into that I don''t know much about, told her I would research this plan further and call back regarding preventative. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2023-12-26 08:06:36', '2023-12-26 08:06:36'),
