  ('zcrm_1579374000130710042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128916028', 'Trevon Stoltzfus', 'COMPLETED MPB Payment Change Form 12.22.2023', '12.22.2023 Trevon had been speaking to William.
He initially contacted us to get help to open a sharing request for a potential scheduled shoulder surgery for an injured shoulder last monday.
William did transfer him to Zion to begin the process of completing a sharing request, but Trevon quickly learned that he is not showing up in Zion''s system
sent billing form to correct routing number
need to send Planstin a correction email to Desiree, Cc Angee and William
Walk Trevon through filling out the form
He''s on his way to New Mexico for Christmas. So I sent him the form, he completed and submitted it.
WE WILL BE WAITING on his account to clear, in order to move forward with the CORRECTION that PLANSTIN needs to do in ZION''s platform, for Trevon to show up there.
THE LAST step in assisting Trevon is to help him open the sharing request with Zion, which is what he initially needed assistance with.

The email sent to him via Outlook:
Good evening Trevon.

Thank you for completing that form. I do see it in our system to be processed. Most likely the Member Services Department will complete the update in our system on Tuesday, as they are all gone for the weekend.
We are closed on Monday.
Once your account is balanced and back in good standing, I will then be able to generate the trouble shooting email to the third party administrator for Zion, Planstin (also your preventative company).
I will keep you posted on any necessary reciprocation from any party.
For educational purposes, I do have the trainees here on this thread.

Thank you and I hope you have a wonderful Christmas.

Nahla Tebcherany
MPB Health
Concierge Consultant
800-519-2969 NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-22 13:38:10', '2023-12-22 16:21:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130710034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674121', 'WAHEED AYUBI', 'COMPLETED the ADD 2 newborns to MPB Plan born 12/2', '12.22.2023 Waheed called to add two newborns who are in NICU.
He had WAAAY TOOO many questions about Sedera sharing his new babies'' visits, given that there were not born in an already approved Sedera maternity medical need.
Messaged both Patti and Kirk with the following, via teams:
FOR TUESDAY
LEAD/Inactive Advisor:
Waheeb Ayubi, needs to add two newborns who are presently in NICU. He is on Sedera, and the mother used HER benefits (not MPB), for her maternity. He has a plethora of questions an advisor and the billing department can shed light on.
He''s extremely concerned about the 30 day for adding the babies, and the other insurance not covering if he puts in the wrong date.
I told him that he will need to call you on tuesday to clarify to you what he needs in order to take the right next step.
I have messaged Patti to make sure she speaks to Waheeb before adding the babes. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-22 13:05:54', '2023-12-22 16:21:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130709016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130194011', 'Ronald Reyes', NULL, '12/22/23: Wanted to change her premium to possibly around the 5th of each month, told her we would look into that and follow up. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2023-12-22 12:37:54', '2023-12-22 12:37:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130709008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105619002', 'James Paulus', NULL, '12/22/23: Returned mbrs call, she mentioned she had completed what she needed to but then asked how an address change could be done, showed her the form on the website. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2023-12-22 12:30:41', '2023-12-22 12:31:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130710018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120745009', 'Diane Sadowski', NULL, '12.22.2023 Diane wants to upload all her receipts, which she later shared are chiro and labwork receipts FOR THE SAME situation.
I did reiterate the process of being shared on chiro visits, but told her to let Zion make the decision at this point.
Her email is full and she is not receiving emails. She is bombarded and is unable to clean out the emails due to the incoming communication for her job.
THEREFORE she is going to ask Zion to send her the invitation link to her husband''s email.
I transferred her to Zion, after giving her their number. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-22 12:06:19', '2023-12-22 12:21:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130710013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098475010', 'Oscar Granados', NULL, 'https://www.healthcare.gov/coverage/preventive-care-benefits/', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-22 12:05:32', '2024-01-15 12:33:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130710008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098475010', 'Oscar Granados', NULL, '12.22.2023 Wants to add their newborn, born on the 7th. They are in good standing of the 30 days.
She was concerned about having the first two baby visits covered. Zion told her they only share the hospital visit and birth. HOWEVER I learned/reminded by Joan that they offer a window of visits in a number of days, as a bridge until they add the baby to the plan.
So her two visits she already had for her baby needs to be uploaded to her maternity sharing request. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-22 11:51:17', '2023-12-22 12:23:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130693072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130373002', 'Lisa Wiesen', NULL, 'Spoke to member to reschedule welcome call after start date of January 1, 2024. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-12-22 11:20:13', '2023-12-22 11:20:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130693067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128943002', 'Joseph Buckwalter', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-12-22 11:19:27', '2023-12-22 11:19:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130693049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291752', 'Christine Harvey', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Put in request to Kelly to resend out QR Life code card. Verified address. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-12-22 11:06:23', '2023-12-22 11:22:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130710003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123832022', 'Elizabeth Anderson', 'COMPLETED the MPB Cancellation Form 12.22.2023 FOR 02.19.2024', '12.22.2023 Elizabeth called to make sure she does not have to complete anything to make sure she still has coverage.
I told her she does not need to do that. It is still ongoing until she cancels it through the MPB forms.
She then said that she will be getting a new benefit plan somewhere else, and will need to fill that form out at one point, and how to do that.
I guided her to speak to her advisor, Leslie Jablonski, as the first step. She kindly shared that it has been extremely hard getting a hold of her in the past, and really does not want to "chase her down" for something like this, so she would like to just finalize with us.
I guided her to all the MPB change forms on the MPB.Health site.
She will fill it out with 2.19.2024 as her last payment, since her new plan will begin on the 1st of March. 
Will share this with Patti. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-22 10:44:50', '2023-12-22 10:44:50');
