  ('zcrm_1579374000130709003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128916028', 'Trevon Stoltzfus', NULL, '12/22/23: Mbr called in as he had injured his shoulder and wanted to know how to submit a sharing request, walked him through the process on how he can do that. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2023-12-22 10:28:51', '2023-12-22 10:28:51'),
