  ('zcrm_1579374000130684003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130311002', 'Nicole Plourde', NULL, '12/22/23: Nicole called bc she was having trouble getting into Cirrus MD. Since her plan doesn''t begin until January, I advised that she wouldn''t be able to register the parts of her plan until then, but I did lead her to the portal section of the website and show her parts she could dig into prior to Jan 1. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-12-22 07:31:07', '2023-12-22 07:31:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130660093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130366012', 'Garrett Ortega', NULL, '12-21-23 Answered some questions for Garrett about how it all works. Impressed on him to get the Welcome Call scheduled before the weekend. Sent him the Direct brochure.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2023-12-21 16:11:20', '2023-12-21 16:11:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130671013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060480124', 'Wendy Summerfield', NULL, '12/21/23: Mbr wanted to know if mammography was covered under her plan, explained to her that it was not unfortunately. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2023-12-21 15:36:41', '2023-12-21 15:36:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130671008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273746', 'David Peck', NULL, '12/21/23: Mbr called in to mention how she had to be hospitalized after having a bad reaction to a knee surgery she had 10 days ago. The sharing request was shared by Zion for the total knee replacement, But mbr called in mentioning that she had gotten a bill for $4k and that she got a letter saying something along the lines Planstin Covered half and she owed the balance which confused her. Told her more research would need to be done on this at this time and will follow up with her tomorrow, encouraged her to call zions ongoing share department as well. WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2023-12-21 15:35:57', '2023-12-21 15:35:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130665033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810847', 'Sally Hammond', NULL, '12-21-23 Sally called because she has a new need and was being told by Redirect that she doesn''t have coverage for imaging, etc. She was in a panic this morning but starting to piece it together. I explained that she is protected with her membership for that with Sedera. She can call the MPB Concierge Team to find a better place for imaging. She learned that in the hospital it''s $1200 or at the ONLY other place it''s cheaper which is an hour away. She''s waiting to do that for when she can get in next week. I told her she doesn''t have to wait but that''s what''s she''s planned at this point. Redirect also told her she has to get it pre-approved which isn''t true either. She feels much better and feels embarrassed that she didn''t remember everything. I told her that''s why we have the MPB Concierge Team to rely upon. She knows how to create the Need with Sedera bc she did it a year ago for Pete. She''ll try starting that now.  She was very appreciative and I let her know to call me still with questions, if she has more.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-21 15:22:24', '2023-12-21 15:22:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130669041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070067085', 'Kayla Boettcher', NULL, '12.21.2023 Kayla called back for a follow up re: the 3D mammogram. Her doc is recommending it. She wants to have all her ducks in a row before her appointment tomorrow.
We did a 3-way call with Planstin to get more clarification and guidance on her options, given that her doctor is considering it as preventative.
We spoke with William at Planstin, and he double checked on the guidelines. and he confirmed that the 3D will be considered diagnostic. He went through the process on how to submit it as an appeal:
1-It will get rejected
2-Doctor will appeal it via strong verbiage in a letter, explaining how it is STILL PREVENTATIVE, but is needed due to ....x, y, z.
3-Submit the letter to Planstin, William was sure to not bring Kayla''s hopes up by saying this is not a promised share afterwards.

Kayla is concerned of having a large bill in the end. She''s decided to cancel her appointment tomorrow, she is having her annual physical next week, so she will discuss it then with that doctor for extra guidance.  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-21 15:14:53', '2023-12-21 16:29:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130661044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087734002', 'Jocelyn Luhr', NULL, '12.21.23:  Texted Jocelyn to alert her Patti sent her an email re: her credit card was declined and she''d need to make pmt. by the 25th of the month to avoid a $25 late fee.  She texted me thanking me for reaching out and informing me she deposited money in her account and to have Patti re-run her card.  I relayed the message to Patti and asked her to let me know if she was going to run the card again.  I texted Jocelyn telling her I''m waiting for a response  from Patti.  Jocelyn is taking her partner to the Mayo Clinic in Jacksonville to have surgery for esophageal cancer.
Patti messaged me she will re-run the card on Tuesday, 12.26.23 and I mentioned Jocelyn should not be penalized with a $25 late fee.
I texted Jocelyn Patti will run her card on 12.26.23.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-12-21 14:25:10', '2023-12-21 14:46:15'),
