  ('zcrm_1579374000130649092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109496027', 'Stephen Osteen', NULL, 'Cancelled eff 12/31/23', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-21 13:09:03', '2023-12-21 13:09:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130665023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131819010', 'Marni Shymkus', NULL, '12-21-23 I received an email today that she had emailed me on the 18th asking to move forward with the enrollment. I never rec''d the email! They want a Jan. 1st start date. Ugh! I called her twice today to see if I can help her enroll and possibly get the desired start date. Not sure. She responded via email to enroll when she''s available on her own. I let her know it will be easiest to allow me to walk her through the enrollment process if we can connect.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-21 12:57:45', '2023-12-21 12:57:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130665018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131819010', 'Marni Shymkus', NULL, '12-11-23 Marni is 58 and Vincent 57 and kids are 19 and 21. They are current Sedera members now and Cloud Medical. They are interested in creating a group with 2 employees in the future. They have Jane who coming on board in mid-Jan and is currently 27 and FTE.  They might have  a 3 month waiting period before offering benefits. She was also interested in adding payroll with compliance. I sent her back to Kirk for payroll but apparently Gusto is no longer working with such small businesses. Marni said they like to do their wellness screenings, blood tests, etc. when needed. They like the idea of HSA as well. She prefers SECURE for the HSA or CARE+ since they have Cloud for their other wellness stuff.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-21 12:54:26', '2023-12-21 12:54:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130649084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109496027', 'Stephen Osteen', 'Decline of 1/24 Share Amount', '1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm - 12/21 (O)
I spoke to member and he said that he now had benefits thru his spouse and wanted to cancel.  I directed him to the cancellation and he will fill out.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-21 12:53:28', '2023-12-21 12:59:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130671003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125254010', 'Francoise Bunnell', NULL, '12/21/23- Mbr called in for proof of coverage as her husband was applying for a new job and needed a membership id to complete it, went ahead and told her she would need to speak to planstin in order to make-  WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2023-12-21 12:29:44', '2023-12-21 12:29:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130669027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080704002', 'Tom Weiss', NULL, '12.21.2023 12.21.2023 Called Melissa to discuss her options and ask her the above questions, but ended up leaving her a VM.
***************************************************************************************
I did not hear back from Melissa, so I generated the below and sent it to her:
Hello Melissa,

I hope this email finds you well.
Today I called you regarding this medication, to give you some extra information. I''ll go ahead and put it here for you to delve into. The information is regarding the medicine below:
WEGOVY:  • 0.25MG/0.5 • PEN INJCTR • 
ZEPBOUND: • 2.5 MG/0.5 • PEN INJCTR • 

After running the information in 10 sites, the medication Wegovy comes up really expensive. I did go ahead and clip you a few coupons as options that were the least expensive. Some with more dosages.
Our international shopper does not source this medication, yet. We will keep trying him, if you request this medication again. Maybe we will get lucky, and he then will start sourcing it. 
        When I was running your prescription quote, I noticed the Wegovy is used for weight management.  Although I do not know if that''s what you are using it for, but there''s language in the Zion guidelines that could be shareable.
Here is the verbiage I found in their guidelines as of 12.21.2023. I never save their guidelines, because they change, so this is straight off their site (https://zionhealthshare.org/member-guidelines/).

"43.Weight Reduction Beginning in the second year of membership, expenses related to weight reduction are shareable if prescribed by a licensed medical provider and approved by Zion HealthShare, up to $3,000 per sharing request. 

M E D I C A L E X P E N S E S I N E L I G I B L E F O R S H A R I N G The Zion HealthShare medical cost sharing community chooses not to share in some medical expenses. Decisions for sharing eligibility are made to benefit all members by keeping monthly contributions low and sharing in medical expenses based on our Principles of Membership. The following expenses are excluded from sharing with the Zion HealthShare community."
The below prices are as of today 12.21.2023:
WEGOVY:  • 0.25MG/0.5 • PEN INJCTR • 
King Soopers = $350 for 1 syringe 
King Soopers = $1292.16 for 4 syringes
