  ('zcrm_1579374000130564042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130526392', 'Brianna Krampetz', NULL, '12-20-23 See notes from Isaiah Burdon''s account. They are trying to put a deposit down for a loan and trying to find a way to give the $ to Isaiah to use for a down payment. Brianna has $30K but  credit issues at the moment. He has good credit. They wanted to open an IUL and pull the available cash value right away but the funds need to remain for 1 year.  They want to fund it $300-$500 a month from running the business. But, until they have that in operation it''s tough to guarantee they will have that money at first. I suggested they open a business bank account where she deposits the $30K into and then uses a portion of that for the deposit that they want for the loan.  She will ponder that idea.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-20 18:02:37', '2023-12-20 18:02:37'),
