  ('zcrm_1579374000130531036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026391226', 'Pam Buderus', NULL, '12/20/23: Pam called needing to submit a need. She''s submitted a need before, so I led her to the "Member Portals" section of website, and instructed her to submit her bills through her Zion Member Portal. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-12-20 10:42:25', '2023-12-20 10:42:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130557013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118975002', 'Laura Pascoe', NULL, '12/20/23: mbr sent an email wanting to cancel, walked her through how to do it since they had gotten a traditional insurance and its close to the deadline, was guided to cancel in this situation as opposed to go through the normal advisor contact process. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2023-12-20 10:41:04', '2023-12-20 10:41:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130557008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116120018', 'David Cole', NULL, '12/20/23: Reached back out to mbr and explained what to expect when enrolling a child after the 30 day timeframe and the 6 month waiting period regarding immunizations etc. Member was forgoing immunizations anyways so it wasn''t an issue, helped walk through filling the form and confirmed they hit save and submit prior to the deadline today.- WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2023-12-20 10:40:12', '2023-12-20 10:40:12'),
