  ('zcrm_1579374000130513004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128921001', 'Jenna Sezionale Basilicato', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-12-20 10:33:18', '2023-12-20 10:33:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130516088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061522092', 'Nancy Allawos', NULL, '12.20.2023 had the colon - they pulled a VERY TINY polyp. Doctor was pleased and not worried about anything. NOT SENDING it in for biopsy.
Nancy wanted to know how to proceed. USUALLY when polyps are pulled it is automatically diagnostic. HOWEVER in this situation, a conversation with the doctor is in order to clarify if it is still indeed preventative or do we move forward with a diagnostic coding for coverage.
Nancy will call us back to confirm, and we will provide her what either steps needed. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-20 10:30:17', '2023-12-20 15:45:53'),
