  ('zcrm_1579374000130531003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114148002', 'Danielle Carnett', NULL, '12/20/23: Danielle called regarding previous chat question. She had an annual gynecological exam and needed direction on how to handle bills. The exam was preventive. But during the exam, they found reason for concern, performed ultrasound, and Danielle ended up having outpatient surgery to remove fibroids. 
