  ('zcrm_1579374000130399023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116120018', 'David Cole', NULL, '12/19/23: David called to enroll his child but mentioned to me they were born. Told me she was born 9/7/23, I wanted to make sure I was guiding the member accurately as it was outside of the 30 day timeframe. Was told by Cari we would want to check with Patti to find out more for this particular situation. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2023-12-19 14:28:33', '2023-12-19 14:28:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130385165', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111239002', 'Lois Hurst', NULL, '12/19/23: Lois called with questions regarding plan:
