  ('zcrm_1579374000130386243', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080094002', 'Theresa Stratton', 'Previous Membership', '12/1/2021-7/31/2022', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-19 13:19:35', '2023-12-19 13:19:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130439018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543087', 'Tania Dibbs', NULL, '12-19-2023:  Nahla is pasting this for me since I do not have CRM access currently.
Tania called.  She''s had horrible experiences w/her Planstin ''prev care'' in Basalt, CO.  Wendy tried last yr to get a listed PHCS office to work w/Tania & it got so bad, Wendy told her to go somewhere else this year.  Wendy asked me to try to help.
     - Tania has a Jan appt w/a new gyno doc.  We decided she will call & ask them to conf they will bill Planstin for her.  She called back & they will not.  [Not 100% sure Tania is hearing me when I tell her what to ask, but she says she is.]
     - I found one gyno doc in Aspen, showing in the PHCS search tool.  Tania is going to call their off to see if they are still in the ''PHCS Network'' & will bill her ''prev care'' for her:  Zahedi-Spung, Leilah D, MD  Maternal & Fetal Medicine, Obstetrics, & Gynecology  401 Castle Creek Rd, Ste 2400B, Aspen, CO  81611  970-925-9480.  I was extremely specific on what to say:  "Ask if this doctor is still a part of the PHCS Network.  If so, let them know you have ''prev care'' cov thru the PHCS Network & would like to make sure they will bill for you (They will not recognize Planstin = the Administrator).  Hopefully, she heard me & will say the correct things.  She''s pretty stuck on calling it Planstin insurance.     - CA', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-19 13:15:07', '2023-12-19 13:15:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130439013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124507177', 'Lisa Triepke', NULL, '12.19.2023 Wants to cancel today....needed to call back....while waiting for her call back, I messaged Wendy. She was expecting me to transfer her when she did call back, but Angee picked up and connected with Wendy instead.
Sounds like Lisa is taken care of, with the plan she found that suits her financial situation, will come back when her finances are in a better place. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-19 13:14:42', '2023-12-19 13:14:42'),
