  ('zcrm_1579374000130444018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124507177', 'Lisa Triepke', NULL, '12-19-23 Lisa is cancelling now. She''s getting a good sized subsidy now since she''s not really working right now and may not work for a year or so. She was super nice! She may come back to us.  She really likes what we are doing and super appreciates our product and service. She wants to write a nice review for me as well which I told her to just send me an email and I''ll document it that way. We should have a way to provide a review of each Advisor.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-19 11:55:36', '2023-12-19 11:55:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130385117', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130421011', 'Shane Mellin', NULL, '12-19-23 Enrolled Shane and wife Caitlin to Secure HSA, $1000 IUA
Both are smokers
