She had bursitus in the shoulder.

Wants to add employees next year.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2023-12-19 11:54:32', '2023-12-19 11:54:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130385112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104633001', 'Cathy Gibbons', NULL, '12/19/23: Cathy called. Going in for annual screening, and wanted to make sure she covered all her bases.
- We checked each provider on the multiplan site. Doctor, Imaging and Lab
- Informed her that planstin only seems to be covering the standard lipid panel so if the doc orders any extra labs to have the bill split, and call us back so we can help find discounts. 
- She asked if the words "preventive" and "screening" were interchangeable. I told her I don''t think so, bc you can also have a "diagnostic screening" and to use the verbiage "preventive" when discussing services with providers.
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-12-19 11:50:52', '2023-12-19 11:50:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130386213', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130449002', 'Kara Cannon', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-19 11:48:07', '2023-12-19 11:48:07'),
