  ('zcrm_1579374000130386203', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130446002', 'Sarah Downs', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-19 11:40:02', '2023-12-19 11:40:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130385104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124507177', 'Lisa Triepke', NULL, '12/19/23: Lisa called to cancel, and requested cancellation link via email. She was in a hurry, at the airport, rushing the conversation - so I didn''t question her too much. Sent her form link via email. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-12-19 11:39:53', '2023-12-19 11:46:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130386198', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088965002', 'Robert Houvener', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment Update Form.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-19 11:23:12', '2023-12-19 11:23:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130385094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118537002', 'Laina Kenyon', NULL, '12/19/23: Laina called, requesting info on how to submit a maternity sharing request with Zion. We reviewed Zion''s maternity guidelines, asking for financial package at first appointment, presenting as cash pay patient, and opening a maternity sharing request. 
She called back bc Zion had her name incorrect in their system (Laina Laina, instead of Laina Kenyon) They said we would need to submit a correction before she could continue. 
Cari submitting change request today. I left a vm with Laina informing her that it should all be corrected by Thursday or Friday.', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-12-19 11:15:04', '2023-12-19 11:15:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130418062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128923011', 'Robin Vise', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-12-19 11:04:55', '2023-12-19 11:04:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130439008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128791002', 'Holly Hoxie', NULL, '12-18-2023:  Holly sent over 9 drugs on an RX Quote!  It was a ton of work, but I sent her the best options for her to decide how she''d like to handle.  Safeway (her req''d pharmacy was not badly priced, but was considerably more exp than Walmart.  Plus, it looks like she''s been limited by "ins" to qtys of #30 on 6 maint type items, so I did price #90 of ea of those if she''s interested.  Saves her considerable amts:
     Safeway = $73.75 with #90 ($71.21 savings compared to #30)
     Walmart = $65.71 with #90 ($46.10 savings compared to #30)
 
     With the above, adding these 2 items ("as needed" items):
     Buspirone 10mg, #30
     Trazodone 100mg, #30
Added to the above quoted prices:
Safeway = $65.05 with the #30 quantity above + these two items
               $90.48 if you choose the #90 on the first items
Walmart = $44.15 with the #30 quantity above + these two items
$72.59 for quantity of #90 on the first items.
 
     Last item:
     Budesonide/Formoterol 160mcg/4.5mcg, #1 inhaler.  
          I found discount coupons locally, but 1 inhaler at Safeway is $70.32 and Walmart is
               quite expensive at $105.74.
         Our international shopper can source this inhaler for $52.51     - CA', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-19 10:39:29', '2023-12-19 10:39:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130418052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130236002', 'Tilio Lagatta', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call after start date of January 1, 2024. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-12-19 10:32:36', '2023-12-19 10:32:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130444003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001653225', 'Isabelle Peyrichoux', NULL, '12-18-23 Thank you, Wendy for all this info and your responsiveness. I really appreciate.

Finances are very tight at the moment and I don’t have any pre-existing conditions. I also know that I’d be covered in France if something happens. I need to cut expenses wherever I can at the moment (at least for 3 months), so I prefer to cancel right now. If I end up staying in the US, I''ll probably use MPowering Benefits again.

Here is what I said in my cancellation form: (I mean it!)

Would you Refer Anyone to MPowering Benefits? If NO, Why?
Yes. and Wendy Scipione is awesome! I very highly recommend her. She is responsive, supportive, transparent. She is great.

Wishing you a fabulous holiday season!

Isabelle 

Isabelle may only be gone for 3 months or she may stay in France longer term. She''s not sure yet. But, she needs to save money for now, per above.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-19 10:28:31', '2023-12-19 10:28:31'),
