  ('zcrm_1579374000130399018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105619010', 'Emmalynn Ibrahim', NULL, '12/19/23: Mbr called in and wanted us to look up discounts for Flexeril 10mg, 30 tabs. Ideal publix pharmacy. Not sure if I have permissions to send rx discounts so had mbr fill out the time and will check with cari or Nahla once they come in to see if they would like to complete it or if I can.-WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2023-12-19 09:24:30', '2023-12-19 09:24:30'),
