  ('zcrm_1579374000130399013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079839002', 'Richard Goecke', NULL, '12/19/23- Mbr called in and mentioned how he wanted to have a penile implant as he was having impotence from a procedure that he had related to prostate cancer in 2020, told the mbr we would need to do some research before providing him an answer, will follow up with Cari. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2023-12-19 09:00:29', '2023-12-19 09:00:29'),
