  ('zcrm_1579374000130399008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109378002', 'Jean-Guy Ricard', NULL, '12/19/23: Jean-Guy called in saying he had a fall and wasn''t sure how to submit a sharing request. Explained to him how he would need to most likely create his mbr portal through zion, mbr is still in hospital and working from his mobile phone at the time. Also suggested if he had someone from home who could help him as well with submitting the share request once he''s created the mbr portal. -WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2023-12-19 08:07:02', '2023-12-19 08:07:02'),
