  ('zcrm_1579374000130385008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029894103', 'Deborah Doolittle', NULL, '12/19/23: Deborah called. She is sick, and her teledoc service isn''t working. According to old plans spreadsheet all members regardless of when they started now have CirrusMD. I sent her an email with CirrusMD registration info.
- Deborah was unaware of the pieces of her plan as I was discussing it with her, and asked if I could send an overview to her. Getting with Patti to make sure I include the right info. 
- We briefly discussed updating her plan to a newer option. She is interested and asked if we could send her some info about the newer plans. She doesn''t intend to make any changes this month, but maybe after Christmas. 
- Her daughter ended up taking company insurance and will not be using MPB.
- Called back to see if CirrusMD worked for her, and it did. She was able to register, talk to someone and get a prescription.
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-12-19 07:41:07', '2023-12-19 08:39:43'),
