  ('zcrm_1579374000130386003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108294010', 'Christopher Kelly', NULL, 'I received VM from Karen asking if this member could be reinstated and now wants to change his membership.  I will reactivate and advised that I would have to received the Change form today 12/19.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-19 07:10:23', '2023-12-19 07:10:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130353076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059893179', 'Brian Cosner', NULL, '12-18-2023:  Nahla is pasting all of this for me & sending a ''Welcome Call'' invite to Brian because I do not curr have access to the CRM:
     - Brian has had our Care+ plan for several years, had several hosp & surgeries, yet never utilized the community.  I offered for him to finally have his ''Welcome Call'' & let him know afterwards, to call us for help.
     - He kept wanting an ID card to present when he goes into the hosp, etc.  I tried mult times to explain how to present, but he''s adamant he wants a card since he "used to have one".  I let him know people presenting a card was causing issues, so they no longer send cards & went over exactly what to do:
        No to "ins", No to having a card to present, ''cash-pay'', ask for ''cash-pay'' disc, SAVE all det inv & pymt rec & we have 6-mos deadline to be careful of, resp for 1k per ''issue'' (tried to explain:  ER, then follow-up = same ''issue''.  ''Issue'' specific.  Not a "ded" as he kept calling it.
     - He finally just decided he will start w/his call & we can go from there.  I''m going to send this to Vanessa so she knows some of the items (like wanting a card as a ''Care+'' member.     - CA', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-18 18:18:50', '2023-12-18 18:18:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130353066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108424009', 'Kathleen Mendenhall', NULL, '12-18-2023:  Nahla is pasting this for me since I curr do not have access to the CRM.
Kathleen called.  We had some phone issues & in the middle of our conv she could no longer hear me.  She called back & we did fine.
 
She wanted to make sure she doesn''t need to do anything to make sure he "ins" renews.  I explained this isn''t "ins", so it will continue unless she cancels.
 
She''s on Care+, so we disc that even if she rec''s notice from Zion about a price increase, she''s grandfathered in on her plan w/us until her Sept 2024 draw date for her Oct mo contribution.
 
