  ('zcrm_1579374000130353061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118397002', 'Theresa Crecelius', NULL, '12.18.2023 Theresa called to learn how to get reimbursed for her prev annual wellness physical. I guided her with the steps with Zion for the prev care in the Direct plan, gave her their number and steps to move forward with and language to use.
