  ('zcrm_1579374000130353048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044406111', 'Chadd Ziegler', NULL, '12-18-2023:  Nahla is pasting this for me because I don''t have CRM access curr.
     Chadd called.  He needs to work w/Sedera on an MRI, Urg Care, etc.  He was in a garage &amp; a bit diff to hear, but I was able to give him their # &amp; he''ll call when he''s in a better place.  I let him know if he has prob, plez connect w/us again, but they are generally really good at holding people''s hands thru the process.     CA', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-18 16:41:22', '2023-12-18 16:41:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130353035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110078001', 'Carleigh Fairchild', NULL, '12.18.2023 Carleigh called to cancel her membership. Attempted to move through the requested process to connect her with her advisor, but Diane was not available. To avoid Carleigh from cancelling without speaking to Diane, I gave her Diane''s number for her to try to reach tomorrow. 
