  ('zcrm_1579374000130353018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081634027', 'Julia Bolz', NULL, '12.18.2023 Julie called wanting to learn how to proceed for coverage for the alternative therapy. She has not used the services before and wants to make sure she''s taking the right steps. She''s been going to see a naturopath for 6 weeks now, has had a couple of tests run: Lead, Mercury toxicity in her. Doing a detox. Hormone levels are not showing up right, now on hormone treatment/supplement and IV once a month. Seeking coverage for naturopath appointments,  4-5 worth of tests, and supplements and IV.
She''s close to fulfilling her IUA, $1000. Will collect all her paperwork, and call on Wednesday to proceed to speaking with Zion. Her initial visit was 11/6/2023. Labs were done a month before, 10/9/2023 per the doctor''s request. Spoke with Cari on the above and receive corroboration in how to proceed. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-18 15:24:36', '2023-12-18 16:50:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130359023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130373002', 'Lisa Wiesen', NULL, '12-18-23 Lisa and Kurt are enrolling now in SECURE HSA $710/$1000, $125, $25 with Schaana Wetzelberger referring them. Enrolled for Jan. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-18 15:12:08', '2023-12-18 15:17:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130334178', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088965002', 'Robert Houvener', NULL, '12/18/23: Robert called wanting to change his payment info or possibly pause services due to lack of funds. He decided on updating his credit card so I sent an update link. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-12-18 14:55:02', '2023-12-18 14:55:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130359018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044406111', 'Chadd Ziegler', NULL, '12-18-23 Chadd called bc he needs help uploading his bills for reimbursement. He had an issue in Oct. that he''s ready to submit. He now says Urgent was about about $200 (above says $165 but probably just rounding up), MRI was $650 and Dr visit to read the MRI was $450. So, he''ll need reimbursement for about $300. He didn''t get good help the first time he called for assistance in creating the new Need. So, he''s going to try calling again now with the MPB Concierge Team. He''ll let me know if he still doesn''t receive the proper guidance.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-18 14:29:29', '2023-12-18 14:29:29'),
