     - Walked him thru req an invite to create his Zion Memb Port. 
     - How & what to submit on that portal as a ''sharing req''.  He will get everything together & let us know if he has further questions.
     - His memb just started in March 2023, so we did discuss pre-x.  He checked the last time he had kidney stones & it 4+ yrs ago.  I sugg he get his doc''s records, but he doesn''t have a PCP, so at least he''s aware they may ask questions about this.
