  ('zcrm_1579374000130224035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105906002', 'Derick Brooks', NULL, '12.15.2023 Derick called to learning how to proceed with getting covered for seeing a hematologist, due to the high platelet count his doctor learned of during his annual phys in october.  
