  ('zcrm_1579374000130138023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066564305', 'Robert Mitchell', NULL, '12-13-23 I cancelled their Anthem plan on C4 for 12/31/23 even though it likely auto cancels since it already showed as that end date. Rob cancelled auto billing. So, they should be good to go for 2024.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-13 11:56:07', '2023-12-13 11:56:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130121018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115994009', 'Patrick Graue', NULL, '12/13/23: Mbrs mother called in with a few basic membership questions and how to cancel. -WU', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', '2023-12-13 11:54:02', '2023-12-13 11:54:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130138018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010282133', 'Susan Atchison', NULL, '12-13-23 Called to find out more about her struggles with the wellness. There are no records from Zion, Planstin or MPB of her calls to get the wellness covered. So, they can''t reimburse her since there''s no record of any calls. Need to find out if she called from another phone number or what happened? She was meeting with a staff member and will call me back.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-13 11:52:20', '2023-12-13 11:52:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130138013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109357023', 'Mark FARR', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 1/1/24 citing the fact that he will now be on the ACA.  Did not speak to L Jablonski.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-13 11:46:43', '2023-12-13 11:46:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130094082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128256003', 'Kathryn Miller', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-12-13 11:02:11', '2023-12-13 11:02:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130142003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128203001', 'Crystal Kulpcavage', NULL, '12.13.2023 Thank you for your patience on your NP Thyroid RX coupon requests.
I searched high and low for your preferred pharmacy to show up as contracted with any of the sites and medication, but it did not show up at all.
Presently, I was able to find you two coupons at Walgreens, to be the least expensive for both medications. I attempted to search in the Cost-Plus Drug site, since it is a mail order platform (per your request), however this medication is not showing up in their system. Instead, I went ahead and contacted our international shopper to see what options you might have. I will forward you what they share. If you choose to proceed with them, you''ll need to connect with them with the information that I will share with you in the next email, should they be able to source it. They are pretty quick at responding, but you just need to make the time for mailing and delivery. It is a smooth process.

Below are the prices as of today 12.13.2023 in the zip code area, 19610.

Walgreens - NP Thyroid
30 MG • QTY 156 • Tablet • 90 Days (Take 2 tablets Monday through Friday, and 1 tablet on Saturday and Sunday) = $133.30
15 MG • QTY 26 • Tablet • 90 Days (Take 1 tablet on Saturday and Sunday (along with a 30mg)) = $12.55

In the meantime, please let us know if you would like anything adjusted or changed. If you have any questions re: the numbers generated for the amount, please connect with us. We are here at the concierge line M-F, 9-8 EST.', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-13 10:56:35', '2023-12-13 10:56:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130138008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118196002', 'Brian Gould', NULL, '12-13-23 Brian apologized profusely for basically ghosting me after spending so much time helping him. His boss'' son helped him instead to work with Kaiser and get it set up how he needed with their company and for his insulin. He greatly appreciated all of my help and will happily refer me to any other friends or employees of the company he works for. I helped him cancel MPB since we can''t get insulin and the additional products a good deals anymore.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-13 10:55:10', '2023-12-13 10:55:10'),
