  ('zcrm_1579374000130060033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, '12.12.2023 Maurine called to get some clarification on how to submit a sharing request to Zion since the one she attempted was not approved. She''s been getting checked for a node on her thyroid - also referring to it as a goiter. She initially had it checked out a while ago, via sonogram, but never submitted the invoice, cz she was not expecting it to grow and be where it is today. Therefore that invoice, as she recently learned, is not shareable due to the date. Presently she''s been seeing an endocrinologist, and she is getting invoiced. Supplements are in the invoice. After speaking to Maurine, I recommended that she request from her physician to separate the supplements from the invoice, so Zion does not look at those for sharing.
I consulted with Cari, via teams, and she concurred with the thought, and added that when it comes to the thyroid, it could be considered maintenance or an issue. 
I mentioned that to Maurine and she confirmed that it is definitely NOT MAINTENANCE, they are trying to cure Maurine by treating the goiter to dissipate it.
Presently Maurine will be connecting with her provider to see how to separate the supplements from the invoices, reach her IUA, and possible add the labs she had work done for this specific issue. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-12 16:28:14', '2023-12-12 16:58:28'),
