  ('zcrm_1579374000130066033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073598040', 'Jennifer Hushka', NULL, '12-12-23 Gregg has alztheimer''s and is now in some type of assisted living. Jennifer had to take over their investment accounts and they were having huge capital gains tax implications. Now, they changed who they''re working with and only showing about $67K in income for 2023. Jennifer will call her dr. to find out if she''s in the Cigna Connect Plan and/or Anthem. She knows she has to decide by Friday. She might want Cigna Connect Flex 0 or Anthem plan that she has now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-12 15:52:32', '2023-12-12 16:14:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130066028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026447189', 'David Naber', NULL, '12-12-23 Rebecca Zweig has strep this year which turned into sepsis and caused hearing loss and then she got shingles because they gave her the wrong medication. It took her too long to get the bills from Boulder Medical Hospital so the costs were not shared after she spent endless hours gathering the bills and the same for Lab Corp. So, she feels like she wants it to be simple and doesn''t want to worry about the cost when going to the hospital or dr. Dave has gout that''s returned from many, many years ago now. Their daughter has ADHD and may need a child pyschologist, meds and she needs to do a test at Children''s Hospital for a heart arythmia and possibly needs OT. She spoke with a Kaiser person who quoted her $900 for a Gold Kaiser plan with income at $120K as best guess. We''ll compare the C4 options with their current membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-12 15:09:51', '2023-12-12 15:09:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130035036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109191001', 'Karl Lawfer', NULL, '12/12/23: Lori called asking if plan auto renews each year, or if they need to re-enroll. I told her it is rolling, no enrollment is necessary. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-12-12 14:26:07', '2023-12-12 14:26:26'),
