  ('zcrm_1579374000130011108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026447189', 'David Naber', NULL, 'Member called in and told me she is "shopping" the insurance around and what would be the procedure on how to cancel.  I told her to be in touch with Wendy and got pushback about this.  I told her that Wendy might have other options for her but she was not open to that.  Wanted to know website /instructions for filling out the form.  I also gave her Wendy''s contact #', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-12 12:37:10', '2023-12-12 12:37:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130017122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078638002', 'Claudia Nanino', NULL, '12/12/23: Mbr called in at her obgyn getting ready to have a wellness womans visit and wasn''t sure how to bill for it as she didn''t have the Planstin card. Gave her their number and informed her they can bill that visit directly to Planstin and anything preventative would be paid for. -WU', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', '2023-12-12 12:33:49', '2023-12-12 12:33:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130017117', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032244040', 'Michael Forakis', NULL, '12/12/23- Mbr called in wanting to know how he can submit a sharing request. Explained his Iua and the amount and if he had expenses exceeding, he would be able to submit to zion, mbr mentioned having prostate cancer and ongoing treatment for that. Told him for something like that he can submit what he already has and start a sharing request and add onto it as he mentioned needing further care that should take him over that IUA. -WU', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', '2023-12-12 12:32:19', '2023-12-12 12:32:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130060018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105229010', 'Michael LeWinter', NULL, '12.12.2023 Called Michael to follow up on how his interaction with CareConnect went, since my last inquiry with CareConnect''s representative, Jaime Anderson, re: his surgery on 12/16/2023.
