  ('zcrm_1579374000130017112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104457002', 'Normandie Rainwater', NULL, '12/12/23: Mbr called in and mentioned that she had some more bills in part of an ongoing sharing request that had been approved back in june of this year but when she would go to upload on zions mbr portal she got an error saying something was pending her action but we couldn''t see what it was. Informed her that in this case she should reach out to zion healths sharing request department as she wants to add on to that existing need already and to call back if that wasn''t helpful. -WU', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', '2023-12-12 12:30:15', '2023-12-12 12:30:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130035026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122995002', 'Erland Slorer', NULL, '12/12/23: Member''s mother called asking to cancel on her son''s behalf. I guided her to where the update form is on mbp website. She said he needs coverage through January 6th, so I advised for him to notate that as his effective date of cancellation when filling out the form. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-12-12 12:22:47', '2023-12-12 12:22:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000130060013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128916028', 'Trevon Stoltzfus', NULL, '12.12.2023 Trevon called to learn when his plan takes in effect, and what to do/how to proceed towards pain in his shoulder, with a friend who is a physical therapist.
