  ('zcrm_1579374000129972079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120745009', 'Diane Sadowski', NULL, '12.11.2023 Diane, 

I''m sorry to hear the Care+ Plan, it''s guidelines, what is and is not covered hasn''t been explained in depth for you.

It sounds like a conversation with your Advisor Louis Spatafore is the place to start.  A conversation with him prior to purchasing this type of plan is quite important.  Here is his contact information:

Louis Spatafore    (304) 276-7246     louspatafore@wle-secure-email.com

This plan is wonderful.  However, healthsharing functions in a very different manner than traditional "health insurance".  That''s why it''s so important to have contact with your advisor prior to purchasing, so you can make an educated decision on whether this is a good for you.

The next step would be to have your ''Welcome Call'' with MPB.  In your original confirmation e-mail, it gives how to schedule your call.  It''s been a while ago though, so I resent you the invitation link earlier today.

The ''Welcome Call'' helps our members with a good foundation of understanding.

Regarding chiropractic care:

Chiropractic care, for an ongoing medical need or sharing request, will be considered on a prior authorization basis.  Submitting a ''treatment plan'' with your ''sharing request'' is how Zion looks at those items.  They do have a maximum limit for the request but will go over that with you.

If they pre-approve the chiropractic care (because it is a proven, less invasive option), you are still responsible for your IUA (Initial Unshared Amount) for the ''issue''.

General chiropractic maintenance is not a covered item.

Once you''ve spoken to your advisor and had your MPB ''Welcome Call'', I think you should have a better idea of what our Care+ Plan''s benefits are.

Please do reach out to us, as your first stop, when you are ready to use the plan for any services, to make sure you''re guided on the right path.

Nahla Tebcherany
MPB Health
Concierge Consultant
800-519-2969', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-11 17:34:12', '2023-12-11 17:34:12'),
