  ('zcrm_1579374000129972064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080107001', 'Lorna Mulkey', NULL, '12-8-2023:  I do not curr have access to the CRM, so Nahla is posting this for me.  

 Lorna submitted an RX Quote req.  She asked for 45mg Armour Thyroid, which the manufacturer does not make.  Sent her an e-mail asking if she takes 1/2 of a 90mg tab, or maybe 1 x 15gm & 1 x 30gms?
 
