12-11-2023:  Lorna wrote back that she gets #15, of the 90mg tabs at Costco for $72 & wants to know why we are not competitive.  Here is my response:
 
"Mon 12/11/2023 2:17 PM
Hi Lorna,
 
You requested a 90-day supply on the form (as I''m understanding it), which is a quantity of #45.
 
Costco can sometimes supply their members with better pricing than we can find.  If we take your $24 for #15 tabs x 3 (=a quantity of #45), you are paying $72.  I''m glad you have that available to you.
 
I recently checked with our international shopper on this ''BRAND name'' item and his prices were higher than anything I was able to find (= the prices I''ve listed below).
 
It looks like on this prescription the best we can do is come within 0.85-cents of what you are paying at Costco.   That''s unusual but does happen on rare occasions.
 
Let me know if you have questions or would like a coupon for one of the options I listed below, should that be more convenient for you.
 
Respectfully yours,
 
Cari Adams-Waneka
MPB Health Concierge
