Hi Lorna,
 
It''s never a waste of time.  Generally, we have great success.  Thyroid prescriptions are one of the touchier items.  Then, take into consideration that people find specific brands that work best for them (for whatever reason, thyroid medications are not as easy to go to generics on) and that''s why it''s so expensive.
 
When I ran the quotes, I had to be careful to make sure I stayed with the brand.  Generics were around $22 for a 90-day supply, if I''m remembering correctly.
 
