  ('zcrm_1579374000129838082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129962046', 'Julie Thomas', NULL, '12-7-23 Julie is 51 and was referred by Nancy Gentry. She left her employment in Oct and is starting her own biz.  She just needs this for herself, not for her son. She watched the video. She wants wellness and HSA, no pre-x, no tobacco. Takes SSRI meds as anti-depressant but is weaning off of it a little bit. She''s a therapist. She mostly just uses her healthcare for wellness visits. She''s interested in SECURE HSA $1000/$405, $2500/$360.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-08 18:13:03', '2023-12-08 18:13:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129838048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109790001', 'Justin Askins', NULL, '12-8-2023:  Walked William thru process for memb''s cancellation since no advisor.  He will call &amp; walk Justin thru the form.  Reminded William to mention deadline, so the mo draw is not pulled.  He said he''ll call &amp; go over w/memb.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-12-08 17:44:52', '2023-12-08 17:44:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129838043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106720002', 'Jessica Chariton', NULL, '12-8-2023:  Jessica called.  Her son hurt himself on the ski slope & the doc wants and MRI.  We went over how to present.  W/in about 1-1/2 h (they live in a tiny mtn comm) the hosp is where they can get that.  I sugg calling the MRI dept & let them know the doc is sending them.  Went over presenting as ''cash-pay'', ask for disc, no ID Cd, keep detailed inv & get pymt receipts.  Had to go over how the IUA works (she was thinking it was like a ded, but seemed to get w/some educ).  They are resp for $2500 on this ''issue'' so offer to pay some & ask them to bill balance.  She knows 6-mos deadline.  Sugg to call us as they find out how bad it is & we can help determine if time to sub ''sharing req'' w/in 4 mos of today.  She knows we are out for the weekend (since she called late on a Friday), but will call us next week if they need further assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-12-08 17:42:48', '2023-12-08 17:42:48'),
