  ('zcrm_1579374000129806027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105051010', 'Taher Sobhy', NULL, '12-7-2023:  Taher called.  He went to get his glasses & was told he has the beginning of cateracts.  Per Zion Memb Guidelines:

"9. Cataract Surgery
Cataract surgery is treated as a pre-membership medical condition and subject to a one-year 
waiting period before it is shareable. Each eye requires a separate sharing request and is 
subject to a separate IUA." =  2023 Guidelines

He had a ton of questions regarding the IUA.  Definitely did not understand how IUAs work.  We did a ton of education here & examples.     - CA

Advisor Karen Torsoe called & asked the guidelines on lower his IUA.  We went over 60-day eff date of chg before can sub any new ''sharing req'' to have new lower IUA (except on accidents), max 1x per yr = how often can change.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-12-07 11:56:01', '2023-12-08 17:58:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129802142', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130291039', 'Erica Henderson', NULL, '12-7-23 sent email F/U', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2023-12-07 11:54:39', '2023-12-07 11:54:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129802132', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129828002', 'Emma Donovan', NULL, '12-7-23 Called Emily, she''s ready to enroll at 2pm  pacific today.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2023-12-07 11:51:35', '2023-12-07 11:51:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129812003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041152148', 'Justin Acker', NULL, '12-7-23 Justin and Lindsey had questions about how to use their membership. They need to get Lindsey onto CirrusMD since she and the kids were added to the membership later. I gave them a review of how to use the wellness portion that''s separate from Sedera. I let them know about Life Care and they want to see if their child''s counselor will join the network. They asked about chiropractic care and I read to them the section from the current Sharing Guidelines which I''ll send to them. I''m not sure if we have a Quick Reference Guide for Sedera''s memberships to send. 
Crazy! Justin remembered my name from SSWSC when I coached. He coached in Vail for Battle Mountain Ski Team in late 90''s early, 2000''s at the same time. He asked Matt Redman why my name was familiar. Matt''name sounds familiar. But, Justin is friends with Teddy Bergland who was racing while I was coaching. Justin also went to Aspen for a while he said. But, he''s now in MI. Small world!!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-07 11:40:21', '2023-12-07 11:43:36'),
