  ('zcrm_1579374000129801097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126847002', 'Erik Pedersen', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-12-07 10:46:42', '2023-12-07 10:46:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129798041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090781002', 'Elsa Kelley', NULL, '12/7/23: Elsa called. Inquiring how to pay for visit to primary care physician to read a blood test. With her plan, I instructed that she is cash pay. Reminded her she could try cirrus MD and sent registration link. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-12-07 10:46:22', '2023-12-07 10:46:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129798036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074947065', 'Andrew Evans', NULL, '12.07.2023 Andrew badly wants to receive the RSV vaccine due to his upcoming travels and his daughter being pregnant with twins, and him not wanting to affect anyone. When he check on prices at Walgreens, they quoted him around $300. I recommended he try pharmacies other than Walgreens or CVS, as they tend to be the highest when we search for coupons.
We also 3-way called with Planstin asking if they have an insight as to when will they be able to cover the RSV Vaccine, spoke with Crystal who in turn consulted with the claims department, and came back with still not knowing when the vaccine will be covered. 
Andrew being concerned and softly adamant he asked if he could lobby for it and where could he send an email. Crystal offered him a planstin email he could send a request to.
He was still no appeased with the options delivered, even though it is out Planstin and MPB''s hands, so I offered to reach out to MPB member services and marketing to see if they can generate a request upon members'' behalf inquiring about the process and timeline of when the RSV vaccine would be considered part of the ACA guidelines for Planstin to cover. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-07 10:42:31', '2023-12-07 10:42:31'),
