  ('zcrm_1579374000129798026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093404002', 'Jordyn Abrams', NULL, '12/7/23: Jordyn called to see if a root canal would be covered. She needs it bc of an accident on an electric scooter. According to Zion guidelines, dental procedures caused from an accident may be considered. Suggested she submit the quotes and bills to Zion, and ask them directly. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-12-07 10:02:40', '2023-12-07 10:02:40'),
