  ('zcrm_1579374000129797021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122381001', 'Jesica Moore', NULL, '12/7/23: Mbr called in and asked how she would submit a sharing request, noticed she was a newer member so I explained how her IUA works and how she can submit a share request through zions member portal. Mbr hadn''t submitted a need before and has not created mbr portal, gave the phone number and instructions to request an invitation to her mbr portal. -WU', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', '2023-12-07 09:52:47', '2023-12-07 09:52:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129798021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037657007', 'Mary Evans', NULL, '12/7/23: Mary called, clarifying how to present for son''s upcoming wellness exam. She already made sure provider is in PHCS, knows to keep it preventive and have provider bill planstin. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-12-07 09:46:37', '2023-12-07 09:46:37'),
