  ('zcrm_1579374000129798016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062929191', 'Jerry Riechert', NULL, '12/7/23: Jerry called inquiring about registering for Cirrus MD. Sent over registration link and told him to reach out if he had any issues. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-12-07 09:26:24', '2023-12-07 09:26:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129802077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131819010', 'Marni Shymkus', NULL, '12-7-23: She answered with the following....
Hi Kirk!

We are interested in a small business group plan. My husband and I are owners of the company and work full-time (our company is an LLC) - we are currently using Sedera Health and a DPC practice (Cloud Medical in Longmont CO) - we live in Boulder CO. We are hiring our first full-time employee in January and we''re looking into health insurance options for all of us. We plan to hire 2 more full time employees this year. We would love to have an HSA plan as part of our group (we''ve used it the past, 10 years ago probably, and really liked this option). 

We have been researching outsourcing HR (payroll, benefits, compliance), but all of those companies, so far, only offer traditional health insurance plans. 

So, initially, 3 members:
Myself, 58 yo (Marni Shymkus)
Husband, 57 yo (Vincent Cobb)
Employee (Jane, approx 27yo) - she lives in Denver - she is a remote worker.

Vince and I would like a family plan (we have 2 college students, daughter 21, son 19).

Please let me know what else you need for an initial quote. We''d like to get an idea of the $ first, then will schedule a call.

Thank you!

Marni', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2023-12-07 09:16:48', '2023-12-07 09:16:48'),
