  ('zcrm_1579374000129806003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119797010', 'Ron Porter', NULL, 'Member called in and had many questions around logging into member portal.  Turns out he was logging into the Cirrus MD portal.  I stepped him through logging in to the portal where he could see his wife &amp; dependent.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-07 08:52:58', '2023-12-07 08:52:58'),
