  ('zcrm_1579374000129797013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129016002', 'Paige Anderson', NULL, '12/7/23- Reached out to the mbr and she answered. Did some basic member education and explained the differences between her Zion HealthShare and planstin. She asked if there were any discounts on dental services, mentioned to her that there are discounts on dental plans, and she could speak to her advisor about that. Mbr asked how she submitted a share request; told her she would need to call Zion to request a link to her mbr portal. Noticed at the end of our call that she had never had a welcome call, sent her the email and encouraged her to schedule this when she can. -WU', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', '2023-12-07 08:00:28', '2023-12-07 08:00:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129801016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129592283', 'Paige Merrifield', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-12-07 07:46:54', '2023-12-07 07:46:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129798003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125402002', 'Michael Kremic', NULL, '12/5/23: M&amp;SEAP called to confirm that Stephanie Barnier is a member. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-12-07 07:32:37', '2023-12-07 07:32:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129797003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080945002', 'Macay Hunter', NULL, '12/7/23: Reached out to mbr as he had missed one of his calls, upon answering I introduce myself him and ask what I may be able to assist with. Says he forgot, reminded him that I did call him back to confirm that his new twins were added to the plan as that was the last thing him and I spoke on. Mbr said he couldn''t remember what it was he was calling for and said he would call back should he remember. -WU', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', '2023-12-07 07:31:51', '2023-12-07 07:31:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129720084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063775002', 'Daniel Gutierrez', NULL, '12.06.2023  Martha emailed me inquiring about changing her IUA. I know that there are implications when the member LOWERS the IUA re: when it goes into affect and how it affects any large medical bills (accidents vs. non).
I consulted with Cari via Teams, and she shared the following language straight from Zion''s guidelines:
1-"Changing IUA Amounts Members may choose to change their IUA once per membership year. If an IUA is lowered, a 60-day waiting period will apply to all sharing requests other than those resulting from an accident"
2-"Required Documentation & Time Limit for Providing Documentation: In order to be eligible for sharing, sharing requests and each itemized bill and statement must be submitted within six months of the date of service. The IUA must also be paid within six months to be considered for sharing. When submitting a sharing request, members should submit any documentation received from their provider. Zion HealthShare may Zion HealthShare | MEMBER GUIDELINES ZIONHEALTHSHARE.ORG | (888) 920-9466 request additional documents that may be required throughout the sharing request process. Document types can include, but are not limited to, receipts, proofs of payment, itemized bills and statements. Original, itemized bills and statements should be submitted promptly to Zion HealthShare along with the sharing request form for us to process the sharing request as soon as possible. 
 
Please reference all applicable guidelines to determine if there are other document requirements or time limits. Meeting the IUA Medical expenses are only shareable after members have met their IUA. Members should provide documentation to Zion HealthShare of all payments that may contribute toward the member’s IUA. The IUA must be paid within six months of the date of service or bills may become ineligible for sharing. Consideration will be given for situations where the cost of treatment has not exceeded the IUA after six months for certain sharing requests. Members must communicate with their Member Needs team representative about a timeline for IUA payment"

I learned from Martha that they are interested in lowering the IUA, but unsure for the reason. 
Given the nitty-gritty aspect of THIS inquiry that COULD very well hinder the member in the future, we wanted to look further into it to be better resourceful for Martha and Daniel. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-06 17:56:37', '2023-12-06 17:56:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129764003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109790001', 'Justin Askins', NULL, '12-6-2023:  There was a VM from this memb, but he called back & tt William.  The only issue is, the advisor listed Leonardo Moraes is an old internal sales person, so I sent the following to William in a chat:
     "Hey William:  I had a VM I had to look into & it''s someone who called later & you talked with.  Justin Askins.  His advisor = Leo Moraes, who shows as active, but he was an old internal sales person who no longer works for MPB.  Since he got benefits thru his wife''s employment, it''s okay to call & walk him thru the form.  He doesn''t really have an advisor at this point.  IF he asked to talk with someone before he cancels, then we''ll take a different approach."     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-12-06 17:56:21', '2023-12-06 17:56:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129720073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013590042', 'Donald J. Hinz Jr.', NULL, '12.06.2023 Don called asking how to get reimbursed for the lab-work he had performed, separately from his preventative appointment.
I explained that it would be a cash pay service and out of pocket. HOWEVER, should results come back to signify the need for further services on a specific issue, then their  cost will go towards the IUA, $1000.
He asked if his dermatology is covered, I shared the same thing, plus that the only time it is covered is if it is affecting the medical health of the person, such as cancer.
He asked if colonoscopy screening is covered, and I said it is covered by Planstin via the RBP pricing model and all he has to do is guide them to call the number on the front of his card to bill Planstin.
Don will give us a call back if he has further questions about the above. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-06 16:06:06', '2023-12-06 16:06:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129720060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725045', 'Michelle Skellion', NULL, '12.06.2023 Michelle called to learn about the MAP program. She was on her phone so we could not peruse the site together, but she will go through it briefly on her phone.
I gave her M&S''s phone number, a brief of what to expect and what she will need to offer them, and what to request from her therapist re: the Impact Suite.
Michelle called back asking if her therapist could be added and I told her that I have heard of other therapist being sponsored to be added to the program, and that they can guide her through it all . NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-06 15:46:50', '2023-12-06 16:09:05'),
