  ('zcrm_1579374000129720052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283234', 'Kristen Le Peau', NULL, '12.06.2023 Kristen called ''cause she was billed by her provider for the prev appt she had on the 18th of Sept. The provider CLAIMS that the bill was rejected by Planstin, they also claim it was coded correctly, after Kristen had already called the provider''s office. Kristen did not know what her next step was, so I decided to three way call with Planstin to clear the air on whether they received a bill or not and if it was covered or not and if NOT then why.
Celeste gracefully answered with that Planstin paid in full for the appointment stated above, that she will provide Kristen with the proof of payment and EOB. Then I recommended that Kristen 3 way call the provider''s office/billing and Planstin like we just did to close the gaps of messaging who said what, to attain a paid preventative appointment. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-06 14:48:48', '2023-12-06 16:12:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129733053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081381002', 'Bren Frisch', NULL, '12-6-23 I spoke with Bren on behalf of MPB and Andrea since she wanted a different opinion on her choices. She''s discovered she could just choose Zion on its own and wants to understand why not to do that. She wants the most stripped down version without MPB''s bells and whistles. I explained to her why MPB''s benefits are so important if/when you have a Need and the value of the MPB Concierge Team vs Zion''s team.  We discussed regular solutions as well.  I have her pricing for CARE+ with the 2024 pricing which barely helps. I also suggested the higher IUA to $2500 which she''s more interested in. She knows that she needs to do this through Andrea. For some reason they seemed to butt heads a bit which isn''t usual. I''ll inform Andrea of our conversation.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-06 14:30:42', '2023-12-06 14:32:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129719227', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129638002', 'Irene Strom Spejcher', 'Member Changed eff 1/1/24', 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-06 13:44:09', '2023-12-06 13:44:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129719222', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129638002', 'Irene Strom Spejcher', NULL, 'I received a Change request from this member wanting to change to the Secure Membership.  I called to verify this will member and spoke to her spouse.  I will process Change and send out request fr proof of Ind Cont status', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-06 13:43:13', '2023-12-06 13:43:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129719212', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061691127', 'Stephen Scharf', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 1/1/24 because a bill that he submitted was denied for something that he considers "Arbitrary".   So no he thinks that Zion is a scam.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-06 13:29:54', '2023-12-06 13:29:54'),
