  ('zcrm_1579374000129733033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022969020', 'Madisen Abbott', NULL, '12-6-23 Maddie determined her income may be $30K instead of $38K that she had for last year. She works in a restaurant and it''s been slow lately. Changing her income gave her a better Cigna plan with the low ded and mop. So, we changed it to the plan showing above. She also wanted dental and I showed her the 1Dental option and South Metro Dentistry shows up in the Aetna Dental Access Network. I helped her sign up for that for $119 since her browser or the site wasn''t working for her. She got the confirmation email already. She''s all set for dental and medical. The dental includes vision as well. I can''t tell if it includes a vision exam or not though. She''ll call and ask.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-06 13:10:29', '2023-12-06 13:10:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129719172', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116744001', 'David Young', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 1.1.24 due to the fact that he has now enrolled in other coverage.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-06 13:08:44', '2023-12-06 13:08:44'),
