  ('zcrm_1579374000129733023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041906167', 'Pamela Tuck', NULL, '12-6-23 Pam decided to rejoin after moving. I re-explained the entire membership to her as a refresher. I read to her the colonoscopy and mammo sections since she''ll get those through Zion after a 6 month wait and possibly before the 10 years for colonoscopies. She was fine with the wait. The last colonoscopy was about 7 years ago and absolutely no problems as well. She''s just going by the drs. recommendation due to family history. She''s not worried at all. She gets compounded hormones through Nextera and that''s it. No other pre-x, no other meds, no tobacco. Rarely goes to dr other than for wellness. I couldn''t waive the $100 since the field didn''t exist. I''ll still try to get that refunded for her. She''s not worried about it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-06 12:33:55', '2023-12-06 12:33:55'),
