  ('zcrm_1579374000129720044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001036027', 'Thomas Summers', NULL, '12.06.2023 Thomas called asking to get into his MPB portal. Before offering him his credentials, I educationally shared that all he would find there are his receipts and any pertinent accounting information.
We confirmed that the username used to log into his MPB portal is also his MPB member ID. I urged him not to change either, as it has not gone well when members took the liberty in doing so.
Thomas was initially confused about his plan, which is why he wanted to log into his MPB portal, because he received a fulfillment package that was aimed for the Planstin and Zion filled plans, not the Essentials plan. I coached him to turn to the email sent to him on the 13th by Vanessa that identifies his plan''s details instead, and in the meantime, I''ll reach out to our admin office to resend to correct package. I message Kelly via teams in the group chat. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-06 11:45:31', '2023-12-06 12:18:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129733013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130216002', 'Montanah Matthies', NULL, '12-6-23 I just saw that she also wanted to review C4 plans. So, I left her a vm just now letting her know we can review that as well if she wants.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-06 11:43:21', '2023-12-06 11:43:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129733003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130216002', 'Montanah Matthies', NULL, '12-6-23 Montanah is 36, lives in Fruita and self-employed. She lost her coverage due to an audit showing she wasn''t working enough hours to maintain benefits. Then they cut her off when they discovered it in March and backdated to the end of the year. So, she couldn''t get Cobra and had no way to get ins all year. She''s athletic and goes rafting, mtn biking, climbing, etc. She was very careful all year. She did get a membership with Mountain Trailhead Clinic for $89 a month to protect her for the small stuff. She also works with a nutritionist. She chooses to maintain health with massage, acu, chiro, etc. She now works as a ramp agent at the local airport, so she gets to travel for free everywhere. She was on a trip now and will be going to SC next. The flexibility of our memberships suits her well. She may need to do a colposcopy and understands it will be at her own cost since pre-x. Otherwise, she just has injuries from long ago that have healed.  She likes the SECURE HSA to gain the tax benefits $325/$1000. Her partner Lauren will also likely be very interested. Montanah will forward the video on to Lauren and her mom Donna to review. Donna was prefer Lauren to have reg ins. But, they can review and ask all of their own questions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-06 11:39:34', '2023-12-06 11:39:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129719102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129638002', 'Irene Strom Spejcher', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-06 11:37:40', '2023-12-06 11:37:40'),
