  ('zcrm_1579374000129719092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129608002', 'Theresa Green', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-06 11:31:07', '2023-12-06 11:31:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129720039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079686002', 'Ronald Flake', NULL, '12/5/23: Ron called. He received a bill for son''s counseling services even though he thought it was covered through MAP. Advised to reach out to MSEAP directly. Also inquired if IUAs start over with each calendar year. We discussed that IUAs are based on a 12 month rolling period, and a member is not liable for more than 3 within a 12 month period. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-12-06 11:29:36', '2023-12-06 11:29:36'),
