  ('zcrm_1579374000129720031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081381002', 'Bren Frisch', NULL, '12/5/23: Bren called inquiring why planstin card has a deductible amount. She also wanted a different advisor so I sent her an advisor release form and looking into the best person to consult her about options and her situation. What she really wants is JUST catastrophic coverage and no bells and whistles. Gave Wendy her contact info to advise.  AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-12-06 10:36:41', '2023-12-08 09:32:02'),
