  ('zcrm_1579374000129697023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109790001', 'Justin Askins', NULL, '12/6/23: Mbr called in wanting to cancel his plan, asked why and he said his wife had gotten benefits through an employer. Emailed his advisor and told the mbr we would wait 24 hours for him to respond and if not we can go from there. -WU', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', '2023-12-06 09:55:57', '2023-12-06 09:55:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129719011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081381002', 'Bren Frisch', NULL, 'Member was transferred to me by Planstin.  She was very confused and the workings of the plan.  She wanted to add her daughter for 1 month because she had been dropped by Medicaid.  She said that she spoke to Andrea who told her that she could do this.  I advised her that she could not.  In her conversations with Zion they of course quoted her a much lower price.  I explained and directed her to the website to look at all of our services that she would be giving up.  She will be making a decision whether to cancel or not.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-06 09:46:41', '2023-12-06 09:46:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129686199', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128525010', 'Paula Lueske', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-12-06 09:39:50', '2023-12-06 09:39:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129720008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014900054', 'Terry Talley', NULL, '12/5/23: Terry called double checking that colonoscopy is covered under planstin. We discussed the same as previous note - preventive versus screening, how to present, and what to do if it turns diagnostic. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-12-06 09:37:40', '2023-12-06 09:38:45'),
