  ('zcrm_1579374000129697018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100874002', 'Troy Kreutzer', NULL, '12/6/23: Mbr called back because the link I sent him did not work on his end, apologized to him and provided the information to him over the phone. -WU', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', '2023-12-06 09:07:05', '2023-12-06 09:07:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129720003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109779071', 'Ruth Glas', NULL, '12/6/23: Ruth called inquiring about using Planstin for an upcoming breast sonogram. Since it''s bc of a spot, I advised it would not be preventive, and she would be cash pay. -AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-12-06 09:02:02', '2023-12-06 09:02:02'),
