  ('zcrm_1579374000129605099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010282133', 'Susan Atchison', NULL, '12-5-23 Susan is very frustrated by the membership bc it''s so confusing and she says nobody was calling her back when she had questions. However, she wasn''t sure who she called. She thinks she called Planstin and Zion directly. We clearly don''t show any notes from any calls. She couldn''t get her wellness visits paid for and wound up paying $500 for it. She''s super nervous if this is how it''s going to go with an actual Need. Although, she knows Darryl Lyle was helped and is happy when he had a need. She''s trying something else for now unless she researches it and finds out it might be bad. She had tried US Health/Freedom Life before MPB and cancelled that before it even started once she learned of its demons. She has the cancellation form that Patti sent and was driving. She knows I call her back. She''s also interested in possibly having me sit down with her and explaining how it all works when she visits her mom in Loveland soon. So, she may not wind up cancelling. She''s just tired of the run around and confusion for a simple wellness visit.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-05 16:02:41', '2023-12-11 17:44:04'),
