  ('zcrm_1579374000129645008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116744001', 'David Young', NULL, '12.05.2023 David called wanting to cancel his membership, b/c he had already signed up for the ACA, now that open enrollment is underway. I could not find Care Plus for America''s contact information. I asked Joan and Julia via teams. Julia was able to connect with Patti, who then shared that it is a Wiley Long scenario and that there''s not much chance of  getting him back.
