  ('zcrm_1579374000129601081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096329001', 'Christopher Cappuccitti', NULL, '12/5/23: Chris called asking how to present himself - insurance or cash pay? Asking about options to pay for counseling. He''s already utilized MAP. We discussed when to use Planstin versus presenting as cash pay for all else. I emailed him instructions for using the Turn Impact Suite app and reminded him that he could always use cirrus md for advice and possibly a referral to a behavioral health specialist  -AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-12-05 07:27:48', '2023-12-05 07:55:00'),
