  ('zcrm_1579374000129612060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116988002', 'Christopher Cantwell', NULL, '12.04.2023 Christopher called after speaking to CirrusMD, and they recommended that he see someone RIGHT AWAY due to the high blood pressure he''s been experiencing for the last week or so. Chris is not in his hometown, instead he is in Las Vegas. My recommendation was to listen to the physician''s guidance and see someone tonight or tomorrow, given that he''s out of town, to go ahead and make it an urgent care visit and present as a cash-pay patient.
We talked about further down the line opening a sharing request, and the 6 month deadline rule. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-04 17:09:24', '2023-12-04 17:09:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129597114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131969002', 'Simone Noble', NULL, '12-4-23 sent email.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2023-12-04 16:51:53', '2023-12-04 16:51:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129612055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081381002', 'Bren Frisch', NULL, '12.04.2023 Bren called concerned about her daughter getting taken off of Medicaid, and left without any coverage for the month of December. She was interested in adding her for just one month with Zion, and wanted to know options and pricing. I guided her to speak to her advisor, Andrea Hinman and directly transferred her to the following number for Andrea, 303-699-2026. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-04 16:34:07', '2023-12-04 16:34:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129605045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129625021', 'Jacqueline Thill', NULL, '12-4-23 Craig is considering joining in April or so after 2 years have passed from a pre-x for his heart. He''s also considering doing Cobra for an extra month for his wife to make sure she''s all set with all of her appointments. She''s set to go for Jan. 1st, 2024 CARE+ $1000/$350.  I''m trying to thank Ben DiSalle but the email got bounced back.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-04 16:05:01', '2023-12-04 16:08:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129612050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, '12.04.2023 Called Hillary,  (561) 414-1974, regarding the above note from William. Left Hillary a VM. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-04 15:49:50', '2023-12-04 15:49:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129612045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080945002', 'Macay Hunter', NULL, '12.04.2023 Received two missed calls from Macay while I was still at lunch (3:26 CT). I called the number Macay called from back, (801) 717-5870 , but it would not ring through. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-04 15:46:18', '2023-12-04 15:46:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129606008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097944002', 'Alexander Duncan', NULL, '12.04.23:  Was informed Marcella Duncan contacted us to switch her son Alexander back to an MPB plan.  They had inadvertently enrolled in Zion''s plan.  Called Marcie - l/m to c/b.  Explained who I am, that I was informed she''d like to rectify her son Alexander''s plan which she thinks they enrolled him in a Zion plan instead of an MPB plan.  Need to ask her if she intends to include Alexander as an employee or put him on an individual plan.
Marcie called back. Said she''d like to put Alexander on his own plan.  I suggesed DIRECT as she said she''d like him to have an annual wellness check.  She liked the DIRECT plan. I suggested she enroll him before 12/20/23 for a 1/1/24 start date and cancel his Zion plan ASAP.  Was copied on Alexander''s MPB confirmation email of his 1/1/24 enrollment being completed.  Emailed Marcieto acknowledge this and thank her. I included the link to change Advisor from Wiley Long to me, as she requested I be Alexander''s Advisor.  Since Alexander never had Wiley as an Advisor, this change form wouldn''t be necessary for him. I included the link to the Permission to Discuss Health Membership Plan form, in case Marcie & Alexander decide to take this option, since he has very little time to deal with the plan.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-12-04 14:48:46', '2023-12-04 14:48:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129605040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001107434', 'Lauren Peterson', NULL, '12-4-23 Lauren is Super nice!  She was stumped as to how to proceed to review plans for 2024. I changed her income from $19K to $21,500 for 2024 to keep her out of Medicaid since she doesn''t want that. The first plan to shows up is Cigna Connect Colorado Option Silver for $0!  Her APTC is $830.99 and the plan costs $822.25. She will review them on her own when she has time. She knows about making the payment and is thrilled that she may not have to pay anything. Actually, she''s doesn''t have to set up a the payment since it''s $0.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-04 14:45:32', '2023-12-04 14:45:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129588167', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129592283', 'Paige Merrifield', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-04 14:12:47', '2023-12-04 14:12:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129595119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, '12/4/23: Hillary called in to find out the process for getting labs done for lipids, thyroid and a1c. Was slightly nervous to give her an answer as Cari and Nahla were gone and it wasn''t an urgent request from the member. Apologized to her for the inconvenience and ask if it would be okay to contact her tomorrow with correct information, she agreed and said i can call 561-414-1974. -WU', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', '2023-12-04 13:49:54', '2023-12-04 13:49:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129588159', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107496002', 'Rebekah Liberty', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request eff 1/1/24.  Member getting other insurance', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-04 13:47:34', '2023-12-04 13:47:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129588154', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109364002', 'svetla grigorova', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation Request eff 1/1/24.  Will be getting ACA coverage.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-04 13:40:31', '2023-12-04 13:40:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129605029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095912017', 'Alicia Hutchens', NULL, '12-4-23 I called Alicia to let her know I''ve submitted an inquiry in HMA to determine how to handle when a provider only wants cash immediately at the time of service. Now with the new cards, they are requiring a Super Bill apparently. Alicia also wanted to know how to cancel her account if she can''t use the funds. I let her know I sent a long email explanation but it''s best to use the funds, not cancel. Otherwise, she will lose her money in the account.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-04 13:24:18', '2023-12-04 13:27:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129597084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130421011', 'Shane Mellin', NULL, 'He lives in Delaware.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2023-12-04 13:11:24', '2023-12-04 13:11:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129595114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974301', 'Gerardo Garcia', NULL, '12/4/23: Mbr called in and asked me to send over his pharmacy prescription info to his local cvs on behalf of his wife. Explained to him how we don''t have traditional prescription coverage but how we do have the prescription benefit program. He mentioned how he had something similar happen to him and that he paid between $10-15, told him if that was the case that might have been the cash price for it and they could still most likely pay that. Mbr felt like he was getting the run around and was frustrated and mentioned he''s paying a premium for nothing. Apologized to him and offered to look up the rx for a discount and did my best to explain the different parts of his plan, mbr disconnected. -WU', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', '2023-12-04 13:09:43', '2023-12-04 13:09:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129588149', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109506013', 'Denise Korab', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation Request eff 1/1/24 citing Employer Benefits.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-04 13:05:50', '2023-12-04 13:05:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129588144', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102741002', 'Vincent Martinez', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation Request eff 1/1/24.  Now has other coverage.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-04 13:01:06', '2023-12-04 13:01:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129612040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084946002', 'Tracie Reithmann', NULL, '12.04.2023 Tracie called to better understand the details of her plan to compare to traditional insurance, b/c she''s being offered benefits through her job. She is contemplating switching plans, and wants pricing and details discussed. I guided her to discuss these details, including whether or not it becomes a new membership or not and how the pricing would change then, with her advisor Jane Kassel. I gave her JK''s phone number, after she shared that she had already emailed her, has not heard back, so she will just wait. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-04 12:59:22', '2023-12-04 12:59:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129588139', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054641074', 'Kerek Swanson', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 1/1/24 due to the fact that he now has employer coverage', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-04 12:55:11', '2023-12-04 12:55:11'),
