  ('zcrm_1579374000129588124', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129458011', 'Adele Woods', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation prior to enrollment due to having second thoughts.  I will refund Enrollment Fee.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-04 12:40:03', '2023-12-04 12:40:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129612035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105959012', 'Dino Clathis', NULL, '12.04.2023 Received a call from Planstin with Crystal re: another failed integration file transfer for Dino''s spouse Tanya.
Crystal was trying to reach Patti, but was not able to connect with her, and wanted the solution in process. So I offered to send Patti a message, via Teams, and try to connect with Cari to see if she would like me to send Desiree (the practiced turn around) a message to fix it on their end. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-04 12:39:49', '2023-12-04 12:39:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129605024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610105', 'Greg Didriksen', NULL, '12-4-23 Greg wants to cancel his membership. They are now going with Covered CA bc their situation has changed. Sounds like their income has dropped and getting a good APTC, without saying so, in so many words.  He was very nice. I just sent him the cancellation form to proceed by the deadline of the 20th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-04 12:37:24', '2023-12-04 12:37:24'),
