  ('zcrm_1579374000129597046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130421011', 'Shane Mellin', NULL, '12-4-23. This is not a Jane Kassel lead. 
I spoke with Shane at length this morning.
He is self-employed, 40 years old
wife is 37 years old
Owns a convenience store so qualifies for Secure-HSA or Care+
His pre-ex is stiff neck pain. 
F/U detailed appointment set for Tuesday at 8am pacific. 
