=============
Shane mentioned Selina has set an appt for him for next week with Jane Kassel.  THAT APPOINTMENT NEEDS TO BE CANCELLED.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2023-12-04 12:16:25', '2023-12-04 12:16:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129588109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129592136', 'Robert Baker', NULL, 'Member &amp; Spouse $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-04 12:10:07', '2023-12-04 12:10:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129605019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120746001', 'Jennifer Zrubek', NULL, '12-4-23 Jennifer has now chosen to keep her SECURE HSA membership bc she has a new Need. She didn''t like the Dr. she used initially and wanted to return to Kaiser for simplicity sake. But, now she''s working with a Naturopath and has done some blood tests and has a scan tomorrow. She''s already spent $1000+ and realized switching she''d have to start all over with a new ded.  So, we cancelled her Kaiser plan slated to start on Jan 1st, 2024. She was already charged mid-Nov and will need to call Kaiser in 3010 days to make sure they refund her the $565.10. I told her to call the MPB Concierge Team for help with submitted a new Need and getting Pre-Approval for alternative care. I told her this a few times to make sure she understood since she''s using a naturopath right now. I also told her about the 6 month time limit to submit a new Need. She understood. She will call right away to get the process started.  Caden will remain on the plan as well. He''s in ID and I''m requesting that he does his own Welcome Call to refresh his memory on how it works. I also sent them the newest Quick Reference Guide to help ease their struggles.  She''s calmer now that she seems to have the bandwidth and time to focus on this.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-04 12:00:03', '2023-12-04 12:00:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129601068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118062001', 'J Sowers', NULL, '12/4/23: Sent welcome call link, and link to preventive care at healthcare.gov. Janelle had questions about using planstin card for child immunizations. We discussed presenting card, searching PHCS network, and making sure it stays under preventive aca guidelines. -AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-12-04 11:49:14', '2023-12-04 12:27:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129612027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003158023', 'Lorene Cecilia', NULL, '12.04.2023 Lorene called concerned about needing to see a doctor right away to be ready for her travels in a week, the cost, how to present and is it covered.
I explained the process to her for non-prev. appts, including the 6 months deadline. I offered to search for physicians on HCBB, but she needed to get in quicker. I guided her to get seen by an Urgent Care center and present as a cash-pay patient.
She was concerned about coverage, so I explained this will be out of pocket, but should it start getting close to the IUA and additional services are predicted to be rendered, then we will guide her to opening a sharing request with Zion.
She was very receptive and appreciative. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-04 11:46:17', '2023-12-04 12:11:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129588104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044118192', 'Charlotta Sakers', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation Request eff 1/1/24 citing Employer Coverage as the reason.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-04 11:41:57', '2023-12-04 11:41:57'),
