  ('zcrm_1579374000129612003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102746002', 'David Mix', NULL, '12.04.2023 David called about his daughter have an orthodontist surgery that is going to cost over $50K - considered medical - possibly pre-x - so wanted to know how to proceed with the sharing request with Zion.
