  ('zcrm_1579374000129595074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128526002', 'Barbara Lucille', NULL, 'No response. Not able to leave message said that the mailbox is invalid. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-12-04 10:06:00', '2023-12-04 10:06:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129606003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079410001', 'Christopher Duncan', NULL, '12.04.23:  Called Marcie - l/m to c/b.  Explained who I am, that I was informed she''d like to rectify her son Alexander''s plan which she thinks they enrolled him in a Zion plan instead of an MPB plan.  Need to ask her if she intends to include Alexander as an employee or put him on an individual plan.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-12-04 10:03:32', '2023-12-04 10:03:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129595064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089271002', 'Kimberly Jarman', NULL, '12/4/23: Mbr called in stating she already had an active sharing request with Zion and wanted to check on it. Provided her the number to check on something like those and transferred her as well. -WU', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', '2023-12-04 10:02:09', '2023-12-04 10:02:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129601028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035227111', 'Jeffrey Parker', NULL, '12/4/23: Jeff called to ask about sedera price change. I let him know I''d email him to clarify, but from what I can see, he falls under the "Sedera Select + PSD" price page - not "Sedera Copay" -AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-12-04 09:36:39', '2023-12-04 09:36:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129595046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128048002', 'Abigayle Welch', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-12-04 09:33:11', '2023-12-04 09:33:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129595041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091330', 'Krista Rogers', NULL, '12/4/23: Mbr called in and stating she had submitted a sharing request to Zion for an mri on her right knee and that it was approved, and she wanted to know if she needed to go to a specific provider. Informed her that she is not limited to who she can see for this mri but that the imaging and whatever service following would need to be $1000 or greater to be shareable. Mbr had a couple imaging centers in mind already and said she would do her own research. -WU', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', '2023-12-04 09:32:32', '2023-12-04 09:32:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129588052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117863002', 'Jonathan Chin', NULL, 'Member left me a VM to cancel membership.  I notified Karen and I will send out Cancellation Link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-04 09:30:48', '2023-12-04 09:30:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129597008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081872009', 'Dante Chupek', NULL, '12-4-23 Spoke to Cameron and her husband.  Told them they legally bought it. But, they claim to have put a  comment in the form asking for their rep at the time to contact them.  I haven''t seen the form BUT if it does have something in there to that effect, then it''s just grey enough IMO that we''d lose if she got legal. Not my decision to make and I''ll represent whatever the decision is.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2023-12-04 09:26:43', '2023-12-04 09:38:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129601018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000127155002', 'Stephen McDaniel', NULL, '12/4/23: Member called - in hospital and asking for ID number. Went over IUA, and presenting as cash pay. -AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-12-04 09:23:26', '2023-12-04 09:23:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129595031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108862002', 'Mark Witt', NULL, '12/4/23: Mbr asked a question through our website, reached out to him and spoke to a woman who I assumed to be his receptionist as she said he was on call. While writing him an email he called back and I was able to clarify the cortisone shot wouldn''t be a pre membership condition. Explained how he submits a sharing request and the process for that. -WU', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', '2023-12-04 09:14:34', '2023-12-04 09:14:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129588047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109363009', 'Suzanne Gallo', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request eff 1/1/24.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-04 09:00:04', '2023-12-04 09:00:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129601013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109357031', 'Melvin Scott III', NULL, '12/4/23: Melvin called, had an knee injury playing tennis. We went over IUA amount, checked the orthopedic surgeon he wanted to go to in HCBB, and presenting as cash pay patient. -AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-12-04 08:58:43', '2023-12-04 08:58:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129588037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081634019', 'Carol Scott', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation Request for an eff date of 1/1/24.  She will have other Coverage.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-04 08:51:02', '2023-12-04 08:51:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129588032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447476', 'Mia Fanali-Skowronski', NULL, 'I sent out the cancellation form, member will be cancelling eff 1/1/24.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-04 08:49:25', '2023-12-04 08:49:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129599018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130421011', 'Shane Mellin', NULL, 'Sent Text on 12/4/23: Hello Shane, This is Selina with Kassel Benefits. We received your contact information from MPowering Benefits and would love to get you scheduled with Jane to discuss your options! You can call us at 602-235-0944 to get scheduled or online at: https://kasselbenefits.as.me/Consultations', 'Jane Kassel', 'Jane Kassel', '2023-12-04 08:41:56', '2023-12-04 08:41:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129601003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128663002', 'Sara Klotz', NULL, '12/4/23: Member called to check if payment update came through on our end. yes, Patti rerunning card per previous note. -AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-12-04 08:33:58', '2023-12-04 08:33:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129597003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081872009', 'Dante Chupek', NULL, '12-4-23 Called LVM for Cameron.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2023-12-04 08:20:35', '2023-12-04 08:20:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129588027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081872009', 'Dante Chupek', NULL, 'The following is the note in the Comments section of the Change form submitted 12/1:
   Hi Patty, hope you''re doing well!
I had called in when my son was born to inquire about pricing for adding my son to my plan. The lady on the phone told me to fill out a form to add Jayce to my plan and to put in the comment section to receive a call requesting information before anything submitted that way they can give me a run down of exact costs. I was never called with any pricing and see now that I have been charged the last two months for him. I would really appreciate a reimbursement because we were never planning on sumbitting any bills and have submitted all his bills to HealthNet (His insurance). 

Thank you so much for taking the time to read over my circumstance. I am looking forward to hearing  back from you so I can finally rest getting some kind of resolution of all this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-04 08:14:11', '2023-12-04 08:14:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129595021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128665002', 'Matthew Weum', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-12-04 08:03:33', '2023-12-04 08:03:33'),
