  ('zcrm_1579374000129562003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129548001', 'Jill Finn', NULL, '12-1-23 Enrolled Jill. This is my own generated lead; I am to get paid  on my original commission agreement. Waived $100 enrollment with coupon code.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2023-12-03 09:28:37', '2023-12-03 09:28:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129511175', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130373002', 'Lisa Wiesen', NULL, '12-1-23 Lisa is 55 and husband is 64 in Jan. 2024. Their daughter is 26 and may want CARE+ separately. She left Seagate in May and they are on Cobra now for $1600 a month with a $2500 ded. She has a side business with a business license and EIN to use for self-employment. She''s used to self-submitting medical expenses bc she only uses alternative care and thermogram, etc. She knows that''s not included in ACA compliant wellness screening. But, saving $900 a month she can easily pay the small stuff on her own. Her husband is more traditional and likes the traditional wellness as well. They also like to fund an HSA. Husband is retired. They are healthy, no tobacco. Husband takes thyroid meds and possibly stopped with statin for cholesterol. She''s not a fan of his meds, so doesn''t pay attention. But, I gave her the run down on pre-x twice and she''s not worried at all. They are super healthy. I''ll send video and overview to review for husband and daughter. She will need husband''s buy in or I can help him choose a C4 plan.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-01 18:35:07', '2023-12-01 18:35:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129511170', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045976082', 'Stacey Garrett', NULL, '12-1-23 Amanda already updated her account earlier today. They changed bank accounts.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-01 18:17:13', '2023-12-01 18:17:13'),
