  ('zcrm_1579374000129538008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679198', 'Kari Rosckowff', NULL, '12-1-2023:  Kari called &amp; tt Angee.  When Angee tried to help Kari register for CirrusMD, it gave the memb the "no records found" error code.  Angee doesn''t have access to Admin123, so she had to connect w/me for us to send a support e-mail to CirrusMD to correct their system.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-12-01 16:15:37', '2023-12-01 16:16:57'),
