  ('zcrm_1579374000129532026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081872009', 'Dante Chupek', NULL, '12.01.2023 Cameron called re: removing her son. I sent the below to Patti as an extra step to expect Cameron''s call next week:
FOR MONDAY:
Hi Patti 
Cameron Chupek sent in a form today, to remove her son, Jayce Chupek from the membership.
She shared that she submitted a form a while back, with the intent to attain numbers of prices to compare their options with adding their son to either her plan or her husband''s. However Jayce was added automatically vs. discussing the prices with Cameron.
Cameron shares she did not know he was added till she noticed the difference in payment, then she called us.
 
Sharing that to share, she would like to speak to billing next week, in hopes of reimbursements, given he was added to his father''s benefits, since they did not hear from (------) to discuss pricing.
 
I hope that was clear. I''d be glad to verbally explain it, if it seems like I jumbled it around LOL.
 
I hope you are enjoying your weekend. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-12-01 15:39:16', '2023-12-01 16:28:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129511115', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129625021', 'Jacqueline Thill', NULL, '12-1-23 Craig called and he''s ready to enroll his wife for Jan. 1st start date. I gave him the new pricing. He will wait until April to join her. This will get him past the 24 months after a heart issue so it''s not pre-x. He couldn''t find my communications and gave me a different email to send info to. I sent it. We have an appt set for Mon. at 9:00 to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-12-01 15:33:03', '2023-12-01 15:33:03'),
