  ('zcrm_1579374000129516023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082146002', 'Ursa Abernathy', NULL, '12.01.23:  Ursa called me. Said she and her husband are currently in an income bracket that allows for free healthcare in the marketplace.  As soon as they change that situation she''d like to come back to MPB.  I told her how to access the Cancellation form from our website and also advised her that since she is cancelling after the 20th of the month, her termination will be Jan 1, 2024.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-12-01 14:44:29', '2023-12-01 14:44:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129518028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117863002', 'Jonathan Chin', NULL, '12/1/23: Jonathan called to cancel membership. Led to form on website. -AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-12-01 14:19:44', '2023-12-01 14:19:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129516018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109620011', 'Monique Koen', NULL, '12/1/23: Mbr called in wanting to know more about the map program. Explained the 4 sessions at a time with the 2 month break in between limited to 12 annually. Mbr asked how to schedule those free visits or present herself, told her I would call her back as I forgot how she can go through the Map program on our website to do this. -WU', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', '2023-12-01 13:47:45', '2023-12-01 13:47:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129490102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103252002', 'Michael Guinn', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request eff 1/1/24 not giving any reason for cancellation.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-01 13:37:20', '2023-12-01 13:37:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129490094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047238273', 'Jennifer Bradfield', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 1/1/24 due to the fact that they now have coverage through Jennifer''s employer.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-12-01 13:25:54', '2023-12-01 13:25:54'),
