  ('zcrm_1579374000129434060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082146002', 'Ursa Abernathy', NULL, '11.30.23:  Was informed by Will Ursa emailed MPB notifying us she wants to cancel her plan as she and her husband signed up for a different insurance through the marketplace that is effective 12.1.23 and is more cost-effective in their situation.  I emailed her to let her know the deadline to cancel is the 20th of the month previous to the month of cancellation. So her plan will terminate as of 1.1.24.  I asked her to call me so I can assist her with the cancellation process.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-11-30 14:13:55', '2023-11-30 14:14:11'),
