  ('zcrm_1579374000129434018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072425023', 'Lior Moshe', NULL, '11.29.2023 Adria called wanting to learn why her appointments are not being covered. She shared that she spoke with someone at MPB who told her that she needs to present as a "Self-Pay" patient on all her appointments, and get reimbursed afterwards. This has not been a practice on any preventative appointment, but a damage control tactic to help members in a pickle.
