  ('zcrm_1579374000129353163', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065731070', 'Carolyn Whitus', NULL, '11-29-2023:  Carolyn called.  She''s getting divorced &amp; needs to quit MPB (immed prob because her new mkt pl ins she believes starts 12/1/23 - she''ll conf that).  Due to the time sensitive nature (the 1st is 2 days away), I walked her to the form.  She is willing to notify Analisa as well, so she took her ph # &amp; e-mail address, then I trans her to Analissa''s #.  I could tell she was struggling, so tried to make it as easy on her as possible, especially with the timing.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-11-29 15:33:39', '2023-11-29 15:33:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129349219', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601365', 'Matt Holstein', NULL, '11-29-23 Matt is applying for residency in France and needs a letter showing proof of membership. I referred him to the MPB Concierge Team for assistance with this.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-29 14:51:57', '2023-11-29 14:51:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129349214', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004762035', 'Traci Hoops', NULL, '11-28-23 Traci called to ask about the colonoscopy that isn''t covered bc coded as diagnostic. It''s $3900 with ins or $1900 as cash pay. I read the colonoscopy benefits from Zion''s Sharing Guidelines to help per understand why this happened and her next steps. I explained that the second it''s coded as diagnostic it''s no longer at no cost to her and it will considered a new Need for sharing above her chosen $1000 IUA. She''s very disappointed to learn this as she was not expecting to have to pay $1000 for this colonoscopy which was 3 years past her initial one. We also changed her benefits from Connected Worksite to SECURE HSA to give her daughter the ACA compliance for school. She thought Zion would have still shared it at no cost until I read her the Sharing Guidelines. She''s upset but now understands. She would be in this same predicament with traditional options as well since it''s all dictated by the ACA or US Preventative Task Force.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-29 14:44:46', '2023-11-29 14:44:46'),
