  ('zcrm_1579374000129349191', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063253037', 'Bobbi Georgeton', NULL, '11-27-23 Chris can keep his Cigna Connect Flex Gold 900 RX and put you onto the RMHP CO Option Drs. HSA Plan. The total for the two of you would be $1268.29 if you want to do it that way. This will give Chris good benefits for his needs and you the lower max out of pocket for your needs and the tax benefits. Cigna is still the best value for the money. So, for Chris this may be a good idea.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-29 11:02:53', '2023-11-29 11:02:53'),
