  ('zcrm_1579374000129349186', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123199001', 'Carey Reynolds', NULL, '11-29-23 Carey and Craig are curious about reg ins options so I showed them the Cigna Connect Flex Bronze 0. They can get a $663.85 APTC with income at $112 estimated for 2024. $54K for Cari and $58K for Craig as their best guess after reducing for expenses. The Cigna Connect Flex Bronze 0 will be $725.31 their cost. The full cost is $1389.16. Labs will cost more than the co-pay. Specialist visit for mental health will cost more than cash pay of $100 vs co-pay of $110. She sees a Psychiatric Nurse Practioner. Wellness visit will have the same hurdles for labs. Their financial exposure for something big is $9450 per indiv or $18,900 for both vs $3K. So, they will review and decide if the savings will be worth her efforts with MCS. The every day items she wants may be easier with Cigna but still more expensive. They know the deadlines of Dec. 15th and Jan. 15th to give them time to ponder.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-29 10:57:54', '2023-11-29 10:57:54'),
