  ('zcrm_1579374000129349178', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059526010', 'Robin Brenneise', NULL, '11-28-23 Robin called bc she thinks she needs more comprehensive benefits. She has rosacea that needs meds or treatment. I let her know to start with CirrusMD for that. She needs PT for her thumb. I let her know to open a Need for that. However PT cost $120 for about 30 min. So, it will take a while to meet the Need for that. She believes she''s ADHD and wants meds to help it. So, she wants an assessment to obtain the proper meds. I suggested she tries CirrusMD since they have Behavioral Health Specialists and while we were talking she learned even  a PCP can diagnose this. Finally she needs to replace a crown. I suggested 1Dental and Dr. Alber since her dentist of choice Dr. Leo Polinkovsky isn''t in network for either of them. On the flip side if she chooses C4 plans she can get a $514 APTC but the plans are at least $315 on up. Decent plans are $425 or more and they still don''t solve her needs. So, she will review it all and let me know what questions arise.  She also needs a 3rd diagnostic mammogram but even with the C4 plans she''ll still be paying most, all or more of the cost than self-pay.  One plan has a $500 co-pay and the rest are co-ins.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-28 20:26:34', '2023-11-28 20:28:57'),
