  ('zcrm_1579374000129350016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593010', 'Suzanne Martinek', NULL, '11/28/23: Suzanne called: lost her card and would like initial letters emailed again. Had questions about vision partners, how to schedule a therapy session, and accessing medical records vault. - I guided her through MAP, MR1.US, and WHLD. Looking into getting her a new card and resending plan letters. Kelly sending card and emailing letters. Emailed Suzy to let her know -AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-11-28 08:33:27', '2023-11-28 12:00:36'),
