  ('zcrm_1579374000129263058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114497002', 'Elsa Gerhardt', NULL, '11-27-2023:  I came in after the long Thanksgiving weekend &amp; even though we were all caught up on messages, a VM from last Wed showed up:  from 11/22/2023  3:23pm eastern:
     Elsa wants guidance on getting her annual ck up &amp; how to find a list of potential MDs.
     ILM, please call us (not sure if looking for PCP, Fam Prac, Gyno?).  We can help.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-11-27 16:38:12', '2023-11-27 16:38:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129289082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129297055', 'Lorna Donovan', NULL, '11-27-23 Lorna has had a miserable experience with Medicaid, Kaiser and C4. She qualified for Medicaid unknowingly a year ago. Then she was told she can''t have Medicaid and Kaiser w/ C4 at the same time. It was cancelled. But, she''s still been active with Kaiser through Medicaid. She recently learned she was cancelled from Medicaid but only discovered that by finding her Kaiser plan cancelled. Her income is $36-$44K. I think she''s among the Covid Medicaid group of people who were kept on Medicaid whether or not they wanted to be. She just did a mammo and now has to pay for it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-27 16:30:56', '2023-11-27 16:30:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129289072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924134', 'Kristen Lassalette', NULL, '11-27-23 Kristen heard from Carmen Burrell from Planstin to resolve the wellness visit issue. Carmen is reaching out to each provider and giving them the Planstin info to bill directly. Then each provider will need to refund Kristen for each payment. Kristen was super nice and also ready to be done with the debacle since she never rec''d a card from Planstin, so she simply paid the cash price like she is instructed for everything else. I believe this happened when Planstin kept delaying the cards and Steve Schone said to just let him know and they''d take care of it on the back end when someone pays cash. So, that''s what we did and it created a bigger nightmare. So, Kristen finally has the card and understands the process for wellness moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-27 16:05:07', '2023-11-27 16:05:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129289067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106731013', 'Lori Miller', NULL, '11-27-23 Lori called bc she got a letter from C4 about a new special enrollment period bc we changed her income by perhaps $5K or so. However, we did not choose a new plan or make any changes to alter her APTC or plan. Everything looks to be the same for 2023 and the plan was chosen on 11/18/22. Her new plan for 2024 was chosen on 11/2/23. I believe she''s all set to go. She will contact Anthem mid-Dec. to make her payment for 2024 onward.  She will contact Andrea for Medicare as she gets close to that in the summer.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-27 15:51:48', '2023-11-27 15:51:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129289062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024892055', 'Elizabeth Neumann', NULL, '11-27-23 Libby has submitted her cancellation form since she''s turning 65 in Jan. 2024. Looks to be all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-27 15:27:46', '2023-11-27 15:27:46'),
