  ('zcrm_1579374000129289023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129378061', 'California Bonham', NULL, '11-27-23 Cali found me via C4 and prefers women since she has her own woman owned business. She was kicked off of Medicaid sometime in the month of Nov. So, she needs ins for Dec. 2023 and 2024 onward. Income will be about $50K.  She is self-employed. DOB 7/17/76 and lives in Rock Creek in Superior, 80027. She just had some perimenopausal symptoms she''s treating with pregesterone 100 mg and estradial Vivelle - Dot patch but fine with generic. She chose Cigna Connect Flex Bronze 0 for the month of Dec. 2023 and might choose SECURE HSA for Jan onward. Her 3 Drs. and meds are in Cigna and not RMHP and one missing from Anthem. 

