  ('zcrm_1579374000129166008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578137', 'Rachel Fisher Ingraham', NULL, '11.22.2023 Cari was able to decipher the glitches in all 3 years of Rachel''s preventative billing mishap and miscommunication. With diligent diplomacy and coaching with Planstin as a whole and their newcomers, Cari was able to attain 1 out 3 solutions, and 1 out 3 possible road map to the second solution. I sent those 3 present status'' via email in Outlook, Cc''d both Cari and Analisa Cleland, their advisor. Below are the emails:
1-The 2021 claims:
I''m breaking the three years into separate e-mails to make it easier to separate the different issues.
This particular year, the doctor has listed Emerson as the patient on both invoices.  I can tell there are 2 different patients due to the different ''Patient #''s".
However, for Planstin to reconsider, the doctor must correct the patient name.  One of these must be for Rowan, but only they can determine which.  Then, they can resubmit.  
It may take some clarification due to one of the invoices previously being paid.  However, if the doctor''s office does not correct the invoice, there is nothing that can be done.

2-The 2022 claims:  
Unfortunately, because this was prior to our out-of-network options, there is nothing we can do towards the 2022 appointments.  
Sadly, doctors offices can choose to come and go from networks any time they desire.  Since their participation in the network for the 2022 appointments did not confirm their network status and they were no longer in network, these will be out of pocket expenses.

3-The 2023 claims have been reprocessed.  On 10/26/2023 Planstin sent a new Explanation of Benefits (EOB) to you showing these were now paid.
Yesterday, 11/20/2023, we asked them to resend you the EOBs.  Please be on the lookout for them.    NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-11-22 12:08:59', '2023-11-22 12:08:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129141033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116121002', 'Brayden Luna', NULL, '11-22-2023:  Bryan (Brayden''s father) called.  He''s super frustrated w/Zion.  Brayden moved from Bryan''s family memb to his own (he aged out) and when they moved Brayden, Zion started declining medical bills because they were looking at the wrong eff date.  Told Brayden/Bryan...  they would corr the eff date issue & get the inv pd.  But, they are again kicking them out.  It''s now impacting Brayden''s medical care.
     - tt Ulises (male) @ Zion:  Says Brayden did not complete Zion''s perm to speak w/Bryan form correctly, since Brayden left off the name of who can speak for Brayden.  Therefore, they cannot talk to Bryan today.  They spent time trying to decide why the info got left off.  Ulises says, Brayden must ask for the form to be sent to him (they cannot just send a copy to Brayden''t on file e-mail).  Curr Zion is open until 6pm (it''s their busy season).
        I suggested Brayden call & get the form in and we try again next week.  Bryan didn''t like that option, but with the holiday hours away, I suggested they call Zion, opt 6 once they have the form turned in.  Then next week would be the first time I can help again.     - CA

Bryan called back.  Brayden signed the form, so we called Zion back.  tt Alanna (at Zion) 122829290 = Brayden''s memb #.  They did rec the corrected Perm Form to tt Bryan.  Per Bryan:  Zion adjudicator said they''d take care of things, now the older items that said they''d fix, are still getting kicked back.

Alanna conf Bryan''s memb eff date, b-date, spouse''s e-mail.  She''s trying to trans us to DA (Determination Adjucator) = Jaydon (female).  Jaydon is waiting for the confirmation of the updated eff date & the MD med records.  Jaydon says she''s waiting for the conf from her mgr that the eff date of 12/1/2021 is accurate.  Bryan is NOT working with them.  Very demanding.  Very much telling them how bad their systems are, etc. (which maybe they are, but the day before a holiday feels like an inappropriate time for this).

Per Alanna, in Aug, she sees a note, but cannot give him specific time when the info was updated.  Bryan feels like Zion is treating them as ''stupid'' (I do not understand that, but that''s how he feels).  DA says they are also waiting for medical records.  Why are they showing as unshareable on his portal?  Bryan wants to know why this is still not getting taken care of & why Zion is not taking care of what they are paying for.  Son''s health is now suffering - he is not able to go see the doctor''s because he''s not having things paid for.

Jaydon came onto the phone:  Glitch on member portal shows as ''not shareable'', but is actually ''under review''.  They are working to fix the portal.  Prev person who said they would fix the issue = his old processor, who no longer works at Zion.  MRI & PT have been approved (even though it looks like it''s not shareable on the portal).  Zion just req''d med records & treatment plan(s) on 11/14/2023.  Sept 14th: DA originally req''d the addl info.  Once that''s rec''d & approvedm he''ll have the pre-pd w/the virtual cc''s.  Ares Functional Medicine 3/7/23 DOS $349 = Zoom type doctor.  Avexia Directed, Analight health = providers, Zion is just waiting for medical records.

Jaydon says curr thinks it''s 30-45 day turnaround time.  2/14/23 Valley Imaging = has been approved to pay (= processor''s make the appr''d pymts).  8/ /23? $4.. = Lab work orders.  Waiting for referring provider''s information (to confirm who ordered the labs, because everything needs to be ordered by a licensed MD who ordered them) = Jaydon has req''d this info.  Several items are lab work.  Once they receive the med records, often the lab orders are in those records in it, which means it will help get 

Functional Med = Physical Doc @Temicula Integrated Medicine:  Brayden saw them for first time ~ 2 weeks ago (per Bryan).  Bryan asked, can Brayden see naturalpath & must be licensed in the state they practice in.  No need to get the naturalpathy pre-approved.  They just need a ''treatment plan'' once he sees them.  MD can fax to Zion at: 435-523-3325 = medical records fax #.

Jaydon will send personal message to Braydon next week as to where things are.

The assigned processor = Jaycee (female).
DA (Determination Adjudicator) = Jaydon (female).', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-11-22 12:07:38', '2023-11-22 13:56:27'),
