  ('zcrm_1579374000129030060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103737002', 'Matthew Hatcher', 'Opened a TICKET = #3130 (Advisor Education)', '11.20.2023 Matthew called trying to lower his monthly payments, since his advisor advised him to increase his IUA. However, Matthew and his family are already at the 5000IUA. Matthew also mentioned the age bracket that he''s under, which is not something I can confirm aside from his birthday, so I urged him to contact Daniel, his advisor to confirm what he was looking at is a match to what we have in the system. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-11-20 15:55:21', '2023-11-20 17:57:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000129029034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129038051', 'Donna Manizza', NULL, '11-20-23 Donna was trying to apply for 2024 and accidentally updated her income for 2023. So, it changed her payment to about $347 for the month of Dec. I helped her then redo the app for 2024. She was about to select the Cigna CO Option Bronze 7200 but I let her know the network is different. So, she''s reviewing the network for that option before making a final decision That is about $253 vs $293 for the non-CO option plan. She believes she''s losing her job in Jan. so she''s being very conservative with what she''s wanting to pay right now. She''ll let me know what she chooses for 2024.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-20 15:28:22', '2023-11-20 15:28:22'),
