  ('zcrm_1579374000129029026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104398007', 'Estefania Luna', NULL, '11-20-23 Estefania enrolled in the cheapest Anthem Essential Pathway Catastrophic HMO plan for $0 her cost.  She also never received a card for the HMA to use. She''s never created an account with the HMA either. She needs help with that. She also tried using her vision benefits recently which were rejected. Taylor with Direct Benefits will reach out to the carrier to find out why. Estefania revealed that she used it early in the year. Taylor will make sure the account is still active. If so, Estefenia likely needs to wait a rolling 12 months before she uses the benefits again. I''ll wait to hear back.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-20 14:00:02', '2023-11-20 14:29:23'),
