  ('zcrm_1579374000128927008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131094002', 'Patrick Hill', NULL, '11-17-23 Delay until Monday at 11am pacific. She needs to speak w/HR about disengaging with the existing coverage she has through Dec.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2023-11-17 12:30:23', '2023-11-17 12:30:23'),
