  ('zcrm_1579374000128880043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089051001', 'Patricia Smith', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation Request eff 12/1 due to the fact that she now has employer coverage.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-11-17 09:52:39', '2023-11-17 09:52:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128876026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122350020', 'Chantel Columna Reinoso', NULL, '11/17/23: Chantel called checking to see if provider would be covered for annual visit. We confirmed by checking PCHS Network. Sent email with instructions in case she needed it again. -AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2023-11-17 09:51:57', '2023-11-17 09:51:57'),
