  ('zcrm_1579374000128880033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078240094', 'Bruce Ballet', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 12/1.  Due to getting Employer Coverage.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-11-17 09:36:49', '2023-11-17 09:36:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128918008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128112010', 'Stacey Guggino', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-11-17 09:34:27', '2023-11-17 09:34:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128915003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088723009', 'Daniela Papi', NULL, '11-17-23 Daniela doesn''t do the wellness for herself nor does her husband. They do it for the kids. But, she realizes it''s better to pay cash instead for the wellness visit for them. She chose CARE+ for $580/$1000. I waived the $100 since used to be  a member.  She''s using ACH bank draft.  All set to go for Dec. 1st 2023. I gave her the new pricing for Oct. of 2024 as well. She''s happy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-17 09:27:05', '2023-11-17 09:35:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128880028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093481010', 'Sanjay Bhattacharjee', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form I will update', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-11-17 09:13:29', '2023-11-17 09:13:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128880023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003401007', 'Benjamin Lampert II', NULL, 'Member submitted Change from to add newborn.  I will process, no change in price due to already Family coverage.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-11-17 08:58:49', '2023-11-17 08:58:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128879008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120817001', 'Benjamin Cowan', NULL, '11/17/23: Mbr called in to ask how to submit a medical need for his wife regarding her knee, explained how submitting a need would work and his iua/process. Had another question about preventative and women''s wellness, told him I would reach back out with more accurate information.', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', 'MPBHealth Member Notification', '2023-11-17 08:40:27', '2023-11-17 08:40:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128880018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105466002', 'Hailey Brock', 'New Membership eff 12/1/23', 'Member only $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-11-17 08:32:30', '2023-11-17 08:32:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128880013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105466002', 'Hailey Brock', NULL, 'Member submitted Change from to change IUA from $1000 to $5000 eff 12/1/23.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-11-17 08:31:39', '2023-11-17 08:31:39'),
