  ('zcrm_1579374000128842013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131969002', 'Simone Noble', NULL, '11-16-2023 We had a great call. Turns out she co-parents two kids with Mark Jowel.
Simone uses a Naturopath, Dr. Kate, who is not an MD. Simone pays a fee to Dr. Kate annully that includes advice and a series of blood test for over $1500.  Told her we can help with discounts on the lab work via the concierge...but it would not be covered under the MEC with Secure HSA as an actual MD is not prespcribing it.  She  also has a shoulder issue that is not serious but she realizes she would need to call that out as a Pre-Ex.  She is doing the math now and going to make a decicision today/tomorrow re going with us.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2023-11-16 11:53:42', '2023-11-16 11:53:42'),
