  ('zcrm_1579374000128848003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004455005', 'Carleen Andersen', NULL, '11-16-23 Carleen changed her income from $35K to $40K to be safe. She may also change her job to medical bill coding at a hospital this year or something like that. She might then get health insurance. She chose the Cigna Connect Flex Gold 2700 for $179 her cost with a $224.91 APTC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-16 11:49:57', '2023-11-16 11:49:57'),
