  ('zcrm_1579374000128760057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088723009', 'Daniela Papi', NULL, '11-15-23 Daniela is looking to re-enroll. She wanted a Dec. 15th start date which I can''t do. So, I gave her the prices for 2023 and 2024 to see if she wants to join for Dec. 1st instead. We will meet on Friday at 9:00 to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-15 20:11:25', '2023-11-15 20:11:25'),
