  ('zcrm_1579374000128777003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919617', 'Heather Davies', NULL, '11.15.23 Heather called back, saying no one reached to her. She wanted to speak to someone regarding the price changes. I connected her with Kirk Bennet. Upon speaking with Karina, she notified me that she contacted Wiley and he replied to her email stating that he would reach out to Heather. JA', 'Julia Avalon', 'Julia Avalon', '2023-11-15 13:51:57', '2023-11-15 13:51:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128755018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083233002', 'Heidi Holliday', NULL, 'Karen contacted me about issue below.  This member submitted Change Form to add her newborn on 10/24 23.  It was processed on 10/25/23.  She is being told by Zion that she has not been added.  I sent a screen shot of her A123 file to Ashlee &amp; Desiree to possibly fix.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-11-15 13:49:59', '2023-11-15 13:49:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128760008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082049', 'Dayna Horton', NULL, '11-15-23 I talked with Dayna and Steve and we realized Steve is already working with an agent that he''s worked with for many years with his x-wife. I don''t have other options to help them with their daughter''s pre-x. Now they are sharing that she''s been getting treated in TX for all of these surgeries and will need to go back to TX but lives in CO. So, I don''t have any options that will eliminate the pre-x clause for them. C4 is their best option and to find a hospital or Dr. that will work on their behalf to get special permission to get service for the unique scenario in another state. So, they''re out of options other than to go with C4 via the other agent. They were very nice and didn''t want to waste my time.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-15 13:42:33', '2023-11-15 13:42:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128754014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083233002', 'Heidi Holliday', NULL, '11-15-2023:  Advisor Karen Torsoe called.  Zion is telling Heidi she hasn''t added her baby yet, but Karen knows it was submitted.  Karen''s going to call &amp; tt Patti Baron.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-11-15 13:29:47', '2023-11-15 13:46:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128755013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000127379002', 'Ryan Broyles', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation Request eff 12/1/23.  He cited the fact that he was now enrolling in Group Ins.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-11-15 13:20:17', '2023-11-15 13:20:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128760003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059611038', 'Heidi McGuire', NULL, '11-15-23 Heidi called again and emailed to inquire about her refund. Karina happened to respond to my previous email shortly thereafter and said she hadn''t seen the bank statements that I sent on Nov. 8th. I just resent everything to her and waiting to make sure she sees it now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-15 13:14:17', '2023-11-15 13:14:17'),
