  ('zcrm_1579374000128687016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043000021', 'Joseph DeGain', NULL, '11-14-2023:  Joseph submitted a quote req.  Julia asked me to reach out to see if we can help with it.  I called, but had to LM & asked him to call the concierge line & ask for me specifically.
