  ('zcrm_1579374000128687011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107479018', 'Steven Wagar', NULL, '11-14-2023:  Advisor Sally Thomsen called trying to understand how hip replacement might work for Cathy Wagar.  Would it be pre-x.  I sugg the memb get their dr records back to 12/1/2020 to see if there is anything in the record of a symptom, or issue (can be as small as hip hurts, pt told to take ibuprofen = symptom).  Then we should begin a sharing req & include their medical records, det inv & pymt rec w/in 6 mos of the DOS.  If it is determined pre-x, then beginning at 12/1/2023, they move to their 2nd yr of membership & at least they are past the waiting period.  Having 25k after that date twds any issue.  
     - Encouraged advisor Sally Thomsen to have the member call us.  We will gladly help them thru this as we know it''s a lot to take in.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-11-14 17:13:33', '2023-11-14 17:13:33'),
