  ('zcrm_1579374000128662024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091189002', 'Sarrah Claman', NULL, '11-14-23 Sarrah chose to join CARE+ with the $1000 IUA / $215. She will be in Mexico for part of the time. I read to her the newer international section from the Sharing Guidelines. I also let her know the Guidelines  will be changing again as of Jan. 1st. Hopefully it won''t affect the international portion of the guidelines. It allows for ER and acute care and needs pre-approval for anything else.  She''s all set and was scheduling the welcome call to set up the virtual healthcare app as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-14 16:07:00', '2023-11-14 16:07:00'),
