  ('zcrm_1579374000128662016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012010011', 'Elizabeth Wood', NULL, '11-14-23 Elizabeth has an ongoing Need with sarcoidosis and her husband had a shoulder surgery or issue within the past year or so. They need to stay put with their membership as they move into the higher pricing for age 60-64. She''s curious about dental and vision options. Dr. Carmen Burke at Family Holistic Dentistry is not in the 1dental networks. So, I explained the HMA instead which she''s interested to learn more especially since she has to do various x-rays, echocardiograms and various visits over time for the sarcoidosis. The HMA could be  a perfect solution long term.  She also gets her teach cleaned by Shelby Kahl who is dental hygenist in Fort Collins and likely far more affordable than Dr. Carmen Burke but was taught under Dr. Carmen Burke.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-14 14:19:34', '2023-11-14 14:31:03'),
