  ('zcrm_1579374000128560026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130802017', 'Bruce Maleski', NULL, '11-13-23 Sara called and left a vm regarding using virtual healthcare app. I see above that she also reached the MPB Concierge Team and seems to have gotten help. I let her know they are the best to help with this.  She needs help for her son.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-13 15:14:45', '2023-11-13 15:14:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128560021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118196002', 'Brian Gould', NULL, '11-13-23 Brian called for more help with ins for his CGM to be covered. But, he''s not finding carriers that cover this. I suggested looking at the RMHP as an option. Then I also looked it up on PlanstinRX and found the Freestyle Libre 2 for $98.81 for 1 Libre and 2 readers or $265.01 for 3 Libres and 2 readers.  He will call the MPB Concierge Team next for help. I suggested he speaks with Cari about this particular information. It might not benefit him to move to regular ins. since it''s still so expensive and not really covering what he wants. There''s even a discount card giving the price of $72.40 at local places in Boulder.  I thought the Co-Pay plan might be good but it''s $475 a month and not worth an extra $250 a month!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-13 15:02:24', '2023-11-13 16:55:38'),
