  ('zcrm_1579374000128488090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330216', 'Nelson Oldham', NULL, '11-10-23 Nelson''s new price would be $315.15 which includes the Admin Fee if he wants to move to Self Directed Healthcare moving forward. It''s not much of a savings actually from $356.47.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-10 20:48:47', '2023-11-10 20:48:47'),
