  ('zcrm_1579374000128495040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330216', 'Nelson Oldham', NULL, '11-10-2023:  Nelson decided he wants price quotes for removing his prev care, in an e-mail.  Replied by letting him know his adv might be best at helping (although she may need to bring in our benefit admin), put in a copy of his last invoice, and cc''d Wendy so she knows he needs asst.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-11-10 18:47:14', '2023-11-10 18:47:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128495026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013590042', 'Donald J. Hinz Jr.', NULL, '11-10-2023:  Donald e-mailed.  The Int Med doc''s we came up w/are telling him they do not do general physicals.  So, I sent him the list of PCP in the PHCS search tool.  Told him HCBB doesn''t seem to list quality of care in the list of PCP.  So, HCBB may show quaility of care inside the ind doc''s information.  Once he selects someone, he can call us &amp; we can check then.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-11-10 17:32:30', '2023-11-10 17:32:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128491042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120108002', 'Penny Fallon', NULL, '11.10.2023 Penny put in an RX request for: SULFASALAZINE (Generic for AZULFIDINE): QTY 540 • 500 MG • Tablet • Near Holts Summit, MO 65043.

