  ('zcrm_1579374000128491027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109660001', 'Laura Hunt', NULL, '11.10.2023 Laura Hunt called for Cari, but Cari was with another valued member, Laura was ok with having Cari call her back when she is finished with the present member. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-11-10 14:57:12', '2023-11-10 14:57:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128488062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112994002', 'Carol VerMeer', NULL, '11-10-23 Carol was starting to complete the form to change to SECURE until she realized it will be better to simply pay cash for her mammo and pap screening and leave well enough alone. Charlie won''t be doing much and they won''t be doing a colonoscopy any time soon. So, she''s happy to keep her membership as is with CARE+. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-10 14:39:27', '2023-11-10 14:39:27'),
