  ('zcrm_1579374000128488049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052396397', 'Helen Zivelonghi', NULL, '11-10-23 Helen is cancelling bc she got a new job with benefits. She had to go FT to get full benefits. She took the job for the benefits since even MCS was getting expensive.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-10 13:26:09', '2023-11-10 13:26:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128491019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123096002', 'Karen Yabuno', NULL, '11.10.2023 Karen is not finding success with the EAP program in finding her a therapist in her area. She was guided to download the Impact Suite app, but was not sure where to find it. I guided her to it, and showed her the intro video and the other apps. Karen seems like she is interested in being able to interact with someone on there, similar to Cirrus MD, but I was unsure of that feature. I consulted with Cari...', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-11-10 13:21:48', '2023-11-10 13:21:48'),
