  ('zcrm_1579374000128451009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117965002', 'Kerri Lee Wemett', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 12/1/23 due to getting employer benefits.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-11-10 08:04:17', '2023-11-10 08:04:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128457008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000127162011', 'Michael Yawn', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Put in request to Kelly to resend out QR life code cards. Verified address. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-11-10 07:50:40', '2023-11-10 09:25:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128408055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128407055', 'Cindy Christensen', NULL, '11-9-23 Cindy called to help her 34 year old son find a new ins plan. His is costing $414 and going up to about $474 in 2024. I explained the entire membership and then asked where he lives and it''s WA! UGH. We were both so bummed. She was on board. He''s super healthy, young, active, etc. He has ADD but that''s all. He does his wellness visits and wanted to fund the HSA. He''s self employed as a home inspector. They are members of InterNashi and was considering becoming a member of ASHI to get the benefits. But, it won''t work. She was looking at SECURE HSA $1000/$300. Who knows, maybe she''ll refer someone. Her son also just sold his home in ID, so that''s not an option. Phoowey!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-09 19:39:39', '2023-11-09 19:39:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128408047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063253037', 'Bobbi Georgeton', NULL, '11-9-23 We had to call C4 bc Bobbi''s account was splitting Bobbi from Chris to choose 2 different plans. The problem was an old address was showing for one of them. Monica with C4 fixed it and we are now able to see the new plans at the correct prices. Even with income at $180K she''s getting a $350 ish APTC. I sent her 3 RMHP plans to choose from, one Bronze HSA and 2 Gold. She will find out if she needs neuro surgery or not and decide what makes the most sense. She was hoping that her business is run as a C-Corp and she''s the CEO of her C-Corp that she could get a group policy. It doesn''t change the fact that her one employee won''t take the plan. She can still get access to the drs. she wants with the RMHP that I sent to her according to the C4 site. I''ve told her to call all of her drs. to make 100% certain they will accept the exact plans she''s looking at. She will. The Tkt # for our call w/ C4 is 472646-G688G9.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-09 19:32:17', '2023-11-09 19:32:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128403077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120264010', 'Robert Putt', NULL, '11.09.2023 Robert placed an RX request. Coupons are attached below. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-11-09 18:03:42', '2023-11-09 18:03:42');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000128383132', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121162002', 'Todd Occhiuto', NULL, '11-9-2023:  Todd LM.  He has MD prev appt tomorrow & can''t find his card.  I called him back & we found his orig e-mail that includes his pdf version.  His Dr Zub is not listed in the PHCS ntwk search, but we went over having the office call Planstin so they can wk out the doc''s off billing for him.  He knows, if they won''t bill it''s not reimb.  Went over keeping everything ''prev'', how to handle labs since very little is cov, & IF Planstin cannot recognize his memb, don''t panic we are having tech diff in the comm between the two companies.  Please let us know.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-11-09 17:50:36', '2023-11-09 17:50:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128403072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105086010', 'Ben Rego', NULL, '11.09.2023  no welcome call
too many questions', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-11-09 17:33:00', '2023-11-09 17:33:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128383124', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123199001', 'Carey Reynolds', NULL, '11-9-2023:  Carey called to confirm what the draw date for the monthly contribution.  She knows last month was an exception, but it is normally processed through on the 20th, then the bank generally takes 2-4 days to show it on their end (then there are weekends &amp; holidays to take into account as well).  She knows to plan on the 20th, but also to keep an eye on her e-mails.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-11-09 17:15:36', '2023-11-09 17:26:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128383119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107788002', 'Kevin Byram', NULL, '11/9/2023:  LM for Jaime:  Not sure if you recently left a message, or if it came in prior to our last conv.  I do not really have any other suggestion, other than what we discussed (in depth last time).  However, didn''t want to ignore the message in case you did still need to talk.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-11-09 17:12:22', '2023-11-09 17:12:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128408042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109354169', 'Daniel McMillan', NULL, '11-9-23 Dan chose Kaiser last year and spent more money for what turned out to be a bad plan. He went in for a skin check that wound up costing about $1K!  His skin was good, no problems.  He realized what a scam it is and wants to go back to MEC with SECURE HSA. He''s self-employed and entering his EIN to enroll. He doesn''t have an health issues and I explained the pre-x clause as usual. He''s re-building a house in S. Boulder right now. He say he''ll have to come to my party next time regarding my client appreciation party. Chose Dec. 1st start date.  He''ll cancel Kaiser for 12/1/23.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-09 16:30:12', '2023-11-09 16:30:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128408031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081352008', 'Daniel McMillan', NULL, '11-9-23 Dan chose Kaiser last year and spent more money for what turned out to be a bad plan. He went in for a skin check that wound up costing about $1K!  His skin was good, no problems.  He realized what a scam it is and wants to go back to MEC with SECURE HSA. He''s self-employed and entering his EIN to enroll. He doesn''t have an health issues and I explained the pre-x clause as usual. He''s re-building a house in S. Boulder right now. He say he''ll have to come to my party next time regarding my client appreciation party. Chose Dec. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-09 16:25:52', '2023-11-09 16:29:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128383114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125276002', 'Tristan Sophia', 'Re:  Tckt #: 3111', '11-9-2023:  Advisor Lou Spatafore submitted a ticket, but from the verbiage, I''m not 100% sure which card he''s requesting.  Sent the following to him to find out who we need to ask for the correct item:

"Cari Adams-Waneka     04:04 PM     ( responded in 50 minutes )

Hi Lou,

You asked for us the send the MPB member card.  Is that what you are requesting?  Or do you mean the Planstin ID card?

The request goes to different people, depending on which they need.

Thanks!

Cari Adams-Waneka
MPB Health Concierge
1-800-519-2969
