-------------------------------------------------------------     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-11-09 16:07:44', '2023-11-09 16:07:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128408023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165420', 'Jennifer Shedd', NULL, '11-9-23 Jennifer made only $10K last year and is reinventing herself now. She may do coaching for helping people in career transitions. She has no idea what her income will be. We had to put it at $32K for her to be above the threshold for Medicaid. She''s getting a $835.84 APTC and paying $96.95 a month for a much better plan with CSR of $100 ded. and $1000 mop. She''ll wait to do her specialist visits once she has the $40 co-pay. She''s happy now and her plan is showing above. I will also send her the dental discount plan to see if it''s worth it or not. Nicholas will be on her tax return in 2024, so he''s still included on app.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-09 14:32:33', '2023-11-09 14:51:33'),
