  ('zcrm_1579374000128383109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013798036', 'Russell Jewell', NULL, 'Member called into me and wanted to know about his wife.  She will be starting her employer insurance 1/1/24 and she has a appointment soon for a breast check up.  He wanted to know if she could stay on the membership for a month.  I advised that we couldn''t do that for that short a time period.  He asked about the possibility of enrolling her on the plan for next year and I gave him pricing .  He to contact Mike Montes', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-11-09 14:11:17', '2023-11-09 14:11:17'),
