  ('zcrm_1579374000128383104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038216055', 'Paul Geersen', NULL, 'Member emailed in asking about cancelling membership.  I sent him link and copied advisor.  I advised member to submit between 12/1 &amp; 12/23 for a 1/1/24 effective.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-11-09 12:43:21', '2023-11-09 12:43:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128403041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114408009', 'Kim Scott', NULL, '11.08.2023 Joel annual check up, had the standard lipid panel tested,  80061, Planstin covered the annual check-up, but sent the $21.73 worth of Labwork cost. We called Planstin, and spoke with Celeste, and we learned it is because it was coded diagnostic. Joel will contact the lab, and request to recode the test to preventative, and call the -----7526 # for billing. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-11-09 12:15:54', '2023-11-09 12:29:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128403036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115246001', 'Kristi Anderson', NULL, '11.09.2023 Kristi called inquiring about getting covered for dermatology. I explained that it will be out of pocket, so present as a cash pay patient and request the cash pay discount, if available. I went in further to explain that the only time we have seen it shared, was if it were affecting the member''s health medically, such as cancer.
Kristi also asked about Lab and Prescription discounts or coverage, and I explained the options are to search multiple pharmacy discount sites, and compare lab discount sites for the best prices prior to going to either place.
I sent her two emails via Outlook: HCBB and Healthgrades sites, and the MPB resource sites and forms for future reference. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-11-09 11:50:15', '2023-11-09 13:35:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128408008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109779247', 'Todd Wells', NULL, '11-9-23 Todd Wells and Megan are both 47 now and their son is 9. They are both self-employed and they have an EIN to use. They want SECURE to do their annual wellness visits and they like to fund an HSA. They are healthy. Todd takes Lipitor for high cholesterol and it''s well managed. Meg takes Estradiol and Progesterone which cost her about $60 total per month. I suspect she can get is cheaper via the MPB Concierge Team. I also coached them on calling the Concierge if they ever needs labs, imaging, scans, surgeries, etc. They live in Durango. We set an appt for Monday to enroll in SECURE $1000/$715, $125/$25 for a Dec. 1st start date. I also gave then the new rates for Oct. 2024.  All set to make the change. They are paying about $1100 in 2023 and I suspect it will be $1300-$1400 for 2024 juding from what I''ve seen for the full price this year.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-09 11:35:52', '2023-11-09 11:35:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128383090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076535957', 'Ryan Koehler', NULL, '11-9-2023:  Megan called:
     - Husband went in for a skin well ck, covered?  Went over how not considered ''prev'', but IF issues, then could move to healthsharing (& what happens if mult areas of the body.  Sub as one, but will prob move to 2 ''issues'' = 2 IUAs).  They did biopsies on 2 spots.
     - Daughter is 10, had yearly ck.  Then yesterday she had to take her to the same doc for illness & presented as ''cash-pay''.  We went over how to handle both situations.
     - IUAs:  Went over how they work, resp for 3 in 12 mos rolling period, if active over several yrs w/no 12 mo or >, etc.
     - Labs:  Went over how to handle labs by being pro-active (not for emerg situations), but how we can help w/disc lab sites that save her & the comm $.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-11-09 11:23:32', '2023-11-09 11:49:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128388081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624001', 'Rachel Holden', NULL, 'Spoke to member she needed to reschedule welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-11-09 11:17:41', '2023-11-09 11:17:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128383085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052396397', 'Helen Zivelonghi', NULL, '11-9-2023:  Helen LM just w/name &amp; ph #.  I called back &amp; had to LM.  Asked her to plez try us again.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-11-09 11:17:12', '2023-11-09 11:17:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128383080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122612001', 'Jennifer Speed', NULL, '11-9-2023:  Jennifer called &amp; LM.  She has an ER bill she needs to submit &amp; wanted help/instructions on how to sub.  I called back &amp; had to LM.  Plez call &amp; we''ll walk you thru the curr process.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-11-09 11:12:54', '2023-11-09 11:12:54'),
