  ('zcrm_1579374000128388066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126068007', 'Amy Zhang', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-11-09 10:50:51', '2023-11-09 10:50:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128388061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126068007', 'Amy Zhang', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-11-09 10:43:27', '2023-11-09 10:43:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128383069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122567002', 'Alexandra Novo', NULL, '11-9-2023:  Alexandra called &amp; LM asking how much Vyvance would cost.  I called back &amp; LM:  just need a strength &amp; qty so I can look it up.  Also mentioned we have an online form for RX quotes, that gathers all the information we need (for next time).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-11-09 10:41:18', '2023-11-09 10:41:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128388046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126312002', 'Russ Carpenter', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-11-09 10:37:15', '2023-11-09 10:37:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128403003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116236002', 'Lisa D''Onofrio', NULL, '11.09.2023 Lisa called concerned b/c she was told by Planstin that coverage for her daughter was cancelled in May 2023, which does not make sense since she signed up with us in March.
She went to the doctor for her daughter, who is 6, but they told her that her daughter''s insurance was cancelled in May. THEN shared with that she has her husband on the insurance, whom she never added, since he had gotten ill and passed away.
I consulted with Cari via teams, and after brief investigation, it called for deeper digging by connecting with outside entities (Planstin & Zion), to get answers. Lisa was willing to hear back from us, to learn where the miscommunication took place, and if she needs to do anything on her end.
We discussed labs, and I informed her that we can help her find prepaid discounted websites to save on those parts of her visits. She was not able to follow along right at the time, so I offered to send her the links she can peruse. I suggested that she call us with any needed guidance or questions.
Lisa also attempted her welcome call, a while back, but they cancelled on her, and was never rescheduled. I offered to resend that link, fresh, so she gets a chance to have the orientation. 
I sent both emails: Lab links & Scheduling welcome call link, via CRM. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-11-09 10:23:45', '2023-11-09 10:28:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128383058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080099002', 'Michelle Stevens', NULL, '11-9-2023:  Advisor Karen Torsoe called.  She wondered how the ''Hosp Bill Eraser'' works.  I don''t have any information on that, but thought Ali would know who to get her to, so trans her to Ali''s line.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-11-09 10:17:44', '2023-11-09 10:17:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128388036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126312002', 'Russ Carpenter', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-11-09 10:07:32', '2023-11-09 10:07:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128383047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000127964002', 'Melissa Griffith', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-11-09 09:59:37', '2023-11-09 09:59:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000128383042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080099002', 'Michelle Stevens', NULL, 'Member called with some questions about cancelling because they might be going on "insurance" however one of the dependents would like to continue on the membership.  I advised that they would have to re-enroll.  I gave her the pricing for the member and advised her of the deadlines', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-11-09 09:33:11', '2023-11-09 09:33:11'),
