  ('zcrm_1579374000128287021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002724127', 'Paul DeFelice', NULL, 'Paul called in explaining how his wife has been having some digestion issues and her primary care doctor referred her to have a colonoscopy and endoscopy done. He wanted to know the process. I explained this is an out-of-pocket cost up to their IUA of $2500. He fully understands as he has done a sharing request before with Zion, he was pulling up the portal and website for Healthcare Bluebook to look up fair pricing facilities in their area. He is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-11-08 08:38:10', '2023-11-08 08:38:10'),
