  ('zcrm_1579374000128233071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111845002', 'Cindy Wolden', NULL, '11.07.2023 Jason called to learn how to submit his bills to get shared with Zion. After naming a few incidences that had to do with his children, Jason learned that to submit the bills, they have to be issue specific, each membership is responsible for only 3 IUA''s total, and he cannot combine all the receipts he has in front of him, which is what he was hoping to do.
