  ('zcrm_1579374000128151055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108411002', 'Andrew Buschbacher', NULL, '11-7-2023:  Andrew e-mailed wanting to go direct w/Zion.  His e-mail and my response is below.  I have him contacting his advisor for help understanding our benefits (although I highlighted them in my e-mail for him) & ultimately if he does decide to cancel, Leslie Jablonski can help him with that process:

