  ('zcrm_1579374000127962023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107479026', 'Jaclyn Peters', NULL, '11.02.2023 He went into Urgent Care on in July, did EKG, sent him to emergency room, did additional testing, had him wear a monitor for week, paid lab bills, paid physician bill, and urgent care bill.
Will call back to open a sharing request...
Cirrus MD Registration successfully sent for both adults: Jaclyn (email on file jaclyn@terrafirmaautomotive.com) and Dan (Dan''s email dan@terrafirmaautomotive.com). NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-11-02 16:26:47', '2023-11-02 17:09:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127962018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096330001', 'Paul Lewandosky', NULL, '11.02.2023 Lisa called and ask for Cari, but Cari was working with another valued member. Lisa offered her phone number instead of contacting her husband, I shared it with Cari via Teams to call her back.
*****************************************************************************************
Lisa called again, since Cari has not had the opportunity to return her call, but Cari had shared with me the progress on the situation; Lisa cancelled from our system, but still showing up on Planstin''s. I shared with Lisa that it has been escalated to the billing department to communicate with Planstin''s party who is responsible for the file integration process and completion, in order to remove her from they system.
Lisa was glad to hear that there''s movement on this, and was appeased for Cari to call her back ONLY if she needed to share anything more or have questions for her. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-11-02 16:16:20', '2023-11-02 16:16:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127962013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031391042', 'Jonathan VanNoy', NULL, '11.02.2023 Nicole called in again today, since no one has reached out to her from the office. She seemed frustrated today, and needed someone to connect with her and offer any clarification on the situation, and their present options. She was not going to wait another week to call us again, so she said she will call back tomorrow to speak to someone. I brought Catherine in on the situation directly, at this point, to expedite the needed progress on it. I sent Catherine and Cari the following:
Good evening Catherine,
I hope your day was productive and less hectic than last week.
I''m bringing the following ticket to your attention, as it requires some progress, but it is outside the scope of the Concierge.
Can you please shed some light on this for this VanNoy family?
 
Ticket #3083 in a nutshell:
1-Different deadlines were shared for conversion; January by Planstin, June by MPB
2-Email from Patti suggests to contact advisor to get help with the conversion, they did, but she was too busy to talk to them
3-Son has major health issues that have surfaced, when they went to open a need with Sedera, they learned they are not covered.
4-VanNoy family have called to learn of their options, and get some clarification on the whole situation, but no one has connected with them.
5-They plan to call again tomorrow, per what they said today (I mistakenly transferred them to Reba''s VM), today they were frustrated
 
Please connect with me if you would like more details on this matter. It is a sensitive matter, and I''m not sure what more help I can offer from the concierge realm. 
 
Thank you in advance Catherine. Please keep me posted as to what we could further do.  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-11-02 16:11:05', '2023-11-02 16:11:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127963033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924134', 'Kristen Lassalette', NULL, '11-2-23 Kristen called bc she still never received a Planstin card. She has all of her preventative visit bills still to get reimbursed. She will send them to me and I''ll forward them to Planstin''s team to handle once and for all. She lives in an area with no PCHS options to choose from. So, it''s been a big hassle from the beginning.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-02 16:08:47', '2023-11-02 16:08:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127963028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106731013', 'Lori Miller', NULL, '11-2-23 Lori will turn 65 in Sept. She is happy to be connected with Andrea now and will reach out in Aug. She''s happy to fund her HSA for the new plan above. She paid her initial payment via C4 with a cc to make sure she''s set for 2024. She will put on her calendar to set up auto pay in early Dec. for 2024. She''s good to go.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-02 15:54:49', '2023-11-02 15:54:49'),
