  ('zcrm_1579374000127942159', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870127', 'Heather Braeutigam', NULL, '11-2-2023:  Heather called.  Her daughter is having back issues & they wanted to know if chiropractic care is a benefit.  We went over how w/prior auth on a qualified ''sharing req'' it sometimes can be.  So we discussed they have a 1k IUA, but my suggestion is to get the doctor to show why the chiro care will be a good option, instead of other treatments & then have the chiro write a treatment plan & lets include the doc''s diagnosis exp, w/a new ''sharing req''.  She will decide how to handle & will call for help on sub a ''sharing req'' if desired.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-11-02 14:28:01', '2023-11-03 16:31:34'),
