  ('zcrm_1579374000127963003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083756038', 'Lisa Birkhofer', NULL, '11-2-23 Lisa got a letter showing she would owe the full cost of her plan at $960+. I reviewed her account and she was qualifying for Medicaid at $19,008. So we changed her income from investments to $21,900 and that qualified her for $965.52 APTC putting her current and new Cigna Connect CO Option Silver at $0 for her!!  She was happy with Cigna and we believe they will be around in the future. She''s thrilled and no payment due. Therefore, nothing more for her to do on her end other than make sure she gets communication from Cigna onward.

