  ('zcrm_1579374000127942099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100495002', 'Paul Eckenrode', 'Decline of 11/23 Share Amount', 'Member called in prior to me sending out decline and advised me to rerun pmt.  Should be ok now.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-11-02 11:15:44', '2023-11-02 11:15:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127932130', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126313011', 'Loreen Crockett', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-11-02 11:12:40', '2023-11-02 11:12:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127942082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113500001', 'Diana Albrecht', NULL, '11-2-2023:  Diana had a ton of questions:
     - ''P''lanstin = ''prev'':  = Only time "ins" = Y, only time ID card presented (Planstin card), NO reimb, office must bill for you & all must be med coded as "preventative".  PHCS ntwk preferred, but outside ntwk ok IF prov will bill Planstin for you.  Planstin''s ph # is on the front of their card prov can call to conf willing to bill ahead of your appt.  *Labs NOT generally cov.  Went thru proactively getting the Lab Order & calling us for help w/pre-pd disc site for best pricing.
     - Mamm:  2D is cov, if unavail call Planstin & conf they''ll pay for 3D as 2D diff in some areas.  Ask them to send e-mail conf you can show your provider (& you''ll have it in writing).  Make sure both imaging cntr & comp that reads images will bill for you.
     - DexaScan:  This is a name brand & is NOT cov by ''prev'' care.  Has too many extra bells & whistles.  Reg bone density is covered.  She has fam history of osteoporosis, but will start w/the ''prev'' that is cov & move to DexaScan if issue so she doesn''t have to worry about paying right now.
     - IUAs:  She had no idea how her IUAs work.  She understood it to be like a deducatible.  Went thru in depth education on this.  Took a bit, but I think she finally understood.
     - HSA:  Went over how this can help w/med bills < 1k IUA or not covered.  Also good retirement tool for items not pd in full by Medicare.  Watch the fees.  Ask acct total can put in each yr. 
     - Illness, accident, catastrophic:  Went over how to present for everything that is not ''prev'': no "ins", no "ins" card,  ''cash-pay'' pt, (if doc has ''prev'' from previous visit, tell them not valid today), ask for ''cash-pay'' disc, get detailed inv & pymt receipts.  If they need pymt upfront or at time of srvc, ask if you can pay 1k (your IUA) and can they bill you the balance.  Then call us for help deciding if/when to sub ''sharing req'' to healthshare.  6mos deadline for DOS to have expenses included.  Can be ongoing & under 1k IUA to protect having those expenses incl.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-11-02 10:55:08', '2023-11-02 11:22:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127932120', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126571002', 'Lindsey Brown', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-11-02 10:37:07', '2023-11-02 10:37:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127942077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471338', 'Steve Tobias', 'New Membership eff 12/1/23', 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-11-02 10:28:12', '2023-11-02 10:28:12'),
