  ('zcrm_1579374000127932100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128526002', 'Barbara Lucille', NULL, '11-2-23 wants to enroll on Thu 11/9. I sent her an email for 3pm. She needs to confirm.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2023-11-02 09:59:00', '2023-11-02 09:59:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127942061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112660002', 'Timothy Rennert', 'New Membership eff 12/1/2023', 'Member Only $2500 Care+', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-11-02 09:49:33', '2023-11-02 09:49:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127947019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113500001', 'Diana Albrecht', NULL, 'Diana called in and needed pricing for a dexiscan for a history from her father of having osteoporosis, along with a mammogram she hasn''t had in 3 years. I let her know Cari would be able to look into that for her, and lastly, she had a question on how the Zion portion works with her injury/illness. I gave her the full run down and she completely understands but just wanted to sure. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-11-02 09:49:30', '2023-11-02 09:49:30'),
