  ('zcrm_1579374000127892003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124848011', 'Eileen Sun', NULL, '11-1-23 A new member has enrolled in a HMA 2500:

Member Name: Eileen Sun     

Member ID: 96634', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-01 21:06:46', '2023-11-01 21:06:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127844063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000127834010', 'Desmond Agostini', NULL, '11-1-23 Desmond is 52 and Kimberly is 57. She had a bad reaction to a vax as a kid. They choose alternative care primarily for 30 years and don''t really use traditional care and never on any meds. They found me via the radio show I did through Naturally Inspired Health and Tammy Cuthbert Garcia. Desmond works for Airgas and Kimberly is a housewife. They have a 29 year old son, Donovan without ins right now and self-employed. He''s a master barber. He might want to join as well. They live in NC near Duke. Desmond had to do a physical for the Dept of Transportation (DOT) and he momentarily had high blood pressure in 2020. He resolved it with diet and exercise in a matter of two weeks. He''s all set on that front. So, no pre-x. Their zip is 27455. They chose to enroll in CARE+ since they don''t do traditional annual wellness visits. They were paying $425 semi-weekly which is $920.33 and his company paid the rest. So, by choosing CARE+ at $1000 it''s $520 a month for now until Oct. 1st. They are all set. For some reason they couldn''t get the Captcha to work and had to do it about 20 times. All set finally.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-01 20:24:20', '2023-11-01 20:24:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127844055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130526365', 'Isaiah Burdon', NULL, '11-1-23 Isaiah applied for the $750K 20YR Term at Standard with NLG and will likely be rated higher since no health issues, meds, family history or anything. He chose the 10th of the month for the bank draft date. It''s set to monthly but he might want to pay annually. He didn''t know any health history for either parent since they aren''t involved in his life. He and Brianna Krampetz are getting life policies to help qualify for an SBA loan of $400K to start their own business. He''s a mechanic and earns around $50K per year and has possibly $80K in assets. He and Brianna live together and share a mortgage but they are not married and file taxes separately. I might have put his DOB wrong above. I can verify via the app in NLG.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-01 20:12:21', '2023-11-01 20:12:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127844050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130526392', 'Brianna Krampetz', NULL, '11-1-23 Brianna applied for the $750K 20YR Term at Standard and will likely be rated higher since no health issues, meds, family history or anything. She chose the 10th of the month for the bank draft date. It''s set to monthly but she might want to pay annually. It was showing at $62 for some unknown reason since the app showed about $44 instead. I''m not sure why but I selected to be notified before it''s issued to determine rating and payment amount.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-11-01 20:04:26', '2023-11-01 20:04:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127844045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109185001', 'Kim Lim', NULL, '11-1-2023:  Lim, Kim(seng) came up in the caller ID of a missed call yesterday (not all calls were ringing to people), but this ph # & name match.  I called him back today & he''s thinking about adding his wife & kids.  He doesn''t know what the price would be AND I let him know he should make sure it''s a good fit re: pre-x, etc for his family members.  He''s going to touchbase w/his advisor Justin Garrett (says he will text him tomorrow), then will call us once he''s sure it''s a good fit & the price is acceptable.  He knows as long as he sub a chg form w/our help no later than 11/17/2023, he can have them added for a 12/1/2023 eff date.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-11-01 18:04:24', '2023-11-01 18:04:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127832033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109660001', 'Laura Hunt', 'Ticket #3090 SUBMITTED', 'Member is Irate for Experiencing The Opposite of What Was Sold to Her
01 Nov 2023 05:10 PM
 Reply Comment
NT
Nahla Tebcherany
just now
RE: Laura Hunt - Member Only
       Leonardo Moraes was Laura''s advisor. Laura only chose to sign up with MPB, b/c she was assured her PCP would be covered.
Dr. refuses to bill for her, and therefore Planstin will not pay, since they do not reimburse.
Laura says she is holding MPB responsible for promises made.

