  ('zcrm_1579374000127844035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359127', 'John Scarrow', NULL, '11-1-2023:  John called.  ER visit:  ended w/another issue, then finally a diagnosis of liver cancer, so he wanted to know the max paid on sharing req.  I let him know Sedera would be the people that can give him best answers, but I didn''t think he needed to be too concerned on the limits.  Gave him their ph # and he''s calling them.  Let him know how sorry I am they are dealing with this.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-11-01 16:39:30', '2023-11-02 11:29:41'),
