Subject: Re: Lab Tests
 
Hi Jamie,

The lab needs you to go online and place the order yourself.  Ask the doctor for the lab order, go online, order, & prepay yourself.  The doctor calling in the labs won''t work because you must place the order.

When you place the order (per the doctor''s order they give you for reference) it will ask you where to send the results.  That will be your doctor''s office (& you as well, although often they have a portal for your reference).

Then, once you have your pre-paid receipt, take that and the doctor''s order to the lab.  They''ll do the tests, and you are all set.

Please give me a call tomorrow if you have questions on this.  I know it''s confusing.

Respectfully yours,

Cari Adams-Waneka
MPB Health Concierge
1-800-519-2969
