  ('zcrm_1579374000127724045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100500002', 'Robin Rudy', NULL, '10-31-2023:  Robin sent an e-mail, instead of calling the concierge line.  This take so much more time, I wish she would have called.  Hopefully, I remembered everything, it''s much harder to type it all out:
