  ('zcrm_1579374000127453074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064410489', 'Michael DePaso', NULL, '10-27-23 Mike Depaso is upset bc his son Spencer joined and nobody can find record of his membership at MPB. Spencer should have been passed to me since he''s Tom''s son. However, Tony Manzanarez took the lead, spoke with him 2 additional times and set it to a junk lead. Spencer joined on his own and directly with Zion, unbeknownst to Tom. At least, that''s what we think happened. Spencer was able to gain proof of membership with his ID card. Mike is frustrated bc he was told the need would be denied. However, they haven''t even created  a Need yet. Spencer spoke with someone at Zion who said it wouldn''t be shareable. Spencer landed in the ER due to a scare and it turns out he has diabetes and likely needs insulin, etc. I wrote notes in Spencer''s account. Mike is a retired Dr. and is upset that he''s told it won''t be shareable. I suspect the Zion Rep didn''t understand he was talking about an ER visit and newly diagnosed diabetes. Anyhow, I''ll help guide Mike and I''m waiting to see if we can get Spencer moved over to MPB.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-27 22:05:21', '2023-10-27 22:05:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127453064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442111', 'Sarah Getzelman', NULL, '10-27-23 Sarah''s mammo is getting denied by Zion. They are saying she doesn''t have the MEC. This is true bc she has DIRECT which includes the preventative mammo. She beyond the 6 month waiting period as well. The visit was 8 months after she moved her membership to DIRECT. So, I forwarded it on to Zion and Planstin and they are looking into it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-27 21:55:05', '2023-10-27 21:55:05'),
