  ('zcrm_1579374000127450047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031391042', 'Jonathan VanNoy', NULL, '10.27.2023 Nicole called to learn how to get covered via health-sharing. It is possible that her son (?) will need a colonoscopy due to a gastrointestinal situation (terms she is worried about: autoimmune -  hereditary)
