  ('zcrm_1579374000127450039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005654025', 'Catherine Krznarich', NULL, '10.27.2023 Cathy called concerned about billing (Like many members yesterday & today), cause we were expecting to extract billing 10.25, and it did not happen due to a system flaw. I assured Cathy that she is covered, and it is a tech. system failure, and that the office is all hands on deck rectifying the issue. 
