  ('zcrm_1579374000127453046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291752', 'Christine Harvey', NULL, '10-27-23 Christine is enrolling now into SECURE HSA with tax ID. Dec. 1st start date. I waived the $100 for her.  She has a small surgery in a few days that she''s not worried about. She knows if anything goes wrong with it, it will be considered pre-x. Using ACH bank draft to pay.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-27 13:18:26', '2023-10-27 13:18:26'),
