  ('zcrm_1579374000127454018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109620011', 'Monique Koen', NULL, '10-27-2023:  Monique''s mom & employer Tina Koen, called.  Monique lost a pregnancy at about 6 weeks & she wasn''t sure what happens w/sharing.  I let Tina know I could only speak in general maternity sharing since Monique is an adult on her own memb.  She was fine w/that.  We went over everything:  1k IUA for preg, poss 2nd if baby needs indep care even during the pregnancy (use hydrocephalus as an example & it turns out Tina''s sister has this condition too, so she completely understood), 6mos deadline for starting the sharing req = 6mos from official conf of preg, etc.  She''s going to have Monique call so I can go over the details with her.  That way, if/when she''s preg again, she''ll know exactly how to present to the doc, etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-27 12:55:22', '2023-10-27 12:55:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127454013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081869008', 'Frederick Koen', NULL, '10-27-2023:  Tina called w/questions re: maternity sharing requests [her daughter & employee who is on her own plan = Monique Koen was pregnant, but only 6 wks along, but they are trying].  She knew I could not speak specifically to Monique due to privacy, but we went over exactly how ''Maternity Sharing Req'' work.  She will have Monique call us so she knows how to handle.  Tina doesn''t think the curr preg expenses got anywhere near the 1k IUA on the plan they provide their employees, but she''ll confirm.  We also talk about it being ''issue'' spec.  So this pregnancy''s exp, don''t move to the next pregnancy''s IUA.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-27 12:50:37', '2023-10-27 12:50:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127448061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085589002', 'Brittani Alsobrook', 'Decline of 11/23 Share Amount', '1st notice sent to member and advisor via em &amp; vm - 10/27 (O)', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-10-27 12:48:20', '2023-10-27 12:48:20'),
