  ('zcrm_1579374000127453021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116383002', 'Liza Bakken', NULL, '10-27-23 Her mammogram is going to be covered 100% finally.  

This is from Planstin -
This letter is to notify you of the resolution of the Level 1 Internal Appeal that you filed with us on October 25, 2023 related to the balance bill you received from Aspen Valley Hospital for a covered preventive service you received on  07/24/2023. Please note that any personal information contained in this appeal is confidential.  After careful evaluation of your request, we have made the following determination:  The original decision is being reversed & the claim is being reprocessed. The claim has been sent back for reprocessing and we will be issuing Aspen Valley Hospital a check in the amount of $262.90 in order to cover your preventive service at 100%. We apologize for any inconvenience this may have caused you. In the event that you receive another balance bill from a provider for a covered preventive service, please reach out to our Benefit Advocacy Team at (888) 920-7526 or you can mail a copy of the bill you received from the provider along with the following information to Planstin, ATTN: Claims/Appeals, 1506 S. Silicon Way, Suite 2B, St. George, UT 84770: Member Name & Date of Birth Member ID & Group Number Claim Number Date of Service Name of Provider', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-27 11:13:26', '2023-10-27 11:13:26'),
