  ('zcrm_1579374000127453016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083756038', 'Lisa Birkhofer', NULL, '10-27-23 Lisa got a letter from C4 stating her APTC is $0 for 2024 which sounds like an error. Her dad passed away in April and she did receive an inheritance which is most not taxable. She believes a small portion of about $30K is taxable. So, she stopped paying herself from savings at $1200 a month and used the $30K to support herself.  Her income will be the similar this year. She''ll plug in the numbers on Nov. 1st and see what her options are. She really liked her Cigna plan at $11.  If she can keep that, she''d like to. But, she can''t pay the full cost of $900+!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-27 10:44:20', '2023-10-27 10:44:20'),
