  ('zcrm_1579374000127404003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109742001', 'Abigail Chan', NULL, 'Abigail called in asking is CirrusMD can do service for dermatology. I let her know yes, but that is the one and only type of service that CirrusMD charges for, which is $75. Abigail then asked would they be able to classify it as a general appointment if this is something that she''s never had before, along those lines. To which getting clarification, she would be fine and not have to pay the $75. Abigail lastly asked what she does if she is then referred to go and see a dermatologist in person. I let her know she is self-pay up to her IUA of $1000, anything thereafter she is to keep all receipts and bills to submit into Zion Health. She said she understands and is all set for now. Also, I told her she does not have to be in network for this type of care. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-10-27 07:54:58', '2023-10-27 07:54:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127398003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095963001', 'Stacie Swisher', NULL, 'I received an email from this member saying that she had two dermatologist visits totaling roughly $1500  and where could she submit them.  I explained the opening of a need to her and coached her not to pay any more than $1000 in the future.  I suggested another Welcome call and she thought that was a good idea.  I will send out the scheduler for her to schedule another one.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-10-27 07:36:45', '2023-10-27 07:36:45'),
