  ('zcrm_1579374000127369039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064410489', 'Michael DePaso', NULL, '10.26.2023 Returned Michael''s phone call. He ended up looking into certain healthsharing services with Zion for his son Spence, who he thought has a plan with a high deductible with us.
I searched for Spencer Depaso, but he only comes up as a lead under Tony M.
I checked Admin123, and he did not show up there either. As a matter of fact, Michael''s name there is Mike - need to parallel both platforms.
I asked Michael, b/c he''s unsure about what his son ended up deciding on and what he did, regarding signing up with us, to have another more informative conversation with Spencer and give us a call back.
The INITIAL call was to inquire about diabetes supplies and equipment, not being covered by Zion (Spencer called Zion and talked to them directly), and Michael NOT BEING AWARE of it off hand, prior to signing up for the plan. He sounded very displeased and a very concerned about his son''s situation and now knowing what their options are from here.
His son was JUST diagnosed with diabetes, after losing 20 lbs instantly, urinating constantly and having an insatiable appetite.
Michael called back, confirming that Zion did indeed send Spencer a confirmation email with a card and an ID#. 
I messaged Wendy, since Michael is one of her members, to see if she can help via Teams, but I was not able to reach her. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-26 15:45:32', '2023-10-26 16:18:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127369034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074947103', 'Holly Hildreth', NULL, '10.26.2023 Ryan called concerned about billing (Like many members today), and wanting to access his MPB Portal to view the charges. We were expecting to extract billing yesterday, and it did not happen due to a system flaw. I assured Ryan that he is covered, and it is a tech. system failure, and that the office is all hands on deck rectifying the issue. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-26 15:40:17', '2023-10-26 15:40:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127374011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116383002', 'Liza Bakken', NULL, '10-26-23 Ashlee with Planstin said they will take are of Liza''s mammogram bill after she got the serious run around from Planstin. It should be all set now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-26 15:28:32', '2023-10-26 15:28:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127375003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128409020', 'Christian Genson', NULL, '10-26-2023 Called LVM.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2023-10-26 14:48:19', '2023-10-26 14:48:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127363053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073555128', 'Raphael Joly', NULL, '10-26-2023:  Raphael called & LM for me specifically to call him back.  We talked and it felt difficult to get specifics.  If I''m understanding:
     - Zion sent him a request to create his ''Zion Memb Portal''.  I walked him thru this new ''Zion Port'' process and he will req an ''invite'' if he needs.  Then, he knows he''ll eventually be able to see his ''med need = sharing req'' (we went over these are the same thing, just new terminology) here and the details.  Because he has an older ''req'' , I told him to call the ''sharing dept = ext #:6'' to see if they can move his req to his portal.  Then he can upload new items to the old req. 
        Re: his surg from this old hit & run accident - he knows Zion is the only entity that can provide the approval for pymt.  I let him know it''s not unusual for the surg to provide an estimate for the surg treatment plan.  That''s something he can get to Zion to get the PRIOR approval.  I think he understands that, but I encouraged him to please call at any time so we can continue to guide him.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-26 14:37:17', '2023-10-26 14:37:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127374003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563258', 'Brandi Stanley', NULL, '10-26-23 Brandi is asking about benefits in Mexico and I just sent her the section from the Guidelines about sharing when  abroad. I also left her a vm but she said email will be better while she''s away right now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-26 14:30:36', '2023-10-26 14:32:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127335058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064410656', 'Gerald Kelly', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 11/1/23.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-10-26 14:26:15', '2023-10-26 14:26:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127363039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064410656', 'Gerald Kelly', NULL, '10-26-2023:  Gerald called back again.  He called Michael Montes'' office &amp; the person on the other end of the line couldn''t even understand what he was asking (said it was like he didn''t understand English).  He couldn''t LM and he''s totally frustrated by trying to contact him.  Since he now has trad "ins" in place, I went ahead &amp; walked him thru the cancellation form, letting him know they will acknowledge it once it''s complete.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-26 13:45:30', '2023-10-26 13:46:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127335048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064410656', 'Gerald Kelly', NULL, 'Member called in wanting to cancel.  I directed him to Mike Montes.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-10-26 13:35:24', '2023-10-26 13:35:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127335038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123838002', 'Cassidy Young', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request eff 11/25.  He has already spoken to JC.  Member wanted a refund for November I advised that we had not billed him as yet.  Also wanted a refund for Sept. since he had not used it.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-10-26 13:06:47', '2023-10-26 13:06:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127363031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257159', 'Michele Schwadron', NULL, '10-26-2023:  Michele called:
     - Mamm: We went over best of both worlds.  Present Planstin ID card at time you make appt & make sure all prov (imaging cntr & people who read the images) will bill Planstin for her.  She knows Planstin''s ph # is on the front of the card if the prov have questions.
     - Toe surgery:  Michele has some sort of issue between her toes.  She told me what it was called (twice) & I still didn''t catch the name.  She wondered how this will be handled.  We went over the curr proc for sub a ''sharing req''.  We also went over how to present & how everything twds this issue can be sub (PCP if for this issue, orthopedic exp, surg treatment estimate, etc).  She''s doing it right now (so we didn''t go over the deadlines).  She knows she''s resp for 1k IUA, then once approved, the comm will help share w/a qualified issue.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-26 11:59:22', '2023-10-26 13:56:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127369023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123838002', 'Cassidy Young', NULL, '10.26.2023 Cassidy signed up with JC. He has had is welcome/orientation call with Vanessa
YET:
He did not know how to take his kid to a preventative appointment
