  ('zcrm_1579374000127363008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103737002', 'Matthew Hatcher', NULL, '10-26-2023:  Matthew left VM, wondering about his Oct draw.  Let him know we sent out some e-mails to notify him  that our system was down & we are trying to fix it, with the intent to process everyone''s pymts on the 25th.  But, the entire system kicked back last night & they are working on it now.  That I expect them to get it fixed in the next day or two & then it can take 3-4 days to show on his end, but his membership is intact and to monitor his e-mail in case they communicate further regarding this month''s contribution.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-26 11:24:39', '2023-10-26 11:24:39'),
