  ('zcrm_1579374000127363003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116033002', 'Laura Boyd', NULL, '10-26-2023:  Laura called &amp; LM w/Julia asking about her covid &amp; flu immunizations.  She''s on CARE+, so does not have any ''prev''.  Let her know many places are still able to access funding for covid though, so she can at least let them know she does not have "ins" and ask if there''s anyway to get help on that one.  Also let her know I had to call around and found much better pricing at a pharmacy I called, after the one I went to was so expensive.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-26 10:32:40', '2023-10-26 10:32:40'),
