  ('zcrm_1579374000127294013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122117002', 'Leisa Heuple', NULL, '10.25.2023 Jeff''s medical doctor''s office, HonorHealth, where he had his annual physical, called to verify his coverage. I offered general information, and requested that Jeff contact us to learn about his plan better. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-25 16:35:37', '2023-10-25 16:35:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127294008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563258', 'Brandi Stanley', NULL, '10.25.2023 Brandi called from Mexico to inquire about international coverage with this plan, in hopes that she can keep it, when she moves to Mexico. I shared that I learned there is travel coverage, but I believe that is temporary. I referred her to speak to her advisor, Wendy, to attain a more clear explanation and option. I offered her Wendy''s number and that I would reach out to Wendy on her behalf as well. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-25 16:34:00', '2023-10-25 16:34:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127301042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105087002', 'Paul Snyder', NULL, '10-25-2023:  Romy called.  Her mamm screening is now going to be a diagnostic.  She knows Planstin will not cover that, so we went over options:  Being diagnostic moves to healthsharing, but she''s now resp for $2500 twds this issue.  If diag mamm shows nothing, prob won''t reach that IUA & will just be out-of-pkt.  IF however, they need to do a biopsy, or further testing, appts, etc., we have 6mos from DOS to sub a ''sharing req'' and prot the early expenses.  Went over how the IUA works and to call us so we can give her specific instructions for sub if needed.
     It happens to be Breast Cancer Awareness month, so I let her know I''ve seen reduced price mamm, but not sure if this would qual.  She''s going to call around to see, could save her $, but no harm, no foul, if they say no.  Sugg their HSA could help cov this exp if needed.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-25 15:08:46', '2023-10-25 15:08:46'),
