  ('zcrm_1579374000127301037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123096002', 'Karen Yabuno', NULL, '10-25-2023:  tt Karen Yabuno &amp; Karen Torseo:  Karen Yabuno still has not rec''d her Welcome Pkt &amp; we think it''s been sent 3 times.  I conf the address we have here in the CRM &amp; Admin123 is correct.  Went over what is in the pkt &amp; how inocuous the information is, so Karen Y doesn''t feel she needs to worry about a memb #, or other personal info, having gone to the wrong party &amp; them using it for identity left.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-25 14:43:53', '2023-10-25 14:43:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127301029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080584001', 'Zubair Niazi', NULL, '10-25-2023:  Zubair called.  He needs to cancel because he now has employer provided "ins" eff 10/1/2023.  Because he wanted to conf he had the HSA w/his new emp plan, he is after the cancellation date, so I asked him to call his advisor Michael Montes to go thru the cancellation process, so the advisor would know why & would be able to secure his relationship w/Zubair (I think Zubair may come back down the road if something happens to his employment).  But, he called & LM twice & never heard back.
