  ('zcrm_1579374000127229021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111961002', 'Philip Kendzior', NULL, '10-24-2023:  Philip called this morning and was a missed call.  He called in just 2 minutes after Kelly answered another call, so that''s why it was missed.  I called & tt Philip.  Planstin had his account inaccurately entered as Memb + Spouse, not Memb + Child and were telling him he didn''t have the correct type of membership so his kids were not covered.  Between his call this am & my tt him, it sounds like Planstin may have discovered the issue was on their end & were correcting it for him.  I dbl ck''d & both Admin123 & our CRM show he is correctly signed up for Memb & children.  He will call if he needs further assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-24 14:44:11', '2023-10-24 14:44:11'),
