  ('zcrm_1579374000127140040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073820131', 'Danielle Lynn', NULL, '10-23-23 Danielle wants to add the MEC. She spoke with Kelly somehow earlier and indicated as such. I left her a vm and let her know Dec. 1st is the earliest start date or possibly Nov. 1st if she completes the process tomorrow. Left vm for her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-23 17:22:15', '2023-10-23 17:22:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127140023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028354134', 'Mary Geitner', NULL, '10-23-23 Mary called trying to understand which numbers from her tax forms to use. I referred her back to her accountant since her AGI vs taxable income are very different and she has a rental property that she has to incorporate depreciation and mort expenses etc. I let her know I am not a tax expert and he will know best. She will contact him so she''s not penalized at any point or rejected from Medicaid if she qualifies.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-23 17:03:14', '2023-10-23 17:03:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127139044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126954002', 'Mark Eudy', NULL, '10.23.2023 Mark called to confirm that everything was set in place, regarding his membership, since he has not received any confirmation or verbiage about his plan. I checked the CRM email and saw that Kelly sent him an overview about his plan TODAY, and asked him to find it. He was appeased with that. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-23 16:45:20', '2023-10-23 16:45:20'),
