  ('zcrm_1579374000127140008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128347002', 'Vanessa Stone', NULL, '10-23-23 Vanessa is in the 30-49 age group. I''m not sure her exact age. She''s healthy and no pre-x. Although she wants more mental health counseling benefits than 12 sessions. She sees a therapist bi-weekly and is hoping to find an ins plan to includes mental health. She will speak with another local broker to see what ins options are available to her at full cost and to use MCS as secondary. I suspect she will abort mission on that front when she sees the cost and lack of benes. I also sent her the dental discount plan and vsp info to review. I let her know Dec. 1st is the earliest start date and she may need to do Cobra for Nov. She will call me when she accepts the job with THIA which she''s planning to do.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-23 16:24:57', '2023-10-23 16:24:57'),
