  ('zcrm_1579374000127082028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128526002', 'Barbara Lucille', NULL, '10-23-23 Sent following email:
Hi Barbara,

I''m following up on your recent interest in MPB Health and medical cost sharing. My name is Kirk Bennett, a senior agent representing MPB Health.

I would be happy to forward some information and pricing to you but we''ll first need to have a very brief conversation so I can understand your needs to forward the correct information. 

