Please let me know by responding to this email if you are still interested and I should follow-up.with you. 

Your contact is welcome.

Best,

Kirk', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2023-10-23 09:20:16', '2023-10-23 09:20:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000127134080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366043', 'Jayne Asatani', NULL, 'Daniel called in as he said he is starting to have problem with his hip, he asked if he needs to go see his primary first before anything. I let him know that he will most likely need to get a referral for this, but he is free to see anyone of his choosing and is only responsible for the first $1000 of his IUA. I lastly let Daniel know to keep all of his receipts and bills as he will need to submit everything into Zion Health to start a new sharing request. I sent him the email that explains how to do so, along with Zion''s phone number for him to give them a call to let them know what is going on. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-10-23 09:18:10', '2023-10-23 09:18:10'),
