  ('zcrm_1579374000127053039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330216', 'Nelson Oldham', NULL, '10-20-23 Nelson called and reached Karina for help with his annual wellness labs that he''s being billed for now almost a year later. The visit was from 11/2022. It looks like he may benefit from the provider re-coding the labs. But, I asked him to call the MPB Concierge Team back for better assistance. He was confused by our new phone tree options since this has to do with billing of his wellness visit. But, our Billing Dept is only for the monthly membership fee of MPB. I forwarded the docs to Cari to better help him. I also let him know that he might still be responsible for these costs if it''s not deemed preventative according to the ACA. I let him know they continue to change and lessen what''s included in the visits. He''s interested in cancelling the wellness part until he realized he needs a colonoscopy soon. He will stay put and get assistance from the Concierge for that as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-20 15:59:47', '2023-10-20 16:01:09'),
