  ('zcrm_1579374000127053029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364085', 'Kristy Tripp', NULL, '10-20-23 I called Kristy Tripp since I received confirmation that her true membership fee should be  $796.50 per the Worksite Bridge EF 50-65 age No MEC. She''s been paying $491.50. The updated price sent by accounting showed a new price of $863 which I can''t figure out where that came from. Upon them reviewing it they agreed with me that it should be $796.50 moving forward. I let Kristy know this is no fault of hers and perhaps even no communication. I can''t tell if she was ever told of the change for this membership. My guess is she was somehow lost in the transition from no age banding to age banding, whenever that happened a year or more ago. So, she''s been getting an incorrect rate for a long time.  They have two open Needs at this time. She doesn''t want to mess with her membership to move to CARE+ to save $16 a month for risk of messing up their account. We will leave it alone. She may choose to add the MEC and move to SECURE at some point in the future. Her husband just did his colonoscopy recently and they are paying cash since the last we spoke there were hardly any drs. in their local area in the PHCS network. I let know with SECURE they know have out of network benefits/RBP pricing. So, if/when they want to add the MEC and move to SECURE they can do so.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-20 14:56:07', '2023-10-20 14:56:07'),
