  ('zcrm_1579374000126912163', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081872001', 'Doreen Restucci', NULL, '10-19-2023: Doreen left a VM &amp; we played phone tag for the day.  We finally talked.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-19 18:22:46', '2023-10-19 18:22:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126912152', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124246002', 'Terry Flood', NULL, '10-19-2023:  Terry & Wanda called Zion today after their Welcome Call, & Zion proceeded to give them a ton of misinformation.  Part of it was the difference in product names (ours vs Zion''s).  The balance I think is Zion''s lack of experienced people right now.  I walked them thru what our pkg is, that Zion is one component, and that I think it''s just confusion due to verbiage.
     - Sent them the Curr Zion Prev Care Guidelines (pulled off Zion''s site today).  We went over how to present & options for either reimb, or sub an estimate ahead & having a pre-pd cc from Zion to use twds the office visit when you have the appt.  It sounds like they will get detailed inv that breaks out the exp for the off visit from everything else done that day & a pymt receipt.  Then call us after the apt for help in sub a ''preventative sharing request''.
        They know about the waiting period on the colonoscopy (6mos).
     They were very upset, so I offered for them to ask for me by name.  Mentioned that currently, the most experienced concierge are available from 12pm-8pm eastern & that Nahla & I will do all we can to make this easier (they spent their "entire morning bouncing around and were about to cancel".     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-19 18:08:08', '2023-10-19 18:18:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126935097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079147423', 'Michael Stocker', NULL, '10.19.2023 Michael called to better understand his plan. I went over basics first, but he had a lot of questions
