IUA vs. ded
how to proceed with appts? NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-19 18:03:29', '2023-10-19 18:03:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126912144', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080584001', 'Zubair Niazi', 'E-mail sb:  zkniazi@hotmail.com (chg form sub 10/19/2023)', '10-19-2023:  Zubair called & LM to please call him.  Zubair has NO IDEA what he''s purchased, what an IUA is, etc.  He''s curr looking at having some "ins" thru a job, but I had a hard time understanding if it''s a temp position, or...  so he asked if he can keep this for now.  We went over healthsharing is always in the 2nd position & would only help for anything denied by his "ins" and over his IUA.  We tried really hard.  I''m just really unsure either of us understood what the other was saying.  But, he seemed happy when we got off of the phone.
     - We have always had the wrong e-mail add on file, so we went in & sub a chg form.  Tomorrow, I will come in & send him his 2022 receipts.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-19 17:35:37', '2023-10-19 18:29:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126912139', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122117002', 'Leisa Heuple', NULL, '10-19-2023:  Leisa called.  Her husb has some labs coming up.  The doc usually draws the blood at the off, then sends it where you want them to.  I explained that for these ''prev labs'' the ACA MEC covers almost nothing & about the only thing we can do is place a pre-pd lab order together on one of our disc sites, they pay, then take that receipt to the lab where they do the draw & tests, but the results can be sent to the doc.  She seemed to understand & she''ll call for help once they have the lab order.  I told her the std lipid does get covered, but often the doc wants more.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-19 17:21:09', '2023-10-19 18:21:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126912134', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091383002', 'Scott Meyer', NULL, '10-19-2023:  Cynthia called.  She''s trying to grasp how the IUAs work.  She was thinking that since her husb ''issue'' was > 1k, they were done for the year (like a ded).  We went over it in depth & I think she finally got it.  She''s going into the doc tomorrow for an ''issue'' (hemhorrhoids - don''t repeat this to her, she was very quiet about it) and wondered how to handle it since this off already has her ''prev'' Planstin on file.  She will let them know she does not have ins & that Planstin in not valid right now.  Then, she''ll let them know she''s a ''cash-pay'' pt, ask if they offer a ''cash-pay'' disc, get a pymt receipt and detailed inv.  IF it continues, she know we must sub a ''sharing req'' before 6mos from the DOS, so I sugg at the 4 mo mark she decide.  We went over the implications of sub & not sub.  She''ll call w/questions.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-19 17:15:17', '2023-10-19 18:25:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126943104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125696132', 'Bryan Gray', NULL, '10-19-23 Per David- 

Hello Sedera,

Please remove Bryan Gray from our account effective the end of October.

I know there is a Member Change Request Form but it has this sentence: If a member has been cancelled or wishes to cancel their Sedera membership. please email memberservices@sedera.com

I ask that you confirm.

Thanks, Dave
Corbel Universe
P: 800-830-4563   M: 208-991-2463
E: dave@corbeluniverse.com   W: corbeluniverse.com', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-19 17:10:13', '2023-10-19 17:10:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126935084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005663707', 'Olga Chwascinska', NULL, '10.19.2023 Called Olga to walk her through our cancellation form. I ended up leaving her a message. Sent her the link and email with instructions as well, via CRM. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-19 16:43:45', '2023-10-19 16:48:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126943096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043386031', 'Robert Eberlein', NULL, '10-19-23 Good Afternoon Wendy,

Thank you for your help. I logged out of and then back into the HMA portal and it magically updated. I have copies of my new card and see they have updated some of the difficult aspects of this program.

Thanks for your help.
Dr Robert Eberlein', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-19 16:38:59', '2023-10-19 16:38:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126943079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129823144', 'Pam Adamson', NULL, '10-19-23 Pamela called to learn more. They currently have Christian Healthshare and she thinks a $1000 AUA and possible % thereafter. She''s really not sure. She thinks they pay $500 or so total for the two of them now. They''ve only been with Christian Healthshare for about 6 months.  I explained the pre-x clause and she assumes Christian Healthshare has the same.  The concerns for them are that her husband takes meds for depression and anxiety and uses Adderral XR 30mg which I see they can get for around $25-$40 or perhaps less through other avenues. The bigger problem is a heart issue called mitrovalve prolapse. I was very clear that if he has a heart issue in the first year it will be their responsibility to pay for 100% and she confirmed something like a heart attack would be lumped into that and I said Yes. She feels like once you hit 62 everyone will have these problems.  Her health issues are high blood pressure and high cholesterol which are exempt from the pre-x clause but she will have to pay for the meds. She understands. Her original purpose of the call is to lower their costs. Even when I told her the costs that aren''t lower, she''s still interested in possibly switching for a Nov. 1st start date. Her husband recently lost his job and is unemployed. She would have to join to show proof of self-employment since he doesn''t have any other income. They live in CA and have to have SECURE. She doesn''t want the co-pay plan with the higher costs even though she asked every way possible about the cost of other dr. visits. She really just wants her annual preventative visits, skin check and med refills.  She knows tomorrow is the deadline to enroll for Nov. 1st SECURE HSA $650/$1000 or $550/$2500.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-19 16:29:18', '2023-10-19 16:29:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126912129', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126948009', 'Audrey Byram', NULL, 'Out of order -

10-19-2023:  Audrey called.  She''s been trying to get ahold of Jeffrey Bersteen &amp; I let her know her records have been sent to Wendy Scipione.  Let Wendy know I fwd''d her to her bus line via Teams chat.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-19 16:04:44', '2023-10-19 16:04:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126892119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079055002', 'Dale Leder', NULL, '10.19.23:  I noticed an email from Cindy I didn''t see, with concerns about not being able to use the doctor she may want.  I called her and told her CareConnect will work with her in any way she prefers.  Jami responded to my email to her asking if they would work with Zion.  She said they''d be happy to assist Cindy. I asked Cindy if she would talk with them and she said yes.  I emailed Jami to have one of her team contact Cindy and provided her contact info.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-10-19 15:45:37', '2023-10-19 15:45:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126912118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005663707', 'Olga Chwascinska', NULL, '10-19-2023:  Olga sent an e-mail to info@mympb.com today at:  3:35pm eastern, saying she wants to cancel her membership.  She also says she cancelled online, but has not rec''d a conf.  I do not see a Cognito form, but recently have had 5-6 people say they are doing things online and I cannot see the forms.  Maybe the process has chg''d & the concierge is unaware of it.  
     Sent Nahla (& Advisor Traci McCoid) the e-mail, that I''m going to have Nahla reach out to Olga to get a signed form, but to ck Admin123 first.  This mo, the draw date has been pushed to the 25th, but I don''t want Olga panicking.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-19 15:44:15', '2023-10-19 16:01:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126935073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005666920', 'Rachel Brandon', NULL, '10.19.2023 Rachel called concerned about the tier they are on with their plan. First she shared that she should be on Employer + Child vs. Member + Family (never heard of that), but shared that with Patti via teams. She also shared that her children are not showing up in the Planstin database, so I messaged Vinnie too, via teams. I direct transferred Rachel to Patti''s VM, per Patti''s request, and she will reach out to her tomorrow. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-19 15:33:01', '2023-10-19 15:37:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126943056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126948009', 'Audrey Byram', NULL, '10-19-23 Audrey had many questions to review per pre-x and how it all works with virtual healthcare, wellness, urgent care, er, etc. She will be turning 62 in April of 2024. The has a thyroid issue and takes levothyroxine and leo... something for her thyroid. She also accidentally found nodules on her lungs when checking her heart. Her heart checked out 100% great, no problems but they found these nodules that nobody''s worried about. As a extra precaution she did another screening and there''s no change.  They aren''t worried about it but now that it''s been discovered.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-19 14:47:00', '2023-10-19 16:15:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126935062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086707002', 'Linda Pringle', NULL, '10.19.2023  
automated emails
completed a form 2 days to change IUA
Received the confirmation receipt yesterday with the date saying effective date 11/1, 
Patti 10/20
Billing is the problem, 22nd is viewable,', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-19 14:35:54', '2023-10-19 15:04:45'),
