  ('zcrm_1579374000126943008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043386031', 'Robert Eberlein', NULL, '10-19-23 Robert called bc he''s having trouble with his HMA card since they just changed it to a new ID card on Oct. 12th unbeknownst to him. I sent him the email update I rec''d from Kirk about the change in card/pmt system. They removed the debit cards and added an ID card.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-19 13:23:58', '2023-10-19 13:41:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126935057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124141002', 'Holli McCormick', NULL, '10.19.2023 Holli called and we missed her call due to high call volume. I called her back but ended up leaving her a message. My understanding, but not confirmed yet, is that she paid her physical annual visit''s bill, and wants to get reimbursed. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-19 13:14:21', '2023-10-19 13:14:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126912110', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061691127', 'Stephen Scharf', NULL, '10-19-2023:  Steve sent in an RX Quote request for immunizations?  We talked &amp; he was quite confused.  I sent him a list of the participating pharmacies in his area.  He''d been using the wrong list.  His doc doesn''t have the immun in stock, so he''s going to give the pharmacy a try.  I gave examples of how to handle things, but let him know both the influenza &amp; Covid should be paid for by his Planstin ''prev care''.  He''ll let me know if he needs further assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-19 12:57:35', '2023-10-19 13:11:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126935043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093072002', 'Richard Brodeur', NULL, '10.19.2023 Melissa called and we missed it due to  high volume of calls. I got the message from Cari, and I called Melissa back, but ended up leaving her a VM to return our call. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-19 12:53:31', '2023-10-19 13:00:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126935038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005630187', 'Paula Amicarelli', NULL, '10.19.2023 Paula wanted to know how to get a doctor''s bill taken care of. She went for her preventative physical annual and wasn''t sure which card to use to pay for it.
She claims she has been seeing this same doctor for 30 years, so I asked her what do you usually use when you go see him. She said I pay for it and get reimbursed. I said that''s unusual b/c Planstin will only collaborate with providers/doctor''s offices not straight with members. She  said the office does not want to call Planstin, and I said it is a short conversation to get paid. All they need to do is call the number on the front of your card or fax the bill over. 
I asked Cari via teams to provide their fax number and she shared that she has tried to attain it in the past, but they told her they do not give it freely, only to doctors. So I relayed that information to Paula, and she is calling her doctor''s office to request that they contact Planstin to get paid. If they need to, they can ask them for the fax number. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-19 12:51:39', '2023-10-19 13:00:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126943003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124848011', 'Eileen Sun', NULL, '10-19-23 I logged back into Cigna and I see Eileen''s enrollment.  It doesn''t show was phase of the process it''s in yet. But, it''s showing a Nov. 1st start date correctly.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-19 12:43:15', '2023-10-19 12:43:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126880148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081381002', 'Bren Frisch', NULL, 'Member submitted Change from to update her address.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-10-19 12:20:31', '2023-10-19 12:20:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126880142', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105466010', 'Anna Marie Somera', 'New Membership eff 11/1/2023', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-10-19 12:11:58', '2023-10-19 12:11:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126935033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109967002', 'Ronald Johnson', NULL, '10.19.2023 Ronald called to get help setting up their CirrusMD accounts.
I was able to help Ronald register no problem, but I needed to put in a ticket for Andrea''s account.
I emailed CirrusMD at 1:09PM (CT). Andrea is not feeling well and would like to use the telehealth. 
I heard back from CirrusMD, pretty quickly 1:25, saying that they reached out to Andrea personally to let her know she is all set and registered. I called Andrea to confirm everything went as planned and she is good to go. I ended up leaving a message on Ronald''s VM for Andrea. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-19 12:11:13', '2023-10-19 13:10:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126880137', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105466010', 'Anna Marie Somera', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to change her plan to the Care + eff 11/1/2023.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-10-19 12:11:07', '2023-10-19 12:11:07'),
