  ('zcrm_1579374000126892108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123717002', 'Cristina Buske', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-10-19 11:24:32', '2023-10-19 11:24:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126892093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123725001', 'Melinda Madsen', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-10-19 11:19:36', '2023-10-19 11:19:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126935008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109660008', 'Larry Essex', NULL, '10.19.2023 Larry called b/c he had to go the ER, tried to use the issued Visa (still unsure who sent it, whether it was Zion or the HMA product he might have), and it did not go through. He now has an overdue bill from the hospital and is trying to pay for with this card.
He has already sent his bills to Zion, and it seems he did that through the website on his own, b/c there isn''t any documentation here that shows anyone from MPB helped him with it.
It seemed as though the card came from Zion, and given he has opened a medical need with them already, I transferred him to Zion for customer service.
Cari was able to respond to me but after the fact, and offered that it might be an HMA product, and that is not an MPB product, and he needs to communicate this to his advisor instead.
Also I mentioned that he did not complete his welcome call, and he was unaware of what that was. I explained what it is, and it can be beneficial. Larry is not aware of the email sent to him by Vanessa, nor whatever Zac Masters may have introduced him to upon signage.
So I RESENT him the scheduling link to have a welcome call. 
I am giving Larry a bit of time and I will I''ll call him back to confirm if it was resolved, if not, I''ll tell him he needs to talk to Zac. 
Tried calling Larry back to reroute him to speak to this advisor. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-19 10:57:12', '2023-10-19 11:46:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126880107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101128002', 'Christine Altamuro', NULL, 'Member submitted Change from to update her IUA to $5000.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-10-19 10:46:21', '2023-10-19 10:46:21'),
