  ('zcrm_1579374000126892073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123819002', 'Heidi Perry', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-10-19 10:40:55', '2023-10-19 10:40:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126935003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123199001', 'Carey Reynolds', NULL, '10.19.2023 Carey called to learn about their options with RX requests, specifically mail order.
I explained the process of non mail order scripts, in case they need one RIGHT away. Then I offered the 3 options for mail order: My free Pharmacy, CostPlus and International Shopper if either of those are not offering a decent price. Carey was appeased with the results of the conversation and will fill out the form on our site, attain her medication. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-19 10:40:40', '2023-10-19 10:40:40'),
