  ('zcrm_1579374000126906039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064218045', 'Eric Lipp', NULL, 'A chiropractic center reached out on behalf of Eric to verify his benefits. I asked them what he was having done with them, to which the provider said he needs a correction done. I let them know that Eric is a self-pay patient up until his IUA of $1000. Anything thereafter, Eric will need to submit the bills into Zion Health for a sharing request. I gave the provider Zion''s phone number in case they need to speak with Zion. I asked if it was ok to transfer over to Zion and the young lady said it wasn''t necessary as he has not spent $1000 yet and that is all they needed to know. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-10-19 09:35:14', '2023-10-19 09:35:14'),
