  ('zcrm_1579374000126834026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000127019002', 'Donna Baker', NULL, '10-18-23 Donna came to me highly recommended from Ruth Glas who said I''m super helpful. Donna is 56 and her husband is turning 59 on Nov. 25th, 2023. He worked for a company for 40 years. The company had a celebration of his 40 years and then proceeded to terminate him the next day! OMG! So, they are now offered Cobra for Nov. 1st which is about $2000. They do their annual wellness screenings. She did her colonoscopy last year and mammogram. They have an HSA account that they like to fund and use. Her husband is newly diabetic and wants to manage it with his diet. He is taking metformin right now until he can manage it on his own. He also had a hernia surgery last March which has never caused a problem since. She had carpel tunnel syndrome which she resolved about a year ago as well. She also has a thyroid issue that she''s had for a very long time and managed without any problems.  She''s been learning about the value of cash prices for labs recently as well. They are both self-employed with their own small family farm! They grow produce and offer it at markets. They use SS#, not an EIN since it''s a sole prop.  
She also asked about dental and vision. So, I described the HMA 10000 for them since they have items to use it on for his diabetes, labs, meds, dental cleanings, glasses, etc.  They want to enroll for Nov. 1st if possible. I have an appt on Friday with them.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-18 17:55:37', '2023-10-20 10:09:19'),
