  ('zcrm_1579374000126740024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112304001', 'Lynn Ware', NULL, '10.17.2023 Lynn called to confirming if a urology prostate procedure that is non-evasive and costs 35K out of pocket, is shareable. Robert is already scheduled for it, so I offered to look up the latest guidelines with Zion, and nothing came up under Urology or Prostate. I recommended that she speak to Zion to confirm by asking for the invitation link for the procedure, and see what they say. I gave her their phone number, since we do not have access to opening sharing requests for them anymore, and asked her to click #3 for customer service, and ask for the invitation link to open a sharing request for a prostate procedure. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-17 15:41:38', '2023-10-17 15:51:05'),
