  ('zcrm_1579374000126641016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107986127', 'Alfons Reinig', NULL, '10-16-23 Alfons called bc he rec''d a letter from Anthem asking for more information otherwise his plan cost will go up to the full amt. He has to find the letter or will just call Anthem directly to find out what they want. His income is still low at around $26K, so he will receive a sizable APTC. I wonder if it''s bc he''s late on his tax filing. That might be causing the problem. I just called him back and he will call his CPA to accelerate his tax filings from 2021 and 2022, so he can maintain his APTC in good standing.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-16 16:14:29', '2023-10-16 16:14:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126643003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116123002', 'Kelly Reiser', NULL, '10.16.2023 Cari shared Kelly''s contact information re: his wife possible having Lyme Disease, and what we can do to help guide supporting and guiding them, especially when I''ve had the same personal experience. I called Kelly, but had to leave him a VM. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-16 16:09:58', '2023-10-16 16:09:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126642008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120998002', 'William Chilton', NULL, '10-16-2023:  William called & we talked.  He''s trying to figure out the best way to handle everything.  Right now, they have ~$500 out-of-pkt at this point.  They''ve prescribed an RX for Ashley that''s ~$2200 (for 14 days).  I sent an inquiry to Reid.  William knows I''ll let him know what I find out.  With this expensive RX, I walked William through how to sub a ''sharing req'' and he''ll start working on that.  He''s also going to get med records back to at least 7/1/2021, so he''ll either know this is a pre-x or he''ll have proof that it is not.  Either way, it''ll guide his directions and solidify whether he''ll sub the ''sharing req''.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-16 15:58:15', '2023-10-16 19:09:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126642003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123096002', 'Karen Yabuno', NULL, '10-16-2023:  Advisor Karen Torsoe called very sad & frustrated.  This member, Karen Yabuno, has not yet rec''d a Welcome Pkt.  I let Karen T know we confirmed w/Kelly F & she said it was sent on 10/1/2023.  (I do not know if a pkt was also sent near her orig eff date of 9/1/2023).  Also, I cannot access Admin123 to confirm the CRM shows the same address as Admin123, or if we are maybe missing a Unit #?  Or?  There is a 6 hour time diff w/HI (It''s 6 hours earlier in HI, than it is in FL).  So, maybe we need to conf the mailing address we are using is accurate?
