  ('zcrm_1579374000126626003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082146002', 'Ursa Abernathy', NULL, '10.16.23:  Ursa called me to tell me she just got married at the end of Septebmer and she just changed her contact information with us a few minutes ago.  Her new last name is Abernathy and her husband''s name is Robert.  He is 63 an has a health plan with a faith-based med. cost sharing group called Impact Health Sharing.  He is paying $270/mo. with an IUA of either $2500 or $5000.  He is healthy, no meds or pre-x. He feels the quality of his plan is very good.  I asked him to get me his plan''s details of services they offer so I can offer them a realistic comparison.  He could get our Care Plus plan for $190 for MO @$5000 IUA or $240 @$2500 IUA.  I gave Ursa the MPB site link so she could see the plan details for Care Plus.  She said they''d get back to me.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-10-16 14:33:44', '2023-11-30 13:53:15'),
