  ('zcrm_1579374000126606003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712271', 'Carey Dubois', NULL, '10.13.23:  Recvd. an email notifying me that Carey will be notified of their pricing increase, which will be $650, beginning 11.1.23. Last year their increased price was never billed, which was supposed to have begun on 10.1.22 at $625.  They have been paying the old price of $500.   Contact Carey.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-10-16 08:22:11', '2023-10-16 08:22:11'),
