  ('zcrm_1579374000126551036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118303002', 'Monica Harkiewicz', NULL, '10.13.2023 Monica called to get clarification on colonoscopies and if getting the box done is considered covered. If the telehealth she had is considered the actual screening, and what should she do if she wants to switch doctors.
I explained not to get the color-guard as Planstin will consider that as the procedure and not pay for the actual procedure should they find something.
I guided her to ask the previous colonoscopy facility/where she had a telehealth, to not code that appt at preventative, b/c she wants to change doctors/facilities (she does not feel comfortable to be in their care anymore). NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-13 16:31:45', '2023-10-13 16:31:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126563029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108424017', 'Jennifer Eisenberg', NULL, '10-13-2023:  Jenn Eisenberg sent an e-mail to info@mympb.com.  It was fwd''d to me with a huge # of e-mails.  I fwd''d it to Patti because Planstin continues to tell Jenn & her doc''s off that Sage has not been added to their memb.  Looking above, Patti''s tried mult times to corr this issue.  I cannot access Admin123 to see what notes/etc are there & Planstin''s phones are set to a "call back later" mode.  Since we are so close to the weekend, I tried to get notice to Patti in case she had time to at least read this before she''s gone for the day (doubtful, but at least she''ll have it for next week).  Jenn is cc''d so she''ll know Patti has rec''d the req to again look into this issue.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-13 15:16:37', '2023-10-13 15:16:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126563018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120539002', 'Michael Morby', NULL, '10-13-2023:  Kari called.  She''s looking for help on selecting a mammography center.  I sent her the 6 providers listed on the PHCS search for her area, but also let her know she can select someone out-of-ntwk if they are willing to bill Planstin for her.  Most imp, whoever she uses must bill Planstin for her.
     We disc 2D is a cov screening, but if they do not have 2D avail, call Planstin to get a conf e-mail to show the doc that a 3D screening will be covered.  She also knows if they req a follow-up catscan, to call Planstin because that is generally NOT a cov item.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-13 14:39:07', '2023-10-13 14:54:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126563013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273746', 'David Peck', NULL, '10-13-2023:  Angie called.  She had knee replacement surgery, but since then, she''s having back issues and they think she has a herniated disk.  Her question:  Will this be part of the same ''sharing req''?  Her knee was a pre-x item & she hasn''t used the full 25k available, but what is my thought.
     I suggested she start a second ''sharing req'' since this is a completely different part of the body.  She knows they could come back and combine them, but, we''ve always been told that separate parts of the body will be different sharing req = sep IUAs. Angie knows they only ones who can give her a definitive answer is Zion''s sharing req dept.  She seemed fine with this plan of action.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-13 14:35:52', '2023-10-13 15:06:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126551031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091159002', 'Daniel Cody', NULL, '10.13.2023 Daniel called to learn how to submit a sharing request, derm mole removals, several times a year, is it covered, used the word deductible, since January, 
told him to turn everything in
explained about the IUA vs. deductible, and max # of IUA''s per membership, 
biopsy vs. extraction due to cancerous mole NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-13 14:04:40', '2023-10-13 14:04:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126556013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521660', 'Teresa Robertson', NULL, '10-13-23 Teresa left a vm and is super mad bc she''s getting bounced back and forth with Planstin and Zion over her annual wellness visit. She''s ready to bail and go back to ACA. She''s aging into Medicare in about a year as well. I left her a vm just now to help her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-13 13:59:32', '2023-10-13 13:59:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126556008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061081', 'Robert Green', NULL, '10-13-23 Played phone tag with Robert to answer some questions for him.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-13 13:55:35', '2023-10-13 13:55:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126563008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081692002', 'Sara Baal', NULL, '10-13-2023:  Sara called.  She wants to cancel.  She''s willing to tt her advisor Karen to process the cancellation w/her.  I made sure she has the # we have for Karen &amp; tried to trans her, but GoTo would not allow me to access transfers.  She was very kind &amp; said no worries, she''ll call her direct.
     As a back up plan, if she has not tt Karen by midday Tuesday, she will call us back for cancellation assistance (since the deadline is next Thursday).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-13 13:12:04', '2023-10-13 13:12:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126551026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109660001', 'Laura Hunt', NULL, '10.13.2023 Laura went to the ER for a respiratory infection, now has bills she would like to upload. They decreased the hospital bill significantly, she says, from aprox $6300 down to a bit more than $1600. She does have some bills trickling in. I gave her Zion''s number and the steps to proceed to open a sharing request, after she click #3.
I also went over a few preventative guidance for Phy. Ann. Check-up, Mamm and woman wellness visit, and all that is covered and that is not. Where to go and what to do with RX''s and extra labwork.
I direct transferred her to Zion.      NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-13 12:30:18', '2023-10-13 12:30:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126528253', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086963002', 'Timothy Viner', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to add email &amp; cell # of spouse Daniela Tudoran to membership.  I will add to CRM &amp; A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-10-13 12:20:12', '2023-10-13 12:20:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126528248', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126559001', 'Michael Duffy', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-10-13 12:13:00', '2023-10-13 12:13:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126528243', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521464', 'Jaime Boswell', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-10-13 12:08:31', '2023-10-13 12:08:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126551018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086963002', 'Timothy Viner', NULL, '10.13.2023 Daniela called b/c she needs to open a need with Zion and add her email to the plan.
I guided her to choose #3 when I transferred her to Zion and request an invitation link to open her portal towards a sharing request. I gave her their number, in case she gets disconnected.
Then I guided her to out Updates page to complete a change form to add her email and cell number for contact and news. 
In the end, I direct transferred her to Zion.   NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-13 11:46:33', '2023-10-13 11:57:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126563003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108862002', 'Mark Witt', NULL, '10-13-2023:  I was asked to call Denise re: immunizations.  I can see that Patti gave her info.  ILM because some of this has changed a bit.  I just told Denise that I might be able to make it a bit easier on her if she needs further asst as immun have chg''d slightly.  That Patti''s info will work, but maybe I can add to it.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-13 10:19:16', '2023-10-13 10:19:16'),
