  ('zcrm_1579374000126506003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120745001', 'Louis Marchetti', NULL, '10.12.2023:  Recvd. an email from Angela on Ticket #3067 to see if we can further assist Louis w/pmt. for the costly lab expenses. We need to find out if the labs were preventive or diagnostic and if the fees were insurance-based or cash-pay rated.  I discussed this w/Cari. She said she will speak with Louis to find out and we''ll move forward from there.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-10-13 07:02:21', '2023-10-13 07:02:21'),
