  ('zcrm_1579374000126493028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055920063', 'Lady Fuller', NULL, '10.12.2023 Lady called to understand why the link we sent her to submit bills to Zion is not working. I explained that they changed their platform, so she''ll have to connect with them to open a medical need, which is not called sharing request. 
She was driving, so she requested that I sent her the phone number and the steps. I will do that via Outlook. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-12 15:31:29', '2023-10-12 15:31:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126493023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039700101', 'David Larochelle', NULL, '10.12.2023 David called before he had bloodwork done to make sure he was not missing a step or doing the wrong thing. I am glad he called us first, b/c I was able to guide him towards the discounted labsites to search through. 
