I walked him the preventative guidelines, no RX''s, no extra labwork he now knows and present his Planstin card. He said he still does not have it. I told him I''d call Planstin and have them send him the cards, virtually and physically. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-12 15:26:37', '2023-10-12 16:22:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126493018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104457002', 'Normandie Rainwater', NULL, 'labowrk towards an annual phys. Called us first.', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-12 15:18:24', '2023-10-12 15:18:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126493013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104457002', 'Normandie Rainwater', NULL, '10.12.2023 Normandie call to get the Pharmacy Codes for the BIN and RX PCN #''s. I gave her what I have on file and they are going to try again at the CVS Pharmacy. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-12 15:15:27', '2023-10-12 15:15:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126493008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108053001', 'Chris Pilgrim', NULL, '10.12.2023 Chris called to cancel his membership. I contacted Wendy via teams, but her icon availability was grey. I went back to Chris and asked him for the reason for cancellation, and he said he owns his own company and he''s just going to go through that insurance. I guided him to the form on line, since he''s getting his coverage from somewhere else (Group Insurance). NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-12 14:55:16', '2023-10-12 14:55:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126475056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081634027', 'Julia Bolz', NULL, '10-12-2023:  Julia called.  She''s had a lot happening.  Both of her parents have been "transitiioning" and she was caring for them.  They''ve now completed their transition, so she wants to try to understand her healthcare.  Her family (that referred her) are super pleased.  She just hasn''t been able to focus until now.
     - She mentioned not really taking in her Welcome Call.  Since she was so kind & now seems open to retaining what she will learn, I sent her a new invite.  Sent Vanessa a Teams chat as to why I offered it too.
        Julia is headed to Canada*, so she''ll sched for when she returns.  [Vanessa''s sched is already full for tomorrow.]
     - Prev:  Julia hasn''t had her ''prev'' ck up for 2-ish years.  She wants to sched.  We went over ''best of both worlds: in PHCS ntwk or outside = both okay IF doc''s off willing to bill TPA Planstin for you.  Disc basics of ACA MEC (the Welcome Call will help a lot w/this understanding, provide resources to better understand, etc.).  Once she''s had her call I told her I dive in deeper to help.  At that point, I''ll be able to show her how to use the post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail as a resource.
     - Labs:  Julia just had $700 in labs done & wondered if they could be paid for.  I explained that labs are a bit diff IF it''s ''prev'', which she says it all was.  Went over how to be pro-active on labs & what the process is:  call the concierge while at your computer.  We have ~5 disc sites we can walk you thru to pre-pay for your labs & save substantially.  You must do it because you pre-pay & select the best lab for you.
        She''s going to go back to the lab(s), she used 3 diff labs, to see if maybe they will bill in case she can get a ntwk discount.  It sounds like she used those pre-set labs w/set pricing & you send off your results.  So, she''s prob not going to have luck this time, but she knows to call us BEFORE she gets them done next time.
     - Colonoscopy:  She asked if she can just sched or needs a referral.  Let her know, she can select any facility, doctor, & anesthesiologist as long as they are willing to bill Planstin for her.  In or out-of-ntwk fine.  We do not req referral, but the rules at vaious cntrs can req a doc''s order, or a pre-procedure appt that can be extra $.  
        Went over IF polyp pulled, completely chgs.  Now ''diagnostic'' and Planstin will no longer pay.  You become resp for sub a ''sharing req & your 1k IUA.  To call us if this happens within a few days & we''ll walk you thru that process.
     * International Travel - Canada:  If ''issue'', told her how to present.  Told her if something did happen where she has to go to the hosp or something, she is still a ''cash-pay'' pt.  To call us for better instructions when she can, but she''ll be resp for her 1k IUA, sub a ''sharing req'', w/paperwork in English (in case she''s in a French area).
     - ** Consistently encouraged her at every turn to call us anytime she''s thinking, "I need to..." if it''s regarding anything healthcare = call the concierge line BEFORE you do anything.  We know it can be difficult to understand and we will help guide you to the corr component, the curr guidelines to get the best coverage, etc.

     I think w/time Julia may be able to understand this healthcare.  She just needs the gentle & patient touch.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-12 13:45:17', '2023-10-12 16:59:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126493003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109662008', 'Juan Enriquez', NULL, '10.12.2023', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-12 13:01:29', '2023-10-12 13:01:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126475039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109662008', 'Juan Enriquez', NULL, '10-12-2023:  Juan called.  He called CirrusMD & they told him to get to the ER right away due his chest pains.  He wondered which hosp he has to go to.  I let him know he can select the hosp nearest/most comf for him as we do not have a ntwk.  Stressed that w/chest pains & inst to get right to the ER distance is going to be imp, to go right now.
     Went over how to present today:  "ins" = N, "ins" card = N, ''cash-pay'' & do they offer a ''cash-pay'' disc, if they send in fin dept let them know if it gets exp enough you will have help.  To keep all det inv & pymt rec, offer to pay twds his $2500 resp & ask them to bill him.  He''s headed out now.     - CA

Juan called back & tt Nahla before I''d been able to complete my doc & she had no idea he & I just got off of the phone.  See her notes below.  He is the one making the decision to ignore the instructions to get to the ER immed.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-12 13:01:00', '2023-10-12 13:19:13'),
