  ('zcrm_1579374000126486003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031218132', 'Sandra Blanchard', NULL, '10-12-23 Sondra has been kicked off of Medicaid and earns at least $100K which includes SS for child but not her shareholder distributions from her business. So, she likely won''t get a subsidy. Madeleine is 13 and has severe psych care/mental health needs, including access to ER visits. Shawn, Sondra''s husband passed away at end of 2021 unexpectedly. So, they have a lot to deal with. Sondra''s C4 account is working for her to login since it''s too old and they''ll have to reset her pwd. I also asked her to have them remove Shawn and possibly update her income. We will look for a plan for Madeleine and she''s considering SECURE HSA for herself. She has hypertension/high blood pressure which is exempt from pre-x and ovarian cysts that she''s watching simply from menopause.  She wants to find out the cost of an ultrasound paying cash for that. She will also determine if she''s comfortable with the risks the first year. She''ll let me know when she can get back into her C4 account to proceed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-12 12:36:17', '2023-10-12 12:36:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126477023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115994002', 'Scott Nonnemaker', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request to cancel this eff 11/1/23.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-10-12 12:35:38', '2023-10-12 12:35:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126475034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120998002', 'William Chilton', NULL, '10-12-2023:  Julia sent me Williams info so I called him back as a follow-up.  ILM and made sure to reiterate how to present today:  "ins" = N, "ins" card = N, ''cash-pay'', ask for ''cash-pay'' disc, if they need some form of pymt today ask if you can pay 1k & have them bill you for the bal.  Make sure to get detailed inv & pymt receipts.  Then please call the concierge line (gave him # & hours) either tomorrow or early next week & we will help you sub a ''sharing req''.  Let him know most imp thing right now is to take care of Ashley.  We''ll do the paperwork in the next few days together.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-12 12:33:30', '2023-10-12 12:33:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126475029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521119', 'Kallie Carpenter', NULL, '10-11-2023:  Called Kallie back.  We went over her 6 RXs.  Sent her 3 coupons & am putting notes for future ref below on the others.  She would love a mail order service, but she has at least one sched drug & that puts a kink into that.  She seemed to understand, so we went w/Walgreens because she can get all 6 items there (curr) for $160.73 = the cheapest of all her local options.  
     Prev she''s used City Mkt, but they''ve been super understaffed, wait times have been long, & they even misfilled one of her RXs, so she want to try another pharmacy = Walgreens  [Walmart & Target could be options, but were far more expensive.  For all 6 RXs, Walmart was ~$207 & Target was ~$246]:
     Sent these three coupons:
          - Levothyroxine Sod 25mcg, #90 tabs = $8.66 at Walgreens on RXGo
          - NP Thyroid (brand) 90mg, #90 tabs = $55.35 at Walgreens on RXGo
          - Zolpidem (=gen Ambien) 5mg, #30 tabs = $14.51 at Walgreens on Sngl Care (no sign-up) = Sched IV
     Here are the other 3 items she consistently takes for future ref:
