          - Ipratropium (=gen Atrovent) Nasal Spray 0.06% (= 42mcg), 15ml = $18.61 at Walgreens on GoodRX
     We talked about the benefit of getting everything at one pharmacy & the interactive software.  She seemed good with that since their price is so much lower than even City Mkt she''d been going to which was ~$209 for all 6.      - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-12 12:23:29', '2023-10-12 12:23:29'),
