  ('zcrm_1579374000126477013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061081', 'Robert Green', NULL, 'This call was transferred to me from Cari after she spoke to them.  I went through the membership with them and then they submitted the Change from to add new spouse Lori.  I made sure they added Lori''s email so she could be sent through to Cirrus to get registered.  Went through how membership works cash pay, IUA''s, saving receipts, multiple needs etc.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-10-12 12:19:19', '2023-10-12 12:19:19'),
