  ('zcrm_1579374000126475013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061081', 'Robert Green', 'NOTE: Caution 2 Robert Greens! This is Robert ''A'' (for Allen) Green 11/27/1964', '10-12-2023:  Robert & Lori (his new spouse) called in together.  They are looking at pricing for putting her onto Robert''s healthcare.  He''s a Sedera member, so I sent them to Patti''s ext (they''ll LM if they don''t catch her).  To help out, I walked them thru the form if they do decide to add her.  Went over they must sub the form by 10/19/2023 if they want the 11/1/2023 eff date they are discussing.  Also made sure they know to hit ''submit'' (not ''save'') or else we don''t rec the form.
