  ('zcrm_1579374000126461016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079055002', 'Dale Leder', NULL, '10-12-2023:  I tt Joan.  Cindy was a missed call, but from the notes I can see she''s taken care of everything.  Joan''s going to let me know when it''s time for me to help Cindy.  Right now, she''s all set.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-12 11:04:20', '2023-10-12 11:04:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126461008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120817001', 'Benjamin Cowan', NULL, '10-12-2023:  Benjamin called.  
     - Prev:  Benjamin''s 2 yr old went for a well baby ck & they are now looking for reimb.  I went thru how Planstin = ''prev'' care & is the only time you will answer:  "ins" = Y, "ins" ID Card = Y, you pay nothing, in & out-of-ntwk fine as long as doc''s off will bill for you.  He''s going to call them & let them know they forgot to present their "ins" ID card, ask them to bill Planstin, then reimb them once it''s gone thru.  We disc imp of keeping 100% ACA MEC compliant ''prev'' care.
     - Welcome Call:  Benjamin thought Jane Kassel had done their call.  I let him know MPB''s 20-30 min call is a great foundation to learning how this healthcare works & sent him a new invite.
     - MAP:  They''ve just moved from TN to AZ & he''s looking for someone just to discuss.  He doesn''t own a computer (just an iPhone), so I gave him Mazz & Sull ph # & best hours.  He will call to get in ntwk counselors & knows that if he needs further help, Mazz & Sull will have someone he can talk w/directly.  We went over the pattern & that it allows for him to pay during the waiting periods if desired.  He may call at some point to go over their website (so he can be on a diff phone while looking at their site).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-12 10:39:21', '2023-10-12 11:01:34'),
