  ('zcrm_1579374000126422019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120998002', 'William Chilton', NULL, 'William called and had questions about spouse''s Gastro Intestinal issue.  Spouse had 1st provider visit yesterday and presented as "cash pay".  Might be going in for XRay today.  I told him always present as Cash Pay and save receipts.  When nearing the $1000 be in contact w/Zion to open a need.  He asked about prescriptions I told him that they would count towards the need.  Also told him to be in contact with Concierge for best pricing for prescriptions.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-10-12 08:43:10', '2023-10-12 08:43:10'),
