  ('zcrm_1579374000126394052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120745001', 'Louis Marchetti', 'TICKET #3067 on 10.11.2023', '10.11.2023 Louis became effective AO 7/1, went to his "preventative" appointment on the 10th, and had his welcome call on the 11th. He called today to learn how to get covered for post lab-work that cost $4300. I explained that, that is not the process and next time to be more pro-active and call us at the Concierge line to help guide you. What we usually do is access and search discounted lab sites to find the least expensive option.
