  ('zcrm_1579374000126399018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087509002', 'Mark Carman', NULL, '10-11-2023:  Alex, which looks like he''s Mark''s lawyer, e-mailed w/questions regarding how to get discounted labs.  That e-mail finally made it to me this morning & while I was working to reply, Alex called.  It looks like Mark (the member) gave permission to a different component (we do not have anything in Cognito forms or listed in the notes).  Alex was very understanding, so I did send Mark the "Permission to Discuss" Cognito link for next time.  In the meantime, Alex was fine if I talk in generalities, rather than account specific.
