  ('zcrm_1579374000126352034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109620011', 'Monique Koen', NULL, 'Monique called in and needed to know what to do on getting an x-ray for her husband. I explained they are a cash pay up to their IUA and can go to anyone of their choosing. If the bills are more than their IUA, that is when they will need to start a Need with Zion. I explained how she does that and she said she understood and will start looking for places to go. Monique called back and said they found a really great place with a fairly decent inexpensive facility to get the x-ray done, but they need to get a referral first. She does not have a GP so I did a search in their area of GP''s and emailed over the list to her so they can get the referral they need to get the x-ray done. They also mentioned they moved to TX so I sent the member change form for her to fill out the new address to update in our system. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-10-11 08:34:10', '2023-10-11 08:34:10'),
