  ('zcrm_1579374000126296029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359127', 'John Scarrow', NULL, '10.10.2023 John called to understand why RCI was not covering his colonoscopy (possible miscoding due to addressing the removal of gaul bladder and appendix).
