  ('zcrm_1579374000126276019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122117002', 'Leisa Heuple', NULL, '10-10-2023:  Honor Health called &amp; asked if we are in ''ntwk'' with them.  I let her know:  Leisa has the best of both worlds: both in ntwk &amp; out-of-ntwk are allowed as long as their office will bill the TPA, Planstin for the memb &amp; it''s only on the ACA MEC ''prev care''.  I gave her Planstin''s ph # &amp; hours to call for instructions on how to bill.  But, the gal was a bit short, so I called to let Leisa know I tried.  She appreciated the help.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-10 14:34:29', '2023-10-10 14:34:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126296018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090048002', 'Lisa Chlysta', NULL, '10.10.2023 Walter had an incident in June. They need to submit bills, he''s been to doctors again, back to hospital 3 nights, they did request the cash pay discounts, which brought the price down to $3000.
