  ('zcrm_1579374000126296008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578137', 'Rachel Fisher Ingraham', NULL, '10.10.2023 Rachel called back, returning my call from last week. Stating she ended up paying, cause it''s just been too long.
Present statements made from each party:
- Planstin: "... Can you find out exactly which claim she is referring to? Every wellness visit we have on file was in network with PHCS and paid at 100%. Is she referring to lab work?..."
