  ('zcrm_1579374000126217038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521119', 'Kallie Carpenter', NULL, '10-9-2023:  Kallie called.  She''s been buying her RXs at City Mkt in Carbondale, but they are so shorthanded it''s becoming an issue in pickup &amp; them making mistakes.  She gave me the name of the 6 items she gets from them.  I''m going to run all items to see if one of the few other pharmacies near her are a good option &amp; ck the few places we know of for mail order, then let her know.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-09 17:55:46', '2023-10-09 17:55:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126217027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044406111', 'Chadd Ziegler', NULL, '10-9-2023:  Chadd called.  He''s at the Urg Care & they are going to suggest somewhere to get an MRI.  I found 2 locations closest to Bldr, CO for him & gave him their ph #s & addresses.  Most are further into Denver & I did not know I was discussing this w/the same gentleman from earlier.  In HCBB I cannot look at a calf MRI, so I ran a full let MRI with & without contrast & it''s ~ $1300.  Since I could not catch Chadd, I tt Wendy.  She said they sugg Spectrum MRI (but Chadd said that was further into Dnvr) & they were ~$450 (which is entirely possible since it''s a smaller part of his body).  All the locations Chadd & I discussed are listed as ''fair priced'', so after I got off from Wendy, I tried Chadd again & this time it allowed me to LM for him.  That as best we can tell, he should be fine using any of the facilites we discussed.  Just hold onto your detailed inv & pymt receipts & we''ll help him w/how to get w/Sedera for sub his ''med need'' request.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-10-09 17:38:34', '2023-10-09 17:40:41'),
