  ('zcrm_1579374000126211048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521464', 'Jaime Boswell', NULL, '10-9-23 Jaime remembered me when I called her. She reached out to MPB directly and Nahla discovered she is my client from the past. Jaime has had coverage through her husband but won''t have it soon. He''s 52 and she''s 46. They live in Belfast, ME and FL. They rarely go to the drs. for anything. They don''t really do their wellness visits either. But, she''s interested in both SECURE HSA and Care+. I also let her know I can waive $100 of the $125. She knows of the Oct. 20th deadline. She will keep me posted.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-09 16:49:22', '2023-10-10 17:29:08'),
