  ('zcrm_1579374000126211043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044406111', 'Chadd Ziegler', NULL, '10-9-23 Chadd called bc he has an injury perhaps a torn muscle or something where he can''t put any weight on his leg. He was driving to the ER until I suggested Urgent Care. So, he''s now driving to 2801 Purcel St. to Advanced Urgent Care and Occupational Medicine in Brighton. I got Cari''s input as to how to advise him for the invoice and she suggested to ask for a detailed invoice instead of a super bill. This eliminates the questions from the staff re self pay. She also mentioned MRI are typically $400-$600 as self pay. I let him know that and to call if the cost will be much more and they will help him. Otherwise, he''s on track and doesn''t need a policy number or anything else. I gave him the Concierge # to call to create the need in a day or two when the dust settles.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-09 16:39:29', '2023-10-09 16:39:29'),
