  ('zcrm_1579374000126211021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126212014', 'Cheryl Adams', NULL, '10-9-23 Cheryl is 61 and lives in Centennial area. She was sent to me by Madisen Abbott. She fired her current broker who would never call her back. She was on Friday Health and chose Kaiser since it was cheapest. He would send her a bill and tacked on a significant charge above the Kaiser cost. He did it all for her and she didn''t think she had a C4 account which I helped her get into with simply resetting her pwd. Her income is set at $65K and she''s getting a decent APTC.  I was going to offer her MCS when I saw the price was still $450+. She then shared that she was severely injured by the covid vax. She was required to get it as a vet to keep her job. After the first one she had full body tremors within 5-12 hours. They were uncontrollable. She managed it all as naturally as possible. She then was encouraged by every health professional to get the 2nd shot to keep her job and allow her to travel. That one was even worse! She now has perivascular spacing in her brain, cardiac damage blood clots in her brain and lungs, micro clotting, right sided heart damage, thyroid, issues, etc.!!!! Also her triponin levels were threw the roof. She''s now following First Line Critical Care since they are fighting for the vax injured. Her nephew even had open heart surgery!  She''s treating it all as naturally as possible with light therapy, acupuncture, laser therapy, applied kinesiology,  Beemer mat, naturopathic doctors, etc. She done most of it out of pocket on her own. She''s a trooper!  She''s in good spirits! It''s taken 18 months for her immune system to start to work again after taking some super helpful Chinese herbs. Her naturopath has 200 covid vax injured patients right now!!! Some of her levels were the worst also!  She wants to move to Portugal for retirement where she can get into their healthcare system in a tiered phasing into it over 5 years. She said many people speak english there as well. 
She put in her payment info with cc for the Cigna plan for Nov. She knows to call in 10 days to make her ongoing payment as well and will call me in Nov. to choose for next year.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-09 15:48:09', '2023-12-11 15:47:07'),
