  ('zcrm_1579374000126135003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100491002', 'Michelle Faciana', NULL, '10.06.2023 Michelle called to understand how to maneuver the healthsharing portion of her plan, plus clarification on which part is preventative. She shared that her husband is have sinus issues, and might need surgery. At first, the ENT was brought up as a specialist, then we wanted to confirm if sinus surgeries are actually shared with Zion. Unlike many other members, Michelle was able to log into her Zion portal, and view where she can start the sharing request.
