  ('zcrm_1579374000125997003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109943001', 'Paul Vanslyke', NULL, '10-3-23 Called and can''t leave a vm with Paul to alert him about his payment not working. Ugh.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-04 17:30:48', '2023-10-04 17:30:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125976041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366043', 'Jayne Asatani', NULL, '10.04.2023 Jayne called to confirm if an urgent care unit is in the network. I explained that it does not need to be in the network. All she will need to do is present herself as a cash pay patient, and save all her receipts that might be connected to this situation, as she goes. This will help show she fulfilled her IUA. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-04 16:57:11', '2023-10-04 16:57:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125976036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115994002', 'Scott Nonnemaker', NULL, '10.04.2023 Nicole called to quote the cost for adding her daughter and to get help to add her email. I guided her to the MPB change forms site, helped her fill out the form and direct transferred her to Michael Montes. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-04 16:20:29', '2023-10-04 16:20:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125976028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125144014', 'Edward Hartman', 'Ticket - #3058', '10.04.2023 Ed called to follow up on the situation above re: the failed integration of information from MPB to Planstin. I offered Ed a phone call tomorrow, after I learned about where they are in the process of fixing that issue.
Ed wanted to access his MPB portal, I gave him his log-in information from the CRM site, but they did not work. I tried on my end, by copying and pasting and they still did not work. I will put in a ticket for attention and hopefully correction. 
I put in a ticket for Ed - #3058.     NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-04 15:53:45', '2023-10-17 10:38:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125994016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079055002', 'Dale Leder', NULL, '10.03.23:  Cindy wrote back not to rush, there''s no hurry.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-10-04 15:16:35', '2023-10-04 15:16:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125994011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079055002', 'Dale Leder', NULL, '10.02.23:  Cindy emailed me.She may need  knee replacement Sx in the future and has questions about how this med. need works with Zion.  I replied I''m looking into confirmation on the process from Zion (tryng to find out if Zion is still approving sharing with using Care Connect) and will let her know when I hear back from a call I put into Zion (Dr. Jeff Lee).', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-10-04 15:15:56', '2023-10-04 15:15:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125994006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087734002', 'Jocelyn Luhr', NULL, '10.4.23:  Emailed Jocelyn.  I explained to her MPB does not provide members with an I.D. #, although we administer an I.D. number to each member in the Admin123 system.  We provide that # to the member only if the member wants to change their password for their MPB member portal.  I included her member # in the email.  I also asked if she completed the plan change form to change to the DIRECT plan.  Jocelyn responded she did not switch over yet. She added, as a small business owner, the HSA is important to her and asked if she switches to DIRECT would she be losing that.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-10-04 15:08:05', '2023-10-09 07:59:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125976023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123096002', 'Karen Yabuno', NULL, '10.04.2023 Karen has not received her welcome package, according to her advisor Karen Torsoe, who called on her behalf.
I double check the message via teams between Kelly and Cari, and I learned they were sent out on the 1st. I let Karen T know and she will relay the message to KarenY. Kelly is double checking to see if KarenY was indeed one of the members who''s package was sent out on the 1st. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-04 14:32:29', '2023-10-04 14:32:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125976018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283234', 'Kristen Le Peau', NULL, '10.04.2023 Kristen filled out an RX Request. I sent her the following:
I was able to search 8 different discounted sites, but all but one site offered only a 12% discount. This led me to check with our international shopper, whose quote was more than the sites I checked. Most of the sites, and our international shopper offered a quote ranging from $180-$207.
A shot in the dark, I checked the manufacturing website for a coupon, and no such luck, but I will include what I found there in the email.
What I was able to find was a coupon for $53.35, and only one website offered that with Walgreens.

Below are the prices as of ​10.04.2023. 
NP Thyroid QTY 90 • 90 MG • Tablet ​: Walgreens=$53.35
Please let me know if you have any questions or need anything adjusted.             NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-04 13:08:35', '2023-10-04 13:08:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125976013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079059075', 'Jon Hancock', NULL, '10.04.2023 Jon called to get access to Teledoc with Zion for a dermatology issue. I explained that is not part of his plan, cirrusMd has helped with derm. issues before, but if he''s looking for an actual specialist, I can help him find one via HCBB.
I reforwarded to him the Summary of Care email that was sent by KellyAnn, via outlook. We perused HCBB together. I also offered him to save HealthGrades.com. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-04 11:41:23', '2023-10-04 11:41:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125976008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120913002', 'Charlie Gomez', NULL, '10.04.2023 Jennifer called to better learn how to maneuver her preventative care appointments:
-Women''s Wellness Visit & -Mammogram
I explained to use the planstin card and offer their phone number to get paid, what to expect to be covered in services and what to avoid getting
I explained what type of mamm is covered and how to present herself in both appointments.
She asked about birth control prescription requests. I guided her to bookmark the page on our site to fill out the form. I let her know that some birth control is covered under Planstin, and that we will be in touch, when we see her form. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-04 11:22:47', '2023-10-04 11:22:47'),
