  ('zcrm_1579374000125947057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106863002', 'Sudhakar Balagurusamy', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation eff 11/1/23 after speaking with advisor Lou Spatafore.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-10-04 07:33:44', '2023-10-04 07:33:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125939076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125144014', 'Edward Hartman', NULL, '10.03.2023 Christine called on behalf of Ed, claiming that Edward called Planstin to attain his card for his appointments, and Planstin shared that he is NOT in their system as Preventative HSA/MEC. I put Christine on hold and called Planstin - Spoke with Neri, and she confirmed that their system is not showing him in there, nor his wife with preventative. Neri went to check with her team if there is anything else they can do. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-03 17:07:54', '2023-10-03 17:09:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125939071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062415323', 'Wallace James', NULL, '10.03.2023 Linda called right before she was being admitted into the ER, and wanted to know what the exact steps were to follow for coverage and more. I assured her that all she needs to worry about, aside from getting through this part of the situation is to:
- present as a cash-pay patient
- try to reach that $1000 IUA
- collect any receipts/invoices
When they settle back in at home, to call us back and we will help with opening a medical need. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-03 15:58:20', '2023-10-03 15:58:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125939063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112618002', 'Antonio DeMarco', NULL, '10.03.2023 Jennifer called for her ID # on her card, it was missing. But she was looking at the MPB card, so I led her to find the white card with the word Planstin on it. I encouraged her to use that card for all of her preventative appointments. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-03 14:56:50', '2023-10-03 14:56:50'),
