  ('zcrm_1579374000125934118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125928002', 'Ronald Reed', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-10-03 14:18:31', '2023-10-03 14:18:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125934113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125927002', 'Carol Rowland', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-10-03 14:14:59', '2023-10-03 14:14:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125939055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124806001', 'Brandon Harvey', NULL, '10.03.2023 Christina called needing to learn more details about her plan, and request her Plansin card virtually to use at the pediatrician''s office visit. She went for the 1st visit ped check up, then the 2nd co-pay visit (jaundice), but had to pay cash for it. After talking to Planstin (Karen), they recommended she ask the doctor to bill Planstin for it and get reimbursed by the office.
Initially I do not have verbiage, lingo nor content to support our member on this new plan, given all the different co-pays for different scenarios. I reached out to Joan and Wendy via teams. Wendy was able to share a snapshot of all the co-pays (shared below) and Joan emailed me the pamphlets for more details. 
Your Co-Pay’s for the following visits is as follows:
Primary Care Offi ce Visit $20.00 Co-Pay/Unlimited Visits
Specialist Offi ce Visit $50.00 Co-Pay/Unlimited Visits
Lab/Blood Work $10.00 Co-Pay***Some Limitations on Apply
X-Rays $50.00 Co-Pay
Urgent Care $50.00 Co-Pay  
*********************************************************************************
Brandon had to call us back, b/c when the provider called Planstin to confirm coverage and payment processing, Planstin could not confirm Brenna being added and part of the plan. 
I put Brandon on hold, and called Planstin via Goto. William answered and:
- He found the profile - Brenna was NOT showing up there - Had me on hold for at least 8 minutes - Reached out to another team member - Had me wait again - Shared that for some reason files are not updating & both tech parties are working towards a solution. 
William did not have a solid solution nor answer, but did not want to have me and the member waiting any longer, SO he offered to call me back with any information found. I offered the same gesture to our member Brandon.     NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-03 14:14:04', '2023-10-03 15:32:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125947047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106890013', 'Alex Shinkle', NULL, '10-3-23 I received a cancellation notice from Cigna for Alex. It looks like she never made her binder payment!  Case:17A3D3.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-03 14:13:25', '2023-10-03 14:13:25'),
