They are guessing they will owe about $20K since Anthem is rejecting the hospital stay for her hand surgery. She stay 5 nights and they guess $4K per night that won''t be covered. I mentioned the Hospital Bill Eraser program but she thinks their income will be much more than $69,680 in 2023. David got a new job and is making more now. So, that''s not an option. I also suggested she asks for the cash price for the hospital stay, if it''s not covered by Anthem. She had the surgery at Anschutz. Also, her plan will likely auto-renew per a letter she received in the mail from Anthem.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-03 13:41:48', '2023-10-03 13:45:00'),
