  ('zcrm_1579374000125934083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114324012', 'Brindra Lekhraj', NULL, 'Member later called in after receiving my email asking to cancel his request to add his children to the membership', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-10-03 12:32:28', '2023-10-03 12:32:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125947021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593010', 'Suzanne Martinek', NULL, '10-3-23 Suzy might want to split their membership moving forward due to separation or may leave well enough alone. If she stays as EO, her portion will be $400.78 but then her husband would have to re-enroll in our current memberships. I don''t know if he has any pre-x or if he uses Redirect''s benefits. I have a vm into Suzy now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-03 12:27:41', '2023-10-03 12:27:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125939050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924134', 'Kristen Lassalette', NULL, '10.03.2023 Wendy reached out to me YESTERDAY via teams, requesting that I connect with Kristen, as she has been trying to phone through and is not reaching us.
I was able to finally call her TODAY, but had to leave her a VM. I offered to try her again in a bit. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-03 12:26:19', '2023-10-03 12:26:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125947013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624001', 'Rachel Holden', NULL, '10-3-23 Rachel is enrolling in SECURE now that they are losing her huband''s insurance again. They have absolutely no pre-x. Husband turned 50 this year. So, SECURE is $905/$1000 and I waived the $100 bc they are with WWSRA. Rachel will remind her team to add this membership info to their next newsletter for WWSRA. She will add their site- https://joinmympb.com/WWSRA/. I showed her where to find the video and told her to simply include my contact information in the newsletter as well. It''s the perfect time on their end to remind folks about this since we''re entering ski season and such.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-03 12:09:35', '2023-10-03 12:14:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125934078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106305009', 'Karen Awad', 'New Membership eff 11/1/23', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-10-03 12:06:07', '2023-10-03 12:06:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125934073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106305009', 'Karen Awad', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to change her plan from the Care + to the Secure plan.  I hope member is eligible for this membership.I will change effective 11/1/23.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-10-03 12:04:05', '2023-10-03 12:04:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125947003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011537054', 'Michael Sharpe', NULL, '10-3-23 From Patti to Michael 
 Mr. Sharpe,
         In a recent audit we uncovered an error in your monthly Share Amount.  In May of 2023 because you turned 60 your price should have increased to $523.78. However you continued to be billed $353.78. We apologize for this error.
         So, moving forward starting with the 10/20 billing your new payment will be the corrected amount of $523.78.  Again we apologize for the error.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-03 11:19:18', '2023-10-03 11:19:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125939039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122567002', 'Alexandra Novo', NULL, '10.03.2023 Alexandra called to learn more how to attain a psychiatrist. I explained about M&amp;S and their services and lead her to use HCBB to find a psychiatrist. I sent her an email via CRM with HealthGrades and HCBB links. She was able to access HCBB via credentials from MPB and together we searched for Psychiatry in her area. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-03 11:15:23', '2023-10-03 11:28:39'),
