  ('zcrm_1579374000125939013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257276', 'Jacqueline Martinez', NULL, '10.03.2023 Jacqueline called to learn how to help David, her spouse, to use CirrusMD, as it has been a while she says that she has used it. She is also not entirely sure that she used CirrusMD, so clarification and assistance in registrations are both needed. 
