  ('zcrm_1579374000125899091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125944002', 'Kevin Krueger', NULL, '10-3-23 Kevin is a smoker! UGH. But, he''s young fortunately. I told him the limitations for 50 and older. He knows he has to pay $50 extra a month.  I told him how to get that removed by quitting for one year and Dr. records. He''s not planning on quitting at this time. Has deviated septum and no ACL from many years ago. Otherwise, nothing more to report. He knows costs associated with those items will not be shared in the first year and then tiered upward. He enrolled in CARE+ $2500/$185 for Nov. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-03 10:17:50', '2023-10-03 10:22:27'),
