  ('zcrm_1579374000125900060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659075', 'Snatam Khalsa', NULL, 'Snatam called in and just wanted to verify the process of what Planstin will be doing for her well visits and child well visits. There was some issue with her and a hospital with having to go back and forth with being self-pay and using her card through Planstin. She mentioned it was too big of a deal and the hospital did not want to deal with the process. So, basically, she just wanted to get confirmation of what she was told by Planstin when she called them yesterday. I explained to her that yes, what she was told is correct and that I myself have personally used Planstin and it was a smooth process and quick. She felt a lot better after telling her this and is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-10-03 08:31:38', '2023-10-03 08:31:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125900055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122803002', 'Peter Fenwick', NULL, 'Peter called in and wanted to make sure he was giving the correct info over to his podiatrist''s office for an appointment he has coming up for his chronic shoulder pain. He initially gave them Planstin''s info, to which I told him unfortunately that is incorrect (I explained what Planstin is for and when he would use Planstin as sharing info to give) and let him know this is a self-pay situation with Zion Health after he pays his IUA. I emailed him how to submit bills to Zion with the link on how and where to do so when the time comes. Pete fully understands now and thanked me for the info. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-10-03 08:08:28', '2023-10-03 08:08:28'),
