  ('zcrm_1579374000125933003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087734002', 'Jocelyn Luhr', NULL, '10.3.23:  Recvd. an email from Jocelyn. Said she needs the member # to log into her MPB portal.  Her Admin123 member # is 678958195. Do not need member # for login.  Need email address and password. Jocelyn''s Admin123 password does not work. Ask her if she changed it.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-10-03 07:56:12', '2023-10-04 15:03:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125900039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578137', 'Rachel Fisher Ingraham', NULL, '10.02.2023 Rachel called again to follow up on the same issue above. I connected with Wendy via teams, she recommended to connect with the advisor, Analisa Cleland (who stated has not been able to access her CRM for a while now, therefore has NOT seen the above notes NOR was aware of the situation with Rachel).
