I called Planstin and spoke with Caden, who was helpful to find her in their system, but realized that Rachel is not on the same Planstin plan as the rest of our MPB members. Caden put me on hold and discussed Rachel''s situation with his supervisor. Upon Caden''s return to the phone, he shared the following, and I recapped prior to letting him go:
