  ('zcrm_1579374000125899076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125928002', 'Ronald Reed', NULL, '10-2-23 Ronald Reed is getting divorced from Michele Brooks as of Nov. 1st 2023. He''s re-enrolling in SECURE HSA. He has an open need but there will be no lapse in his benefits. He just completed the Remove Spouse from Membership and re-enrollment in SECURE. I removed the $100 fee of course. I told him to still do the Welcome Call to have them help him get his virtual healthcare app set up successfully again under his new membership. I also told him to print and keep the Quick Reference Guide.  He''s in the middle of an open need which I made sure he made note of on all forms to show proof of no lapse. Original start date is Dec. 1st, 2020.  I also asked how they found MPB to begin with  and he had no idea since his wife was in charge of it. She just wanted an option with an HSA since she''s an accountant.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-02 16:42:58', '2023-10-02 16:42:58'),
