  ('zcrm_1579374000125900034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106792002', 'Anne Silseth', NULL, '10.02.2023 Anne called asking about dental coverage. I explained that her plan does not hold or offer any dental coverage, despite the fact that the Planstin card says dental/vision on it. I explained that we have different coverage plans and that the planstin coverage that she presently has is purely preventative.
I recommended that she speak to Karen Torsoe, her advisor, to inquired if she can offer any companion products that support dental coverage. Anne was happy to do so, and I have her Karen''s number so she can connect at a later time. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-02 14:43:35', '2023-10-02 14:43:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125899033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109943001', 'Paul Vanslyke', NULL, '10-2-23 I tried calling Paul and his vm is full at the moment. I''ll try text and another email to reach him about his late payment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-02 14:30:12', '2023-10-02 14:30:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125899028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126939027', 'Tyler Fritz', NULL, '10-2-23 Tyler has a company Ironwood Marketing and was referred by Mateusz Piasta. Tyle has many 1099 contract workers and some W2. He believes he will easily get 3+ members to join, likely 5-6. There are about 20 folks in office. He will contribute $50 towards the cost of the membership. He''s good with a Nov. or Dec. 1st start date. He''s ready to roll already. I sent him the List Bill page to complete. He knows of all of the deadlines. He understands the pre-x clause, IUA, etc. He watched the video on Friday last week and didn''t have very many questions to ask. I re-explained much of it to make sure he was up to speed. Most employees are young in their 20''s and 30''s. There one woman in her 50''s who is likely already on her husband''s health ins. So, the group is young. They are interested in SECURE / $1000. He knows of the $200 fee for the group and $25 annual renewal fee.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-02 14:12:40', '2023-10-02 14:12:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125882044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124631129', 'Kendall Wright', NULL, 'No Response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-10-02 13:19:09', '2023-10-02 13:19:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125900029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124216002', 'Bradon Erickson', NULL, '10.02.2023 Bradon called to cancel today''s welcome call. He rescheduled it with no problem but did not know how to cancel today''s. I message Vanessa via teams to help with that part and let her know of the change in schedule. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-10-02 13:09:15', '2023-10-02 13:09:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125899023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121975002', 'Lynn O''Malley', NULL, '10-2-23 Lynn is Very mad at The Hope Institute. She was pissed that she has to use her own computer and Google for her job. She wants nothing to do with them. Therefore, she doesn''t want to continue any of her benefits on her own either. So, I''ve requested to have her removed from 1Dental and MPB list bill. Andrew requested this after the deadline. He requested this on Sunday, Oct. 1st. I got it today on Oct. 2nd and let him know we can''t cancel her retroactively. I sent a note to 1Dental and Karina to cancel her membership. I sent Lynn the cancellation form via email since she hung up on me when I was asking her if she wanted to keep any of her benefits. So, I called back and left a vm and sent the email. She is quite angry and says the job was all a scam.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-02 13:03:18', '2023-10-02 13:03:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125895008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110429010', 'Mark Strona', NULL, 'Mark reached out via SalesIQ needing help getting into his MPB Member Portal. I reached out to him and provided the link to bring him straight to the login page for the MPB Member Portal, his portal username, password, and lastly his MPB Member ID number just in case he wanted to change his password to something more personal to him that he can remember, instead of the automated one the system created for him. I let him know how to change the password if he chooses to do so. Mark is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-10-02 13:01:56', '2023-10-02 13:01:56'),
