  ('zcrm_1579374000125900021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119444002', 'Charlene Conlin', NULL, '10.02.2023 I left Charlene a message last friday to clarify her RX request. She returned my call today, and I was able to price her request on a few sites, and not find anything at least 75% discount. I asked her for some time to do more research, and perhaps reach out to our international shopper. She was ok with that, as she said, she has enough right now. 
