  ('zcrm_1579374000125672026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116383002', 'Liza Bakken', NULL, '09.28.2023 Liza called back following up on our previous conversation via outlook, re: complete bill coverage from Planstin towards her Mamm screening.
