We reached Celeste at Planstin who was helpful and  direct in the information stating that Planstin did their part and paid 100%. Liza explained the numbers showing member responsibility on the bill the facility sent her, and asked why is it still showing a balance. Celeste explained that she would be happy to share with Liza and the facility, verbiage supporting 0 cost left as member responsibility, due to the contracted agreement the facility has through PHCS.
We let Celeste go, and Liza had an additional question re: Lab-work coverage during preventative appointments. I explained that all we have seen covered is the Std. Lipid Panel. Liza had three other lab-work she needed to get done and will do those at her local lab site in her area. I sent her an email with the discounted labsites to peruse prices for contrast. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-28 15:41:10', '2023-09-28 15:41:10'),
