  ('zcrm_1579374000125660013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115996020', 'Cord Dorcey', NULL, 'Cord called in and needed some pricing options for what a typical EKG costs as he has been having some chest pains. To which CirrusMD suggested he go and get an EKG done. I explained to him how to proceed as it will be out of pocket up to his IUA. I also did some research in his area using his zip code and sent him a link to see what some fair pricing would be for this procedure he needs. Sent via email and is all set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-09-28 09:07:29', '2023-09-28 09:07:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125657003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087734002', 'Jocelyn Luhr', NULL, '09.28.23:  Jocelyn responded and asked what her member number is. Emailed her to tell her there are 2 membership #s:  MPB # and Planstin #.  Asked what the purpose of her need for the # is so we can provide the correct # to her.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-09-28 08:51:31', '2023-09-28 15:21:29'),
