  ('zcrm_1579374000125626082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121824002', 'Meghan Nyswaner', NULL, '09.27.2023 Meghan called to learn how to access her MPB portal, to update her address on her account. I explained what is all in the portal first off, and guided her to the page where all the forms to update the plan are, then I offered her the log in information to the MPB Portal. She accessed her portal while we were still on the phone. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-27 17:59:17', '2023-09-27 17:59:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125632045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066206016', 'Jacqueline Olivier', NULL, '9-27-2023:  Jacqueline called.  William had something rem''d from his shoulder that''s been there for a while.  I walked her thru the current proc for sub a Zion ''sharing req''.
     -', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-27 17:56:28', '2023-10-13 16:58:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125632040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029894166', 'Steven Brooks', NULL, '9-27-2023:  Vivien called.  She needs an x-ray & was thinking RCI would be paying.  We did educ on the diff components and what they help with.  Since the x-ray is not ''prev care'', it would be her healthsharing component that would help:
     - She knows that the $500 IUA on the older plan = issue specific.  So, if the doctor that''s having her get the x-ray''s visit(s), the x-ray itself, and all other exp towards this issue become $500 or >, then Sedera will help her with the process of how to proceed.  She''s been working with them already, so seemed to understand this.  I gave her a heads up re: 2nd MD = an education piece Sedera can ask you to do & it''s important for best ''sharing''.  She''ll keep an ear open in case they request this.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-27 17:55:14', '2023-09-27 17:55:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125640003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125639002', 'Michael Monahan', NULL, '9-27-23 Mike was just sailing to the Caribbean and is back now.  He''s my long time friend!  He''s super healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco. He hasn''t even been to a dr. for a bunch of years now. He had a vasectomy over 2 years ago and no problems with that. He doesn''t do the annual wellness visits. He''s moving his world from MA to CO now and he used his CO address which is current for enrolling.  He just enrolled in CARE+ at $240/$1000 and knows that when he turns 50 in Feb. his new monthly contribution will be $265 which he''s fine with. He''s thrilled this will work around the world since he sails a bunch. He''s also planning to build a new home in Carbondale this year.  He''s all set for Nov. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-09-27 17:01:45', '2023-09-27 17:01:45'),
