  ('zcrm_1579374000125626072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091055002', 'Steven Meath', NULL, '09.27.2023 Dawn called with Steven to gather a good deal on flu shots and RSV. I searched 3 disc. pharmacy sites, but none recognized rsv.', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-27 15:43:23', '2023-09-27 15:43:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125626064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120995010', 'Tom Trimmer', NULL, '09.27.2023 Thomas called to get additional guidance on how to proceed and be covered for the following appointments: Dermatology & Colonoscopy and Gastroenterology.
I explained that Derm and Gastro (Stomach) will be a cash pay visit/portion of the visit.
As for the preventative visits like Colonoscopy, to present the planstin card, offer the number ending in -7526, and maintain the physical annual as preventative. I guided no RX with the appointment, so separate if it is medically needed, as well as the extra lab-work outside the std lipid panel. As for the colon. screening if they pull polyps, then we will have a different conversation to be covered, through Zion the health-sharing company.
We perused HCBB and Healthgrades together, and Thomas was intrigued and the value of the searches, and seemed confident in doing the searches independently. Thomas will call us back if he has anymore questions. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-27 15:10:30', '2023-09-27 15:30:25'),
