  ('zcrm_1579374000125632014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080704002', 'Tom Weiss', NULL, '9-27-2023:  Melissa called.  Had surg last yr in November.  Orig >$152k.  She has been trying to get itemized ''cash-pay'' invoice to pay since.  Has been trying to get details on the inv every-month since before May 2023 & still can''t seem to get one that has the breakdown, CPT codes, etc.  Hosp always says, we''ll get that to you & it never arrives.  Just a new bill for the lump sum due of 11k.
     -  $116,980.52 = pre-pd cc Melissa rec''d in May 2023 from Zion to pay twds the $152k stmt (wasn''t a bill, just an itemized stmt).  But, since Melissa hasn''t had an invoice to pay, that pymt amount expired.  Planstin was billed???  and that''s where this $ amt came from.
     - Hosp is telling her she still owes ~11k = last bit, but she can''t seem to get an itemized stmt.  Presp St Luke''s here in Colorado.
     - Called Zion together & tt JoAnna - told her we are trying to brain storm.  Due to huge discount of the ''cash-pay'' bill, may be the issue.  Need to be able to see details of each item for Zion to pay.  JoAnna sugg getting a lawyer involved to nudge hospital, but Melissa says she cannot afford that.  Keeps getting un-itemezied bill.  I sugg the orig itemized stmt with an invoice that shows that orig amt, the disc, and then the balance now due & JoAnna said she didn''t think that would work (not sure why if DOS, etc, lines up).  JoAnna finally said, let me go tt a supervisor to see if we can just get this taken care of.  tt Dept & General Mgrs.  Want to make sure the acct # matches & they may be able to go ahead and pay.  
        Melissa decided she''s going to try to connect w/the hosp one last time to make sure on a recorded line that this ~11k invoice will completely clear their acct.  That nothing else will be due.  JoAnna says to upload a cover letter that refers to the processor looking at her acct for notes on today''s conv (9/27/2023) to make sure they know what the intention is & send everything to: needs@zionhealth.org.
       Melissa was able to conf today that the hosp stmt, and now super discounted invoice, show the same account #.  She will submit the orig itemized stmt that shows that same acct # as well.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-27 13:42:03', '2023-09-27 14:17:49'),
