  ('zcrm_1579374000125626056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '09.27.2023 Carolyn called wanting to be reimbursed for the Covid/flu shot she received.
She said she did not have her card on her, but thinks she is in their system. I told her Covid is for sure covered at participating pharmacies. I was trying to conjure up solutions to have her get reimbursed or reverse her transaction with the pharmacy, and all I could come up with is have her connect the pharmacy with Planstin, bill them, to be covered. As for reimbursement, I shared with her, and according to Cari after consulting with her via teams, is that members do not get reimbursed.
In the end, Carolyn''s information started changing, saying that "they did contact planstin". I asked her, "wait so they billed Planstin and they rejected them?". She said "I don''t know what they did...". At that point there wasn''t much I could do, with little to no clear information from her and know that Planstin does not reimburse members. Carolyn had to get off to head on somewhere, she seemed frustrated, rightfully so, but I don''t think she fully understands the process of her RX coverage.
I called Planstin afterwards to have a card sent to her, and asked them for advice on the situation, and they said, when the pharmacy bills them, they pay the provider...never the member. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-27 12:40:10', '2023-09-27 12:40:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125628083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081349010', 'Deepak Maragal', NULL, 'I received cancellation eff 10/1/23  from this member due to the fact that he now has coverage thru his spouse.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-27 12:36:34', '2023-09-27 12:36:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125626051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123074010', 'Caleb Vogtner', NULL, '09.27.2023 Caleb called to reiterate parts of his plan for use:
