  ('zcrm_1579374000125633003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087734002', 'Jocelyn Luhr', NULL, '09.27.23:  Recvd. an email from Jocelyn. She now has a DPC physician registered through Zion. Wants to change her plan to Direct ASAP. Wants to know how to do this. Emailed her how to access the Membership Updates form and fill out Section 5 to change her plan and submit it.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-09-27 12:00:12', '2023-09-27 14:07:27'),
