  ('zcrm_1579374000125626041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079410001', 'Christopher Duncan', NULL, '09.27.2023 Marcella called to attain and solidify the process of having a mamm and colon performed and covered by Planstin''s coverage. I walked her through:
