  ('zcrm_1579374000125632003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088818002', 'Shane Simmons', NULL, '9-27-2023:  Shane called.  He''s having weight loss surgery in a diff country (US = $27k, other country = $4800 & says it is medical doctors).  I walked him thru Zion''s curr proc for setting up a Zion Memb Port (& reminded him that portal is for his sharing req only.  If he needs to chg pymt forms, address, etc, plez contact us here at MPB.)
     - Because his surgery is ''med tourism'', I let him know it will req prior authorization.  He''s in his 2nd yr of memb (or maybe longer to hear him talk) so even if it is pre-x, he would have some help, with restrictions:  
        [I did NOT go over the limitation specifically on weight loss.  Curr in the 2nd yr of memb you qual for up to 3k in help per sharing req.  If the surgery is $4800 & approved, they would share the $3k + 1k IUA = $800 extra he''d be resp for.  I am leaving it to Zion to go over this with him.]
        He will call if he needs further assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-27 11:09:35', '2023-09-27 11:15:48'),
