  ('zcrm_1579374000125617013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064410541', 'Lori Streim', NULL, '9-26-23 Ilyse (Lori) Streim and David Rubine called to get help with a recent incident. Ilyse had a finger infection and had a great surgeon help her to resolve the problem. But, he recommended she stay in the hospital for 5 days to do the surgery and manage the infection. Now Anthem is disputing the hospital stay and isn''t paying for that part of the bills. She asked for my advice how to move forward in the dispute process. I suggested she gets her dr. to write up a note outlining why he recommended what he did and have him advocate for her. They were planning to do this and she believes the surgeon will do so. They really liked him. Her infection is resolved now and all is well. She was totally calm about it all.  She will also be moving to Medicare in 10 months and I''ve already connected them with Andrea.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-09-26 17:12:23', '2023-09-26 17:13:26'),
