  ('zcrm_1579374000125605049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059281121', 'Dechen Hawk', NULL, '09.26.2023 Dechen called wanting to learn why the discounted lab-site is requesting a referral from the doctor. I visited the site Jennifer sent; LaboratoryAssist.com, and it a site that I have not sampled yet. Dechen explained exactly what he is seeing when he is trying to check out. We visited two other sites, and they ended up being 2/3 more expensive.
