  ('zcrm_1579374000125605044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123838002', 'Cassidy Young', NULL, '09.26.2023 Cassidy called to understand how to register for his welcome call. His concern was that the times that were open to sign up, were not aligning with his schedule. He works during the day, and is not available till after 4pm MTN time.
