  ('zcrm_1579374000125520138', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106407002', 'Maria Faria', NULL, '9-25-2023:  Re: Ticket #3021 & other info:
Ticket #3021: This ticket was assigned to me when I was out for a family memorial & not in the office.
     - Mon 9-25-2023: ILM at (401) 316-6839 - Plez call concierge. Gave # & hours. This appears to be Maria''s #.
     - tt Victor, & in the meantime he tt Zion & they are e-mailing him a ck = ~$400 reimb. He will let us know if he has further questions, but seems set for now.  Closed ticket.  
-------------------------------------
     - Victor had questions re: annual appt.  Wondered if they automatically use the annual appt amount (curr $175) when they sub a larger ''sharing req".  I told him he would have needed to sub a req to use that & went over how it only covers the visit, nothing else & best to use after 13-mos to make sure no overlap in the 1x in 12 mos.  He said they did not req that they use that for his larger ''sharing req''.  If he has questions, I told him the ''sharing req'' dept could confirm.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-25 18:12:54', '2023-09-25 18:15:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125520133', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080099002', 'Michelle Stevens', NULL, '9-25-2023:  RX Quote for Michelle Stevens:
     Michelle is headed out of town, yet having trouble finding a Walgreens w/her NP Thy 15mg in stock.  Her normal Monument, CO Walgreens gave her stock to someone else today.  Plus, that store is limiting her to #30 because they can''t get enough.  Walgreens pricing is $20+ < all the other coupons I can find on the discount sites (I think that''s because they use this specific brand as their generic?).  Michelle had me send her 2 coupons as follows.  If she cannot find a store to pick them up at, she''ll call back and we can find one of the far more exp places for her to go:
     - NP Thyroid 15mg, #90 tabs = $31.22 at Walgreens on RXGo
     - NP Thyroid 15mg, #30 tabs = $13.41 at Walgreens on RXGo     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-25 14:46:56', '2023-09-25 14:46:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125538069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650322', 'Kathryn McGaughey', NULL, '09.25.2023 Kathryn called inquiring about the mental health services in her plan. I guided her to the MAP program we have through Mazzitti and Sullivan group. Gave her a short orientation of the site and her options from there. 
******************************************************************************************
Kathryn called us back to inform us that she called the EAP program to set up sessions with M&S EAP, but it was after hours and she got confused as to why they needed to get back to her within 1-3 business days. I three way called us, and Destiny answered, and confirmed they do have her information to contact her back TOMORROW at her west coast time.
I guided Kathryn to take one step at a time, and wait to speak to them tomorrow, and to call us back with results received from the EAP group. Destiny was utmost caring and helpful and patient in maneuvering their database and offering Kathryn a stronger grasp on how the program works in its initial phases with members. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-25 14:33:07', '2023-09-25 15:26:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125520125', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497108', 'Kathleen Walsh', NULL, 'Member PU form I will update in A123. Verification sent via outlook', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-25 14:00:31', '2023-09-25 14:08:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125520108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109785015', 'Ivonne Gonzales', NULL, '9-25-2023:  Ivonne called.  I walked her to the pymt chg form.  She knows to use the ''submit'' button &amp; is planning to use an ACH Bank Acct = no processing fees.  I let her know we''ll update her acct for her Oct pymt.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-25 13:15:44', '2023-09-25 13:15:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125509063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123843002', 'Ginovelli Silvestre', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-09-25 12:55:19', '2023-09-25 12:55:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125520088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094942002', 'Tim Ottmann', NULL, '9-25-2023:  Angela called & tt Julia at the main off.  Angela wants help sub a sharing req.  I called the # on file:  = (303) 909-5593 = Tim''s # & LM that we are trying to connect w/Angela to help.  Asked him to have Angela give the conc line a call & gave our # & hours.  Also, sent an e-mail to the e-mail on file which also looks like Tim''s w/our info.  Please call & we''ll help you.     - CA

Let Julia know & she was able to provide the # Angela called from:  303-349-5140.  I tt Angela: she had an emerg situation in June.  We walked thru how to curr submit a Zion ''sharing request''.  She pd $2500 before she left the hosp, but the hosp got bought out & she''s still struggling to get a bill (esp one that shows she''s a ''cash-pay'' patient).  She knows there''s a 6 mo deadline & will stay on top of that.  She has lots of smaller misc bills.  We discussed & she''ll prob call Zion to pay the other $2500 twds their 5k IUA, so she can just start getting pre-pd ccs from Zion for all the other items.  She seems to have a handle on this, but will let us know if she needs anything further.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-25 12:49:03', '2023-09-25 13:42:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125520078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110468002', 'Emma Mallon', NULL, '9-25-2023:  Emma called.  She says the doc''s office called us last week & we told them to have her pay & then submit the receipts.  I''m thinking the differenciation of ''Prev Care'' appt never came into the conversation?  
     Emma called the doc''s office & we did a 3-way call.  Her appt is today & she''s wanting to resolve this prior to her going to her appt.  Lisa = the first person we tt.  She could not hear that this has nothing to do w/Emma''s healthsharing comp Zion & that this was on a sep component.  
     Eventually, she gave us Eliz (in the fin dept)''s #: 608-368-3319.  They kept getting stuck on "in vs out-of-ntwk" & said they do not bill any ins they are not in-ntwk with.  So, I went to the PHCS search tool & the doctor she''s seeing at the location listed in PHCS is there:  Anderson, Jane E, M.D.     Family Practice,Obstetrics and Gynecology     Telemedicine Services Available     849 Kellogg Ave     Janesville, WI 53546  [I e-mailed this doc''s info out of the PHCS Search Tool to both Eliz at the doc''s off & Emma]  But, then Eliz said they do not accept PHCS.  I let them know that the doc is listed in the PHCS network, so maybe that will correct the issue or the doc needs to remover her name, but Eliz isn''t sure so she''s going to have to research it & will not know today.
     When we got off the phone, Emma we resched her appt so as NOT to have to pay the $328(?) for the appt.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-25 12:42:34', '2023-09-25 13:20:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125538061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107285002', 'Rick Rife', NULL, '09.25.2023 Patty called to double check as to why her preventative appointments were not covered, or covered completely. She just got back from vacation, and saw that she has outstanding balances on her EOB''s.
After consulting with Cari via teams, I guided her to have the doctor''s office to resubmit the bills to Planstin.
Gyno visit, with Deborah Wilson, Patty shares she might be good to go there, as she has not heard from them, but will call them for good measures.
Annual physical, with Judith Mello, ON THE PHCS Network list, paid partially, so she will call the office and ask them to resubmit the bill. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-25 12:17:40', '2023-09-25 12:17:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125520058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105051010', 'Taher Sobhy', NULL, '9-20-2023:  Karen originally contacted me via Teams chat saying Dr Sohby''s daughter hadn''t been removed.  I was out the 21st and on the 22nd, she gave me the first name of Taher, so I was finally able to find the file, but it was late.  

9-25-2023:  I let Karen know both Jennifer & Kelly F confirmed the e-mail & sent the ''memb chg form'', but I do not see it in the Cognito forms.  I tried calling the #: (847) 867-2867 = a butcher shop, so I did not leave a message.  Sent Karen another Teams chat letting her know what I can see & asking if she knows his updated phone #.  I am sending another e-mail, but this time from my Outlook to see if he reads that one.  It shows he opened the previous e-mails, but apparently he''s not reading them since we''ve sent 2 previously & still have not received the form.  Did point out he must use the ''submit'' button at the bottom (the ''save'' button does NOT save the info to his account).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-25 12:09:58', '2023-09-25 18:23:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125538053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113416002', 'Conrad Buteau', NULL, '09.25.2023 Conrad called to learn the best way to proceed towards his physical annual check up. I walked him through the steps of:
- Making an appointment titling it Preventative Only
- Offering Planstin''s phone number for billing and pricing collaboration
When at the appointment maintain:
  - No RX''s
  - No other lab-work than the Std Lipid Panel
AND if the above are needed, then ask how their office would like to handle it, maybe separating it from the preventative appointment all together. 
Also, if other blood work is at play, to go ahead and call us back to help research pre-paid discounted lab-sites, since it will be out of pocket. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-25 11:43:07', '2023-09-25 11:48:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125538048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103737002', 'Matthew Hatcher', NULL, '09.25.2023 Matthew called wanting to know how to proceed in taking his daughter to an urgent care facility. I noticed they have not completed their welcome call, and so I asked them if what they need for their daughter is primary care or is it an emergency. They said it is primary care.
I then said, I''m asking because it does not look like you completed the welcome call, and educationally speaking, they explain about having the telehealth service. This service could save you money if it is only primary care that she needs. 
I was about to help him set up his account to speak to a doctor, then he asked if he can have his wife call, since he needs to head back to work. I said of course. I did not hear back, so I called the number on the profile, and no one answered. I did not leave a message b/c it did not sound like a line his wife has access to. I went ahead and sent him a registration link and called HIS number back and left HIM a a VM saying to accept the invitation, b/c it expires in 24 hours. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-25 11:41:54', '2023-09-25 12:30:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125520044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032454006', 'Georgannna Garrison', '"Cami" is what Georganna goes by...', '9-25-2023:  Cami (= Georganna) called.  She wants access to CirrusMD.  However, it gives an error message that they cannot find her info.  Went to submit a support ticket & I cannot find her anywhere in Admin123.  Have a call in to Patti for help.     - CA

Patti helped me find the file.  We accidentally had the CRM spelling of the first name inaccurate & it was keeping me from finding the Admin123 file.  I sent Dayra a req to update the CRM file.
     Once I got the proper spelling, CirrusMD conf she''s already registered.  Called Cami & got her to the point of tt a doc.  She''ll let us know if she needs further assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-25 11:29:46', '2023-09-25 11:51:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125538043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115142002', 'Howard Thomas', NULL, '09.25.2023 Howard called to learn the best way to proceed towards his physical annual check up and to regain the scheduling link for the welcome call. I sent him the missed welcome call template, and I walked him through:
- Making an appointment titling it Preventative Only
- Offering Planstin''s phone number for billing and pricing collaboration
When at the appointment maintain:
  - No RX''s
  - No other lab-work than the Std Lipid Panel
AND if the above are needed, then ask how their office would like to handle it, maybe separating it from the preventative appointment all together. 
Also, if other blood work is at play, to go ahead and call us back to help research pre-paid discounted lab-sites, since it will be out of pocket. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-25 11:04:44', '2023-09-25 11:04:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125509048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125284001', 'Marianne Ricciardi', NULL, 'Spoke to member will reschedule welcome call after start date of October 1, 2023. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-09-25 10:32:48', '2023-09-25 10:32:48');
