  ('zcrm_1579374000125538011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111619002', 'Lynne Diekmann', NULL, '09.25.2023 Lynne called regarding an incident she had at work, 2 weeks ago, hair salon.
They have an auto shut door, which shut vigorously and caused a glass jar to fall off and shatter behind her and cut her leg from the back. She attempted a clinic to get stitches, but no one would take her. She ended up at the ER for 10 stitches. Valley View hospital, stitches only, $1799 is the bill amount, deducted $316.05.
Lynne needs to open a medical need for this. I sent her the Zion medical need link that she opened while we were on the phone. She did experience the usual glitch of it not responding to her credentials to enter the portal. 
I explained to Lynne the following:
- you are responsible for the IUA
- you might be able to have your massage therapy shared, given it is need related
- talk to zion about the incident leading up to today, and the therapy sessions lined up this week.
Lynne also followed up about the need she submitted in June, and has not heard back from Zion. I guided her to open the conversation with THAT need first, and then get into getting help in opening the second need for the back of her leg.
I attempted to transfer her, as I promised her I would, but it got disconnected while I was transferring her. I tried calling her back, and no one answered. I can only assume that she hung up to call Zion herself. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-25 09:13:05', '2023-09-25 09:53:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125520016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024401', 'Merily Pompa', NULL, 'Member claims she cancelled this membership a few months ago, however there are no notes nor any Cancellation request in the database.  I spoke to her and she will fill out a cancellation request for me.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-25 09:07:12', '2023-09-26 08:41:27'),
