After the phone call, I attempted in finding her cancellation form in the Cognito platform, but it would not filter the name Pompa at the time.
The admin team was in a meeting, so I promised Merily a call back from the admin''s office to help clear the matter. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-25 08:51:51', '2023-09-25 08:54:38'),
