  ('zcrm_1579374000125445127', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119666002', 'Brad York', NULL, '09.22.2023 Brad called to understand why the pharmacy, Walgreen, that he went to deferred him from getting covid vaccine (100% covered) through Planstin/OptumRX.
