  ('zcrm_1579374000125473008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064604272', 'Hal Feldman', NULL, '9-22-2023:  Ember McDaniel from Planstin called.  Our member got the bill for his labwork (sounds like from his ''prev care'' appt & of course it pays for almost nothing.  He complained that he was never told this when he bought his memb.  I looked & can see a few things, but he reached out to us AFTER his ''prev care'' appt, which means there is almost nothing we can do to help.  I went over what we tell the members and she felt that was good 

