  ('zcrm_1579374000125445088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105906002', 'Derick Brooks', NULL, '09.22.2023 Melody called needing clarification on how to benefit from OptumRX for flu shots and Covid shots. She had gone to a pharmacy but they deferred her. We went into the conversation of what is covered under the ACS guidelines with Planstin, I copied and pasted the Summary of Care email and sent it to her via outlook.
