I was unsure about the "Handing over the ''card'' to the pharmacy to attain services", so I consulted with Cari again via teams. I added Cari to the call to reiterate the OptumRX service again, as I listened in.
It turns out, after Cari''s research on the OptumRX site/list, the pharmacy that Melody went to is a participating pharmacy and SHOULD HAVE complied with the services Melody was asking for. Cari suggested that she go back to that pharm and ask them to contact Planstin for coverage. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-22 10:56:49', '2023-09-22 11:02:31'),
