  ('zcrm_1579374000125374069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013590075', 'Jason Adams', NULL, '09.21.2023 Dawne called sharing that her doctor recommended that she get a coloscopy, and after she spoke with Zion, they confirmed with her that she indeed does have coverage for such preventative. HOWEVER, here in the CRM profile, it shows she is STILL CareZ Bridge, but should have been switched over back in Sept 2021 (According to notes from Wendy, their advisor).
Due to the notes, I proceeded to guide and coach Dawne on the steps to take towards using HCBB to find a facility for the colon., making the appointment, opening a medical need, what happens if polyps are found and the sites to search for the facility close to their area (HCBB and Healthgrades). I had to give Dawn the Concierge log in information, b/c her credentials were not working for us to peruse the site together. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-21 17:12:34', '2023-09-21 17:12:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125374056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165383', 'Tyler McMahon', NULL, '09.21.2023 Tyler called about two items:
An ongoing ovarian cyst issue, medical need that needed to stay open, but got closed due to breach of timeline.
A glitch in opening a new medical need.
I three way called with Zion, and got Callie, who was kind enough to get extra help for Tyler through the determination committee re: reopening the need that was closed. The determination committee was preoccupied, so they have his information for a good call back number. I asked him to call us back if he does not hear back from them in the next few days. She also proceeded with the process of opening a new medical need. Tyler was able to access the links and begin the process successfully, while all three of us were still on the phone.
At the end, Tyler shared he is more aware of the process of getting his bills shared and feels confident moving forward. I invited Tyler to give us a call anytime he has any questions or needs guidance. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-21 16:18:32', '2023-09-21 16:34:02'),
