  ('zcrm_1579374000125363003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122246010', 'Mikaila Cameron', NULL, '09.20.23:  Received an email from Sherry Myers (MAP). She got a call from Mikaila who complained she was told she could get up to 12 counseling sessions/yr. in CA.  I told Sherry we would call Mikaila, apologize for the error and explain that CA residents are only eligible for 3 sessions every 6 months, due to the Knox-Keene Act. Called Cari to ask if she would contact this member.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-09-21 10:21:57', '2023-09-21 10:21:57'),
