  ('zcrm_1579374000125348003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125254010', 'Francoise Bunnell', NULL, '9-20-23 Fran enrolled today in SECURE - HSA as am employee for her company. She''s paying for it but they also want to help fund an HSA. They expect possibly only one more person from the company to enroll, so they won''t have enough for a group with their own site. She is super excited to be moving to this model moving forward. She was very nice and is all set for SECURE  EF $905 / $1000 and there was not the $25 fee showing still either.  Oct. 1st, 2023 start date. She included her 20 year old son.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-09-20 21:37:30', '2023-09-20 21:37:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125296078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123624010', 'Heli Ananda', NULL, '9-20-2023:  RX Req for Heli:
     Heli sub req for two items.  The pharmacy she req''d: Bldr Med Cntr Pharmacy does not have a contract with the disc sites & is super exp w/the listed coupons (90-ds of both = $180.09).  I left 2 messages for her to make sure KS would work, disc the ds of the 2 rxs, but since I''m out tomorrow sent her the following 3 coupons:
     - Estradiol 0.025mg/24h, #16 twice weekly patches = $33.19 at KS on RXGo= 60ds
        Estradiol 0.025mg/24h, #24 twice weekly patches = $46.78 at KS on RXGo = 90ds
     - Progesterone 100mg, #90 caps = $21.86 at KS on Sngl Care (no sign up)     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-20 18:12:04', '2023-09-20 18:12:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125296073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108616001', 'Kristin Huntington', NULL, '9-20-2023:  ILM for Kristin last Friday &amp; tried her again today.  Since she never had her ''Welcome Call'' (where they make sure you have your cards, verify addresses, etc.) that would be good to have her sched as well.  Asked her to give us a ring.  Since she doesn''t have her cards, I''m concerned w/have inaccurate info  If we don''t here from her, hopefully, I can order them for Friday.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-20 15:40:07', '2023-09-20 15:40:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125296068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125339002', 'Suzanne Hughes', NULL, '9-20-2023:  Christine called because the amount drawn for Suzanne''s application today was &gt;1k.  We looked &amp; it appears 2 applications may have gone thru.  I let her know the only one that can help her is Patti &amp; she''s gone for the day.  She has a mess in for Patti, so will wait to tt her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-20 15:34:56', '2023-09-20 15:34:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125296057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118826002', 'Cathy Baker', NULL, '9-20-2023:  Cathy e-mailed asking about Covid & influenza immunizations:
     - Care+ = no prev care & that''s where immunizations are ususally covered.
     - Suggestions:
               - Covid shots/boosters w/no "ins'' = gvmt helped.  Still available?  
               - Call various pharmacies to see their pricing.  Gave examples of what I found at KS & Target.  Also mentioned I know Walgreen''s provides immunizations if that''s a convenient spot for her.
               - PCP''s often do a special to get people to come get their immunizations
               - Health Fairs
               - Special Events:  "Today only, get your Covid booster, or your influenza" for a special discounted price.     - CA

9-25-2023:  Got excited and called Cathy (I remember her because we''ve worked together so much).  Then realized her plan does not have prev & had to apologize.  Next yr she plans to upgrade & then the Covid shot & booster will be part of the immunizations covered.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-20 15:07:43', '2023-09-25 18:19:53'),
