  ('zcrm_1579374000125304001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064604285', 'TL Facha', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Member Assistant', 'Visit ID : 3278 Question : How do I change bank accounts on my payment', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-09-20 13:34:57', '2023-09-20 13:34:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125296016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093898002', 'Matthew Hoit', NULL, '9-20-2023: Selina called.  Her daughter has her annual back to school type physical tomorrow.  We walked thru:
     - ''P''lanstin = ''P''rev Care Only:  only time "ins" = Y, only time you present your "ins" ID card (Planstin card), in & out-of-network are fine but doc''s off must be willing to bill Planstin themselves.  She says they told her they would do that, but if it kicked back, it would be more expensive.  We went over making sure everything stays ''prev'' (example: don''t have a wart frozen off = treatment, can chg the entire billing codes & not get pd for).  Even though her daughter''s only 16, I did let her know the one thing they can prescribe for adults (16 yr old too?) is bcs.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-20 13:26:59', '2023-09-20 13:26:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125296008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122246010', 'Mikaila Cameron', NULL, '9-20-2023:  Mikaila called.
     - Mammography:  We looked at the PHCS ntwk, but went over she can use any provider(s) that are willing to bill Planstin directly for her screening (must be med coded ''prev screening'').  We talked about 2D vs 3D.  Becoming more common cannot find 2D, so she will call & tt Planstin if 3D is only available option & ask them to send her in writing (for her docs office) that the 3D is fine w/prev screening med code.
     - Bone Density:  The same facilities pulled up.  She had asked about a DexaScan & I let her know they do not pay for that because of the extra bells & whistles, but a std bone density screening is a part of her ''prev care'' thru Planstin.  She''ll see if she can maybe sched both at the same place/time.
     - MAP:  She had questions about counseling & was much further into the process than expected.  We went to the Mazz & Sull site & went over everything.  She actually already found a counselor in their ntwk, but she hadn''t rec''d the paperwork yet, so Mikaila will call their 1-800# to see if she can get that done.  She had question on the Impact Suites, so we disc that too.  Because she''s in CA, I told her to specifically ask Mazz & Sull what the pattern for the 6 annual visits looks like.  She knows that their hours are quite early since they are on the east coast.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-20 12:54:44', '2023-09-20 13:34:34'),
