  ('zcrm_1579374000125272024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102604002', 'Cynthia Shelden', NULL, '9-20-2023:  Hunter (= Collins) called in.  He wanted to learn how to sub a ''sharing req'' for his mtn bike accident in Aug.
     - Zion Memb Portal:  I walked him thru requesting an invite to create a Zion Memb Port & made sure he knows for him, this portal will just be to sub ''sharing req''.  [For chg of address, etc., plez call MPB. Health so we can take care of the chgs on all of his components.]  He knows what to upload & how.  That his 1k IUA is issue specific, so no matter what the bill is for, if it''s due to this issue, it''s on the same ''sharing req''.  He''ll let us know if he needs further assistance.     - CA

