  ('zcrm_1579374000125272003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046294019', 'Melany Matheson', NULL, '9-20-2023:  Melany called:
     - MPB.Health: Wanted to get into her MPB.Health Memb Portal thinking it would give her links to all of the components.  I got her into her portal & showed her the pymt history, info, and let her know for most things, our website will work better.  Took her to our website: MPB.Health & showed her the following due to her questions: 
     - MAP: They are considering counseling.  She seems familiar w/EAPs, and loved how much was available here.  Walked her thru the highlights, told her how to req ntwk counselors, warned her of their earlier hours since they are in the eastern time zone, told her the pattern for the counseling here in CO, etc.
     - CirrusMD: They''ve used CirrusMD before.  Eric just tested positive for COVID, so they thought they''d see if they can get an RX for the Paxlovid that''s supposed to be helpful.  I let her know it''s a great place to start.  They do have a limited scope, but it won''t cost anything to find out.  IF they prescribe something, she knows we can help look for best pricing in their area.
     - Prescriptions:  KS is their normal pharmacy.  She''ll get drug name, strength, qty prescribed, and directions for us if she needs pricing.  Since we were talking about the process today if CirrusMD writes for Eric, I did not go into the form - this will be an immed need.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-20 10:31:37', '2023-09-20 10:42:09'),
