  ('zcrm_1579374000125200011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125254010', 'Francoise Bunnell', NULL, '9-13-23 Fran is 51 and her husband is 58. She was inquiries for the small office she works in and for her own family. She''s had Anthem for 6-7 years but is excited to join MPB for her family right away. Her boss is totally open to offering this to the employees soon. Fran is paying $2000 a month right now and would love to cut that in half. They are in good health, except her husband takes cholesterol meds for 3 years and it''s well managed.  One of her their kids goes to a therapist.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-09-20 08:17:19', '2023-09-20 08:17:19'),
