  ('zcrm_1579374000125185048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122612001', 'Jennifer Speed', NULL, '09.19.2023 Dunwoody Obstetricians called on behalf of Skyla to confirm coverage. I confirmed the birthdays, and realized Sklya is a child, so I asked to speak to the parent. Jennifer was there, she confirmed the account, that she is her parent and gave permission to speak to the front desk lady. I confirmed their coverage with her, offered her Planstin''s number to call, spoke again with Jennifer for minor coaching on maneuvering her plan. Called Planstin to have a card sent to her email. 
After speaking to Planstin, Karen from there, said that Jennifer and her children are on Zion BUT NOT showing up under Planstin in their system. All in the while, they are on both Zion and Planstin on both of our member platforms: CRM and Admin123. 
I consulted with Pati via teams for immediate attention, since they are already at the doctor''s office. Karen from Planstin said she will contact billing on their end to see what happened. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-19 13:02:58', '2023-09-19 13:18:35'),
