  ('zcrm_1579374000125185028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113835002', 'Terry Draper', NULL, '09.19.2023 Shelly called to understand why the mamm facility''s billing department and receptionist scheduling section, is giving her the run around whether they accept PHCS or not. One party says they do, the second party says they don''t. She revisited the first party and they changed their story and said they don''t. She reminded them that she used them for another medical preventative purpose back in the spring, and they accepted PHCS/Planstin NO PROBLEM.
I helped relieve her by no longer needing to abide by the PHCS network, AO June, and coached her on how to RE-present herself with them under the RPB (I did not mention the acronyms, I did not want to confuse her and the Facility anymore than they already are confused).
