  ('zcrm_1579374000125133031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086963002', 'Timothy Viner', NULL, '9/18/23 - Danielle''s advisor, Karen Torsoe, called in on behalf of Danielle because they are experiencing issues with Zion and/or the Viner''s membership. I advised Karen that I would call Danielle to discuss this and to assist her with getting her member portal information. I called Danielle and left a vm for her to call me back. I will get on a call with Danielle and Zion to make sure that she receives her portal information. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-09-18 14:31:42', '2023-09-18 14:31:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125134016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060779385', 'Lorrie Marchant', NULL, '9-18-2023:  Lorrie called for several items:
     - Wanted to confirm her acct had been straightened out.  Admin123 has just her and the 2 kids showing.  I sent update req to Dayra to fix the CRM.
     - Lorrie didn''t realize she could save $16.50/mo in fees.  She sub a req to go to ACH to save that amt & got it in today so her Sept contribution would not have the fees.
     - Sophia is struggling to get her bc''s 1 mo at a time w/school.  Lorrie wondered if she could get 3mos at a time.  We ran several quotes.  3 mos locally was as cheap as about $18, but on CostPlusDrugs.com, she can have them delivered for at $21, so I walked her to their site & she thinks that will be a good option for Sophia.  
        I also showed her the RX quote sheet & let her know to put in her req when possible 5-7 days before she wants to pick up the RX.  If she''s on her way (like from the doc''s office), we''ll try to help right there & then.
     - MPB.Health Portal:  We got her into the portal so she can see all of her 2022 receipts so she can calculate her total expense for that year.  She seemed fine w/leaving her user name & pw as they are to make sure she can get in at a later date.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-18 14:05:00', '2023-09-18 14:13:05'),
