  ('zcrm_1579374000125103056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118196010', 'Robert Wadlington', NULL, '9-15-2023:  RX Quote Req:   Trintellix BRAND 10mg, #30 tabs  1d = #84 tabs for $283.59 + $9.95 shipping = $293.54 thru Reid (International Shopper)
     - Local Pricing: This is super expensive.  The cheapest on the disc sites was a bit over $430 for the 30 tabs.  He likes CVS, but I connected w/our int shopper to see if he could do anything.
     - Reid''s quote is amazing:  #84 tabs for $283.59 + $9.95 shipping = $293.54 **  tt Bob, he has plenty to get him thru the 4 wk delivery time.  Sent him an e-mail w/quote & Reid''s contact info & let him know it''s important to start the process now, because of the delay since it''s international.  
     Bob told me even the disc site pricing was less than he used to pay on his "ins".  But, he was super excited by Reid''s price.  I made sure he knows Reid only used FDA approved pharmacies.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-15 17:53:48', '2023-09-15 17:53:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125103042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103277001', 'Kim Robinson', NULL, '9-15-2023:  Kim hadn''t found the list of labs that Jennifer sent her yesterday.  With my help we found the e-mail.  Kim tried it on her phone and we got a little ways.  She''s going to try it on her laptop when she can &amp; will let us know next week if she needs help.  
     - Her husband is slowly getting better, so they are hopeful he will continue to improve.   He''s going into a rehab type cntr.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-15 17:01:19', '2023-09-15 17:01:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125103037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078409064', 'Maria Blaettner', NULL, '9-15-2023:  Over the last week, both Jennifer & I have worked w/Maria (= Toni).  
     - First, unbeknownst to me, Jennifer sent her the one center she saw under "mamm" in the PHCS ntwk.
     - A tckt came in that was then assigned to me & because I didn''t know Jennifer had already provided her w/info, I went to both PHCS & HCBB since ''screenings'' can now be in or out-of-ntwk.  That was still only two providers.
     - Toni became very snippy in a response saying she found all sorts of prov under ''radiology'' in PHCS.  Both Jennifer & I had stopped searching that due to members being upset that it was so misleading (they''d call & call the listed centers, have trouble catching them, then be angry because no one listed actually did mamm).  Jennifer & I looked at the radiology listings after Toni was so short w/us, and she''s correct.  The nice thing, these centers now tell you what they provide, which gets rid of so much of the issue we''d had before.  
     - Out of curiosity, Jennifer tried ''Breast Cancer Screenings'' as the desired search & it had a huge list of providers for her.  Jennifer sent over that new list and thanked Toni for helping research what is the current best search.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-15 15:53:10', '2023-09-15 15:53:10'),
