  ('zcrm_1579374000125103032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529382', 'Mitchell Magdovitz', NULL, '9-15-2023:  Mitchell called.  He wanted help with a "claim".  We did a quick educ on this isn''t "ins" ...  
     - Sedera:  He was able to get onto his Sedera portal and found the "New Need" link.  I reminded him that it is important, if they ask you to do the 2nd MD appt (which is more education than just a 2nd opinion), it''s imp to do that appt or they do not share in the ''need'' as fully.  I made sure he has Sedera''s ph # in case he needs help.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-15 13:57:28', '2023-09-15 13:57:28'),
