     - ILM for Kristin at: (480) 340-3411 Told her I just want to conf we have the accurate e-mail &amp; mailing address for when I order the new Planstin ID cards.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-15 13:14:52', '2023-09-15 13:14:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125103019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578137', 'Rachel Fisher Ingraham', NULL, '9-15-2023:  Rachel called w/all sorts of issues.  It''s very convoluted and confusing, so we are going to address ea situation separately.  All are re: his kids'' annual ''prev care'' appts:
     - 2023 = after June 1st date = now can utilize in & out-of-ntwk docs as long as they are willing to bill.  Planstin declined the bills saying it''s out-of-ntwk.  Rachel called on this particular scenario & Celeste told them they don''t show she can do either.  I tt Jennifer Thorin, she''s sending an e-mail to Melissa over at Planstin.  We are several mos into this new option & they are still not giving accurate info to our memb.
     - 2022:  The doc decided to no longer be a part of the PHCS Ntwk (even though he was a part last yr & has it showed they were part of the ntwk on their website) when they went to their appt last yr.  Rachel wanted the doc''s off to chg her to cash pay here and they told her since it had already been billed to "ins", even though it was denied, they cannot now go to ''cash-pay''.  She says they just denied it and did not do a ntwk discount.  I told her we will look into this once we get 2023 issue fixed.
     - 2021:  This year, the doc was in ntwk.  They billed for both children & one child''s visit was paid for, the other child''s was not.  She''s been trying to fix this ever since & completely getting the run around.  I let her know this could be challenging as far in the rears as it is, but we will try.  Maybe, if they claim one child was on the memb & the other wasn''t we can get Patti''s help to clarify?     - CA

Rachel & I will talk next week, once we have a reply from Melissa.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-15 12:25:12', '2023-09-15 13:09:15'),
