  ('zcrm_1579374000125103011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120495002', 'Carla McCarthy', 'Carla declined sub a "permission to discuss" for so her husb can talk to us on her behalf', '9-15-2023:  Carla''s husb called to get her an "ins" card.  She came on w/him since he''s not on the memb & we did a bunch of educ - NOTE: Care+ Memb:
