  ('zcrm_1579374000125082003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121930002', 'Scott Faulconer', NULL, 'Mailbox is full. Not able to leave message. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-09-15 08:28:47', '2023-09-15 08:28:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125080003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124582030', 'Mel Fonseca', 'Onboarding complete', 'AZ license was received and email sent out with Agent Credentials', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2023-09-15 08:23:46', '2023-09-15 08:24:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125079013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110554002', 'Dirk Anderson', NULL, 'Member submitted ticket re: issue below.  When his 7/20 pmt declined the billing date advanced to 9/20, so the 8/20 pmt never was pulled.  I left VM for member to let him know that I would be processing 8/20 pmt and setting the correct billing date.
Also member requested that previous 2 pmt methods be deleted which has been done.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-15 08:10:04', '2023-09-15 08:12:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125079003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117101001', 'Nicole Murad', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form.  I will process in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-15 07:45:37', '2023-09-15 07:45:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125022066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117101001', 'Nicole Murad', NULL, '9-14-2023:  Nicole called.  She was trying to figure out how to chg her pymt info on her memb portal.  I took her over to the ''MPB.Health'', ''Memb Updates'' link to use the chg pymt method.  She orig thought she''d chg to a cc, but we disc the 3% processing fee, and she decided to go w/a diff cking acct.  I made sure she knows to use the ''Submit'' button at the bottom (the ''save'' does not save it to her acct).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-14 17:25:58', '2023-09-14 17:25:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125022055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013590042', 'Donald J. Hinz Jr.', NULL, '9-14-2023:  Donald called.  He wanted to go over a lot of stuff:
     - MPB.Health Card = Ref card & we went over how to use the QR code on the back.
     - ''P''lanstin = ''P''rev Care only:  only time "ins" = Y, only time you show your ID card (Planstin), in & out-of-ntwk are options as long as doc''s off will bill for you because the do not reimb the memb, went over keeping everything ''prev'' care, etc.
     - Lab Work:  Std Lipid is only test we consistantly see Planstin''s ''prev care'' pay for.  He''s going to get a lab order so we can help look at the disc sites for him.
     - Derm:  Annual skin ck is NOT part of the ''prev care''.  IF has issue, can move to the healthshare component:
     - Zion:  Went over healthshare = illness, accident, catastrophic help.  No to "ins", no ID card, ''cash-pay'', ask for ''cash-pay'' disc, offer to pay up to 1k IUA if needed & can they bill you bal.  Retain pymt receipts & detailed inv. 6mos deadline from DOS to sub, so call us even if not at 1k & we''ll go over curr process.
     - CirrusMD:  No addl exp.  24/7/365 board cert phy.  Lmtd scope, but great place to start.
     - HCBB:  Donald''s eff date excludes him from being able to use HCBB.  I sent him a copy of the Int Med docs w/in 12 miles of Lafayette (he lives near Erie, so the 1 DO doc is of interest, even though it means going into Lgmt).  He will let us know if he wants further info from HCBB.
     - Concierge Line:  Great pre-appt advice.  Good traffic directors if nothing else.  Can help keep the rules of ea component sep.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-14 16:45:30', '2023-09-14 17:44:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125022035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110554002', 'Dirk Anderson', NULL, '9-14-2023:  Dirk called.  His Aug mo cont was never processed.  I sub tckt #: 3003 to notify the office:
     
     Billing Issues: Dirk Anderson     14 Sep 2023 02:25 PM     URGENT!
     Primary Memb:  Dirk Anderson     DOB:  4/10/1968
          
     His August draw was never pulled & he''d like to get this corrected so his Sept pymt will pull
     accurately.
          
     He''s also wondering: can we delete the old accounts we have on file?  He''d like that if so.  
     The correct current banking account is showing as active = ending in ...1725
         
     It''s my understanding you will notify him when you go to take the August pymt, correct?

     Then, he''s anticipating the Sept 20th draw as scheduled (assuming we are able to fix the
     situation).     

Used URGENT priority because there are < 7-days to the next billing cycle.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-14 15:29:07', '2023-09-14 15:32:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125057003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112728002', 'Way Walters', NULL, '9.14.23 - Way called in to let us know that his soon-to-be ex-wife took his son to the doctor for what he thinks is a pre-existing condition. Way was not made aware of this prior to the appointment by his ex-wife and he just wanted to let us know about the condition. I advised Way that I would put a note in his profile for our records and I will be sending Way a copy of this note via email. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-09-14 14:53:31', '2023-09-14 14:53:31');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000125025013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063253037', 'Bobbi Georgeton', NULL, '9--14-23  Talking with Kizzy from Cigna now about tkt # is TUO-34602. She''s looking at the issue now since it''s going to 432352 to Rod/MPB for no good reason. UPDATE - Kizzy discovered my contract with MPB showed as ended in March 2021. Barbara Georgeton enrolled in April of 2021. Therefore, it''s their responsibility to move Bobbi to under as an Individual Broker with my book of business. It will take 5-10 biz days to update the account. Jamal will make up up to 3 attempts to reach me with a resolution when it''s complete. Then I will have to fight for the commissions to be paid to me for the back pay since April 2021. MPB paid me 2 months of this, as far as I remember and no more.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-09-14 14:14:52', '2023-09-14 14:45:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125031006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125052002', 'Lauryn Sargent', NULL, '9-14-2023 Enrolled!', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2023-09-14 14:09:09', '2023-09-14 14:09:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125025008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063253037', 'Bobbi Georgeton', NULL, '9-14-23 Calling to verify she can''t make changes until Nov. 1st for Jan. 1st start date. She definitely needs a back surgery and wants to make sure her doctors are in network, etc. She''ll call me Nov. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-09-14 14:07:12', '2023-09-14 14:07:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125018045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086960002', 'Thomas Worley', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form I will update in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-14 13:48:20', '2023-09-14 13:48:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125018037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001637159', 'Gretchen Wegner', 'Aging into 50 age band eff 10/23', '1st notice sent to Member &amp; Advisor - 8/23 (O)
2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor 9/14 (O) price updated', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-14 13:32:44', '2023-09-14 13:32:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125034001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082090', 'Susan McCausland', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 3271 Question : I had an irregular pap smear last October so they asked me to come back this September to check on things.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-09-14 12:31:06', '2023-09-14 12:31:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125018013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125016003', 'Nicole Stinson', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $2500 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-14 12:18:29', '2023-09-14 12:18:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125022021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109083002', 'Karin McGrath', NULL, '9-14-2023:  Kari (= Karin) called (Patrick was in the background):
     - Planstin = Prev care only.  She''s going to try calling the office re: Patrick''s annual to see if they can get it billed.  He presented as ''cash-pay'', but also gave them his Planstin card.  Now they are being billed.  This is retroactive so I did the three sheets of paper example for the various components, how to present w/ea, & the basic rules.  He may have crossed into non-preventative care, so Kari is going to have a gal at her doc''s office call so I can explain how this new healthcare works.*
        I took her to Healthcare.gov site & we looked over what they show as covered.  She had more questions on specific items.  I let her know we don''t make these decisions or have access to what she was asking.  Let her know Planstin might better be able to answer some of the questions she had.  Made sure she has their phone for those super specific details.
     - Dermatology:  Maint skin ck = Pre-cancerous, skin cells, but nothing they decided to worry about right now.  Total was only  $148.  We went over annual skin cks are not a part of the ACA MEC cov, but if it becomes a medical issue (cancerous removal, etc.) it can move into their healthsharing component.  
     - Zion = Healthsharing: Went over how to present, deadlines, etc.
     - CirrusMD: They''ve used & she had the best experience.  Very pleased w/this component.
     - RX:  Went over how to use the form.  What to do if you are just leaving the doc''s office, wrong pharmacy, etc.
     - Concierge Line:  They are very coachable, however, they''ve been going online & have been confusing the diff component instructions.  I encouraged Kari to call and use us for ''what-if'' & general traffic direction.     - CA

* Front desk person from the clinic called: Maureen.  She wants help on how to bill.  tt Maureen at AALFA FMLY CLIN [Kari told me this gal would be calling for inst].  Maureen seems willing to go above & beyond by cking w/Planstin to see which CPT codes are cov as prev.  She''s going to tt Planstin (I recommended tt the ''claims'' dept).  I let her know, worst case scenario, they will lose the ''cash-pay'' discount, but Plasntin will kick things back w/a ntwk discounted price.  Prob not quite as good, but since we are doing this in the rears, it may be the best we can do.  Maureen was very nice, but this is truly above & beyond.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-14 12:13:02', '2023-09-15 17:07:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125022013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113141002', 'Scott Readence', NULL, '9-14-2023:  Eliz called.  Her husband Scott was working in the yard & a large branch hit him in the head.  She wondered how that would be handled.  I told her that it depends on whether it is considered vision or medical, then walked thru the following options:
     - Zion: Healthshare comp = present as no "ins", no "ID Card", ''cash-pay'', (forgot to mention asking for a discount - her kids were having a hard time and we got distracted), to make sure they save pymt receipts & detailed inv.  6mos deadline for sub a ''sharing req'':  we decided that unless they get close to the 1k IUA sooner, she will connect around the 4 mo mark if it looks like this will be ongoing.  She knows it may or may not qualify as a sharing event, but can''t hurt to try since it was a physical accident that started the issue.
     -      - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-14 12:03:38', '2023-09-15 17:08:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125029001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121506002', 'Brian Tollefson', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Member Assistant', 'Visit ID : 3270 Question : I am having knee pain. In the past I have gone to Mayo Clinic for a cortizone shot. I have an appointment scheduled today but they are telling me since I am a cash patient I need to $5,000 deposit for x-ray and the shots. Need help or other suggestion', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-09-14 11:53:36', '2023-09-14 11:53:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125028008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105051010', 'Taher Sobhy', NULL, 'Taher reached out to me via SalesIQ asking to send the link to the form to remove a family member. He confirmed his email address and I sent him the Member Change Form link. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-09-14 11:46:31', '2023-09-14 11:46:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125025003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165383', 'Tyler McMahon', NULL, '9-14-23 Tyler called to determine if it makes sense to switch to SECURE and pay an additional $384 a year for more wellness benefits. I''m not sure it''s worth it since they get the $175 Dr. visit per member, per year no matter what the visit is for. They currently each have a Dr. visit at $255 per person to get reimbursed. There were some labs above that to total $327 for Shailee. But, running the labs through ins. is usually at elevated rates, so it might not help with the cost. He has to do blood tests for his thyroid which won''t be included in wellness and she has blood tests for another issue with her ovaries. I suggested he calls the Concierge Team to price out the labs that they want. Then they can decide if it''s best to wait to do the tests in Nepal or do them here. In Nepal he can get a full panel for under $100.  He will call the Concierge next.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-09-14 11:28:00', '2023-09-14 11:28:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125022003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123624010', 'Heli Ananda', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-09-14 11:01:58', '2023-09-14 11:01:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000125018003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079844010', 'Jose Licon', NULL, 'Belinda called in from Axxis Solutions and let me know that this member would like to cancel.  I will send him out the cancellation.  I asked how many members she had in her group and she told me 2.  I will let Karina know about this re; minimum 3 people.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-14 10:32:15', '2023-09-14 10:32:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124989018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123582002', 'Michele White', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-09-14 09:59:59', '2023-09-14 09:59:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124987028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084812002', 'Hermilo Cavazos', NULL, '9/14/23 - Hermilo called because his child''s pediatrician recommended they see a specialist. I advised that anything outside of prev care = cash paying patient and to keep their detailed bills and receipts. Hermilo will call back if they need further assistance. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-09-14 09:52:08', '2023-09-14 09:52:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124999008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125052002', 'Lauryn Sargent', NULL, '9-14-2023 She is ready to go.  Is leaving for Italy on 10-2, 
