  ('zcrm_1579374000124983017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124981038', 'Anthony Welti', 'Emailed Getting Started Letter', 'I have exhausted my emails for the day, so I sent out in Outlook the Getting Started Letter.  I included Charles Froman on the email as well since he will be the upline.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2023-09-14 08:33:43', '2023-09-14 08:33:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124987013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058967087', 'Busia Stern', NULL, '9/14/23 - Busia called in because she now has an insurance plan through her husband''s employer and wanted to cancel her plan. I sent her the link via email and let her know that she has benefits for the rest of September but will not have any as of 10/1/23. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-09-14 08:26:14', '2023-09-14 08:26:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124979013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054641074', 'Kerek Swanson', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-14 08:22:52', '2023-09-14 08:22:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124979008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054641074', 'Kerek Swanson', 'Previous Zion enrollment', '11/1/2021 - 1/31/2022', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-14 08:22:29', '2023-09-14 08:22:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124987003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109278001', 'Carrie Conrad', NULL, '9/14/23 - Carrie called to access her Zion member portal to start a new need request. I had to transfer Carrie to Zion to receive her portal info and let her know to give me a call if she needs assistance once she has her portal set up. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-09-14 08:15:55', '2023-09-14 08:15:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124983008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124981011', 'Erik Cox', 'Interested in becoming an Advisor', 'Erik sent in an Advisor Agreement without going through the on-boarding process. The Onboarding Letter was sent for him to complete the training.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2023-09-14 08:12:07', '2023-09-14 08:13:29'),
