  ('zcrm_1579374000124953008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124947019', 'Catherine Colle', NULL, 'Member &amp; Child $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-14 07:32:24', '2023-09-14 07:32:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124953003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124947012', 'Jared Wallen', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-14 07:25:29', '2023-09-14 07:25:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124937008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054641074', 'Kerek Swanson', NULL, '9-13-23- Kerek calling me back in 30 minutes to re-enroll in CARE+. He''s not a fan of Western Medicine and hasn''t had any health issues in the last 24 months. So, he''s ready to roll once he gets home to Longmont.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-09-13 16:18:14', '2023-09-13 16:18:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124937003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054641074', 'Kerek Swanson', NULL, '9-13-23 Left vm for Kerek. He left his job and wants to re-enroll with us. He was happy with MPB.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-09-13 16:10:25', '2023-09-13 16:10:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124936003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101897001', 'Daniel Kane', NULL, '9-13-2023:  Daniel called.  His hip is bothering him so he thought he''d like to start having it ck''d out.  We talked & it sounds like this is a pre-x item, so he doesn''t think waiting until he''s past his 1st year waiting period & his 2nd yr of memb = 11/1/2023 will be too hard since we are not far out from that date.
     - HCBB:  We walked thru using this tool so he can find a high quality, fair priced doc.  Prices in his area seem high, so that may be challenging, but he seems to understand the goal is "green, green".  There''s a huge range in pricing in this area.
     -      - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-13 16:09:27', '2023-09-15 17:08:49'),
