  ('zcrm_1579374000124914028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107280002', 'Bibi Frederick', NULL, '9-13-2023:  Bibi called.  She was calling to find out why her mamm & abdominal scan were not pd.  It sounds like both were sent through her Planstin (she thinks).  I couldn''t determine if they went thru Planstin or not.  So, we set up the following plan of action:
