  ('zcrm_1579374000124778043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109184005', 'Merryl Rothaus', NULL, '9-11-23 Talked with Merryl and she''ll at least try to call Cigna to find out if they will cover her surgery or why they won''t. The $6400 was the cash price, not the ins. price. So, she can''t really get it cheaper at that facility. She really likes the place she chose and they are reputable. Not willing to switch places. Neither of us think waiting will really help either since costs just keep rising.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-09-11 15:54:54', '2023-09-11 15:54:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124778018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109662015', 'Henry Miller', NULL, '9-11-23 Henry called bc everything is going up in price in the world and he can''t afford it right now. I suggested he contact me in Nov. to see if they will qualify for a subsidy or not. His best est of income for 2023 is $60K and doesn''t know for 2024 yet.  He will cancel for Oct. 2023.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-09-11 15:21:04', '2023-09-11 15:21:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124778013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129625021', 'Jacqueline Thill', NULL, '9-11-23 Craig is retiring for Jan. 1st.  They pay nothing now through his current company for Anthem BC/BS. They live in Boulder area and his wife wants to be able to use Boulder Community and Avista Hostpital to keep her drs. She is healthy. He had a heart event in April of 2021 (I think) or 2022. He has a stint put in to clear out his artery. He''s now on blood thinner for life. They will be paying $1700 a month on Cobra. His wife could also choose a plan through PARA for pre-retirees.  I explained everything to him up until how to use the membership with the ER example. He was going to call me back but seems to have forgotten. He also wants me to send him the info which I will. I suggested he remains on Cobra and moves his wife to CARE+. She''s not working so she won''t qualify for SECURE. However, I didn''t ask about other forms of income, which I need to. His current ins has a high ded of $4K and he''s managed to save $35K in his HSA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-09-11 15:13:03', '2023-12-01 15:30:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124786029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122964002', 'Michael Mendoza', 'Welcome Call', 'Completed by JAT on 9/11/23', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-09-11 14:49:38', '2023-09-11 14:49:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124767048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005671043', 'Susan Chapman', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will cancel &amp; Refund 9/23 HES pmt', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-11 14:12:39', '2023-09-11 14:12:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124764019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070067085', 'Kayla Boettcher', NULL, '9-11-2023:  Kayla called.  She has a rash she feels like she needs to see a doc.
     - Zion: We disc she''s resp for the $2500 IUA (x3 issues, then how it works 4th & behond in a 12 mo rolling period).  No ntwk, but she likes the thought of using HCBB to find a highest quality, fair priced docs.  Hasn''t set up an HSA yet.  We went over how to present:  "ins" = N, "ins card" = N, ''cash-pay'' & ask about ''cash-pay'' disc, save your pymt rec & det inv.  6mos deadline to sub expense twds ''sharing req'' & discussed how that might look.  Let her know if we get to the $2500, it''s not only reimb, but w/approval & written estimates, can have pre-pd cc to pay for appts if enough time to get the exp approved before the appt.
     - Planstin, ''prev care'':  One of their challenges has been the ntwk.  They travel a lot & have a hard time finding an in ntwk doc who will do the ''prev care'' appt in the first visit, even if they are accepting new pts.  I let her know the plan has opened to any prov that is willing to bill for you (in or outside of the ntwk).  We disc the shortage of PCP right now & how that may be far worse with time.
     - CirrusMD:  Free to see if they can help.  Limited scope, but worth a try.
     - Prescriptions:  If end up w/RX for the rash or something else, concierge can look for best price in that area.  Even if called into one pharmacy, can show her how to trans to another for pricing.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-11 13:56:39', '2023-09-11 14:42:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124767040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089437001', 'Tracey Rominger', NULL, 'Member submitted change request to change her IUA to $1000 frm $2500.  I will process.  Notified via outlook', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-11 13:47:27', '2023-09-11 13:56:17'),
