  ('zcrm_1579374000124763018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109660001', 'Laura Hunt', NULL, '09.11.2023 Laura called for STILL not being billed properly. I sought out Pati directly via teams, and ended up hanging up with Laura, in process of giving Pati Laura''s name and number and situation, to call her back. Serendipitously, Pati was free 30 seconds later. and said she will give her a call. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-11 12:42:59', '2023-09-11 12:42:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124778008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109662015', 'Henry Miller', NULL, '9-11-23  Left vm for Henry. He wants to cancel for a few months or a year according to vm. Not sure what''s going on. He probably can''t afford it anymore. He already has the lowest contribution option other than $5K IUA which doesn''t make sense.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-09-11 12:42:38', '2023-09-11 12:42:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124778003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109184005', 'Merryl Rothaus', NULL, '9-11-23 Merryl called and left long vm bc she needs an eye surgery and it''s scheduled for Oct. 9th. Cigna won''t cover it even though she qualifies for it! It''s going to cost $6400. She trying to figure out what to do. We don''t know the plans for 2024 yet but they probably aren''t going to be better. I''m not sure if the $6400 is the ins price or cash price. I will find out when we connect. We are playing phone tag for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-09-11 12:38:08', '2023-09-11 12:38:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124767022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109660001', 'Laura Hunt', NULL, 'I billed this member the $325 that she hasn''t been being billed for 7/23, 8/23 &amp; 9/23. I just billed for 9/23 and set up billing date correctly.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-11 12:34:11', '2023-09-11 12:34:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124763013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120895010', 'Lawrence Srubas', NULL, '09.11.2023Lawence reached us today through Planstin, and unfortunately already frustrated due to the run around he received with who he was referred to.
