  ('zcrm_1579374000124764011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091055002', 'Steven Meath', NULL, '9-11-2023:  Steven & Dawn both have prescriptions & need to have lab test done for their renewal.  Steven really does NOT understand this plan or how to use it.  He was easily confused when we were discussing lab orders, locations, etc.  This plan may not be a good fit.  It took 20-minutes to explain how to get a lab order, who it would come from, etc.
