  ('zcrm_1579374000124764003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094954002', 'Ted Benedict', NULL, '9-11-2023:  Ted called back.  I went to trans him to Nahla & she was on the phone.  Since I knew the situation, I went ahead and took care of assisting him.
