     - Chg of address:  They''ve moved to WY.  I walked him to the chg of address form.  He''ll get it submitted.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-11 11:27:11', '2023-09-11 11:36:33'),
