  ('zcrm_1579374000124739023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094954002', 'Ted Benedict', NULL, '09.11.2023 I received a message via teams that we still need to address the process Ted was trying to attempt in getting his billes shared with Zion last week.
Zion''s phones were down for quite a bit of time, and no one was able to get through. As I was waiting to be able to do that promised three with with Ted and Zion, the day became packed with numerous long and needy calls. I really wanted to do a three way to be sure that Ted was able to connect with Zion, but I did not get a chance to call back right that day.
I called Ted back today and left him a voice message saying who I am, where I am calling from, our phone number to call back on, and the reason for the follow up call. Looking forward for Ted''s return call to start his sharing process. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-11 10:40:19', '2023-09-11 10:43:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124755003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121749002', 'Stuart Skok', NULL, '9-11-2023:  Stuart called.  
     - Appendix:  She''s well enough now she was ready to learn how to sub her ''sharing req''.  We walked thru the curr process and she''s all set.  She''s already pd the 1k IUA, so I told her what to expect as far as the pre-pd ccs.  
