  ('zcrm_1579374000124739018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114725002', 'Louis Young', NULL, '09.11.2023 Julie wanted to learn how to get covered for the $260 she spent for an ear infection. I explained how ZIon''s healthsharing works, and how the IUA needs to be fulfilled prior to a share.
