  ('zcrm_1579374000124717029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108616009', 'Kevin Kakos', NULL, '9-8-2023:  Patti let me know she was able to get Kevin''s wife set w/eff date of 9/1/2023.  That should show up on the other company''s records after the tape goes over tonight (so Mon).  She said we were not able to do the exception for the 8/1/2023 eff date (which Kevin understood), but since we made the mistake, we won''t go back & charge them the extra money for her Sept benefits.  The Sept 20th draw will have the new mo contribution of $755 to cover Oct.  Kevin was great when we talked and very appreciative.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-08 12:44:00', '2023-09-08 12:44:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124691031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108616009', 'Kevin Kakos', 'New membership eff 9/1/23', 'Member &amp; Family $2500 Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-08 12:13:07', '2023-09-08 12:13:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124691026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108616009', 'Kevin Kakos', NULL, 'This member requested addition of his spouse late in the month so it got pushed to a 9/1 start.  It got missed in the Cognito, so I received an exception to add spouse eff 9/1.  I will set up new pricing to start on 10/1 due to our mistake.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-08 12:12:11', '2023-09-08 12:12:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124717024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119704002', 'Jonmi Brunette', NULL, '9-8-2023:  Richard & Jonmi called.  He went to Zion like Nahla instructed, but it hadn''t gone as expected.  We walked thru in detail how to handle:
     - $175 Off Visit (& pap if billed with it) to the total of $175.  Went over its limitations in detail.  That they can submit the detailed inv & pymt receipt after the appt, but that it must break down the exp of the "office visit" & if having a ''pap'', that must also be on the same bill = reimb of up to $175, 1x per 12 month rolling period.  (ie: I sugg going the 13th month to make sure enough time has elapsed.)
     - Lab work:  He wanted to use a LabCorp in AZ & wanted to try to do it on his own.  I gave him 3 sites to compare.  AZ is a bit tougher so these are what I sugg after seeing the lab he wanted on their site (pricing for a std lipid panel was a bit surprising on the sites too), he''ll call if he needs further asst: walkinlab.com, healthlabs.com, laboratoryassist.com.  The std lipid was coming in between $14 & $32.40 - I haven''t seen such a large diff & it was actually not on the site that is usually cheapest.
     -     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-08 12:05:47', '2023-09-08 16:44:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124691018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610563', 'Peter Jurica', NULL, 'Member now has Sedera Select DPC eff 10/1/23.  I cannot "change" members product because he lives in TX which is a "Do Not Sell" State.  Per Sedera  the workaround is I will update only the prices and not change the product.  Member has DPC Member Only $1000 IUA.  Pricing update to 50-59 Age Band', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-08 12:03:08', '2023-09-08 12:06:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124722008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129625021', 'Jacqueline Thill', NULL, '9-8-23 Ben DiSalle with The Financial Retirement Group (referred by Melinda Niemczyk)  just sent his first client to me who is wanting to retire soon and needs some viable health insurance or MCS. He still has a few years before he reaches 65 and will have the option of Cobra for 18 months. But, prefers options to get him to 65.   I called and left him a vm and told him Ben asked me to call him. Ben wants me to follow up with him to let him know if  I was able to help Craig. Waiting for Craig''s return call now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-09-08 11:41:30', '2023-09-08 11:41:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124722003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123699044', 'Ben DiSalle', NULL, '9-8-23 Ben just send his first client me who is wanting to retire soon and needs some viable health insurance or MCS. He still has a few years before he reaches 65 and will have the option of Cobra for 18 months. But, prefers options to get him to 65. Ben has one more client to send me but forgot who it was at the moment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-09-08 11:37:20', '2023-09-08 11:37:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124720016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120894012', 'Gary Clayton', NULL, '09.08.2023 An official called from Lynda''s university to confirm she has coverage. I was not able to discuss details, of course, so I answered her questions vaguely. Offering reassurance that Lynda is indeed covered and is enveloped with a plethora of tools to help her get by her daily activities no matter the weight, and is covered preventatively and catastrophe wise. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-08 11:31:13', '2023-09-08 11:31:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124717013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098361002', 'Don Maycock', NULL, '9/8/2023:  I hadn''t heard from Shirley to walk her thru how to get her mamm, so I called & tt both her & Don.  
     - Planstin: only time "ins" = yes, only time you will present an ID card = your Planstin card, in & out-of-ntwk ok as long as all prov (images & reading) will bill Planstin directely.  
        They found their old Planstin pdf card in their e-mail, however, Shirley would like hard copies.  tt William at Planstin and confirmed he has their curr add to send them to = 307 N Independence Hwy, Inverness, FL  34453.  I let Don & Shirley know printing & sending can take 2-4 weeks for delivery.  William is new and isn''t sure if the card shows just the primary or both names, but he sent a hard copy for each of them.
     - Shirley is quite frustrated w/this plan and how difficult it is to use.  They stay w/it for the HSA, but when Don ages into Medicare in March 2024 they will both prob let this plan go.  I went over how it works & if Shirley would like to continue, I can help her apply, carrying her longevity with her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-08 11:27:09', '2023-09-08 11:37:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124677130', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118543002', 'Kelcey Nichols', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-09-08 11:24:11', '2023-09-08 11:24:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124717008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081509011', 'Tammy Goen', NULL, '9-8-2023:  Tammy called again re: mammogram
     - She called Planstin:  they told her they would pay for the 3D mamm as long as it is billed as a screening.  She''s going to call them back & ask that they send the conf of that in an e-mail (so she can show the doc''s off).  Plus, then if it''s denied she has proof she was told they would pay. 
        She''s frustrated because no one in her area offers the 2D - I told her that''s super unusual.  That OR is prob just ahead of the curve.
     - She called PHCS: she''s upset that even the location she went last year is not on the list.  "Who am I supposed to use?"  I re-educated her again regarding that the PHCS ntwk is an option, however no longer req''d.  Now she just needs any provider in the srvc (mamm = imaging cntr & people that read the images) to bill Planstin direct as they do not reimb.
     - Plan of action:
               - Call Planstin to get e-mail showing they say they will pay for the 3D mamm if billed as a screening.
               - Sched w/cntr that will bill for her, conf they will use the ''prev screening'' med coding.
     Tammy will call if she needs further assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-08 11:10:27', '2023-09-08 11:10:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124720008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119704002', 'Jonmi Brunette', 'RCV''D Permission To Discuss MPB Plan w/ Richard Brunette 9.8.2023', '09.08.2023 Richard and Jonmi called to get clarification on using the coverage towards Jonmi''s physical annual, and if the waiting period is over.
I consulted with Jen and Cari via teams, and they confirmed, if there is a waiting period it would be 6 months, and the annual physical preventative has not waiting period and receives up to $175 towards the appointment only. I transferred Richard and Jonmi to speak to Zion to attain that prepaid card, receive their member ID card and give Richard permission to speak on Jonmi''s behalf when needed, due to a language barrier with Jonmi. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-08 11:00:36', '2023-09-08 11:03:03'),
