  ('zcrm_1579374000124691003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004533005', 'Brian Mirsky', 'Outcome of Issue below', 'This issue was caused by a file transfer issue that we are having with A123.  Planstin is not getting any changes that are sent over.  They did not have new plan that I entered after we identified coverage level mistake on 6/30.  Member has told me that he would like to remove his children from his membership since one has other coverage and the other will now be covered under his college Insurance.  Since Planstin has not yet received this I will change this plan now and when file issue gets resolved he will have the correct plan', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-08 08:15:56', '2023-09-08 08:15:56'),
