  ('zcrm_1579374000124662052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081509011', 'Tammy Goen', NULL, '9-7-2023:  Tammy called back re: mammogram
     - Tammy called all around in her area, Bend OR, to find an office near her that would bill her ''prev care'' mamm to Plasntin (she had trouble last yr because she had to drive so far to find a PHCS doc) - this yr, she says no one does std 2D mamm anymore.  They all told her "because insurance covers 3D".  I told her the only ones that could tell her if this benefit now includes 3D is Planstin.  I made sure she has their ph # & hours and trans her to them direct.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-07 17:46:24', '2023-09-07 17:46:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124662047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108616009', 'Kevin Kakos', NULL, '9-7-2023:  Kevin called.  He was looking at his acct &amp; does not see that his req to add his wife is showing.  I ck''d &amp; can see the Cognito req.  I sent a chat to Patti to look at as I''m not seeing anything in the notes, etc.  She may be looking into the time exception?     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-07 16:45:46', '2023-09-07 16:45:46'),
