  ('zcrm_1579374000124663021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115996020', 'Cord Dorcey', NULL, '09.07.2023 Cord called from the ER room for his wife. At the time of the call with Cord, she was in the intake room. Cord wanted to know how to handle coverage, and I guided him to only worry about presenting as a cash-pay patient, try to fulfill the $1000, and to contact us back once Jessica is back home and settled, so we can talk "medical need" for Zion to share. I told hi if the hospital questions him, to just reiterate that he has coverage through an organization called Zion, and to present as cash-pay. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-07 16:32:04', '2023-09-07 16:32:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124662036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089065002', 'Susan Fontana', NULL, '9-7-2023:  It sounds like there''s been a tape transfer issue.  We are creating a ticket for multiple members having issues.  Patti has already tt Susan.  We are adding her to the list so there''s a record.  We anticipate that ticket going in tomorrow.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-07 16:01:43', '2023-09-07 16:01:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124663016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023370023', 'Heather Seasonwein', NULL, '09.07.2023 Heather called to remove both of her sons from the plan. I guided her to the MPB change form on the Member Portal and Updates. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-07 15:29:58', '2023-09-07 15:29:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124662025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993160', 'Karen Peirson', NULL, '9-7-2023:  Karen called.  She got orders for a diagnostic colonoscopy and an endoscopy.  She wasn''t sure how to proceed:
     - Single issue?  Endocrinologist (has been paying herself) for the last few years & they are planning to remove her thyroid.  But in testing, instead sent her to the hemotologist (high blood platelets) who now wants the diagnostic colonoscopy & endoscopy. 
     - Sedera:  No "ins", no ID card, ''cash-pay'', ask for ''cash-pay'' disc.  She knows she''s resp for $1500 IUA/issue.  She also knows it may take answers from the hematologist to know if this is a single issue or 2 separate issues.  She''ll get guidance from Sedera.  I made sure Karen has Sedera''s ph # & trans her to them.  They sb able to help her start a ''med need'' and guide her thru these events.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-07 14:33:10', '2023-09-07 14:35:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124630085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124631307', 'Tiffany Crouse', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-07 13:35:41', '2023-09-07 13:35:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124662011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111977009', 'Roseann Hummel', NULL, '9-7-2023:  Roseann called.  Her husb got a job w/employer provided health ins.  Her advisor is no longer w/the comp and w/emp prov ins, I went ahead and helped her find the cancellation form.  I sugg getting the form signed &amp; in by the 15th to give a little leeway.  She''s liked our option during the time they needed it, so she''ll keep it in mind should they get into a situation again where they have no provided health ins.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-07 13:30:40', '2023-09-07 13:46:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124630080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124631280', 'Kasey Summerer', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-07 13:27:03', '2023-09-07 13:27:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124673028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089144002', 'Sarita Yeldandi', NULL, '9-7-23 Sarita got a new job with benes starting Oct. 1st. I helped her complete the cancellation form. She asked about the HMA and will keep it for now. She''s trying to understand the math behind it which I can''t exactly tell her other than it''s compounding over time until it reaches the max level. It will compound more significantly as it approaches the max level. She joined the HMA 10000 and pays $155 a month since she added family members to the membership. All set for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-09-07 13:25:09', '2023-09-07 13:25:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124662006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647053', 'Lester Tang', NULL, '9-7-2023:  Lester & Amy called.  Amy got hurt & she wanted to know about physical therapy.  They asked if they could just use CirrusMD to get a referral for PT & how that would work:
     - Zion:  I told them how to present when have an accident, illness, or catastrophic issue = no "ins", no ID card to present, ''cash-pay'' & ask if they offer a ''cash-pay disc, keep all receipts & need a detailed inv.  6mos deadline to sub twds the ''sharing req'' & IUA, but everything twds this injury = same 5k IUA (issue spec).  Went over same issue (even if > a yr.  IUA does not just renew annually), unless 12mos or > = they close the req & you have to start again.
        PT, chiro, etc, req pre-approval.  Amy will get a ''treatment plan'' for the physical therapist to submit too.
        Once she''s ready, they will call the concierge for the up-to-date process for sub a ''sharing req''.  I let them know it''s been going thru some adj, so that way they''ll get the most current/accurate instructions when they are ready.
     - CirrusMD:  Amy thinks she''s used the srvc before & knows they have 2 accts, ea w/a unique e-mail addres.  She''ll let us know if she needs help.
     - They appreciated the concierge service & said we''ll prob hear from them far more often, because the call was super helpful.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-07 13:23:26', '2023-09-07 14:37:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124655041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123577002', 'Trevor Franklin', 'Welcome Call', 'Completed 9/7/23 by JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-09-07 13:13:28', '2023-09-07 13:13:28'),
