  ('zcrm_1579374000124591057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121237002', 'Nelson Vasconcellos', 'Nelson = "Ryan"', '9-6-2023:  Ryan called.  He thinks he tore his Achillies tendon playing basketball just now.  I helped him get onto CirrusMD for guidance & made sure he knows their potential limitations.  IF he needs to see someone (ie: orthopedic surgeon, PCP, etc. he will call tomorrow for help finding someone near him).  We went over how to present if he needs to go to the Urg Care or ER (it''s already past 6pm in TN, so he may not have any option but the ER if they feel he needs to go tonight).  & we went over our hours in case they prescribe something.  He will call us tomorrow or later (we disc the 6 mos deadline from the DOS for expenses to be included in the ''sharing req'').     - CA

Ryan called back.  CirrusMD sugg going ahead & starting w/an orthopedic surg because it does sound like he''s headed that direction.  I sent him a list from HCBB w/docs w/in 13 miles of his zip & it was quite extensive.  The third doc, Dr Brian Dierckman has a 4.8 pt review rating, so he''s going to start there.  He will call tomorrow if he has further questions.  He''s worried he won''t be able to get in & see an ortho doc tomorrow, so he asked what happens if he goes to an Urg Care then.  I told him he can absolutely do that if he can''t get in w/one of the ortho spec, just keep your detailed invoice for the visit & make sure to keep your pymt receipt.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-06 17:10:32', '2023-09-06 17:56:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124591052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091055002', 'Steven Meath', NULL, '9-6-2023:  Dawn''s # was listed on our call log during a time when more calls came in than we could take at that time.  I called her back &amp; she said someone told her they would help her with a prescription she needs to get.  Neither Nahla or I know anything about it, but Dawn said she''s already been helped.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-06 16:36:34', '2023-09-06 16:36:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124566210', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093404002', 'Jordyn Abrams', NULL, '09.06.2023 Jordyn called to learn how to get covered for her ultrasound. I learned it is b/c of a lump on her breast. I explained, briefly, what the process would look like, and direct transferred her to Zion. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-06 16:10:25', '2023-09-06 16:10:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124570036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089144002', 'Sarita Yeldandi', NULL, '9-6-23 Sarita got a new job with benes and wants to chat to cancel and ask questions. We are set to talk tomorrow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-09-06 15:08:09', '2023-09-06 15:08:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124566205', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091198002', 'Robyn Hallet', NULL, '09.06.2023 medical need access', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-06 14:55:20', '2023-09-06 14:55:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124591044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061006173', 'Brian Delaney', NULL, '9-6-2023:  Brian injured his foot about 2 weeks ago.  Has appts both tomorrow & Friday to have it looked at.  We went over how to present since this will be part of his healthsharing: no "ins", no ID Card, ''cash-pay'', ask for ''cash-pay'' disc, he''s resp for 1k IUA, then he will call us next week after he''s had the appts so we can help him sub his ''sharing req''.
     - Zion Card:  I let him know, no card to present.  We disc 6mos deadline from DOS to include the exp in the ''sharing req'', options on how to pay his IUA, etc.
     - Planstin = ''Prev Care'' only.  Gave examples of what is included, told him 1 lab we see pd: std lipid & to call us for help w/disc on others.  He hasn''t had his ''Welcome Call'' yet, but said he will try to get it scheduled & understood when I talked about it being a good foundation for learning the package of products he has.     
     -     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-06 14:25:22', '2023-09-07 16:05:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124591039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830450', 'Debbie Eubanks', NULL, '9-6-2023:  Debbie called back.  She''s having her screening colonoscopy & the billing gal has been horrendous.  She told her "with your kind of insurance you have to pay & be reimb".  I let Debbie know that we can of course help, but here''s the reality:  this is an ACA MEC plan and they do not reimb.  That she has no req''d ntwk, just that all incl prov must be willing to bill Planstin for the memb.
     Kicker:  if they pull a polyp during the screening, it''s no longer ''prev care'' anyway & moves to her healthsharing where she then pays 1k IUA & it goes thru Zion.  [Debbie spends quite a bit of time in Mexico & can get the whole thing done down there for $400, so she''s considering her options.]     
     I made sure Debbie knows Planstin can conf for the billing office it''s cov if it stays ''prev'' and make sure they have the add to bill.  Planstin/Zion maybe having phone issues today though, so be prepared for that as well.     - CA

According to Nahla, Debbie called again to let us know she cancelled her appt & is just going to take care of her colonoscopy in Mexico.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-06 13:54:34', '2023-09-06 18:05:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124591034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116003002', 'Robert Hanley', NULL, '9-6-2023:  Andrea called.
     - Having to doc next day.  I think Andrea wanted inst on back-to-school physicals for the kids.  We disc in & out-of-ntwk fine as long as doc''s off will bill Planstin for her.  Appts must stay 100% ACA MEC benefits to keep billing med coding ''prev'' & pd for.  IF they needed (doubtful w/kids, but just in case) labs - call us for help w/disc because doubtful part of the plan.  We went over how to present w/Planstin = prev care:  only time "ins" = Y, only time you present your Planstin ID Card, only time you do not pay cash at time of service (sb no chg).     
     -     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-06 13:38:46', '2023-09-07 17:51:01'),
