  ('zcrm_1579374000124570026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114634022', 'Abram Dunaway', NULL, '9-6-23 Abe is cancelling MPB bc he''s able to get a good subsidy with his wife Amanda now unexpectedly.  She was riding the wave of free Medicaid but definitely doesn''t qualify for it now.  They''re getting $568.45 APTC for a Kaiser KP Select Bronze 6500/35%/HSA for the rest of 2023. They will revisit for 2024 to get a "better" plan.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-09-06 13:17:36', '2023-09-06 13:17:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124570021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111955009', 'Abram Dunaway', NULL, '9-6-23 Abe is cancelling MPB bc he''s able to get a good subsidy with his wife Amanda now. They''re getting $568.45 APTC for a Kaiser KP Select Bronze 6500/35%/HSA for the rest of 2023. They will revisit for 2024 to get a "better" plan.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-09-06 13:16:03', '2023-09-06 13:16:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124584061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121927002', 'Brooke Singleton', 'Welcome Call', 'Completed 9/6/23 by JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-09-06 13:10:59', '2023-09-06 13:10:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124570016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104398007', 'Estefania Luna', NULL, '9-6-23 Estefania called bc she''s sick and sounds terrible. She needs to access her plan. I gave her the Subscriber ID 92A74D and Customer #/Case ID  92A09D. She created her account and will contact Cigna or a Dr. for benefits.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-09-06 13:03:38', '2023-09-06 13:03:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124591026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081509011', 'Tammy Goen', NULL, '9-6-2023:  Tammy called to understand how she goes about finding a prov for her mammogram.  She though HCBB was the req''d ntwk, so I went over education on how that''s a source for highest quality of care & to find fair pricing.  
     Last yr the closest in ntwk cntr was 1-1/2 h away.  I remember us talking and trying to find anything.  Because of the ntwk, she had to drive by all sorts of other providers that are excellent & close.
     I let her know this yr so can use in or out-of-ntwk providers and the ACA MEC benefits will pay - she gets the best of both worlds - as long as all providers involved are willing to bill Planstin directly for her (they will not reimb).  We found 2 mamm cntrs w/in 18- miles of her.  She knows the std 2D mamm is what her ''prev care'' covers.  She''s going to try the two cntrs we found & go from there.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-06 12:59:57', '2023-09-06 13:05:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124584051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004533005', 'Brian Mirsky', NULL, '9/6/23 - Brian called in upset because back in June he found out that his children weren''t on his plan but his wife was (she never should have been on the plan) and it was supposed to be sorted out back in June. Brian called Zion this AM to verify his coverage and they told him his account was cancelled completely back in June. I tried to let Brian know several times throughout our conversation that I am not sure why Zion is telling him that as I am showing him active in our system. I transferred him to Patti to discuss this matter. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-09-06 12:50:12', '2023-09-06 12:50:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124591021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094706002', 'Kiet Ly', 'Pronounced:  Kit', '9-6-2023:  Kiet called back re: the ADHD testing.  CirrusMD told him they cannot help.  He also was confused thinking CirrusMD & Planstin were the same company.  Because we tried to find anything in the curr Zion Memb Guidelines the other day, I told him tt Zion would be best.  That he can let them know he realizes he''s resp for the 5k IUA, but he''s wondering if they will help share if it goes over that.  He seemed to understand.  I made sure he has their ph # (& let him know they are having internet issues today that are interfering w/their phones.  He knows to try again or another day if he can''t get thru) and trans him to Zion directly.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-06 12:42:08', '2023-09-06 12:42:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124554226', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081140001', 'Alexandra Roldan', 'New Membership eff 10/1/23', 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-06 12:25:21', '2023-09-06 12:25:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124566200', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109481002', 'Lucy Pirner', NULL, '09.06.2023 Lucy called to better understand how the pre-X tier works, and what is the best way to save money, aside from presenting as a cash-pay member.', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-06 12:24:53', '2023-09-06 12:24:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124591013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089065002', 'Susan Fontana', NULL, '9-6-2023:  Susan called back.  When she tt Planstin, they told her the kids are not on her plan.  They have her &amp; her ex-husband on one plan &amp;...
     - I ck''d Admin123 &amp; I see Susan &amp; the 2 kids listed on her plan.  So, I trans her to Patti''s line because she''s trying to get the doc her son needs &amp; can''t get it until Planstin corrects things on their end.  She will LM if she doesn''t catch Patti.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-06 11:56:46', '2023-09-06 11:58:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124554221', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081140001', 'Alexandra Roldan', NULL, 'Member submitted Change request to change IUA to $2500 eff 10/1/23.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-06 11:56:29', '2023-09-06 11:56:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124591008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089065002', 'Susan Fontana', NULL, '9-6-2023:  Susan called.  Her son entered college &amp; they did not accept him showing his Planstin ID card to waive their coverage.  I let her know that Planstin can prov letters for both their prev care thru Planstin &amp; their healthsharing comp Zion.  Most colleges will accept these, however there are some that till decline acceptance.  She knows if she needs to call them back their ph # is on her Planstin ID card &amp; then I trans her to them.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-06 11:38:44', '2023-09-06 11:38:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124566195', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094954002', 'Ted Benedict', NULL, '09.06.2023 Ted called a little frustrated, not at MPB, but at the process of trying to submit his bills and being placed on hold when he called Zion. He ended up hanging up. I decided to call them and conjure up a three way call with them and Ted, but I was on hold for a good 6 minutes. I ended up hanging up too. I told Ted Benedict, who has been proactively trying to submit his bills in a timely manner, that I would call him back at, 303-522-5174. Although frustrated, Ted was respectful and patient. He did make one statement re: his signage, and that is that he did not think he signing up with multiple companies.  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-06 11:23:16', '2023-09-06 11:23:16'),
