  ('zcrm_1579374000124566190', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111395009', 'Eric Hove', NULL, '09.06.2023 Aimee must have messaged somewhere asking about her plan details. Jen messaged us via teams, requesting that someone call her to answer her questions. I called, (650) 823-0097, got a VM recording for Aimee Hove, I left her a message. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-06 11:03:19', '2023-09-06 11:03:19'),
