  ('zcrm_1579374000124566185', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123644002', 'Shane Patterson', NULL, '09.06.2023 Shane called to HAVE his welcome call, right then and there (YESTERDAY was the same experience, where 4-5 members called to actually have their welcome call with whoever answered the concierge line). I was not aware of the process set, where members call the concierge line to just have their welcome call. An email has been sent out to all the new members to proceed through those steps and complete that part of their plan sign up. 
Like the other members, I sent Shane the scheduling link to set up his welcome call with either Jen or Vanessa. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-06 10:21:57', '2023-09-06 10:21:57'),
