  ('zcrm_1579374000124583013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124582030', 'Mel Fonseca', 'Begin Agent Onboarding', 'August 24, 2023 received an email from Wiley Long Enterprises to begin the on boarding of this agent.  Email was sent.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2023-09-06 09:29:25', '2023-09-06 09:29:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124584036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082319002', 'Steven Smith', NULL, '9/6/23 - Joni called in regarding how to proceed with a screening colonoscopy. We went through the process of presenting her Planstin card and not to worry if the provider is not in network due to the RBP model. Joni will call back if she needs further assistance. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-09-06 09:20:30', '2023-09-06 09:20:30'),
