  ('zcrm_1579374000124584026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120635002', 'Timothy Bush', '9/6/23 Script Quote Completed', NULL, 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-09-06 08:19:04', '2023-09-06 08:19:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124584013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107127002', 'Marcia Estes', NULL, '9/6/23 - Marcia called in because she injured her knee and wanted to know how to proceed once she has her bills and receipts. I explained the needs process to which Marcia stated that they are not computer savvy so they would rather send the bills in via USPS. I advised Marcia that this is not possible and that they can call the concierge line to assist them. Marcia was adamant that they are not able to use a computer and is not sure how they are going to do what is necessary to upload the documents to Zion''s website. I reassured Marcia that once she is ready to give us a call and we will try to walk her through the process. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-09-06 08:05:58', '2023-09-06 08:05:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124554048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123828018', 'Karen Munchel', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-09-06 08:02:43', '2023-09-06 08:02:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124584008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120635002', 'Timothy Bush', NULL, '9/6/23 - Tim called in for a prescription quote form. I sent one via email and explained the process. I will keep my eye out for the script quote form. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-09-06 07:11:00', '2023-09-06 07:11:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124570011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116383002', 'Liza Bakken', NULL, '9-5-23 Sent to me from Steve - 

Please see from our Claims Manager

Hi Steve – 

This claim was paid at 100% of RBP rates. I will send to the processor to reprocess for the remainder of the billed amount since this is preventive care.

Thank you, 

LESLIE KRANING

CLAIMS MANAGER', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-09-05 21:56:09', '2023-09-05 21:56:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124566172', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123789009', 'Huong Le', NULL, '09.05.2023 Darin called following up on why they have not received their Planstin card, soft and hard copy. I called Planstin to have them send the cards, and they shared that Huong and Darin are not in their database at all. However in our database they show that their plan includes preventative/MEC/Planstin.
Cari and I agreed to do some investigative work TOMORROW, to see all where all the points lead, before putting in a ticket, as it does not feel pure. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-05 17:45:24', '2023-09-05 17:56:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124535096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130311002', 'Nicole Plourde', NULL, '9-5-23 She was out grocery shopping. Wants to talk tomorrow.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2023-09-05 15:47:49', '2023-09-05 15:47:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124566164', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122612009', 'Annette Mosbarger', NULL, '09.05.2023 Annette called stating she was told to call the concierge line to set up her welcome call. I welcomed her and sent her the welcome call link to schedule it online at her own leisure. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-05 15:13:59', '2023-09-05 15:13:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124566154', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094706002', 'Kiet Ly', NULL, '09.05.2023 Kiet (Kit), called to refresh his memory on the preventative and the telemed portion of his plan. I went over the key elements of how to present for Planstin preventative, what to avoid, and how to maneuver items presented during the appointment that are not considered preventative, i.e. RX''s, labwork outside of the std lipid panel...etc.
I attempted to help him get registered with CirrusMD, and it did not recognize his credentials, so I sent CirrusMD an email via outlook, for a support ticket to help get him set up. 
*************************************************************************************
Heard back from CirrusMD re: Kiet''s account with them. They shared that they sent him another invitation, and he needs to accept that within 24 hours. I called Kiets and left him a VM, to check his email and accept the invitation, in order to proceed from there. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-05 15:09:40', '2023-09-05 15:35:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124556077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089437001', 'Tracey Rominger', NULL, '9-5-2023:  Tracey called.  She wants to ck on the mo contribution diff if they go to the 1k IUA.  We disc how our memb seem far more pleased w/their plan at that IUA level.  However, I let her know the best person to quote that price diff is our Ben Admin Patti.  It''s 4:59pm in FL though, so I sent her straight to Patti''s VM for tomorrow (she was fine with that).  We also talked about the waiting period if she does change & how it only moves fwd.  So anything already on file is at the curr $2500 IUA.  She''s super nice & I think this could be a good chg for her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-05 15:04:36', '2023-09-05 15:04:36');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000124556064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119797002', 'Ryan Dunlap', '(Ryan has an old CRM file if need further notes.)', 'Also under Ryan Dunlap = Partially Self Directed eff 12/1/2018 - 1/31/2023     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-05 14:48:31', '2023-09-05 14:48:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124556056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', 'See Ryan''s new CRM file eff 7/1/2023 = Secure Zion Essential w/HSA MEC', 'The name is still ''Ryan Dunlap'', just a diff CRM file.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-05 14:46:33', '2023-09-05 14:46:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124556048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078122113', 'Travis Olsen', NULL, '9-5-2023:  Travis called.  He''s ready to learn how to submit it ''sharing req''.  I walked him thru step-by-step, the curr process because the temp from the CRM is not working right now.  He has the right questions, so I think he understands.  He knows if he needs further assistance to please give us a call.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-05 14:39:08', '2023-09-05 14:44:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124556040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080945002', 'Macay Hunter', NULL, '9-5-2023:  Macay called back.  I told him Nahla tried him back on Aug 29th & apologized for our not being able to connect at that time.
        He''s trying to figure out:  They have a pediatrician through a major hosp system in Cleveland area.  It''s been nothing but issues for them re: ''cash-pay''.  We hear this often from that area.
     - HCBB:  I looked for new family docs in their area & it''s extremely limited.  I tried pediatricians, family prac, gen prac...  We finally found one & that office has had them on a waiting list for a long time, plus they don''t take children under 6 yrs of age.  Macay asked me to send him the link so he can play w/the system - so I resent his post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail & highlighted that sub category for him for easy reference.  He may call to get helpful hints in using it, but right now he''s in the car w/his little one & it''s not a good time.
     - Twins:  They are expecting twins in Nov, hence his wanting to find a new doc outside the massive hosp syst in Cleveland.  He said they already have their ''sharing req'' for this maternity need, so I didn''t ask anything further.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-05 14:06:19', '2023-09-05 14:28:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124556026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082384010', 'Karabo Molakwane', NULL, '9-5-2023:  Karabo called, he wanted to get his tax paperwork & figure out how to get into his portal.  Something is happening w/our MPB.Health portal.  We haven''t been able to get anyone in for about 2 weeks now.  Instead, I sent him copies of all his 2022 & 2023 (to date) receipts for his payments.  I also walked him thru getting into his Planstin portal for his prev care tax doc.  He can''t seem to get it to show him a document, so I made sure he has their ph # & trans him to req help from them w/their portal.  He will call back if the receipts from us do not show up (he could see some, but not all by the time we got off the phone.
     In my notes, I have the following:
               •	[9/16 10:11 AM] pbaron mympb.com – Teams chat
                        Only the Planstin portion is deductible because it is the only part that is 
                        “Insurance”. 
                                  Here you go: ...
                                  Member & Fam - $135
                However, when they broke out the Planstin in June 2023, it''s showing as $110/mo.  I gave Karabo both numbers and the dates, so he has both.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-05 13:43:55', '2023-09-05 13:44:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124570003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124142012', 'Trudi Sorensen', NULL, '9-5-23 See notes under Shane Sorensen. Trudi is Shane''s wife and remaining on the membership since inception 7/1/2020. Shane is aging out into Medicare Oct. 1st, 2023.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-09-05 13:32:55', '2023-09-05 13:33:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124566144', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111873002', 'Gregory Cox', NULL, '09.05.2023 Lindsey called thinking she can get her welcome call in by just calling the concierge line and asking questions, however even though I was able to answer her questions re: preventative care, cash-pay situations and a few elements of what the essentials consist of, I urged her to schedule a welcome call that goes into the plan in a more in-depth approach. I sent her two emails via CRM (to both emails: hers and Gregory''s); one with the Healthcare.gov link and the MPB Change form, the second as the welcome call template for scheduling. Lindsey was driving, but will make notes upon her destination arrival. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-05 13:01:06', '2023-09-05 13:01:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124556021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006176011', 'Dona Tolan', NULL, '9-5-2023:  Dona called.  She''s trying to log into her MPB.Health portal.  None of us have been able to get anyone into their portals for the last few weeks.  She''s looking for tax doc.  Instead, I sent her copies of all her 2022 & 2023 (to date) receipts for his payments.  As far as I can tell from this & Admin123, her plan does not include a MEC, so I did not go over the ''prev care'' doc.  I did tell her it''s important to let your acct know you have ''healthsharing'' rather than ''trad ins", which she said they are already aware of.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-05 12:59:05', '2023-09-05 13:54:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124566129', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079409010', 'Julie Macki', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form.  I will update', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-05 12:53:02', '2023-09-05 12:53:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124566124', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062380257', 'Rachel Brisson', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form.  I will update in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-05 12:48:03', '2023-09-05 12:48:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124566095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119797002', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, '09.05.2023 Ryan called requesting guidance on how to get his daughter''s vision medical condition, related to her dyslexia, covered via Zion. I consulted with Cari via teams for guidance on how to proceed with a situation like this, as this is the first time, and she shared that usually with health-sharing communities they are more willing to share when it comes to children, but the only ones that can really determine if it is a shared expense would be Zion.  I gave him Zion''s number, and coached him to hit menu #6.  He doesn''t have a medical need/sharing request open yet, but they can tell him if he should do that. I direct transferred him when we were done with the call. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-05 11:57:28', '2023-09-05 11:57:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124566090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088593002', 'Marija Nadel', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request eff 9/30/23 due to the fact that she "didn''t need it anymore".   I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-05 11:54:19', '2023-09-05 11:54:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124566085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123575002', 'Lori Fawcett', NULL, '09.05.2023 Lori called to schedule her welcome call. I went ahead and sent her the link to schedule it, via outlook. I explained that she can choose from two styles of delivery via Jen or Vanessa. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-05 11:43:47', '2023-09-05 11:43:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124556016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079686002', 'Ronald Flake', NULL, '9-5-23:  Ron called, Planstin told him they would pay for the colonoscopy prep, but then told him to call MPB.Health first.  His new Planstin card does have the pharmacy info on it incl BIN #, etc, so he''s going to present that card to see if it works.  I let him know in the past they''ve told us it was not covered, so to be prepared as generally, prescription benefits are not included in our plan.  He will see what type of prep they''ve suggested as well (if it''s the new tabs & not cov, he knows to call us for a coupon).  He was kind enough to tell me he will call to let us know if the Planstin card worked, so we know for future members.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-05 11:37:50', '2023-09-05 11:37:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124566074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122827002', 'Jean Doty', NULL, '09.05.2023 Jean called sharing the VM Vanessa left her RE: the link to schedule the WC. However, Jean has not seen the email come through yet, so I sent it to her via outlook, and she received it while we are on the phone. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-05 11:36:34', '2023-09-05 11:36:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124566069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060460087', 'Adrea Rice', NULL, '09.05.2023 Adrea called to learn how to process a medical need towards a dermatology appointment. I explained that usually dermatology is not covered, but it is becomes a medical issue, then it might become shareable when the IUA is reached.
Adrea shared that it might be cancerous. I consulted with Cari via teams to make sure it would be shareable, b/c I could not find it in the guidelines and wanted to double check with her, since it is something that I was trained on in the past.
I pulled Cari in on the call for the extra details that we will need to share with Adrea, since it would be too cumbersome via chat. Cari was able to go over the process in detail. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-05 11:32:07', '2023-09-05 11:39:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124566023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123096002', 'Karen Yabuno', NULL, '09.05.2023 Jennifer is out due to a loss in the family. I called all her welcome calls (David, Peter Fenwick &amp; Karen Yabuno), including Karen, to help them reschedule their welcome call with her. I left Karen a VM on her phone number that he shared for the welcome call: 706-550-1701. 
Resent the link for Karen to reschedule. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-05 10:37:07', '2023-09-05 10:42:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124566018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122803002', 'Peter Fenwick', NULL, '09.05.2023 Jennifer is out due to a loss in the family. I called all her welcome calls (David, Peter Fenwick &amp; Karen Yabuno), including Peter, to help them reschedule their welcome call with her. I left Peter a VM on his phone number that he shared for the welcome call: 410-916-3929. 
Resent the link for him to reschedule. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-05 10:36:20', '2023-09-05 10:43:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124566013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122246002', 'Lisa Morrell', NULL, 'Received Cancellation from member she was leaving the employ of this group eff 8/31.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-05 10:36:17', '2023-09-05 10:36:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124566008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124507207', 'David Stipp', NULL, '09.05.2023 Jennifer is out due to a loss in the family. I called all her welcome calls (David, Peter Fenwick &amp; Karen Yabuno), including David, to help them reschedule their welcome call with her. I spoke with David on the phone, and he said he will reschedule for sometime in 1.5 weeks, due to travel. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-05 10:34:49', '2023-09-05 10:34:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124556011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098613002', 'Lisa McDowell', NULL, '9-5-2023:  ILM for Lisa re: missed chat.  Please call concierge line w/our ph # &amp; hours.  I did mention we want to talk asap, because for a "sharing req" they have a 6-mos deadline from DOS on including expenses.  Sent an e-mail from this CRM file as well - in case she doesn''t receive the VM.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-05 10:30:25', '2023-09-05 14:51:55'),
