  ('zcrm_1579374000124556006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071992009', 'Jason Cooper', NULL, '9-5-2023:  Martha called to confirm we''d rec''d her cancellation form.  I let her know Patti just processed it about 40-minutes ago.  I did let her know that since it was past the deadline, the cancellation will be effective 10/1/2023.  She was very nice &amp; they''ll keep our srvcs in mind in case they don''t like the employer prov "trad ins".     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-05 10:25:51', '2023-09-05 10:25:51'),
