  ('zcrm_1579374000124443042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120424002', 'Tory Erickson', NULL, '9-1-2023:  Tory called her advisor, Kori Allen.  Kori called in for her, to find out how to get proof of benefits for school.
     - I encouraged Kori:  we are willing to help with these things so it frees her up to grow her bus.  She''s under Angela, so I also told her Angela will be helping the advisors w/training & their questions.  (She said she knew Michele Rebal was, but couldn''t get ahold of her - I let her know Michele had to take a leave for pers reasons, but Angela is curr taking those calls.)  So, for next time she knows.  We tried the main off (I trans her) but it doesn''t seem like she ans, so I went ahead & trained Kori a bit:
          - Planstin does the paperwork for both Planstin & their sister comp Zion.  So, I made sure she has the acc ph # for Planstin & their hours, then told her what to ask for.  I told her we generally have good luck, but Zion seems to have a lot of new emp, so to let us know if she has issues.  I also let her know that most schools acccept this info, but we''ve had a few decline acceptance (to not mention this until we find out, because it''s a super sm %).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-01 13:35:37', '2023-09-01 14:13:22'),
