  ('zcrm_1579374000124445016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578137', 'Rachel Fisher Ingraham', NULL, '09.01.2023 Rachel is just learning that her annual physical for one of her sons, was not paid for by Planstin. After consulting with Cari via teams, and further investigation with Rachel, I coached Rachel to speak to bother parties: The provider''s office to make sure they billed Planstin w/o the behavioral test, and to speak to Planstin to make sure her kids'' birthdays are in their system properly.
She checked her bills and they were both for Emerson. It is possible that Rowan is not identified in the system as her son with Planstin. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-01 12:32:25', '2023-09-01 12:32:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124445011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120264002', 'Cheryl Powell', NULL, '09.01.2023 Cheryl called to learn how to connect with a mental therapist. She was already logged onto the site, but was not sure how to connect with anyone.  I guided her to the upper right hand corner for the number and the live chat on the right hand side. Cheryl was more confident at the end of our call. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-01 12:07:53', '2023-09-01 12:07:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124422058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063253037', 'Bobbi Georgeton', NULL, '9-1-23 Jamal called me back only to tell me what I already told him that she was getting paid to me through MPB. MPB''s Producer Code is 432352. I told him that''s how I learned of the problem was through them. However, they never should have been paid. They''ve never been connected to me via C4 since inception. So, it''s an issue on Cigna''s end. He could see me as the Broker of Record. I have no idea how this happened and I shouldn''t need to complete a BOR client transfer form. He''s updating the ticket and will let me know the resolution.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-09-01 12:07:22', '2023-09-01 12:07:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124448008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077742031', 'Tyler Holt', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to add Emilia''s SS #.  It was added to A123 to be sent to Planstin.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-09-01 11:54:11', '2023-09-01 11:54:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124422053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014431007', 'Suzanne Cote', NULL, '9-1-23 Suzanne called to better understand about becoming an Advisor or Agent and I shared with her how it works. She''s looking more to supplement her current income in the arts by working remotely somehow. But, she said she''s not good at building a business and getting new clients or even doing research. She needs a template to follow to succeed. She''s a good communicator with sales experience and owns her own biz. She managed people for 20 years.  She''s in design/aesthetics/muralist with paint, glazing, fauz finishes and went to School of Applied Arts in Denver. She''s now living in Thornton and feels like she needs to start over with getting new clients now that she''s not in Boulder County. She''s 61 and not interested in working on scaffoldings anymore.  I''ll keep my ears open if I learn of anything.  She also said she''s probably not the best for the Concierge type job either. But, she wants to work 20-30 hours a week.  
We also discussed that we need to reconnect in Nov. to update her choice for 2024 with ins via C4.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-09-01 11:52:35', '2023-09-01 11:52:35'),
