9-1-2023:  Laura called to help set up Joseph''s telehealth.  I was able to send an invite to the above unique e-mail address.  Did mention lmt''d scope, but to call us if they did write an RX so we can help find best pricing.  She was thinking it was a call, so we disc it''s a text first srvc.  [Did not discuss it becoming a call or video w/her.]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-01 11:11:53', '2023-09-01 11:11:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124445006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075338242', 'Cathy Watson', NULL, '09.01.2023 Early called to refresh our memory with our conversation with Cathy, and to better learn how to proceed after being admitted to the hospital via ambulance, to get covered. I sent him and Cathy an email via outlook, the instructions on how to submit bills to Zion. 
Earl was offered a discount by the ambulance division, from over $2500 to $2044 if he pays by the 14th of Sept. I urged him to start the medical need process and get Zion to share that part ASAP. The ambulance division did not send him an invoice and told him to just pay via check. He is in the process of attaining a bill from them in order to submit and qualify for the offered balance of $2044. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-09-01 11:04:48', '2023-09-01 11:04:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124443017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035268015', 'Catherine Watson', 'NEW CRM File:  Cathy Watson w/husb Earl Henderson = CARE+ Eff: 10/1/2021', '9/1/2023: There are several old file.  As of today, see the above for the current file.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-01 11:04:07', '2023-09-01 11:04:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124443003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088593002', 'Marija Nadel', NULL, '9-1-2023:  Marija called.  She is not comprehending or listening.  In giving instructions/suggestions, she does not want to do it that way.
     She called because she wants to cancel her "ins".  When asked if she''s tt her advisor Karen Torsoe, she says no.  I let her know that''s usually the person that helps the member w/their cancellation.  Offered her Karen''s ph # & she said something like my "ins" is w/you and I want to cancel w/you.
     Since she wants this cancelled immediately (like yesterday being her last day), I took her to the MPB.Health Memb Updates & helped her find the Cancellation Form.  I let her know she''d missed the deadline, but that once she submitted the form, we could trans her to Patti to discuss options.
     Again, she doesn''t want to submit the form first for Patti to have for reference.  So, I trans her to Patti per her req.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-09-01 10:52:46', '2023-09-01 10:57:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124441013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563258', 'Brandi Stanley', NULL, '9/1/23 - Brandi called in to see what differs between stateside medical services and international medical services as far as her Zion plan is concerned. We went over the differences and Brandi let me know that she is always happy to call in to MPB because we recognize her every time. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-09-01 10:16:17', '2023-09-01 10:16:17'),
