  ('zcrm_1579374000124422043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124507177', 'Lisa Triepke', NULL, '9-1-23 Lisa answered my second try and she enrolled in CARE+ for Oct. 1st. She might join a DPC sometime and will upgrade at that point. For now, she''s happy with CARE+ $1000/$265. I told her about Welcome Call and Quick Reference Guide.  All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-09-01 09:29:05', '2023-09-01 09:29:05'),
