  ('zcrm_1579374000124401044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000255554', 'Ruthann Reid', NULL, '8-31-2023:  There are several old CRM "Reid" contacts, that look more like old ''Leads''.  I do not see anything on the new or old side of Admin123 (although, maybe they are even older than that).  In trying to find a member with the last name Reid, it added to my having to go into each listed CRM Reid contact.  Because that adds unnecessary time, while I''m on the concierge line w/a memb, I sent Dayra a req to see if these can be moved to ''Leads'' instead.  No idea if that''s possible, but it would be nice for the NOT to show on the ''Contacts'' list.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-31 17:14:25', '2023-08-31 17:14:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124401036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123843002', 'Ginovelli Silvestre', NULL, '8-31-2023:  Gino called.  He''s trying to set up their CirrusMD &amp; having trouble.  I let him know that''s because their accounts are not active until tomorrow.  He will call the concierge line tomorrow w/unique e-mail addresses for both him &amp; Jiezel so we can try to send invites.  Then, if we are having issues, we can sub a support tckt.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-31 16:58:31', '2023-08-31 16:58:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124373286', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071992038', 'Willa Bonzi', NULL, '08.31.2023 Martin wants to be clear on how to proceed with his preventative appointments, since he changed their plan to Secure. I went over how we don''t have a deductible and how the IUA works first, since he thought that he had a deductible.
I went over Healthcare.gov to refer to what preventative services are included with Planstin AND the Zion guidelines site to download fresh EACH TIME (not the actual PDF). We talked about what to avoid during annual physicals to keep coverage, and how to separate items that need to be addressed but are not preventative items. 
I sent him and the secondary email address, via CRM, the links: healthcare.gov & the Zion website to download his guidelines freshly. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-31 16:54:11', '2023-08-31 16:54:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124401025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109598030', 'Jeffrey Pietras', NULL, '8-31-2023:  Jeffrey called:
     - Derm: Wondered about gen skin ck, how it wks, doc choice, etc.  We went thru presenting as ''cash-pay'', asking for disc, no "ins", get det inv & pymt receipt in case issue is discovered.
     - Prev Care: ''Planstin'' - Only time "ins" = Y, present ID card, in & out-of-ntwk ok as long as doc''s off will bill Planstin for you = NO reimb to pt.  Keep all ''prev'' for medical coding, etc...
