  ('zcrm_1579374000124401008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121048010', 'Margaret Heaton', NULL, '8-31-2023:  Margaret got a job that started providing employer benefits on 8/22/23.  She wanted to cancel, so I showed her the cancellation form.  Since it''s employer provided coverage &amp; Jeffrey Bursteen is no longer with MPB, I didn''t do anything further.  She will get it submitted today so it''s before the Sept cov period.
