  ('zcrm_1579374000124373268', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121749002', 'Stuart Skok', NULL, '08.31.2023 Stuart was admitted to hospital last night, for an appendectomy. Stuart was concerned on how to proceed, given being so new to the plan. So I provided the guidance needed when it comes to specific issues related to medical need health sharing with Zion.
