  ('zcrm_1579374000124401003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870127', 'Heather Braeutigam', NULL, '8-31-2023:  Nahla pulled me in on the call as Heather''s questions kept getting deeper.  It sounds like for some reason Planstin declined her std lipid panel.  We decided she''s going to call Planstin for details on why.  IF they state it''s because it''s out-of-ntwk lab, I coached her to remind them she can now go outside the ntwk because it sounds like it was after we started to offer that option.
