  ('zcrm_1579374000124364081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125944002', 'Kevin Krueger', NULL, '8-31-23 Kevin is 32 and lives in MI. He''s split between W2 and self-employed and working towards 100% self employed. He learned of health sharing years ago from friends who''ve joined other ones. He found MPB via searching online and nobody referred him to MPB. He doesn''t take any meds but he does use tobacco on occasion and not interested in quitting. I shared with him the limitations once he''s 50+ and he will have to think about that. I also let him know all other health shares I''ve seen have similar limitations but ins does not. He knows of the $50 additional fee per month as well. So, he will have to ponder this.  He''s also missing hi ACL and can''t do martial arts any more. But, he does his machinery labor no problem. I reiterated the pre-x clause and he understands. He hasn''t done a wellness visit in a while and wants to do one. He hasn''t funded an HSA but is open to it. I explained SECURE and CARE+ for him to decide. I sent him both to review and he will ponder.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-31 11:16:43', '2023-08-31 11:16:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124373240', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121660002', 'Amendoa Hopper', NULL, '08.31.2023 Amendoa called asking for her member ID #. I gave her the MPB member ID number, and told her that she most likely won''t need that ID number for many items aside from talking to us at MPB. She then shared that she is looking for an Ortho., which in turn I realized she is trying to figure out how to get covered for a cash pay visit. Then I went into the fact that she is trying to set up a "Cash-Pay" visit, which is   how she will present herself, and when her services for THIS ISSUE, exceed the $1000 IUA, then she will open a medical need, when she will NEED her Zion''s member ID number. Then I guided her to search her email for a welcome email from Zion to attain the member ID, and she did :). We then talked about her getting in a welcome call to attain that post email with a plethora of resources, including the HCBB. I sent her the link to schedule one, and an email, via CRM, to have the HCBB and healthgrades to search for a specialist. Amendoa is looking forward to refreshing her knowledge on her plan. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-31 11:16:33', '2023-08-31 11:16:33'),
