  ('zcrm_1579374000124383047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108626001', 'Karen Schofield', NULL, '8-30-2023:  Marty called.  Karen got her annual bone density test done and Planstin denied it as not a cover benefit.  He is not sure if it was a reg bone density test or the newer one w/all the extra info req''d (which I know is not covered).  We talked &amp; after making sure he has Planstin''s ph # I trans him to them, letting him know they will be able to help differenciate.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-30 17:29:33', '2023-08-30 17:29:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124383030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899568', 'Stephanie Yost', 'MPB.Health Memb Portal - info we have is not working', '8-30-2023:  Stephanie''s user name &amp; PW for the MPB.Health Memb Port must have been chg''d as the info we have does not get her/us into the system currently.  Tried on Edge &amp; Chrome.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-30 16:45:17', '2023-08-30 16:54:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124364066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063253037', 'Bobbi Georgeton', NULL, '8-30-23 I spoke with Jamal at Cigna to get Bobbi''s commissions paid to me, not to MPB anymore. I have no idea how it''s getting paid to MPB at Producer Code 432352. Jamal put in a ticket to get it moved to me. He sees me as the Broker of Record and tkt # is TUO-34602. It usually takes 1-2 days but it might take a little longer. Jamal will call me back with a resolution when it''s finished. Yay!  They will pay me my back pay as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-30 16:43:20', '2023-11-07 20:37:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124383025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114233002', 'Dilan Bollmann', 'Also see notes in: Sara Brandenburg (if questions)', '8-30-2023:  Longtime member Sara Brandenburg is his fiance'' per Sara.  They moved to &amp; are living in MO now (this CRM file has a MO address, so maybe his is already accurate?  Her''s still shows Berthoud, CO).  She''s tt to Dilan to see when they want to combine their memberships.  Both = Care+     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-30 16:36:34', '2023-08-30 16:36:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124364061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104398007', 'Estefania Luna', NULL, '8-30-23 Jamal with Cigna confirmed the application is approved and payment is set for initial and auto pay! YAY!!! App # HS20188932.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-30 16:30:06', '2023-08-30 16:30:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124373041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109660008', 'Larry Essex', NULL, '08.30.2023 Larry called to get help in opening a medical need. I sent him the instructions to sending bills to Zion. It went to his spam folder, and the links in it were not accessible, until he moved it to his inbox.
I offered him Zion''s number to call them directly, should he experience a speed bump in the process and the glitches that have been surfacing for the last 3 months. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-30 16:13:06', '2023-08-30 16:13:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124373036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899568', 'Stephanie Yost', NULL, '08.30.2023 Stephanie called to get help in changing her banking information. I guided her to the MPB change form on the website. She also needed to access her MPB portal for pertinent documents to complete her taxes. I guided her to search her emails for Planstin back in February. She did and found the email from Planstin with instructions to attain her tax documents. Stephanie also asked about where we are on the RBP price model switch up, b/c she really needs to go see a OBGYN. I explained that the switch took place very recently, and she may go to a doctor of her choosing, but make sure they contact Planstin from the back of your card, and to keep her appt preventative and how to proceed if it starts becoming diagnostic.  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-30 16:10:40', '2023-08-30 16:44:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124364056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125944002', 'Kevin Krueger', NULL, '8-30-23 Kevin called while I was in the Mastermind. I just called and left him a vm. Although the name on caller id shows up as Carl.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-30 16:10:29', '2023-08-30 16:10:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124373028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098254002', 'Angela McGuire', NULL, '08.30.2023 Angela called to get clarification on how to proceed with an annual physical preventative apt. We went over, how to keep the appt preventative, and offered some verbiage to counter statements that recode the appt to diagnostic, as well as, IF the doctor found it imperative to test for something observed, to request that they separate that part from the appt and present as a cash pay patient on that, including (RX''s, extra lab-work and findings). NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-30 15:27:20', '2023-08-30 15:35:41'),
