  ('zcrm_1579374000124292003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093898002', 'Matthew Hoit', NULL, '08.29.2023 Selina called to learn more on how to get covered for PT. I explained it will need a treatment plan, with coverage of $7500 or 35 session max, whichever comes first and IF it is approved to be shared. She continued to share that they sent her a letter statin they will share towards this issue, via pre-X guidelines of the 1st sharing year (25k). However, in the same letter they stated they did not check medical history to attain the heading of this issue as pre-X. I guided Selina to conjure up verbiage from both doctors, the previous one 15 years ago & the present one re: the pelvic floor discomfort. Completely unrelated issues, according to Selina. I coached her to communicate with Zion that it is not a pre-x and that since they did not do the research, she will contact the doctors and bring forward all documents needed to make a decision. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-29 15:17:39', '2023-08-29 15:17:39'),
