  ('zcrm_1579374000124284003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118197019', 'Robert Meekins', NULL, 'I answered Robert''s call earlier this morning to which he called in to ask about an in-depth explanation of how the pre-existing conditions guideline work, along with needing to see if something he is dealing with will be considered so. I told him I wanted him to speak to Patti here, as she has better knowledge on how all of that works here. I transferred Robert over to Patti and I stayed to listen to the conversation of how she explained everything, that way I will be able to learn, and understand better for future use. All set by ending the call with telling Robert he needs to call Zion Health directly to see if his situation falls into being a pre-ex-condition. All set on our end for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-08-29 13:29:54', '2023-08-29 13:29:54'),
