  ('zcrm_1579374000124198052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123505002', 'Catherine Fisher', NULL, '08.28.2023 Catherine called b/c she received a letter to set up her welcome call. I went ahead and send her the scheduling link, given that both Vanessa and Jennifer have the scripts for this new Secure CoPay plan. Catherine scheduled herself while we were on the phone, and received a confirmation that it was received and will receive a confirmation of the actual orientation call. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-28 12:07:15', '2023-08-28 12:07:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124198039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082503008', 'Timothy Schaewe', NULL, '08.28.2023 Lisa called after speaking with Zion and Planstin, telling her "in order to have them send her emails directly, she will need to speak to us to add that to her profile first"
I checked CRM and her email is added here, but not on Admin123. I did call Zion and speak to Joanna and brought Lisa in on the call. Joanna still only saw Timothy''s email and not, Gakyo61@gmail.com.
I messaged Patti via teams, and she was able to add her email to that platform, which in turn will communicate with Planstin and Zion''s platform. Lisa will try contacting Zion and Planstin tomorrow to proceed from there. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-28 11:31:51', '2023-08-28 11:32:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124205008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105905002', 'Stephanie Mundy', NULL, '8-28-2023:  Stephanie called.  Tons of questions & RX Quote:
     - Giving plasma & had med emergency.  Kept passing out & the cntr ended up calling ER to get her taken care of.  She just got the bills & is now needing to take care of them.  We went over how to sub a ''med need'' thru Zion''s new memb portal system, calling for an invite, etc.
     - Educ:  not a ded, IUA = issue specific, etc.  We disc all details, even rolling 12mo period, 
     - Elbow:  DPC doc has been working w/her.  Testing, etc.  End of March it began hurting.  Finally, went to see her chiro she knows well & she sent her to her DPC in June.  DPC sent her to get an ultrasound (had to be done twice).   We disc pre-x, phase-in period, but she went on a trip w/her sister late in March & that''s when she noticed the pain in her elbow.
     - Wishes her ''Welcome Call'' would have been as helpful as our conversation...
     - MAP: Behavioral Health - wants to look at counseling.  We walked thru the entire site, how to use, etc.
    - Kids have state ins & in the new yr they will need to pay again.  Curious what she might save if she rem''d them for a few months.  We disc pros & cons - pre-x could happen during interim, so it''s a calculated risk = worth the savings?
     - RXs:  Went over how to hdl RX Quotes.  Overheard her telling her son they are headed soon to pick up her husb''s RX at Costco.  I quickly ran over the pharmacy benefits & while we were on the phone I did a quick ck.  She''s already looked on GoodRX.  I sent the following coupon & went over tt her Costco & Sam''s pharmacies, because they offer some items super cheap (maybe better than we can see online).  Here''s what I ended up sending:
               - Amoxicillin 500mg, #21 = $4.62 @ Meijer on Sngl Care (no sign up) = for William Mundy 
     - Has accident ins - she''ll call her adv Whitney Kline to find out if that will help w/the ER visit.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-28 11:15:32', '2023-08-28 18:24:04'),
