  ('zcrm_1579374000124205003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124159002', 'Sado Albitar', NULL, '8-28-2023:  Sado called.  He signed up yesterday for an Oct 1 start date, but wondered if he can push that to Jan 1, 2024.  Since that''s so far out, I trans him to Patti Baron''s line to get an accurate answer.  He will leave her a mess if she cannot answer.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-28 10:40:31', '2023-08-28 10:40:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124198034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063775002', 'Daniel Gutierrez', NULL, '08.28.2023 Martha called to get guidance on finding another Orthopedic who is not a surgeon. Together we perused the HCBB again, and guided her to also search Healthgrades.com for additional research. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-28 10:37:07', '2023-08-28 10:37:07'),
