  ('zcrm_1579374000124198029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061522092', 'Nancy Allawos', NULL, '08.28.2023 Nancy called to get guidance on how to proceed for a Colonoscopy screening. I guided her to use the Planstin part of her plan, use the back of her card to offer their number for the office to collaborate pricing and billing.
I introduced her to HCBB and healthgrades to research her providers/facilities. We went over how it will be covered is it''s a pure screening or if they pull polyps and it turns diagnostic. Nancy has not used her plan yet, and she''s looking forward to starting to learn how to use it now. 
I emailed her, via CRM, a post welcome call for Secure plan with Planstin and Zion. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-28 09:31:31', '2023-08-28 09:31:31'),
