  ('zcrm_1579374000124198008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106720002', 'Jessica Chariton', NULL, '08.28.2023 Jessica opened a ticket #2953 for Reimbursement and pay ahead?
"1. I have a vaccine bill for my son that I paid for and they told me it could be reimbursed if I tuned it in.
2. I am getting a mammogram done on Tuesday and need to have the payment for it at the time of service."
I left her a VM to call us back for guidance on the bullets above, with hopes in having her open a preventative medical need for both her son''s vaccine and her mammogram. 
******************************************************************************************
Jessica called back, and I was able to go over what her process is to get reimbursed from Zion. I sent her the email, via CRM, instructions on how to bill Zion. I direct transferred her and guided her to choose #5 for medical need to explain what she needs. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-28 08:51:52', '2023-08-28 12:53:22'),
