  ('zcrm_1579374000124166016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121975010', 'Nicole Schoch', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 9/1/23 due to all of the factors below.  She should have never been enrolled in our membership in the 1st place.  This is the fault of the advisor who didn''t vet the prospect thoroughly.  I will cancel &amp; refund the 9/23 share amount.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-08-28 07:33:55', '2023-08-28 07:33:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124179003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115993002', 'Paolo Gramcko-Tursi', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-08-28 07:32:54', '2023-08-28 07:32:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124166003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104640002', 'Jenna Sampaio', NULL, 'I received cancellation from this member eff 9/1 as she now has employer coverage.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-08-28 07:22:54', '2023-08-28 07:22:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124148043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109363009', 'Suzanne Gallo', NULL, '8-25-2023:  RX Quote:  Suzanne - This is a statin & they are on Planstin HSA MEC.  I tried to get accurate info on if this is one of the free statins.  After waiting & working w/diff people at OptumRX, Healther told me #30 (=30-ds) would be $5.27.  I''m not 100% sure she''s giving me the correct info, but after 30+ minutes trying to get an answer, I''m utilizing that info.  $5.27 x 3 = 90-ds = $15.81.  She can get a 90-ds for < that thru our coupons on other sources.  She did not put down a pharmacy.  I see above Cost+ was recommended to her back in Jan by Nahla.  Since I cannot tell what other pharmacy was recommended, here is what I sent:
     - Rosuastatin Calc 20mg, #90 tabs = $10.87 @ KS on Sngl Care (no sign-up)
               [Next cheapest was also at KS for $12.37 on both RXGo & WebMD RX.]
     Evergreen, CO is quite remote so I also mentioned that the same Cost+ recommended back in Jan is only .73-cents more even w/s&h on their site.  Plus, it will come to them.  I included their sign-up pg again in case they need it.  They may only have a PO Box & maybe Cost+ won''t ship to that?     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-26 16:59:38', '2023-08-26 16:59:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124148038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100495009', 'Jace Perry', NULL, '8-25-2023:  Jace called to get instructions on how the counseling portion of our memb wks.  We were able to go to Mazz &amp; Sull site together &amp; go over all the inst on how to find a doc w/their asst.  [I did not do the usual site walk thru as he called in on a Friday night at 5:58pm].  However, I took the time to go over the pattern of appts, can ask them to approach his own counselor if he has one, etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-25 18:07:09', '2023-08-25 18:07:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124148033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471338', 'Steve Tobias', NULL, '8-25-2023:  Steve called.  He had a colonoscopy clear back in 2022 and he''s still receiving bills from the anesthesiologist.  After talking, he says RCI was the company who told him everything would be fine ahead of the procedure & now he can''t get pymt.  I inquired whether the anesthesiologist was in network and his reply was "they approv''d everything before hand".  I''ve been locked out of our "MPB Plan" document (says I do not have authorization to access), so I tried to tell from Admin123 what was a portion of that old plan.  When he talked about getting it pre-approved, I wondered if he had worked thru Redirect, but he says no, it was RCI.  I gave him RCI''s ph # & hours and told him they will be the best people to talk with.  I trans him there, but he knows I''m here a few more hours if he needs me.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-25 15:41:37', '2023-08-25 15:41:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124126110', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109659009', 'Massimo Didomenico', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request eff 9/1 after speaking with his advisor.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-08-25 14:23:35', '2023-08-25 14:23:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124140064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088509010', 'Scott Blossom', NULL, '8/25/23 - Scott called to gain access to the MAP program for his son. We went through some of the details and I transferred Scott directly to MAP. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-08-25 14:06:05', '2023-08-25 14:06:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124151008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010282165', 'Alicia Turbidy', NULL, '8-25-23. Alicia alerted me that Sabrina is still not showing up in her account as active yet. I submitted a ticket #2945 and was told by Angela Sedera won''t give the member a start date until 9/1/23 bc they were never notified.  She escalated the matter to JK and he''s out of the office. However, I reached out to Sedera myself since this is vital and it can''t wait.  Sedera requested proof of submission by the client and proof of payment. I supplied both just now and waiting to hear back for an Aug. 1st active date for Sabrina per the clients requested submission on 7/27/23 per the Cognito form and Admin123.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-25 13:52:53', '2023-08-25 13:52:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124151003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010282165', 'Alicia Turbidy', NULL, '7-27-23 Alicia completed the Cognito form to add Sabrina to her membership for Aug. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-25 13:49:04', '2023-08-25 13:49:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124148022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121975010', 'Nicole Schoch', NULL, 'Out of order [I got another call & had not been able to document.  She must have called back while I was on that call to talk w/Patti.  See Patti''s note above]:

8-25-2023:  Nicole called & we talked at length on her quiting her MPB memb to go directly w/Zion.  I tried to get her to disc this w/her advisor Stephen Cox before deciding.  Zion told her she can save money by going direct with them (is this happening in the memb''s Zion ''Welcome Call''?).  I tried to disc options and she finally said she would discuss w/Stephen.  Apparently, she gave him no time to get back to her as I wasn''t off the phone long before she called & tt Patti.
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
For our records, I did go ahead & sub tckt #2952, so we''d have record of another member Zion stole from us:
     Zion Taking Another Member
     25 Aug 2023 12:42 PM
