  ('zcrm_1579374000124139018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116003002', 'Robert Hanley', NULL, 'I got a call from Andrea this afternoon stating that due to her experience with CirrusMD for her first time, she was driving to be seen in person due to a terrible Sinus Infection she has. Andrea said her CirrusMD session was not a good one due to the provider she was connected with told her 2 things that not only one of the 2 things relayed were incorrect 100%, but the other was also quite odd, and didn''t help whatsoever with her sickness. Walked her through process of self-pay, and lastly told her to give me the providers name for CirrusMD she saw, and I will reach out to let support know so it doesn''t happen again. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-08-25 11:52:54', '2023-08-25 11:52:54'),
