  ('zcrm_1579374000124139013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097036002', 'Charles Knox', NULL, 'While monitoring on the SalesIQ chat system like I usually do today, Charles responded to my greeting message early this afternoon around noon time. He reached out wanting to know about the process for him needing to get an MRI due to his "Acute shoulder injury" he has. His question was if an MRI would be reimbursable and that he would be going to an imaging center that does not require a referral from his doctor or anything like that. I explained how his IUA works and submitting the bills/proof of IUA payment into Zion Health, along with there is no network he needs to stay in. I let Charles know the wording he is to use when presenting himself is "self-paying patient". To which Charles said that is exactly what he has been doing. Lastly, I gave him Zion''s phone number and suggested he give Zion a call since they are the ones that he needs to contact during the entire Need process. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-08-25 11:41:37', '2023-08-25 11:41:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124148003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095960001', 'Doug Richter', NULL, '8-25-2023:  Jennifer called for a few items:
     - Her daughter is going for a back-to-school/sports physical & she wanted to know how to handle it.  She does have her Planstin card & we went over all the details.  Their doc is not showing as part of the PHCS ntwk, but I let her know as long as the office will bill for her, that will be fine - NO reimb though.  They are seeing the doc for the first time, so it''s an estab appt.  I let her know unless they will bill it with ''prev care'' medical coding, it will not get pd.
