  ('zcrm_1579374000124139008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830450', 'Debbie Eubanks', NULL, 'Debbie called in and said she needs to have her colonoscopy screening done but in another part of the state of CO she is in and just wanted to know how to search to a provider. I let her know I sent an email to her with the link to search with instructions on how to navigate the website to do so. Along with the link to the site and the 2nd link is to the list of preventative procedures available in her plan mandated by the ACA. Verified her email address and she lastly let me know that in November coming up she is turning 65 and wanted to know the procedure for aging out into Medicare. I explained that she was exactly correct in asking if she just ages out and it is an automatic drop off until the end of November, etc. I let her know that Patti Baron who deals with that type of situation has been sending the email''s out to make people aging out aware of the process so she should look out for that email in the following month or so. She is very grateful for the support the concierge gives and noted that we made the transition from traditional health insurance into Health Sharing a lot easier and not so confusing. She is all set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-08-25 09:15:32', '2023-08-25 09:15:32'),
