     She knows it would have to get quite expensive for there to be any help (> 5k IUA) and then maybe they allow for surgical intervention?  But, not hearing aides?
        She will ask Andrew to call the concierge line if he has further questions.  He hasn''t ever had his ''Welcome Call'', so I don''t think he has any idea what he''s purchased.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-24 15:27:00', '2023-08-24 15:27:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124075043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104398007', 'Estefania Luna', NULL, '8-24-23 Cigna is Still showing her enrollment as Submitted, not yet Approved. I''m talking with Joanne now to see what''s going on. There''s no way for me to add the payment information here either still. On hold... She finally found the application ID HS20188932 and supposedly it''s processing today. I should be able to see a change in 24-48 hours. Then I still need to set up the binder payment I think. Nobody can see that part yet. Soo.... frustrating!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-24 15:15:05', '2023-08-24 15:25:46'),
