  ('zcrm_1579374000124075013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088723009', 'Daniela Papi', NULL, '8-24-23 Daniella called be she''s going to be teaching in the school system and they are offering her benefits for Sept. through Dec. and the cost for the entire family is only $39 a month! She wanted to make sure there are no negative repercussions of cancelling for that time period. I let her know about the pre-x clause which will start over. Nobody has any health issues. However, she called back to ask about mental health therapy for her son who was bullied by some kids at school a year or so ago. I explained Life Care and suggested she call the MPB Concierge Team to get help in requesting his counselor to join the network. She will call to see if that''s possible so he can continue to see his counselor at no cost. This may only be relevant if they don''t cancel or rejoin though.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-24 12:19:32', '2023-08-24 12:19:32'),
