  ('zcrm_1579374000124071003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109886002', 'James Evans lll', NULL, 'Due to note below member submitted cancellation.  Advisor clearly was not trained because he was under impression that he had Preventative.  I will cancel member and refund September share amount.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-08-24 11:52:59', '2023-08-24 11:52:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124067007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442408', 'Jacquelynn Mariest', NULL, '8-24-2023:  Jacquelynn called.  She tt CirrusMD & they sugg she have a screening colonoscopy.  We went into details on:
