  ('zcrm_1579374000124048008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021903103', 'Jodi Anglin', NULL, '8/24/23 - Jodi called to get her son Alex''s CirrusMD services set up because they believe he has an ear infection. I attempted to send an invitation via email but received an error message. I sent a support email with the member tagged so that they can get Alex''s services set up. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-08-24 08:11:52', '2023-08-24 08:11:52'),
