  ('zcrm_1579374000123981098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089233002', 'Alexander Myers', NULL, '8-23-2023:  RX Quote for Shannon Myers:
     - NP Thyroid Brand 60mg, #68 tabs = $29.96 at Walgreens.
        Mentioned to her if this is not a 90-day supp, we could potentially increase the qty &amp; poss get a price break.  Please let us know.  If she has refills, she may not even need to call the doc off to do so.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-23 18:21:01', '2023-08-25 02:49:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124014110', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039700101', 'David Larochelle', NULL, '8-23-23 David called bc the hospital wants to know who he had membership with as of 8/5/22 and that was Redirect Health that needs to be billed for anything more for his colonoscopy. He will start with telling them that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-23 18:17:08', '2023-08-23 18:17:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123981093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098248002', 'Marcus Alig', NULL, '8/23/2023:  Marcus wondered where we were at on ''prev care'' and ntwk.  I left a detailed mess &amp; gave him my # &amp; hours on the concierge line thinking that might be the best way to make sure he has ALL the ''prev care'' guidelines.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-23 17:51:51', '2023-08-23 17:51:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123981088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091198002', 'Robyn Hallet', NULL, '8-23-2023:  Robyn called in & we were able to walk thru HCBB together.  Her doc has great ratings, so hopefully this will work well for her.  She''s needing a "robotic laparascopic hysterectomy".  When we look up on HCBB the laparascopic hysterectomy, the range is ~ 15k, fair price is ~19k, & high is 40k.  Since this will be pre-x & she''s in her second yr, she''s trying to figure out how much she will owe.  Her doc wks in a non-profit clinic & told her she''ll be able to beat the "ins" price.  I explained this is handled in a diff manner, so it''s not like "trad ins" where you call to get it approved, they tell you your max, etc.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-23 17:45:21', '2023-08-23 17:45:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123981083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108522002', 'Michael Hulstrom', NULL, '8-23-2023:  Karen called.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-23 17:43:03', '2023-08-23 17:43:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123981075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123908002', 'Charlotte Westbrook', NULL, '8-23-2023:  Charlotte called in a major panic.  She was told since she was putting in her application after the 20 (yesterday was the 22nd) she would not be elig for a memb until 10/1/2023.  I''m assuming it still allowed a Sept 1st eff date & she didn''t notice the toggle.  She''s very concerned because it went ahead a pulled the fee from her account, but I didn''t confirm if it was both the enrollment type fee(s) alone, or if it also pulled her monthly contribution.  (Maybe all of this is due to the audit they were running yesterday?)   Now she has double cov for Sept w/her BCBS not yet cancelled.  
     - She LM for Patti (it''s already 7:20-ish FL time) & she knows Patti is out until tomorrow.  She will find out her options from Patti, then figure out if BCBS would allow her to cancel her Sept at this time.  I sugg she go ahead & call BCBS to find out their cancellation requirements so she''d know when she tt Patti, but she didn''t like that idea.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-23 17:38:51', '2023-08-23 17:41:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124014075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045976082', 'Stacey Garrett', NULL, '8-23-23 Redirect has been challenging for Amanda. After a long talk, she shared with me her Redirect Card which shows the PHCS network and Lab Corp only. The response I received from Mike Bechtol was as follows and my response to Amanda - 

Here''s the response I received from Redirect Health.

The plan has two options for a Network.

PHCS network
Open Network
 
For members to get benefit on the plan they will need to use the RDH Member app and there is a pathway to notify of appointments inside the app.  This will let us call those offices who are not in PHCS and get a direct contract in place.  48 notice is required for office visits for pre-authorization.  This is so that the member avoids the negative experience in the office.

Members and the office are to send the Referral Authorization Form so that they can see who Redirect Health spoke with at the office.
___________
I''d also recommend using the app for labs to see if you can make better progress on that front. I haven''t heard of any other Redirect clients in your area having trouble obtaining labs. Give it a try and let me know if you run into any troubles.

If you''re still feeling frustrated, we can review a new option. But, Redirect is more lenient or has more leeway with the annual wellness visits, labs that are associated with them and more frequent colonoscopies. If you can get their app and system to respond appropriately, you may still be best served to stay put.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-23 17:36:01', '2023-08-23 17:39:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123988111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862244', 'Andrew Racuch', NULL, '08.23.2023 Andy emailed me to let me know that he cannot access Sedera to create a portal for a medical need. It turns out he is on Zion, and Jen had already sent him the information he needed and connected him to Zion. I responded along those lines, and he confirmed he was good to go. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-23 17:26:08', '2023-08-23 17:26:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123988106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111987008', 'John Graber', NULL, '08.23.2023 John Graber called to learn how to set a preventative appointment. I walked him through the language to use and how to maintain the appointment as preventative. 
I shared the following sites for him to search for a provider, except MultiPlan Link was not working for him. It kept kicking him out: HCBB, MultiPlan Link and Healthgrades.com. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-23 17:24:07', '2023-08-23 17:24:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124014036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111955009', 'Abram Dunaway', NULL, '8-23-23 Abe wants to revisit everything bc his wife, Amanda Barrientez will be removed from Medicaid as of Sept. 15th. She shouldn''t have been approved for it for a while now. But, her account was showing an erroneous renewal date and they just let it ride for a while. They are now running their own business together. They can tweak their income to help with gaining a larger subsidy. So, in doing so, they believe than can get about a $568 or so APTC. Amanda has fibroids and needs a surgery ASAP. She has been put on a wait list for 8 months through Medicaid. So, we looked at the lowest MOP which is the Cigna Connect Bronze HSA 6500 for about $351 a month. If no surgery, then the Cigna Connect Flex Bronze 0 may be better. They will decide and let me know by Friday. Amanda''s kids are all adults now and are all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-23 17:05:47', '2023-08-23 17:05:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123988101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061006173', 'Brian Delaney', NULL, '08.23.2023 Brian called to confirm that he has coverage. At first he was not coming up, but for some reason after the 3rd try, he popped up on the list under contacts.
We went over that he does not have Redirect, but Planstin, Zion and the Essentials, and I went over each one briefly. I resent him the welcome call link to schedule a welcome call. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-23 16:15:00', '2023-08-23 16:15:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123988091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107797002', 'Sarah Sumner', NULL, '08.23.2023 Sarah sounded frustrated when she called. She requested to have Zion''s fax number, but I did not have it. We did a three way with Zion, since she was unable to get through to them. Zion representative was kind and patient, and when I merged the calls, he offered the fax number and email to have medical records sent in. At the end, Sarah ended up just hanging up after saying to thank for the information. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-23 15:48:57', '2023-08-23 15:48:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124014016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167696', 'Rachel Weitz', NULL, '8-23-23 Dan and Rachel are leaning towards CARE+ for Oct. 1st and then we need to deal with Sept. which is likely Cigna Connect Flex Bronze 0 which is $593.34 as their cost. They will now be earning about $90K after subtracting expenses. So, they will receive a subsidy of about $355 including their daughter Emunah. For Oct. 1st with CARE+ at $1000 IUA it''s $580 and limits their mop substantially. They will decide and let me know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-23 15:43:00', '2023-08-23 17:23:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123988086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111781002', 'Raymond Wilson', 'GOES BY SCOTT', '08.23.2023 Jara-Lee from the hospital called to confirm that Scott, aka Raymond has coverage. I explained that he is a cash pay patient, and is respsonible for no more than $1000, the rest he will send to his healthsharing company, Zion. She understood and was able to move on. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-23 15:12:14', '2023-08-23 15:12:14'),
