  ('zcrm_1579374000123988076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099559002', 'Phonesavanh Phongsavan', NULL, '08.23.2023 Phonesavanh wants to know about the progress of her medical need and the sharing part with Zion. I direct transferred her to Zion. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-23 12:06:22', '2023-08-23 12:06:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123988071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093898002', 'Matthew Hoit', NULL, '08.23.2023 Selina called to better understand how the IUA works and its part in the whole sharing process. I explained it is the part the member is responsible for, Zion looks for that receipt for it when opening a medical need, it is issue specific.
Then we went into scenarios that would lead to opening a medical need with Zion, and went into details on how to present, the PRESENT process of opening one with all the glitches Zion still is going through and who to call once it is open. I emailed her the instructions/invitation to open the portal towards the medical need.
Selina will call her providers'' offices to attain all her receipts she''s paying for the last 6 months. I told her to even add the receipts FOR THIS SPECIFIC ISSUE that are longer than 6 months anyways and have a conversation with Zion about them. The worst that they can say is no.
When she is ready Selina will call Zion directly if she faces any challenges with opening this medical need. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-23 11:39:03', '2023-08-23 11:39:03'),
