  ('zcrm_1579374000123969003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004762009', 'Lori Keller', NULL, '8-22-23 We reviewed her billing bc it looked wacky on her end bc of the changes, refunds and separation of 2 fees. Now it''s back to normal and it actually looks accurate thankfully. She agrees and sees it is correct. She will be moving to Medicare next year and I will send her Andrea''s contact information to proceed on that front.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-22 17:06:43', '2023-08-22 17:06:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123950040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107797002', 'Sarah Sumner', NULL, '08.22.2023 Received a missed call from Sarah, while Cari was at lunch. I must''ve been on the phone, and her call did not come through to me at all, or show up on my list. Cari saw it on her end, as well as another missed call. She took one missed call and I called Sarah back to see what she needed, but ended up leaving her a VM with our company''s name, my name and our Concierge Consultant line''s number. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-22 16:25:32', '2023-08-22 16:25:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123950035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442145', 'Suzanne Picard', NULL, '08.22.2023 Steve called re: him aging out and how the amount $650 extracted is different from what was discussed with him and Suzanne, $450~.
