  ('zcrm_1579374000123950018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058781018', 'Michele Brooks', NULL, '08.22.2023 Barbara Wise from a provider''s office called to confirm Ronald''s "insurance" coverage, since he provided her with his MPB card.
