  ('zcrm_1579374000123949013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039700101', 'David Larochelle', NULL, '8-22-2023:  David called.  He had his colonoscopy a few mos before he chg''d his plan (he thinks).  He''s not really understanding all the various components, which of course is double the companies since he was orig:  Redirect/Sedera, then eff 4/1/2023 = Planstin/Zion.
