  ('zcrm_1579374000123949008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032809035', 'Michele Manna', NULL, '8-22-2023:  Michele called.  She''s traveling thru Oregon, but knows she''ll need a refill on her RX when she''s home to CA.  She''s gotten a refill from CirrusMD before & they told her to see her PCP, which she hasn''t done.  (She''s a nurse.)  I let her know their scope is limited, so she can try for another refill, but I don''t know what they will say since they sugg she see a doc before.  Also advised her to let them know she is traveling in OR, but plans to pick up RX (CA?) due to the doc''s licensing.
