  ('zcrm_1579374000123935003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120913002', 'Charlie Gomez', NULL, '8-22-2023:  Jennifer called from Fry''s to find out about her RX benefits.  She''s picking-up a bc prescription, so she''s going to try to use her Planstin card w/the RX benefit info I gave her = Bin: 610011,	 
