  ('zcrm_1579374000123821016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114224009', 'Hanan Fathallah', NULL, '8-21-2023:  Hanan called. She''s ready to sched her colonoscopy for Sept (= past the 6mos of memb waiting period: March, April, May, June, July, Aug).  She got a written estimate, so we walked thru the new process for sub a ''prev care med need'' w/Zion.
     - Fibroid cystis in her uterous:  She understand this will be a ''med need''.  They are going to do an ultrasound soon to see what the best course of action is: can they leave it as it is for now (even though the pain is how they found them recently)?, do they need to do surgery?, etc.  We disc when she first had symptoms, etc, in case it was pre-x, but it sounds like this is new in the last month or so.  She is going to see what they find in the ultrasound & will get back to us.  She knows she''s resp for the $2500 IUA either way.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-21 12:34:04', '2023-08-24 10:26:45'),
