  ('zcrm_1579374000123856023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012379061', 'Lindsay Patterson', NULL, '08.21.2023 Lindsay called with Pneumonia. She went into UrgentCare on Friday. They asked her to get a follow-up appointment with her PCP, but she does not have one ATM. 
I sent her 3 links (needed to add a fourth one cz one of the links I sent was the wrong one), to be able to search for one. I sent her the email via CRM: HCBB, Healthgrades & Multiplan Link.
Lindsay also needed to attain her 1095, I guided her through searching her emails back in 2/2023, but she did not find one there. Therefore I direct transferred her to Planstin, after we were done talking.
Lindsay also needed clarification on whether breast ultrasounds are preventative. I remember Cari teaching me that it is not, however, Lindsay said the the guidelines are changing and I wanted to double check that for her. I asked Cari via teams, and she confirmed that ULTRASOUNDS for breasts is are not covered. For that, Lyndsay is considering having an MRI instead of other screenings, due to her dense breasts. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-21 11:55:35', '2023-08-21 12:34:37'),
