  ('zcrm_1579374000123821008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024355002', 'Linda Reely', NULL, '8-21-2023:  Linda called.  She has not been charged properly since May 2023.  May''s refund corrected that month''s contribution.  But then June, July, & Aug, she was only chg''d the $51.50 (=HSA MEC + cc fee) portion of her membership each month.  She''s aware they are trying to fix the issue.  I sent JK the following:

