  ('zcrm_1579374000123856013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109886002', 'James Evans lll', NULL, '08.21.2023 Thomas Lash called on behalf of his member, James Evans III, re: cancelling his membership. I guided Thomas to the form on our Member Portals and Updates page that he was not aware of. Other pertinent elements that did not arise as time sensitivity for Thomas was the monthly billing extraction that takes place on the 20th, in order to avoid another month of unwanted coverage. From what I understood from Thomas, he did not get training on the sensitive elements of the plans for MPB members, such as deadlines for billing nor where to find the resources on the MPB pages.
