  ('zcrm_1579374000123856003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107710002', 'Jana Baldwin', NULL, '08.21.2023 Jana called to learn how to submit bills to Zion. It is her first time, and she is being tested for chronic headaches, unknown reason as of yet, where they are coming from. Presently, she''s paid $500 towards a specialist, and they are ordering a CT scan that is reaching $300. 
