  ('zcrm_1579374000123814050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122122001', 'Elizabeth Bay', NULL, '08.18.2023 I heard back from  Elizabeth today, and was able to run her quote again. Although the deals were not as attractive as the beginning of the week, but I was able to find her a couple of options:
